window.AKK_ANCIENT_MISS_CEO_WIFE_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_ANCIENT_MISS_CEO_WIFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: I Seven and you Three","paragraphs":["\"Thank you, auntie.\" Shen Yin suddenly felt that there might still be an opportunity to approach the auntie.","\"Alright, thank you auntie. I'll put the things in the car.\" Shen Yin hadn't had water for a while and was a bit thirsty.","When she returned to the car and opened the trunk, she suddenly noticed that there were some tea leaves, a bottle of wine, and boxes of milk in the trunk. When had she put these things in the car? It wasn't there yesterday morning when she drove to the hospital. Suddenly she remembered something and smiled faintly, taking these items out.","After drinking some water, Shen Yin carried a box of milk in one hand and the tea leaves and wine in the other, entering the courtyard again.","\"Miss, why are you bringing these things over?\" asked the elder woman.","\"I just noticed that my uncle seems to enjoy drinking tea.\" Shen Yin walked to the door of the cottage and put down the items.","\"Take them with you when you leave. Your uncle probably won't want them,\" the woman said.","\"Then I'll give them to you. I can't just have a meal for free,\" Shen Yin smiled.","Shen Yin was of the cool and reserved type, but she looked exceptionally beautiful when she smiled. Seeing how sincere and pretty Shen Yin was, the woman asked, \"Miss, you look so young, you don't have a partner yet, do you? Let auntie introduce someone to you.\"","Shen Yin smiled again, \"Auntie, I already have a child.\"","The woman was surprised and didn't quite believe it.","\"Auntie, let me help you cook,\" Shen Yin had already decided to approach this auntie, so now she needed to extract information from her about why Kang Guopeng was unwilling to take on furniture projects.","\"You know how to cook? There aren't many young ladies who can cook these days.\"","Shen Yin followed the woman into the kitchen, which was clearly kept tidy and organized by someone who knew how to manage a household.","There were already some chopped vegetables on the cutting board. Shen Yin volunteered to do the stir-frying, and the woman didn't stop her.","Everyone has their own cooking style, and Shen Yin had a talent for making simple ingredients appetizing.","\"Miss, are you a chef? Not only does this meat dish look good, but it smells so fragrant too,\" the woman asked.","Shen Yin was reminded of her great-grandfather, who had spoiled her and cultivated her taste buds, allowing her to develop this skill.","\"No, it's just because I'm a picky eater that I learned how to cook,\" Shen Yin replied.","The auntie burst into laughter. Shen Yin felt that she could proceed and asked, \"Auntie, why doesn't Uncle Kang take on furniture projects anymore?\"","The woman sighed and said, \"Your Uncle Kang's family has a hereditary talent for woodworking. In the early years, he took on projects and earned quite a bit of money. But once he made a lot of money, someone grew jealous and accused him of plagiarism. They produced design drawings that were indeed very similar to your Uncle Kang's designs. After that incident, your Uncle Kang stopped taking on projects, saying he couldn't tarnish his reputation or lose face. But he also didn't want the family's skills to be lost, since there are few craftsmen nowadays, so he took on two apprentices.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin felt a sense of pity, as it's hard to fathom people's hearts sometimes. She then changed the subject, chatting with the woman as the dishes were being prepared.","The woman brought the dishes to the living room. \"Husband, it's time to eat.\"","Kang Guopeng came out and saw Shen Yin walking out of the kitchen. She turned on the air conditioning.","\"Well, well, you're finally willing to use the air conditioning today,\" the woman remarked.","Kang Guopeng sat down.","\"Miss, you come sit down too.\"","There weren't many dishes - two vegetable dishes and a plate of stir-fried chicken, all cooked by Shen Yin. The auntie had helped her in the kitchen. To be honest, Shen Yin was quite hot in the kitchen, but she persisted, thinking that all endeavors have difficult beginnings and that one shouldn't lose enthusiasm after just three minutes.","\"These dishes weren't cooked by you?\" Kang Guopeng turned and asked.","\"They were all cooked by this young lady. See, I told you she's a great cook,\" the woman said, looking at Shen Yin.","After the woman sat down, the man started eating. Shen Yin was still confident in her cooking skills.","Sure enough, a few minutes later, Kang Guopeng spoke up, \"Is the furniture workshop yours?\"","\"Yes, Uncle Kang,\" Shen Yin felt that there was now an opportunity to negotiate.","But after saying that, Kang Guopeng fell silent.","\"Miss, start eating. There are only three dishes, don't mind it,\" the woman said.","Shen Yin started eating too, but her mind was focused on Kang Guopeng, who did resemble her great-grandfather.","\"Liang will be back on vacation soon,\" the woman said to Kang Guopeng.","\"When?\"","\"This weekend. He told me that it's hard to buy tickets now because of the crowds, so he's not sure exactly which day he'll be able to come back.\"","From their conversation, Shen Yin guessed that this couple probably had a son who was studying at university.","After the meal, the woman cleared the table. Kang Guopeng sat on a wooden sofa with a small table next to it. Shen Yin felt there was still a chance, so she walked over and said, \"Uncle Kang, I think we can continue to discuss this.\"","After some thought, Kang Guopeng said, \"Tell me about your workshop.\"","Shen Yin felt there was still an opportunity, \"The workshop has just been registered. I want to make high-end Chinese furniture. From my market research, I've found that Chinese furniture is either very expensive or low-quality. I have the designs, but I need funding and skilled technicians, so I want to hire you to make the furniture. I've also looked into this, which is why I think you're suitable since you have the skills.\"","\"You mean I just need to follow the designs?\" Kang Guopeng asked.","\"That's right. And you can rest assured that my designs are original. The final profit will be split, 70% for me and 30% for you. You can also be assured that the furniture will definitely sell. I'm confident about that,\" Shen Yin said confidently. In this day and age, there was no shortage of wealthy people willing to pay hundreds of thousands for a set of Chinese furniture. With her designs and his exquisite craftsmanship, sales wouldn't be a problem.","Kang Guopeng could hardly believe it. A 70-30 split was like a partnership, and he wouldn't even need to do the designs, just the craftsmanship.","\"Why me?\" Kang Guopeng asked.","\"Your exquisite skills and dedication to craftsmanship are valuable assets,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"But I was accused of plagiarism before.\"","\"I'm looking at your skills, and that doesn't concern me,\" Shen Yin said.","Kang Guopeng felt that this young lady spoke with a maturity beyond her years, with confidence and poise.","Seeing Kang Guopeng deep in thought, Shen Yin already felt she had succeeded. \"I noticed the university admission letter for your son, Liang, to Rong City University over there. If you agree, I'll bring a formal contract in a few days, and we can discuss your work location then. I can also give your son a ride back.\"","Kang Guopeng was swayed. He hadn't had an income for years, and his son's tuition, living expenses, and housing fees still needed to be paid. He had been scrimping, even avoiding using the air conditioning unless there were guests, like today.","\"Okay, I agree,\" Kang Guopeng said."]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Come Rain or Shine","paragraphs":["Shen Yin felt better after hearing those words, feeling that her sweat had not been wasted in vain.","\"Alright then, this weekend I'll come over. Can you give me your son's phone number so I can contact him when I get there?\" Shen Yin said.","Kang Guopeng's wife, who was in the kitchen, heard this and hurried out. \"That would be troubling you, Miss.\" She then gave Shen Yin her son's phone number.","Shen Yin took out her phone and noted down the number.","\"Well, I should get going now.\" Shen Yin picked up her bag and bid them farewell.","As she got into the passenger seat, Shen Yin took out her phone and called Xu Xiuhe back.","Earlier, when she was noting down the phone number, she had seen that Xu Xiuhe had sent her several messages asking if she had eaten and how things went, and had also called, but she had been coming out of the house and missed the call.","It was a video call, and Xu Xiuhe answered instantly.","\"Hey, wife, why wasn't your brother answering the phone?\"","Shen Yin pointed the camera at herself, and Xu Yunzheng's fair little face appeared in the video.","\"Mommy, when are you coming back? Zheng Zheng misses you.\"","Shen Yin was warmed by Zheng Zheng's words and imitated his tone, \"Mommy misses Zheng Zheng too. Mommy will be back soon, can Zheng Zheng wait for Mommy?\"","When Shen Yin imitated Zheng Zheng's way of speaking, her voice sounded a little childish and whiny. Xu Xiuhe, listening on the other end, wanted to see his wife on the screen, but Xu Yunzheng had monopolized the phone, taking up the entire frame, leaving Xu Xiuhe no chance.","\"Zheng Zheng, can you let Daddy see for a bit?\" he asked meekly from the side.","Zheng Zheng shook his head. \"Zheng Zheng hasn't seen enough of Mommy yet.\"","\"Honey, can you persuade him?\" Xu Xiuhe's tone dragged a little, with a hint of whining, something Shen Yin had never heard from him before.","\"Zheng Zheng, give the phone to Daddy for a bit. Mommy needs to tell Daddy something,\" Shen Yin coaxed.","Though reluctant, since Mommy had spoken, Zheng Zheng had to obey.","\"Here, Daddy.\"","Xu Xiuhe took the phone, and his mouth widened into a grin when he saw Shen Yin. \"Honey, are you coming back now?\"","\"Yeah, were the wine and tea in the car put there by you last night?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I forgot to tell you. So how was it? Did the carpenter agree?\"","\"He agreed. I'm about to head back now. Zheng Zheng should take his afternoon nap. Can you get him to sleep for a bit? I'll be back soon.\" Shen Yin replied.","Shen Yin drove slowly, estimating that it would take her quite some time to return.","\"Alright, be careful. Let me know if anything comes up.\"","After Shen Yin agreed, she hung up and drove back. The sun was still glaring, and apart from cars, there were hardly any pedestrians on the road. As she passed by a courtyard, Shen Yin noticed that the dog at the gate had its tongue lolling out.","When Shen Yin reached Yang City, the weather suddenly changed. Fierce winds picked up, swallows flew low, and the faint rumble of thunder could be heard in the distance. Shen Yin felt a pang of worry, wondering if she would encounter severe weather. The morning weather forecast had been fine, but now it had changed so rapidly.","Her phone kept ringing, and when Shen Yin answered, it was Xu Xiuhe's voice on the other end.","\"Hey, wife, it's raining heavily in Rong City. I just checked the weather forecast for Yang City, and there's a storm warning. You should find a hotel to take shelter from the rain first.\"","\"Okay.\" Shen Yin had originally planned to keep driving until it rained and then stop, but now that didn't seem feasible. The wind was too strong, with leaves, plastic bags, and other debris flying through the air. The thunder was growing louder, and the sky had darkened, as if the earlier sunny and bright weather had been just a day ago.","She had no choice but to heed Xu Xiuhe's advice and found a decent-looking hotel, driving straight into the underground parking garage.","When Shen Yin approached the front desk, the receptionist spoke first, \"Hello, Ma'am. Would you like to book a room?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"What kind of room would you like? The regular rooms are almost fully booked. These are the remaining options.\" The receptionist pointed to a few room types in the brochure.","\"This one,\" Shen Yin said, pointing to the loft room type. She had never been one to deprive herself, whether in the Dasheng Dynasty or here.","Few people booked the loft rooms, and the receptionist was observant. This woman booking a room was clearly out of the ordinary. The receptionist immediately made a call, and someone soon came to lead Shen Yin upstairs.","Outside, the sky grew darker and darker. As Shen Yin opened the curtains upon entering, a bolt of lightning suddenly struck.","\"Boom, boom, boom!\"","Shen Yin could feel the thunder right above her. Soon after, rain droplets the size of beans began pelting down.","With the rain preventing her from leaving, Shen Yin took a shower in the bathroom, as she had sweated profusely earlier and found herself unpleasant.","Shen Yin's phone kept ringing outside, but the sound of the shower drowned it out. It wasn't until she came out of the bathroom that she heard it.","Seven missed calls. Just as Shen Yin was about to call back, Xu Xiuhe called again.","\"Wife, why weren't you answering your phone?\" Xu Xiuhe sounded anxious.","\"Mommy, Mommy,\" came Zheng Zheng's little voice through the phone.","\"The wind and rain were too heavy. I found a hotel and just took a shower, so I didn't hear it,\" Shen Yin explained.","Only then did Xu Xiuhe feel relieved. Earlier, he had been so worried that he had picked up Zheng Zheng, gone downstairs, and was now sitting in the car, preparing to head to Yang City.","\"Stay safe in the hotel. I'm coming to get you now.\"","\"Don't come. The wind and rain are fierce here. It's too dangerous to drive. I'll drive back once the rain stops. Zheng Zheng, be a good boy and listen to Daddy. Mommy will hurry back,\" Shen Yin patiently consoled. She had checked the weather forecast too, and didn't know if she could return tonight, as it showed continued rain.","\"Mommy, be safe. Zheng Zheng will be good. Mommy, please come back quickly. Zheng Zheng wants Mommy to hug him.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin felt that Zheng Zheng was so well-behaved. How she wished she could fly to his side and hug him right now.","\"Okay, Mommy knows.\"","After hanging up, Shen Yin stood by the window. Outside, the rain only grew heavier, with no sign of stopping.","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","Shen Yin opened the door.","A server stood outside, holding a fruit platter and some snacks.","\"Ma'am, hello. This is the afternoon tea provided with the suite.\"","Shen Yin thanked him and accepted the fruit.","The server seemed to have received some notification through his earpiece and hurried away.","Shen Yin sat by the window, eating the fruit, when suddenly she heard some commotion outside. Shen Yin went to the door and opened it, seeing several servers rushing in the same direction."]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: Midwifery","paragraphs":["Shen Yin's imagination was quite expansive. She thought some kind of accident had happened and they were running somewhere to take shelter.","\"Hello, may I ask if something happened?\" Shen Yin stopped someone and asked.","\"Yes, in one of the rooms ahead, a pregnant woman's water broke, but the ambulance can't get through. There's a life-threatening situation now, and we're rushing over to help,\" the server said, gasping for air.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin didn't know why, but she felt she couldn't just stand idly by. She grabbed her room key and followed them.","It was also a loft room. When Shen Yin entered, she heard an older hotel staff member asking, \"Is everyone here? Who has experience with childbirth? Quick, come and help.\"","\"Ma'am, you must hold on.\" Xiao Wang said, \"The ambulance hasn't arrived yet.\"","A young girl answered, \"I called them, they were on their way, but the wind was too strong. A big tree fell onto the road and a car was hit. The ambulance was driving fast and couldn't stop in time, crashing into the scene. Now they're trying to rescue themselves.\"","\"What about other ambulances, are any coming?\"","\"The road is blocked, the accident scene is quite serious.\"","\"Is there anyone who knows how to deliver a baby? The pregnant woman's life is in danger now,\" the older person shouted, their voice trembling. If anything happened, it would be the hotel's responsibility. Those staying in these types of rooms are not ordinary people. If a life was truly lost, or even two, the hotel couldn't afford it.","Seeing the pregnant woman's pained expression, Shen Yin's heart stirred for some unknown reason. Without thinking too much, she said, \"I'll do it.\"","Although she had never delivered a baby before, she had read similar books. Plus, with her skills amplified, she thought she could manage.","\"Prepare some hot water, alcohol, and scissors,\" Shen Yin instructed.","The other staff members gradually prepared the items.","The pregnant woman was now slumped on the sofa. Shen Yin felt this position was unsuitable for delivery, so she instructed, \"Help me, let's move the pregnant woman onto the bed inside.\"","With difficulty, several people helped move the pregnant woman onto the bed.","\"Take off the pregnant woman's pants,\" Shen Yin said, then went to the bathroom to wash her hands and disinfect.","Upon returning, Shen Yin observed the pregnant woman's contractions and helped her adjust her position, lying on her back with her legs bent. Then, noticing the pregnant woman's pained expression, Shen Yin placed some pillows behind her back to ease the pain.","\"Stay calm, breathe with me deeply,\" Shen Yin held the pregnant woman's hand, and the staff behind them dared not make a sound to disturb.","\"Everything is ready,\" a staff member said.","Shen Yin didn't respond, continuing to guide the pregnant woman. During stronger contractions, Shen Yin had her exhale, and when the contractions eased, she had her push. Fortunately, the pregnant woman was very strong, following Shen Yin's rhythm throughout, until finally the baby's head emerged.","Shen Yin gently supported the baby's head, following the knowledge in her mind step by step. When the baby cried loudly, everyone in the room breathed a sigh of relief, including Shen Yin.","But Shen Yin knew it wasn't over yet. She still needed to handle the placenta, slow the blood flow, and cut the umbilical cord.","After carrying out each step, both the pregnant woman and baby were safe, and outside, night had truly fallen. After ensuring their safety, Shen Yin exhaled deeply. She had succeeded.","The hotel staff could handle the remaining tasks. Shen Yin was exhausted and unwell. \"I'll head back first. If anything comes up, find me in my room.\"","After returning to her room, Shen Yin took another shower. She was grateful that she had read many books and could store the knowledge in her mind. Otherwise, she truly wouldn't have known what to do.","After showering, the rain still hadn't stopped. She wouldn't be able to return today. Shen Yin decided to call Xu Xiuhe to report in.","\"What were you doing just now? You didn't answer my calls, and now you look utterly exhausted,\" Xu Xiuhe said with concern.","\"I just delivered a baby for a pregnant woman,\" Shen Yin replied.","Xu Xiuhe: \"!!\" He didn't understand. Wasn't his wife a designer? How did she also know childbirth?","\"That's so dangerous. Wasn't there a doctor? Did you consider what would happen if something went wrong?\" Xu Xiuhe felt his wife was too daring.","\"No, look at the rain outside, it's extremely heavy,\" Shen Yin pointed the camera outside.","\"The ambulance was in an accident on the way. When I saw the pregnant woman in pain, I didn't think too much about it,\" Shen Yin said. Now that she thought about it, she probably couldn't stand seeing such suffering, or perhaps it was instinct, thinking of how Yue had a difficult labor and faced a similar predicament. Or maybe it was how her grandfather had raised her well since childhood.","\"You haven't eaten yet, right? Go eat first. When you're back, Zhengzheng wants to video call you. He's chatting with Huahua now,\" Xu Xiuhe switched the camera, and Shen Yin saw Huahua and Zhengzheng in the living room.","She vaguely heard Zhengzheng say, \"Huahua, Zhengzheng misses mommy. Do you miss mommy too?\"","Huahua nodded.","\"Then when Zhengzheng's mommy comes back, let's ask mommy to help you find your mommy,\" Xu Yun Zheng patted Huahua's head.","Shen Yin nearly cried. How could she help Huahua find her mother? Shouldn't that be Xu Xiuhe's responsibility?","Xu Xiuhe joked, \"When you're back, help Huahua find her mother.\"","Shen Yin: \"I can't find her. I'll go eat first. I'll call you back tonight.\"","Zhengzheng suddenly turned and walked over to Xu Xiuhe, asking, \"Daddy, who were you talking to on the phone just now? Was it mommy? Zhengzheng wants to find mommy. Why hasn't mommy come back yet?\"","\"Zhengzheng, mommy just did something very great, so she needs to go eat now,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"What did she do? Zhengzheng wants to do it too.\"","\"Earlier, mommy welcomed a new life into this world.\"","\"A new life?\"","\"Yes, Zhengzheng, you were once a new life too. So we should be very proud, because mommy is extraordinary,\" Xu Xiuhe explained bit by bit.","\"Will mommy come back tonight?\"","\"No, mommy is tired, so she needs to rest. Tomorrow morning, daddy will take Zhengzheng to find mommy, okay?\"","Hearing that mommy wouldn't come back, Zhengzheng felt a little sad. But then hearing they would find mommy in the morning, he became happy again.","Xu Xiuhe called for a car at 3 AM.","After helping Zhengzheng wash up, the obedient child didn't cry or fuss, and obediently fell asleep in bed.","At 3 AM, Xu Xiuhe got up, changed Zhengzheng's clothes, picked him up, and went to the entrance, where the driver was already waiting.","\"Hey man, you look a bit familiar. Have we met somewhere before?\" the driver asked.","Xu Xiuhe didn't answer, only saying, \"Drive slowly, my son is asleep.\"","\"Up so early and bringing a child... headed to Yang City?\"","The driver was curious."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Take My Wife","paragraphs":["\"It was raining in Yang City yesterday, and my wife got stuck there.\"","The driver was a talkative person: \"I see, picking up your wife. I see you have a car in the back, why are you taking a taxi?\"","\"My wife doesn't have a car.\"","\"I see, then I won't disturb you. You just hold the baby and sleep a bit, it'll be dark, and I'll drive slowly and carefully.\"","The big brother driver was very enthusiastic.","Xu Xiuhe was holding Zhengzheng in the backseat, and Zhengzheng was sleeping soundly. Xu Xiuhe tried to relax himself as much as possible to let Xu Yunzheng sleep comfortably.","As the clock struck, the east gradually brightened, Xu Xiuhe opened his eyes, looked at his watch, and out the window.","\"You're awake, you know, the rain in Yang City is really heavier than in Rong City,\" the driver said as he saw Xu Xiuhe wake up.","Xu Xiuhe didn't say anything, just quietly looking out the window. In fact, he wanted to say that of course he knew the rain in Yang City was heavy, his wife had told him yesterday.","There was still water on the road, and branches, leaves, and various trash bags were scattered on the ground, a typical scene after a heavy rain.","\"The rain now is a good thing, it's just too heavy. The corn has just been planted, and it might need to be replanted in a few days,\" the big brother driver sighed.","This was the first time Xu Xiuhe had heard about crop-related topics, and he found it interesting. He didn't interrupt the driver and just listened. After all, he didn't have many opportunities to hear such things. Since he started his business, he had even taken fewer taxis, usually driving himself. Liu, his assistant, would sometimes drive for him, and there were drivers at the Ziyue Manor, but lately, he and Shen Yin had been driving themselves, forgetting about the drivers.","\"Sir, your child is so young, why did your wife go to Yang City?\" the driver was still curious.","\"On a business trip.\"","Instantly, the driver's gaze in the rearview mirror changed. His wife went on a business trip, and the man was at home taking care of the child? Could it be that this man was a \"kept man,\" a house-husband.","The driver didn't say anything else, pondering in his heart. These days, there are all kinds of people. The man in the back looked well-dressed and well-off, but who would have thought he was a \"pretty boy,\" relying on his wife to support him.","The driver thought more and more about it, and he hated men who spent women's money the most.","Xu Xiuhe didn't know what happened, but he could feel the driver's attitude towards him had changed. Could it be that the driver had recognized him just now? That's why he didn't dare to speak.","It was getting brighter, and the driver kept looking at Xu Xiuhe through the rearview mirror, not for any other reason, just disdain. But the more he looked, the more familiar the man seemed. Now that it was bright, he might have said the wrong thing just now.","\"Are you the president of the Yuhuan Group?\" the driver asked cautiously.","Xu Xiuhe didn't admit it, but he didn't deny it either.","The driver confirmed it. He didn't know if the president in the back had noticed his disdain, but he really knew he was wrong. Who would have thought that he, a Didi driver, would pick up the president of a major group? And who would have thought that the president's wife would be on a business trip?","\"I apologize for my disrespect just now,\" the driver suddenly became serious.","\"I see you are a good driver. Would you be interested in working for me? The salary will definitely be higher than driving for Didi,\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Ah!\" The driver didn't respond immediately. He just took a single ride, and now he had found a stable job, and it was at a big company. He couldn't quite believe it. Could it be that he had just done a good deed.","\"Of course.\"","\"To be precise, you'll be driving for my wife. My wife has just opened a few studios and may need to travel back and forth. You'll be her exclusive driver from now on.\"","The big brother driver still couldn't believe such good luck had befallen him, and hurriedly replied, \"Okay.\"","\"Daddy, where are we going?\" the sleepy Zhengzheng in Xu Xiuhe's arms asked.","\"We're going to get Mommy,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","At the mention of finding Mommy, Zhengzheng suddenly became alert, sitting up from Xu Xiuhe's arms, with an excited little expression, which was clearly visible.","\"Find Mommy, want Mommy to hug me,\" Zhengzheng clapped his little hands.","\"Sit tight, we'll be there soon,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","It was just past six o'clock, and it was already bright.","Xu Xiuhe didn't tell Shen Yin that he had brought Zhengzheng with him. From the video Shen Yin sent yesterday, Xu Xiuhe had a rough idea of which hotel she was in.","After the car was parked, the big brother driver got out and opened the door.","\"You can go back now. Report to Qinghe Villa tomorrow morning.\"","\"Okay, thank you, sir.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng and walked up to the front desk, asking for Shen Yin's room. The front desk girl looked at him, and according to the rules, she couldn't casually give out the guest's privacy. But Shen Yin was a VIP guest, and the girl had also heard yesterday that this gentleman had helped the pregnant woman give birth smoothly.","\"Hello, sir, may I ask what is your relationship with Ms. Shen Yin?\"","Zhengzheng answered first, \"Shen Yin is Zhengzheng's mommy, Zhengzheng is Shen Yin's little baby.\" Zhengzheng emphasized this twice.","The front desk girl, seeing Zhengzheng's expectant little expression, his eyes wide open so cutely, couldn't help but give the room number.","Xu Xiuhe turned and took Zhengzheng to the elevator. The front desk girl then regretted it, what if something happened? She wouldn't be able to take responsibility. Tsk tsk tsk, it's all because of that pretty face, she was bewitched by an adult's charm.","\"Knock, knock, knock,\" Xu Xiuhe knocked on the door.","\"Mommy, open the door, Mommy, open the door for Zhengzheng.\"","After just a few knocks, the door opened. Shen Yin was a little surprised when she opened the door, thinking it was a hotel staff member.","\"How come you're here so early?\" Shen Yin asked. She knew from yesterday's drive from Rong City how long the trip was, and they arrived here just after 6 a.m. Could it be that they came over in the middle of the night?","\"Mommy, hug,\" Zhengzheng, who hadn't seen Shen Yin for a day, couldn't help but cozy up to her.","Shen Yin took Zhengzheng in her arms and asked, \"Why did Zhengzheng wake up so early today?\"","\"He didn't wake up early, I just carried him into the car while he was still sleeping,\" Xu Xiuhe quickly explained, worried that Shen Yin would blame him for not taking good care of Zhengzheng.","\"Come in first,\" Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng into the room.","\"I've already washed up and was just about to go back. How come you're here too? What about work?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe just realized he hadn't told Liu Bo that he wouldn't be going to the office in the morning, and that Liu Bo would need to preside over the meeting.","\"Let me make a call.\" Xu Xiuhe took out his phone and went into the bathroom.","\"Hello, President, any instructions?\"","\"Assistant Liu, I'm in Yang City now. You preside over the morning meeting. I'll give you a raise and introduce you to a date in return.\"","Xu Xiuhe said, and without waiting for Liu Bo's response, he hung up.","Liu Bo was almost at the office, and the president told him that he was in Yang City. Could it be that he went there last night? The president is awesome! With such heavy rain, he went there overnight."]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Broken Heel","paragraphs":["The CEO's pie that he drew could choke Liu Bo to death, the salary pie was already baked, and the girl's pie just kept getting bigger.","As Liu Bo stepped into the elevator, just as the door was about to close, a girl in a white shirt and black skirt with a high ponytail rushed in.","Along with her rushed-in, was the coffee in the girl's hand.","\"Fuck!\"","The scene froze, and Liu Bo almost jumped up from being scalded, luckily it wasn't on his chest, but on the upper left side, otherwise, he could have been scalded down to the skin.","\"Xiao Li'er! Weren't you watching where you were going?\"","\"Sorry, sorry.\" Xiao Li'er quickly apologized. This was indeed her fault.","Liu Bo looked at the suit he had just worn, it was all dirty, and when he took it off, the white shirt underneath had a huge coffee stain.","Liu Bo glanced at Xiao Li'er: \"You little girl, you're an assistant, how can you be so careless.\"","Xiao Li'er looked at the scene in front of her, knowing it was her fault, and admitted it, but she really wasn't being careless, she just stumbled for a second, and Liu Bo was accusing her unfairly.","\"What's wrong with you? You can't even stand properly, did you sprain your ankle?\" Liu Bo asked.","Xiao Li'er shook her head, she did sprain her ankle, but the reason for the sprain as well as the reason she stumbled just now was because the heel of her high heels had broken.","\"The heel of my high heels broke.\"","Liu Bo looked at Xiao Li'er's shoes, and sure enough, the heel was broken: \"Are you poor recently?\"","\"Huh, what do you mean?\"","\"Poor to the point of not having money to buy shoes, the quality of these shoes is so bad.\" Liu Bo replied.","Xiao Li'er was just about to retort when Liu Bo gestured for her to be quiet.","\"Mr. Xu, the meeting this morning is at 10:30, right?\"","Xu Xiuhe, who was eating breakfast, replied: \"Yes, what's up?\"","\"I need to go back and change my clothes first, the clothes got coffee spilled on them.\"","\"Who spilled it, what did you do wrong?\"","\"Xiao Li'er!\" Liu Bo's eyes turned to Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er looked apologetic, and seeing that she was again the focus, she immediately lowered her head, it was really the fault of the high heels.","\"Oh, that's fine, just handle it yourself, you don't need to ask me.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Xu Xiuhe hung up the phone and peeled a boiled egg, handing it to Shen Yin.","\"Thank you.\"","\"Don't say thank you to me.\" Xu Xiuhe said seriously.","\"Hmm, let's go back after we finish eating, you're letting Liu the assistant do everything, it might not be a good idea.\"","\"Where's the problem? I promised him I'd introduce him to a girlfriend.\" Xu Xiuhe sipped his porridge.","\"Cough cough, cough cough.\" Shen Yin was also drinking, and upon hearing this, couldn't help but choke. She was really exasperated.","\"Have you considered starting a marriage introduction agency?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe was actually considering it: \"It's not impossible.\"","\"Cough cough, I was just joking, by the way, why are you so concerned about their love life?\" Shen Yin asked again.","\"Without getting married, no one will love them, it's really pitiful.\" Xu Xiuhe sighed.","\"Well, maybe they don't want to get married, don't you modern people advocate being single?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Most people don't not want to get married, but because they haven't met the person they love, haven't met someone worth devoting their whole life to.\" Xu Xiuhe said seriously.","Xu Xiuhe's current insight into love has gone beyond Shen Yin's understanding, she is no longer surprised at all, after all, since he moved into the villa, he has changed from the original Xu Xiuhe, as if some seal has been broken.","\"Xu Xiuhe, be honest with me, did you come from somewhere else? You're no longer the Xu Xiuhe who used to always have a gloomy face.\" Shen Yin looked inquisitive.","\"Haha, you can't suspect that I'm not the real me just because my emotional intelligence has improved.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Oh, you're becoming more and more free-spirited.\" Shen Yin responded.","\"That's because I'm facing you.\"","Shen Yin blushed a little at his words, and said a little shyly, \"I'll go see if Jingxing is awake.\"","In the underground garage of the Heyuan Group, Xiao Li'er was limping along, and Liu Bo, walking in front of her, couldn't bear it anymore and turned back.","Xiao Li'er thought he might be a gentleman and help support her, but instead Liu Bo walked up to her and said, \"Just take off those shoes and throw them away.\"","Xiao Li'er was like \"???\", she couldn't just walk around barefoot, could she?","But Liu Bo really squatted down and took off Xiao Li'er's broken high heels, \"Throw this one away too.\"","Liu Bo took the two shoes and threw them in the trash can. Then he walked over to the car, got in the driver's seat.","\"Can you hurry up, you're walking so slowly without high heels.\" Liu Bo complained.","\"You've already got in the car, can't you drive it over here?\"","Liu Bo thought about it, oh right, start the car.","Xiao Li'er finally got in the car.","\"We don't have time to go home before the meeting, so we'll buy shoes and clothes at the mall nearby.\"","Liu Bo felt he was quite a gentleman, letting the lady go first, so he parked at the shoe store.","\"Get out, we're here.\"","Xiao Li'er felt a bit embarrassed, with all these people around, she was barefoot, it was so embarrassing.","\"What's wrong, hurry up.\"","\"I don't have any shoes.\"","Liu Bo looked down at the ground, and realized that going barefoot might get her feet hurt by something, so he went to the passenger seat and picked Xiao Li'er up in a princess carry.","Liu Bo specifically emphasized it was a princess carry, he wasn't trying to take advantage of her, his hands were tightly clenched in a gentlemanly manner.","\"Hello, is this lady here to buy shoes?\" the sales clerk asked.","\"Yes.\" Liu Bo put Xiao Li'er down on a bench.","Then he just stood there watching.","\"Sir, don't you want to help your girlfriend pick out some shoes?\" the sales clerk asked, standing next to them.","\"She's not my girlfriend.\"","\"I'm not his girlfriend.\"","The two spoke at the same speed.","The sales clerk immediately understood, \"I see, not yet.\"","\"Miss, what kind of shoes would you like?\"","\"High heels, size 37, something sturdy that won't break the heel.\"","\"Miss, don't worry, we only have shoes that people are unwilling to wear, not ones that will break the heel.\"","Xiao Li'er spotted a pair, pure black.","\"I'd like to see that one.\" Xiao Li'er pointed to the black high heels on the counter.","\"Miss, you have good taste.\"","Xiao Li'er took the shoes, checked the heel, and it felt pretty sturdy, so she started trying them on.","The size was perfect, Xiao Li'er walked around the fitting area for a few steps, very satisfied.","\"I'll just wear these, how do I pay?\"","Under the guidance of the sales clerk, Xiao Li'er scanned the QR code and the payment was successful. But when she saw the amount, 1099 yuan, she was shocked. She had never bought such an expensive pair of shoes before.","\"Let's go.\" Liu Bo called out, he still needed to buy a suit and shirt.","Xiao Li'er thought about the money she had just spent, feeling a little heartbroken, and her enthusiasm wasn't high.","\"What's wrong, didn't you just buy the shoes?\""]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: To Yangcheng","paragraphs":["\"It's fine, let's go.\" Xiao Li'er held back her pain, \"It's only 1099, no big deal, I'll just not buy clothes next month.\"","When Liu Bo was trying on clothes, Xiao Li'er sat next to him, playing with her phone.","\"Miss, your boyfriend is trying on clothes in there, aren't you going to take a look?\" the salesperson asked.","Xiao Li'er didn't respond at first, but when she realized there was no one else around, she realized the salesperson was talking to her.","\"Oh, he's my boss, not my boyfriend.\" Xiao Li'er hurriedly explained, not wanting to be misunderstood.","\"I see.\" the salesperson said, a tinge of disappointment in her voice.","\"Let's go.\" Liu Bo came out, already wearing the new clothes, the bag in his hand containing the old ones.","Looking at Liu Bo, Xiao Li'er couldn't help but admit that he had a good figure and didn't really need to try on clothes.","Xiao Li'er followed behind him, thinking that since it was her fault, she spoke up: \"Assistant Liu, let me take these clothes back and wash them.\"","\"Okay, you take them back and wash them.\" Liu Bo handed the bag to Xiao Li'er, and she took it.","\"Don't think that just by washing the clothes, that's it. The President won't be coming this morning, so I'll be presiding over the meeting, and you'll be taking the meeting minutes.\" Liu Bo said again.","Hearing this, Xiao Li'er obediently accepted her fate.","At this time, Xu Xiuhe was driving Shen Yin's car, with Shen Yin and Zhengzheng in the backseat.","\"I may have to come to Yang City again in a few days,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Hm? Didn't you agree already?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yes, I agreed, but the specific details haven't been worked out yet, like the job location and the salary and such, I still need to go back and draft those out,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Mm, that's good, I've arranged a driver for you, so you don't have to drive yourself in the future, it's too tiring,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin thought this was quite good, \"Thank you.\" She didn't put on airs, she would just use whatever he arranged for her.","\"I've told you not to say 'thank you' to me, there's no need for that between us. But Xu Yunzheng, you should say 'thank you' when someone helps you or is good to you, we need to have manners,\" Xu Xiuhe originally said this to Shen Yin, but then the topic shifted to Xu Yunzheng.","Xu Yunzheng was a bit bewildered, his eyes wide open, a look of confusion on his face, \"Why does Mommy not need to say 'thank you', but Zhengzheng has to say 'thank you'?\"","\"Because Daddy and Mommy are husband and wife, husband and wife are one, there's no need to say it. But Zhengzheng is different, Zhengzheng needs to be an obedient, polite child,\" Xu Xiuhe explained.","\"Ahem.\" Shen Yin pretended to cough. Zhengzheng is still young, she just said 'thank you' once, and Xu Xiuhe was able to say so much.","\"When exactly are you coming over? I want to have you join the weekend social event.\"","\"Haha, do you know that it's super funny for a big CEO like you to hold employee social events,\" Shen Yin laughed, her sense of humor suddenly tickled.","\"Funny?\"","Shen Yin nodded.","Shen Yin thought it over, \"I'll be able to come back in the afternoon on Saturday.\"","The days flew by quickly, and in the past few days, Shen Yin had rented a small building on the other side of this street, without much decoration, as it was just a place to put the furniture. Once the Chinese-style furniture was placed inside, the whole building would look different.","She had also drafted out the specifics, Kang Guopeng had wood resources, and he would also select high-quality wood, so she didn't need to worry about that. She would provide the blueprints, and since Kang Guopeng's family lives in Yang City, it would be inconvenient for him to come over, so the furniture would be delivered to Rong City after it was finished.","It would take a long time to make a set of furniture, which worried Shen Yin a bit.","But she had long-term plans, and starting a business would definitely require capital investment, so she would do it this way first, and then sell the finished furniture.","On Saturday morning, Shen Yin planned to go to Yang City, the driver that Xu Xiuhe had arranged for her was already waiting at the bottom of the small building.","Shen Yin had already contacted Kang Liang, Kang Guopeng's son, the night before.","\"Ma'am, shall we go straight to Yang City?\" the driver asked.","\"Go to Rong City University first.\"","Hearing this, the driver started the car. He never dreamed that one day he would be able to drive a luxury car worth hundreds of millions. On his first day of work, Xu Xiuhe had him go to the garage at Ziyue Manor and take out a car.","As the car was approaching Rong City University, Shen Yin made a phone call to Kang Liang.","\"I'm almost there, just wait for me at the university entrance,\" Shen Yin said, then hung up.","\"Mommy, who were you calling?\" Zhengzheng asked.","Shen Yin wanted to say it was a big brother, but she always felt the relationship was a bit off, she calls Kang's parents as aunt and uncle, so Zhengzheng calling Kang Liang as \"big brother\" might not be right.","\"Someone Zhengzheng doesn't know,\" Shen Yin replied.","When the car arrived at the entrance of Rong City University, Shen Yin called again to tell Kang Liang the license plate number.","When Kang Liang pulled up with his suitcase and laptop bag, the driver helped put the luggage in the trunk.","\"Young man, you sit in the front,\" the driver said.","Throughout the journey, there was only the conversation between Shen Yin and Zhengzheng in the car.","Kang Liang felt a bit at a loss, this was the first time he had ridden in a luxury car, and the driver was also being very careful, as this was his first time driving a luxury car out of town.","Kang Liang kept feeling that the woman and child in the back looked familiar. He then took out his phone and checked his previous Weibo posts, only to find that the woman in the back was actually the wife of the president of the Heyuan Group.","How did his parents know such an influential person? After all, the Heyuan Group was a big company, rising to the top in Rong City in just a few years, it was even known nationwide. Kang Liang had been dreaming of working for this company.","Kang Liang calmed down and opened the drama he had been following recently, \"Yan Xi's Legend\", and suddenly realized that the child in the back looked very similar to the child in the drama.","Kang Liang couldn't quite believe it, was the CEO's son acting in a drama?","Kang Liang secretly glanced at the rearview mirror, the more he looked, the more similar they seemed.","\"Hello, stranger.\" Xu Yunzheng smiled and greeted him.","Kang Liang was a bit taken aback by this unique form of address.","Shen Yin also didn't expect Xu Yunzheng to be so lively and polite now, knowing to greet and say hello, although this form of address wasn't really necessary.","Kang Liang turned his head and smiled back, \"Hello.\"","Xu Yunzheng was very excited that the person in front had responded to his greeting, clapping his hands.","\"Is this you?\" Kang Liang pointed to the screen, where Jiang Yu was displayed.","\"Yes, Mommy, look, there's also Zhengzheng on the phone,\" Xu Yunzheng said excitedly, as he had only seen himself on TV, and this was the first time he saw himself on a phone.","\"Good, that's Zhengzheng, Zhengzheng is great,\" Shen Yin said affectionately.","Kang Liang didn't usually watch dramas, but this drama starred Shu Yi, the campus goddess, and his whole dorm had become fans of the adorable child in the drama, his roommate dreaming of having a child like that. They had been searching online for information about this young actor, but couldn't find anything. Now he was seeing the real person, the young master of the Heyuan Group, this would explain why there was no information available online."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Good Culture needs to be Passed On","paragraphs":["Kang Liang heard this and felt a bit excited, as he had actually met the real person.","When the car arrived at Kang Guopeng's house, Kang's mother had already come out to welcome them. Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng out of the car, while Kang Guopeng was sitting in the living room, dressed very formally, looking visibly nervous.","Kang Liang dragged his suitcase and walked to Kang's mother, asking cautiously, \"Mom, how did you get to know them?\"","Kang's mother was startled by the way Kang Liang spoke and wondered if this woman was a swindler.","\"What's wrong, Liang? Is there something wrong with her?\"","Shen Yin was about to enter the house while carrying Zhengzheng, and Kang Liang remained silent when he saw them coming.","\"Auntie,\" Shen Yin called out.","\"Who is this?\" Kang's mother looked at the child in Shen Yin's arms and asked.","\"This is my child,\" Shen Yin answered.","Kang's mother was stunned. She thought this young lady had told her about getting married last time, but it seemed like she was rejected. Yet this time, she brought a child with her.","\"You look so young, not at all like someone who has been married before.\"","\"Mommy is young,\" Zhengzheng chimed in.","\"Oh, this child is so well-behaved and handsome. Come in, everyone.\"","Shen Yin put Zhengzheng down and noticed that the air conditioning was already turned on as they entered the house.","Kang Guopeng stood up, looking visibly uncomfortable.","Shen Yin whispered a few words to Zhengzheng, telling him to behave and not to speak unless asked.","\"I have listed all the details here for you to take a look,\" Shen Yin handed him a document.","Kang Guopeng took it and started reading it.","Kang Liang pulled Kang's mother into the inner room and closed the door, asking, \"Mom, how did you get to know them?\"","Kang's mother looked puzzled. \"Liang, do you mean she's a swindler? I'll go tell your father right away.\"","Kang's mother was about to go out, but Kang Liang grabbed her arm and said, \"She's not a swindler. Her family has assets worth billions. What would they swindle from us?\"","\"Billions of assets?\" Kang's mother couldn't believe it.","\"Yes.\"","\"She took the initiative to find your father and said she wanted to do business with him, to have him make furniture. What does her family do?\"","\"Her husband is the boss of a famous group in Rong City. Her family is in real estate, hotels, and some equipment businesses.\"","\"That's impressive. When she came last time, I even asked her to cook. What should I do now?\" Kang's mother realized her mistake.","Kang Liang also found it unbelievable. \"Mom, do you know that child? The TV series he's acting in is currently popular.\"","Kang's mother felt she hadn't properly entertained them last time and needed to cook more dishes this time.","\"Liang, let's not talk about it anymore. I'll go cook.\" Kang's mother hurried out, and Kang Liang followed her.","Zhengzheng heard the sound of the door opening, turned around, tugged at his pant leg, put his hands beside his head, and smiled. Then he walked over. Kang Liang felt excited, thinking how adorable this little doll was standing in front of him. If he told his roommates about this, they would be so jealous.","\"You mean I can work on furniture at home?\" Kang Guopeng could hardly believe it. He had already prepared to go out, and just a while ago, Kang's mother had told him to take care of himself when living alone and not to miss home. But now he could work at home.","\"Yes, this kind of woodworking cannot be rushed. It requires patience and the ability to endure loneliness, so there aren't many craftsmen like you left. I also know that a set of furniture may take more than half a year to make, so it's not a solution for you and your wife to live apart.\"","\"Miss, why are you so devoted to this kind of furniture? Although one set can sell for hundreds of thousands, it's time-consuming and laborious, not very profitable.\"","\"Not just tens of thousands, at least hundreds of thousands. I also know that although it makes money, when you calculate the time spent, the profit is not that high. But I feel it's a culture that needs to be passed down. You can take a look at the design drawings first.\"","Kang Guopeng took the drawings and examined them carefully. To his surprise, compared to his previous designs, they were not even worth mentioning.","\"Did you draw these?\" Kang Guopeng asked.","\"Yes, they are my original creations. You don't need to worry about plagiarism,\" Shen Yin said.","Kang Guopeng naturally knew that he had never seen such exquisite and ancient furniture designs before. If he could make them, they would definitely find buyers and might even start a trend.","Outstanding culture always needs to be passed down. In museums across the country, there are not many well-preserved ancient furniture pieces made using traditional methods, and almost none of them are exquisite.","Shen Yin based her designs on the furniture she remembered from the mansions of high-ranking officials and the general's mansion, which could be considered elegant.","She approached Kang Guopeng because his craftsmanship was inherited from his ancestors, so he should know many traditional manufacturing methods.","In this fast-paced era, skills and craftsmanship have become increasingly precious.","\"Alright, Miss, you not only have money in mind but also sentiment and a sense of responsibility as a youth of this era. Rest assured, I will follow the drawings and make the furniture with utmost care.\"","Kang Guopeng agreed. It was the first time he had seen such stunning designs. If he could make such exquisite furniture, he would feel a sense of accomplishment. He also understood that the furniture carried a handicraft that was on the verge of being lost.","Meanwhile, Kang Liang had started playing with Zhengzheng. He even thought of taking a photo to show off to his roommates but dismissed the idea, considering it might invade their privacy.","\"What's your name?\" Kang Liang asked.","\"Zhengzheng, Xu Yunzheng.\"","\"And you?\"","Zhengzheng wasn't shy anymore and asked boldly.","\"I'm Kang Liang.\"","\"Like the moon's light?\" Zhengzheng asked.","\"Yes.\" Kang Liang didn't expect such a young child to ask that.","\"Kang Moonlight,\" Zhengzheng said again.","Shen Yin turned around, not quite catching it, and thought Zhengzheng wanted to see the moon.","\"Zhengzheng, there's no moon during the day. We'll look at it tonight.\"","\"Mom, he's called Kang Moonlight.\"","\"Zhengzheng, you should be polite and call him uncle,\" Shen Yin reminded him. She actually wanted Zhengzheng to call Kang Liang \"older brother,\" but with Kang's parents around, it would be confusing the generation order.","If it were before, Kang Liang would be annoyed if someone called him \"uncle,\" but now he was delighted. The adorable little baby in front of him was calling him \"uncle.\"","\"Miss, why don't you have lunch here?\" Kang Guopeng suggested.","Shen Yin actually wanted to go back since the driver was still outside, but after Kang Guopeng, who looked like her great-grandfather, said that, she didn't want to refuse.","\"Okay.\"","After settling the matter, Zhengzheng wanted to go out and play. He had never experienced this kind of house with a small courtyard garden where various vegetables were grown, and he was very curious.","\"Mom, I want to go out and play.\"","\"It's too hot, Zhengzheng. You'll get tanned,\" Shen Yin thought it was too hot outside.","\"I have an umbrella,\" Zhengzheng pointed to the umbrella near the door."]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Sorority","paragraphs":["Shen Yin picked up the umbrella, holding it over Zhengzheng as they entered the vegetable garden. Zhengzheng was delighted to see the tomatoes, cucumbers, and string beans hanging from the vines.","\"Mom, look,\" Zhengzheng exclaimed, jumping up and down.","Shen Yin followed closely behind, worried that Zhengzheng might get sunburned in the scorching midday heat. Yet the child seemed unfazed by the blazing sun.","\"Mom, pick them,\" Zhengzheng said, pointing at the cucumbers.","\"Zhengzheng, we can't pick them. They don't belong to us. But when we get home, Mom will plant some for you, okay?\" Shen Yin patiently coaxed.","\"Okay.\" Zhengzheng reached out to touch the small cucumbers, then turned to caress the little tomatoes. Perhaps feeling the heat, they decided to head back.","Kang's mother watched from the kitchen window, making a mental note of the vegetable garden.","As Shen Yin was leaving, Kang's mother picked some cucumbers and tomatoes and handed them to her. \"Miss, these aren't expensive, but they're homegrown and fresh.\"","\"Thank you,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Thank you, Grandma,\" Zhengzheng echoed.","By the time they arrived in Yang City that afternoon, it was already late. Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng upstairs, and after bathing, she received a call from Xu Xiuhe.","\"I'm almost home. Get ready.\"","Shen Yin dressed Xu Yunzheng in a white shirt with a small tie and black shorts, creating a cute scholarly look. She herself wore a white long dress and low heels, quickly applying only a touch of lipstick before hurrying downstairs with Zhengzheng.","\"I have something to take care of. You can leave once you're done,\" she told Li Huanhuan, who nodded.","Xu Xiuhe's car was parked outside. Shen Yin opened the rear door and got in.","\"Dad, look at the cucumber,\" Xu Yunzheng said, showing Xu Xiuhe the cucumber Shen Yin enjoyed.","\"Is it for Dad to eat?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Xu Yunzheng didn't answer. Instead, he broke the cucumber into three pieces, handing one to Xu Xiuhe and another to Shen Yin.","\"Thank you, Zhengzheng,\" Xu Xiuhe said with a smile.","\"Dad, you don't need to thank Zhengzheng,\" the child replied.","Xu Xiuhe fell silent, while Shen Yin suppressed a laugh, and the corner of Xu Xiuhe's mouth curved upward.","By the time they arrived at Qingfeng Mingyue, several employees had already gathered. Upon seeing Xu Xiuhe, Liu Bo immediately went to greet him. The CEO truly kept his word—he said he would hold a mixer, and here he was, attending his company's employee mixer. What other CEO would do such a thing?","\"CEO, you're here,\" Liu Bo said as he approached.","The family of three, each strikingly attractive, drew a wave of attention.","\"Have you spotted any suitable candidates?\" Xu Xiuhe asked with interest. He had said he wanted to find a partner for Liu Bo.","\"CEO, you're just joking with me,\" Liu Bo responded.","\"I'm serious,\" Xu Xiuhe said matter-of-factly, not sounding like he was joking at all. \"You go ahead and host, then look around. If you see someone suitable, don't miss the chance.\"","Xu Xiuhe's tone was so serious that Shen Yin could no longer hold back her laughter—she had been suppressing it all day.","\"If you want to laugh, then laugh. Don't hold it in; I'll feel bad if you make yourself sick,\" Xu Xiuhe said in a low voice, leaning close to Shen Yin's ear.","Shen Yin felt a flush of heat near her ear and shifted away slightly.","\"Mom, what's wrong?\" Zhengzheng asked, standing nearby.","\"Nothing, Mom's fine,\" Shen Yin replied, smoothing her dress before crouching down to pick up Zhengzheng.","\"Why are you carrying him? That must be tiring,\" Xu Xiuhe commented.","Zhengzheng smiled at Xu Xiuhe, his eyes shining with mischief. \"Dad, Mom is carrying me, not you. Aren't you upset?\"","\"If Dad is upset, what will you do?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Zhengzheng reached out his arms. \"Then since Mom isn't carrying you, I'll carry you instead.\"","Xu Xiuhe took Zhengzheng, thinking to himself, \"Your mom has carried me more times than she's carried you.\"","At the mixer, someone had discreetly taken a photo. The Galaxy Couple's fans had never expected to witness such a sweet moment at a mere mixer.","Worried that his presence might make the employees feel uncomfortable, Xu Xiuhe took his wife and child to a less crowded area.","The venue was full of people, and since it was a mixer, the single men and women weren't idling either. They chatted, observed, and searched for suitable partners.","\"Those two young ladies didn't come?\" Shen Yin asked.","It took Xu Xiuhe a moment to realize she was referring to the two young women who had visited his office. \"What do you think? They're probably out on dates now.\"","\"What's the deal with this Assistant Liu? I think he should be quite popular with the young ladies, but why is he just sitting there eating by himself?\"","Xu Xiuhe looked over and indeed, Liu Bo was sitting alone, eating. The man really didn't know how to seize opportunities. Xu Xiuhe had organized this mixer partly for Liu Bo's sake, yet there he was, missing out.","Xu Xiuhe walked over, naturally drawing a wave of attention as the center of focus.","\"Look, the CEO is actually going to talk to Assistant Liu.\"","\"Speaking of which, Assistant Liu is no spring chicken. Why hasn't anyone from our company pursued him?\"","\"You must not know—the young ladies in our company have always thought Assistant Liu might have an unconventional sexual orientation.\"","\"Liu Bo, what are you doing? I organized this mixer to help you find a partner, and you're just sitting here,\" Xu Xiuhe said as he sat down in a relaxed pose.","\"CEO, I don't think this is really my thing,\" Liu Bo replied.","\"Then what is your thing? Should I start setting you up for blind dates every day after work starting tomorrow?\"","\"...\"","\"Look at Xiao Li'er—take a page from her book.\" Xu Xiuhe felt exasperated. With that, he turned and left. He had done all he could; he couldn't very well force the young ladies to approach Liu Bo for a chat.","Liu Bo looked toward Xiao Li'er in the crowd. Indeed, she seemed to have a thorough understanding of the term \"mixer.\"","Xiao Li'er wore a black minidress and shoes that Liu Bo recognized as a recent purchase.","After Xu Xiuhe left, the atmosphere in the venue noticeably livened up compared to before.","Several men surrounded Xiao Li'er. Liu Bo didn't quite understand—Xiao Li'er was just an ordinary woman. Why were so many men gathered around her?","Oh well, to each their own. Liu Bo raised his glass and took a sip of alcohol.","\"You're the CEO's assistant, right? I'm a manager at a hotel in Rong City Film Town. Can I join you for a drink?\" A woman sat down next to Liu Bo.","\"No, I don't like drinking alcohol,\" Liu Bo replied, his glass still in hand.","\"But you just drank some, didn't you?\" The woman felt a little embarrassed and reluctant to give up.","\"That was then, and this is now. Just because I drank then doesn't mean I want to drink now. Understand?\" Liu Bo raised the glass and took another sip.","The woman spoke up, \"At first, when they said your sexual orientation was unconventional, I didn't believe it. But now I do. Sorry for the disturbance.\" With that, she turned and left."]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: I Have No Parents","paragraphs":["Liu Bo was still standing in the same spot. Just because he didn't drink, that didn't mean there was anything abnormal about his sexual orientation. He was perfectly normal.","\"Miss, are you an employee at the headquarters of the Yuandan Group?\"","\"Yes, that's right. What about it?\" Xiao Li'er asked.","\"So, do you guys get paid pretty well there?\" The gentleman next to Xiao Li'er suddenly became curious.","\"It's alright, I guess.\" Xiao Li'er replied nonchalantly, clearly giving an evasive answer.","She felt that these men all had impure intentions, and they were not as decent as the men she usually associated with. In comparison, Xiao Li'er lost interest.","\"Miss, why don't we exchange WeChat IDs? I think we'd make a great match.\" The man extended his phone.","Xiao Li'er didn't know why, but she had a strange feeling about the way this man was looking at her, and she didn't really want to add him. However, considering this was a social event, adding WeChat was normal, so she reached out and scanned the code.","\"Miss, what do you do at the Yuandan Group headquarters?\" Another person asked.","\"I'm an assistant.\" The man looked a bit dejected, and his expression turned disdainful.","\"What's wrong with being an assistant? Isn't our assistant's work just as valuable? Are assistants somehow inferior?\" Xiao Li'er's tone became a bit sharp. With that, she turned and left.","\"What are you doing here?\" Liu Bo asked, sipping his drink.","\"What, is this your home? Am I not allowed to sit here just because you're sitting here?\" Xiao Li'er was irritated by the comments from those men, and now she was even looking at Liu Bo with distaste.","\"No, no, it's fine, you can sit. Please, have a seat.\" Liu Bo shifted over to make room for Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er sat down, took a couple sips of her drink, and looked at Liu Bo sitting quietly. She said, \"Assistant Liu, why don't you go find a girlfriend? You're almost thirty, don't your family members nag you about it?\"","Liu Bo didn't say anything. He had never known what it was like to have a family. Ever since he could remember, he had been in an orphanage. In college, he refused to accept financial support, working and studying hard instead. After graduation, he just happened to join Xu Xiuhe's company, and that's how he ended up where he was today. But no one had ever pressured him to get married, except for Xu Xiuhe occasionally dangling that carrot.","\"Hmm, what are you thinking about? Don't tell me you're actually...gay? Or are you in love with the CEO?\" Xiao Li'er said jokingly.","Liu Bo shot her a look that could kill.","Xiao Li'er, unafraid, continued, \"Sister, liking men isn't your fault, but you can't go after a married man. The CEO and his wife have such a great relationship, you can't interfere with that.\"","Xiao Li'er was getting increasingly ridiculous, and Liu Bo couldn't take it anymore. \"Xiao Li, shut up.\"","Xiao Li'er closed her mouth.","Liu Bo kept drinking, and Xiao Li'er could see that he was in a bad mood, so she apologized, \"I'm sorry, I didn't mean anything by it earlier. Don't take it too seriously.\"","Liu Bo didn't say anything, he just kept drinking, downing more and more.","At a amusement park in Rongcheng, Shen Yin was holding Zhengzheng's hand as Xu Xiuhe came over with some yogurt and snacks.","It was Zhengzheng's first time at an amusement park, and coincidentally, it was also Shen Yin's first time. As for Xu Xiuhe, the last time he had been to an amusement park was over a decade ago, when he went with his mother.","\"It's so beautiful.\" Zhengzheng gazed at the Ferris wheel spinning round and round.","Shen Yin agreed, marveling at how clever people nowadays were, inventing all these high-tech things.","Seeing the mother and child's excitement, Xu Xiuhe said, \"Do you want to ride the Ferris wheel? Come on, let's all go together.\"","As they were about to board the Ferris wheel, Xu Xiuhe caught sight of a familiar back. The closer he looked, the more familiar it seemed.","Upon closer inspection, sure enough, it was Xue Jingrui. Xue Jingrui also spotted them and turned to greet them.","Walking in front of him was Qi Ji.","\"Pretty sister, little friend.\" Qi Ji greeted them.","\"Qi Ji.\" Shen Yin was pleasantly surprised, not expecting to run into them in the vast city of Rongcheng.","\"Sister, do you have time tomorrow? I've been wanting to have you custom-design a wedding dress for me, but I haven't had a chance to come by yet.\"","\"Sure, just come find me tomorrow.\"","\"Alright, let's go get on the Ferris wheel first.\"","The Ferris wheel was quite large, with enough room for five or six people in each cabin. It worked out perfectly that they could all ride together.","Halfway through the ride, a fireworks show began at the amusement park. Suspended in the air, they had a front-row view of the fireworks blooming and fading in the sky. The fireworks were beautiful, mesmerizing them. Before they knew it, they had reached the highest point, with the nightscape of Rongcheng spread out below.","The fireworks had ended, and Xu Xiuhe was only concerned about his wife and child. But Shen Yin was different - as a woman, her observations and intuitions were more acute. She could sense that the couple in front of them had a different dynamic, not quite like a newly married pair. In fact, their relationship seemed less intimate than her own with Xu Xiuhe. But with them there, she didn't feel comfortable asking outright.","By the time the Ferris wheel brought them back down, Zhengzheng had fallen asleep. Xu Xiuhe didn't linger, quickly saying goodbye to Xue Jingrui and Qi Ji.","\"Goodbye, pretty sister.\"","\"See you tomorrow, Qi Ji.\"","On the way back, Shen Yin asked Xu Xiuhe about the current relationship between Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui.","Xu Xiuhe replied, \"They're married, a husband and wife.\"","Shen Yin...","She would just have to ask them directly tomorrow.","Outside Qingfeng Mingyue, one car after another was leaving, but Xiao Li'er was still sitting on the sofa, watching Liu Bo drink.","Liu Bo had been drinking all night, one glass after another, not quite drunk, but no longer entirely sober either.","\"I'm really sorry, I didn't mean to say those things about you. You're a real man, a gentleman. You don't have to be so petty as to drink yourself silly just because I said a few things.\"","\"No one's been pushing me to get married.\" Liu Bo said listlessly.","Xiao Li'er could hear a hint of sadness in his tone.","\"What, your parents don't nag you about it? You're almost thirty.\"","\"I don't have parents. I'm an orphan.\"","\"I'm sorry, I didn't know.\" Xiao Li'er apologized. She had never coddled a man before, and if she had known the situation earlier, she wouldn't have sat here. Dealing with something like this was better than facing a bunch of distasteful men.","Xiao Li'er suddenly felt pity for Liu Bo. As a woman, her heart had softened. She helped Liu Bo up. \"Let me call you a driver.\"","\"My sexual orientation is normal, I'm not attracted to men. I'm straight. Why does everyone say I'm gay? I'm not gay, I'm straight.\" Liu Bo's words were slurred.","The manager of Qingfeng Mingyue, of course, recognized Liu Bo. Seeing that Liu Bo was drunk, he went over to arrange for someone to take Liu Bo home, but Liu Bo refused."]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Drunk","paragraphs":["Liu Bo was still conscious, and the manager of Qingfeng Mingyue, seeing that Liu Bo had company, tactfully withdrew.","\"Assistant Liu, shall I call you a driver?\" Xiao Li'er asked.","Liu Bo shook his head and staggered over to a car. Xiao Li'er had no choice but to follow him. \"Assistant Liu, that's not your car.\"","Xiao Li'er had seen Liu Bo's car before, and even though she hadn't drunk, she remembered it clearly - Assistant Liu's car was quite a luxury vehicle, but the one he was now leaning against was nothing like it, apart from the color.","\"Assistant Liu? Assistant Liu?\" Xiao Li'er called out several times, but Liu Bo didn't respond.","Xiao Li'er walked up and found that Liu Bo had fallen asleep on the front of the car.","\"Oh, good heavens,\" Xiao Li'er sighed inwardly, wondering why she had to deal with this.","She had no choice but to reach into Liu Bo's pockets, find his car keys, and drive his car. As an assistant, being able to drive was a basic requirement.","Xiao Li'er mustered all her strength and managed to drag Liu Bo into the backseat. She had no idea where Liu Bo lived.","She regretted her earlier suggestion to get him a driver - it would have been better to just leave him at Qingfeng Mingyue instead of having to drive a grown man home in the middle of the night.","Since she couldn't get the information, Xiao Li'er had no choice but to take him back to her own home.","Fortunately, by the time Xiao Li'er reached her apartment, Liu Bo had regained some lucidity and could walk shakily, otherwise she as a woman would have had no way to get this 1.8-meter-tall man inside.","In the Qinghe Residence, Zhengzheng was in her own room, while Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin had gone to bed after some amorous activities, the man not daring to demand more, though somewhat unsatisfied, out of consideration for his wife.","Sunday was a rest day for the studio, with no employees coming in. Xu Xiuhe used to have no weekends, but lately he had been slacking off more and more, occasionally skipping work and passing things on to Liu Bo.","This morning, he had originally planned to have Liu Bo handle some documents, but then he suddenly remembered that Liu Bo had attended a matchmaking event last night, and might need time for a date today, so he abandoned that idea.","Xu Xiuhe arrived at the office much later than usual.","The Heyuan Group had a weekend shift system, with each department having a rotating schedule, and overtime pay being double the normal rate, so many people were willing to work overtime.","When Xu Xiuhe reached the top floor, in the assistant's office area, there were a few assistant staff - Yang Mo, Qin Zhenzhen, and Xiao Li'er.","\"Xiao Li'er, come into my office for a moment.\"","Xiao Li'er instantly became nervous again. Whenever she was called into the boss's office, it was just like being called to the principal's office back in school days, when she hadn't been paying attention in class and done poorly on a test.","\"Chairman, you've summoned me.\"","\"How was the matchmaking event yesterday? Did you make any progress?\"","Xiao Li'er shook her head. The previous participants weren't really suitable, and she hadn't felt comfortable with them. As for the last one, she had just seen Assistant Liu drinking. Speaking of Assistant Liu, she had almost gone crazy last night - it would have been better if he had just stayed asleep the whole time.","\"Alright, then we'll hold more of these events in the future. Make sure to participate actively, you'll find someone eventually.\"","Xiao Li'er: \"...\" If it were up to her, she would never participate in these events again. But the entire assistant team had been registered, so she wondered why she hadn't seen Yang Mo there last night.","\"That's all, you can go now.\" Xu Xiuhe didn't stop her, and Xiao Li'er walked out of the office. When she reached the assistant area, she was just about to ask Yang Mo why she hadn't attended the matchmaking event, when Yang Mo spoke first:","\"Xiao Li'er, your phone has been ringing for a while, is there an emergency?\"","Xiao Li'er quickly grabbed her phone and went to the restroom. She didn't need to check to know who was calling.","\"Hello.\"","\"Come back, immediately, right now.\"","Xiao Li'er looked at the disconnected call and suddenly remembered something - she felt she might not have a good day ahead of her, but this really wasn't her fault.","\"Momo, there's a family matter I need to attend to, I'm going home first.\"","\"Go ahead, go ahead. Assistant Liu isn't here today anyway, so you won't be caught.\"","Xiao Li'er...","She felt she had never rushed home so quickly before. If only she had gotten up earlier, she wouldn't have to be in such a hurry, she could have just washed up and clocked in on time. She had forgotten that last night, she had tied Liu Bo up, and didn't release him this morning. Unfortunately, there were no \"ifs\" - what she was about to face, she didn't even dare imagine.","Xiao Li'er's apartment was small, a one-bedroom one-living room one-bathroom single-person unit, paid for by her parents when she first started working. Now she was still paying the mortgage every month.","Xiao Li'er felt a bit anxious. How could she have forgotten about this in the morning? She had just been thinking that the drunk person might sleep in a bit longer, and never thought about untying Liu Bo.","In the bedroom, Liu Bo was lying on Xiao Li'er's bed, wrapped in what seemed to be a sheet or blanket, and bound with several ropes. He was completely immobilized, and could only use voice commands on his smart device to make a call. To be honest, when he woke up, he was completely bewildered, not knowing how he had ended up in this strange room. If it weren't for the photo of Xiao Li'er on the bedside table, he would have thought he had been kidnapped.","But now, this was no different from being kidnapped - he was wrapped up and completely unable to move.","Xiao Li'er cautiously pushed open the door and saw the angry look in Liu Bo's eyes, feeling a bit too timid to approach.","\"Stop standing there, hurry up and untie me,\" Liu Bo said, looking at Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er walked to the bed and untied the ropes around his upper body, allowing Liu Bo to move a bit, though he was still wrapped in the sheet.","Xiao Li'er then quickly untied the ropes on his thighs and calves, then immediately ran back to the door, keeping a safe distance.","\"Is that it?\" Liu Bo was still struggling, as the sheet was wrapped around him in multiple layers, and he felt utterly humiliated.","Xiao Li'er hurriedly went back to help Liu Bo unwrap the sheet.","\"What did I do to deserve being tied up with three ropes?\" Liu Bo asked.","Xiao Li'er didn't dare say a word. He hadn't really done anything, he had just had a drunken outburst, sitting on the table in the living room crying, clinging to her arm like a child, going to the bathroom without closing the door, and even taking off his shirt, complaining that it smelled bad.","Last night, she had been completely at a loss - this was the first time she had seen someone have such a drunken fit, and as a proper young lady, she couldn't tolerate him being undressed, so she had coaxed him into wrapping up in the sheet."]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Custom Toasting Dress","paragraphs":["At the Qinghe Villa, Shen Yin brought Zhengzheng upstairs to check on the ready-to-wear dresses, waiting for customers to come pick them up.","Shen Yin was not busy at the moment. Under her management, the clothing studio was running smoothly, taking orders regularly. She would sometimes give Wang Nannan some suggestions, and she would also take a look at the fabric selection. The customers were quite satisfied.","The furniture studio was temporarily paused. Master Kang was slowly working on it, and Shen Yin couldn't help much now. She couldn't just spend every day taking care of Zhengzheng without anything else to do.","There was no one else in the store, so Shen Yin thought that if any customers came to pick up dresses, and she was not downstairs, they might be confused. So she brought Zhengzheng downstairs to play.","The five Tibetan mastiffs at the entrance were lined up. Shen Yin was really afraid that the customers would be scared off by the dogs.","And they did scare someone - Qi Ji, who stood far away at the entrance, didn't dare to come in. But Xue Jingrui walked in front, and Qi Ji followed behind him step by step.","Seeing the little girl so frightened, Shen Yin asked the dogs to scatter a bit, not blocking the entrance.","Except for Huahua, the other four dogs understood, and Qi Ji felt a bit more at ease.","\"Pretty sister,\" Qi Ji called out.","\"Qi Ji is here,\" Shen Yin responded.","Xue Jingrui and Shen Yin weren't very familiar, so he said a bit stiffly, \"Sister-in-law, please bring her upstairs to get a wedding toast dress. Will it be ready by next Friday's wedding?\"","\"It will be ready. Qi Ji, come up with me, let me take your measurements.\"","Shen Yin led Zhengzheng, who was a bit slow climbing the stairs, but Zhengzheng just kept smiling at Qi Ji.","Qi Ji couldn't resist, and reached out his hand. Zhengzheng actually held Qi Ji's hand. With one hand holding his mother and the other holding Qi Ji, climbing the stairs became much easier for him - he's so smart.","The stairs were wide enough, and Qi Ji, who normally liked children, was a bit excited to be in such close contact with the well-behaved child.","\"Zhengzheng, please sit here, while Mommy takes the measurements for the aunt, okay?\"","Zhengzheng nodded and climbed onto the sofa, the movement a bit difficult, with his right leg first, then the left, finally sitting up.","Shen Yin went to get the tape measure, but Qi Ji was entranced by Zhengzheng's every movement, like a little adult, trying to lean on the sofa but unable to, his legs just dangling.","The cute baby tried several times before giving up, his legs swinging back and forth. He was only sitting on the very edge of the sofa.","So adorable, Qi Ji realized for the first time how thoughtful children could be. When she drew babies before, she often lacked inspiration, but now she felt like she knew how to draw them.","\"Do you like children?\" Shen Yin noticed Qi Ji's eyes never leaving Zhengzheng.","Qi Ji shyly nodded.","\"If you like them, have one. Sometimes taking care of them can be tiring, but often they can also heal me.\"","Qi Ji's smile faded. She really wanted a baby, but she and Xue Jingrui's marriage was arranged, without love, so they couldn't have a child. This wish seemed so distant, maybe in the future.","\"What's wrong, don't want one?\" Shen Yin asked.","Qi Ji felt that Sister Shuyi and this sister in front of her were both very warm and understanding, even though she had only met them a couple of times, there was a certain charm that drew her in without hurting her.","\"I feel now is not the time. Jingrui and I had an arranged marriage, no love, he still has someone he likes. So I treat him as a brother for now. When the family business is stable, we'll get a peaceful divorce.\"","Shen Yin wanted to say something, but each person's situation is different, she didn't know how to advise this young lady about arranged marriages and marriage issues as an experienced person.","In fact, Qi Ji understood that arranged marriages rarely have good outcomes. Her parents had an arranged marriage, polite and distant, with no love, just a familial affection.","Since that's the case, it's better for her to treat Jingrui as a brother from the start, so there won't be any awkwardness after the divorce.","\"Matters of the heart should be natural. You're still young, don't think too much. If you're bored, you can come play with Zhengzheng anytime.\"","\"Really, sister?\" Qi Ji smiled.","Shen Yin nodded.","\"What style of wedding toast dress do you like?\"","\"A nice one,\" Qi Ji said with a smile. She hadn't been married before, so she didn't really know.","\"Should we ask Xue Jingrui?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xue Jingrui was sitting downstairs, looking at the decor, feeling it was quite nice. When he turned around, he was attracted to a red wedding dress across the room.","The wedding dress was beautiful, with a unique style. Especially the embroidery, so vivid, every stitch, every thread, outlining a kind of beauty.","Xue Jingrui didn't understand much, but he felt the embroidery stitches were fine and the colors were elegant. Against the red background, it was stunning. What was remarkable was that the embroidery was not just a little bit, but a lot, large and small, decorating the wedding dress.","[Xiuhe, the wedding dresses in this shop are so exquisite, where did they get them custom-made?]","[Jingrui, are you stupid? Look at what kind of shop you're in, and you're asking where they got the custom-made?] Chang Zhiyuan replied.","[Clothes are clothes, embroidery is embroidery. Look at this embroidery, it's so beautiful, even I, who know nothing about it, can see it.] Xue Jingrui said, and even took a close-up photo of the embroidery and sent it to the group.","[Zhiyuan is right, you don't even look at what kind of shop you're in, and you don't look at whose wife runs the shop.] Xu Xiuhe said proudly, he hadn't realized how beautiful the wedding dress was before, but thinking about it, his wife did come from ancient times, of course the embroidery would be extraordinary.","[...]","[...]","[By the way, did you go order the wedding toast dress?] Chang Zhiyuan asked.","[Yes, they went upstairs. By the way, Xiuhe, why do you have so many dogs at the entrance, and they're all Tibetan mastiffs? I'm scared just looking at them, Qi Ji didn't even dare to come in, won't it affect the sister-in-law's business? People have to go around.]","[Did you see it interfere? Did the mastiffs bite you?] Xu Xiuhe retorted.","[Jingrui, this is where you don't understand, you can never underestimate a woman's love for beauty. For beauty, they'll go through fire and brimstone, as long as the sister-in-law's work is good, even if there were ten dogs at the entrance instead of five, people would still come to place orders.]","This point Xu Xiuhe agreed with, he was now worried every day that his wife was working too hard. If it's really necessary, should he buy a few more?"]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Painting","paragraphs":["Shen Yin agreed to help Qi Ji with the wedding attire, so she wouldn't pass this task to anyone else.","From that afternoon, she started drawing designs. Since she had never worked on wedding attire before, she referred to a lot of materials for reference.","On a summer afternoon, the sun was scorching hot, and it was just Shen Yin and Zhengzheng in the studio. While Zhengzheng was still taking a nap, Shen Yin looked through many design sketches and information about wedding attire.","Since it wasn't a traditional Chinese wedding, Shen Yin used bolder colors, breaking away from the traditional red. She chose a champagne color, which looked elegant and dignified.","The first thing Zhengzheng said when he woke up was \"I'm thirsty.\" Shen Yin had already prepared the afternoon tea, as it was easy to get dehydrated in the summer heat.","Zhengzheng had been napping in the living room, and when he woke up, he saw Shen Yin sitting in front of the computer, so he got up and went to her side. Shen Yin stood up, picked up the fruit tea on the table, and handed it to Zhengzheng, who gulped it down.","\"Zhengzheng, after you finish your drink, would you like to read some books? Do you still remember the poem your mother asked you to recite last time?\"","Zhengzheng's eyes rolled as he thought for a moment, then recited: \"Bright moonlight before my bed, I wonder if it's frost on the ground. Lifting my head, I see the bright moon, Lowering my head, I think of my distant home.\"","He recited it smoothly, without any hesitation, and even his pronunciation of the ambiguous parts was accurate. Shen Yin was very satisfied. The little baby was small, but his memory was excellent. Whether it was from Xu Xiuhe or the original host, he seemed to have inherited both.","Shen Yin realized she needed to get to know this little baby better. He was smart, and his brain worked quickly, which she had overlooked. She decided she could occasionally teach Zhengzheng to recite poems and recognize characters in the future.","\"Zhengzheng, do you enjoy reciting poems?\"","\"Yes, it's fun.\"","\"Then let's do more of it in the future, okay?\"","\"Okay.\"","Seeing Zhengzheng's quick agreement, Shen Yin brought several books from the bottom of the TV cabinet to the carpet.","Xu Yunzheng was also happy to join. After finishing his drink, he put down the cup, walked to the carpet, sat down, and started reading the books.","Shen Yin felt relieved. \"Zhengzheng, Mommy will learn with you.\"","Shen Yin had looked at many styles of wedding attire and had her own inspiration. The wedding attire should be convenient and easy to move in, as it would be worn during the toast ceremony. It couldn't be too revealing when facing the elders.","After thinking for a while, she finally put pen to paper.","In just over two hours, Shen Yin's design sketch was complete, and she could start sewing tomorrow. Zhengzheng had stopped looking at the books and was playing with the toys on the carpet. Shen Yin looked over and just watched him quietly.","The sun outside was setting, and the golden evening glow from the window shone on Zhengzheng. The warm and beautiful scene captivated Shen Yin, and she picked up her pencil and started sketching a few strokes on an A4 paper.","Shen Yin had never drawn this kind of pencil portrait before, but she felt something guiding her, stroke by stroke. The Zhengzheng she drew turned out surprisingly beautiful.","Suddenly, a thought occurred to her. She could use her pencil to record Zhengzheng's growth. In this high-tech era, a series of drawings might be more precious than photos.","\"Zhengzheng, look, who is this?\" Shen Yin held up the A4 paper and walked over to Zhengzheng, pointing at the drawing.","Zhengzheng immediately smiled and pointed at the drawing, saying, \"It's me, Zhengzheng! Zhengzheng looks so good!\"","Xu Yunzheng stood up and swayed back and forth, his little bottom wiggling.","\"Yes, our Zhengzheng looks so good,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Yunzheng became even happier after the praise, giggling with delight.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng is hungry,\" the little child's mood changed quickly, and he now pouted his lips.","\"Then Mommy will go make dinner. Zhengzheng, be good.\"","Just as Shen Yin was about to go to the kitchen, Xu Xiuhe came in.","\"You're home so early today?\"","\"It's the weekend, so I came back early to spend time with you,\" Xu Xiuhe said as he entered the kitchen.","\"I can handle this. You go keep Zhengzheng company in the living room for a while. I'm a bit worried about him being out there alone.\"","Xu Xiuhe complied, hugging Shen Yin from behind for a few seconds before going to the living room.","\"Has Zhengzheng been missing his dad?\"","\"Yes.\"","Xu Xiuhe sat down and watched Zhengzheng playing with the toy cars on the carpet, unable to move them on the rug.","\"Zhengzheng, the cars can't move well on the carpet.\"","Xu Xiuhe took the car and placed it on the wooden floor next to the carpet.","\"Zhengzheng knows, but Zhengzheng just wants the car to run on the carpet,\" Xu Yunzheng said, putting the car back on the carpet.","\"Is this you, Zhengzheng?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, picking up the drawing, pretending not to know.","Xu Xiuhe looked at the A4 paper in his hand. The drawing was simple, just Zhengzheng sitting on the carpet, but the details were exquisite and delicate. He was the only one at home other than Shen Yin, so he knew his wife was truly a master of all trades, capable both intellectually and domestically. Xu Xiuhe felt fortunate to have married Shen Yin, but also worried that he wasn't worthy of her.","For the first time in twenty-seven years, he felt a sense of inferiority.","With this realization, Xu Xiuhe went back to the kitchen.","\"Why are you here again? Shouldn't you be keeping Zhengzheng company?\"","\"My dear wife, do you dislike me? Do you not want to see me?\"","Shen Yin was perplexed. She wiped her hands and placed her palm on Xu Xiuhe's forehead, asking, \"You don't have a fever. What are you saying?\"","\"Nonsense!\" Xu Xiuhe emphasized the word, always quick to seize the key point.","Upon hearing this, the corners of Xu Xiuhe's mouth involuntarily curved upwards.","\"My dear, let me help you.\"","This time, Shen Yin didn't refuse.","\"That drawing was really beautiful.\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"The Zhengzheng in the drawing is so lifelike.\"","\"I want to learn oil painting and use Zhengzheng as my model, giving him a new painting every month.\"","\"Great, I'll buy you an easel and art supplies tomorrow.\"","\"I can buy them myself.\"","\"What's mine is yours. It's only natural for me to buy them for you.\"","Shen Yin's heart was filled with sweetness. Although she hadn't expressed it out loud, she had fallen completely for Xu Xiuhe. This man was too good to her, pampering her, buying her all kinds of clothes and bags, surprising her from time to time, caring for her every day, and considering her needs.","Perhaps such a husband's actions towards his wife were ordinary and common, but for Shen Yin, she was already extremely contented. She didn't ask for anything else, only wishing that the people she cared about could live safely and peacefully."]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: The Wedding","paragraphs":["The faint morning light painted the sky with rosy hues. Shen Yin and Zhengzheng looked fresh and neat, dressed in matching parent-child outfits.","Xu Xiuhe glanced at their attire and chose a coordinating color himself. As it was Friday, he had taken the day off to attend his good friend's wedding.","The family of three arrived early at the Qingfeng Mingyue Hotel. Xue Jingrui's social status in Rong City ensured that his wedding would be grand. With a mother who was an entrepreneur and a father who held a prominent position in the city government, the wedding guest list included not only business and government figures but also members of the media.","\"You go find Shu Yi and Qi Ji first. I'll take Zhengzheng to see Jingrui,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin obtained Qi Ji's room number from Shu Yi. Since Qi Ji's family lived in Yang City, they didn't have time to travel from home to the wedding venue. Moreover, they had already registered their marriage, so the wedding ceremony was held directly at the hotel.","When Shen Yin reached Qi Ji's room and knocked on the door, Yan Yan answered.","Yan Yan was slightly excited to see Shen Yin; it had been a long time since they last met. She was genuinely grateful to Shen Yin for helping her secure her current job.","Before Yan Yan could speak, Shen Yin said, \"I've come to see them.\"","Qi Ji was having his makeup done by a top makeup artist in the industry. The bridal makeup had to be perfect, tailored to suit Qi Ji's unique style. It wasn't the typical bridal makeup template; at first glance, it seemed almost like a transformation.","\"All done. Next, I'll help you into the wedding dress,\" the makeup artist said.","The wedding dress was also custom-made, designed by a renowned foreign designer. Each gown cost millions, and the veil was a bit long, making it difficult for the makeup artist to handle alone. Seeing this, Shu Yi stepped in to help.","\"It looks gorgeous. Today, our darling Qi Ji is the most beautiful in the world,\" Shu Yi praised.","The pure white wedding dress was truly stunning, and Shu Yi couldn't help but feel a twinge of envy, though Qi Ji seemed indifferent; this was merely a formality for her.","\"Thank you, Sister Shu Yi,\" Qi Ji thanked.","Shu Yi chose the bridesmaids' dresses, opting for the most basic style so as not to outshine the bride.","\"It's almost time. Is the bride ready?\" someone outside called.","\"Yes, I'm ready.\"","Qi Ji held a bouquet of flowers, with Shu Yi and Yan Yan trailing behind her.","Shen Yin followed beside them, and Shu Yi handed the wedding ring to her. Everything proceeded according to the schedule.","At 10:38, the doors of the venue were tightly shut, but they could still hear the voice of the host, a famous presenter from Rong City Television, conducting the wedding ceremony.","\"In the accompaniment of this beautiful and romantic wedding march, at this moment of happiness, we will witness this love. With a glance, we are all waiting for someone, the person loved by the groom Xue Jingrui, she is called Qi Ji. I think at this moment, we are all witnessing a miracle, two people in love, with outstanding talents and beauty, will step into the hall of marriage. Just like when I first saw you in the crowd, you were alone and beautiful, and from then on, the beautiful bride walked into the groom's heart, and love became the only thing. Next, please welcome the bride.\"","The door opened, and the spotlight shone on Qi Ji. Blue light, white wedding dress. Qi Ji appeared in the sight of the public like a princess.","Stunning everyone, including the groom. Qi Ji wore a crown, and the diamonds on the crown, under the light, reflected dazzling brilliance. The pearls and diamonds on the wedding dress echoed each other, and Qi Ji exuded light all over.","The wedding dress was heavy, the crown not light. Qi Ji's steps were small but steady, considering Shu Yi and Shen Yin dragging the train behind her, she walked slowly, but even more dignified.","When Qi Ji was close to a circular stage, the host said, \"Please bride, take your father's arm.\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Ji freed her left hand, holding flowers in her right hand, and linked her left arm with her father's.","The music style in the venue suddenly changed, from romantic to warm now, the music was very healing. Qi Ji was a sensitive person, she didn't feel much when she got the marriage certificate, but now listening to the music, linking her father's arm, her heart was unexpectedly filled with reluctance. From today on, she would have a different identity, leaving the Qi family, having her own life. She knew all this when she got the certificate, but the sense of ceremony turned out to be so important. At this moment, she felt that she was getting married. Tears slowly gathered in her eyes, just on the verge of flowing down.","Qi Ji walked slowly with her father, the wedding dress trailing on the stage, needing no one to care for it.","Shen Yin, Shu Yi, and Shen Yan walked to the front of the groom's stage from the other side of the stage, the venue was large, accommodating nearly a thousand people.","From the moment Qi Ji opened the door, it was extremely quiet, and now it was even quieter.","\"Next, please let the father hand over the bride's hand to the groom.\"","Qi's father did as instructed, Xue Jingrui took Qi Ji's hand from Qi's father, Qi Ji turned around, facing the guests.","Qi's father walked down and sat on a chair.","Shu Yi and Shen Yan immediately pulled their skirts to the back.","The cameras clicked, recording this scene.","\"The bride and groom exchange rings.\"","Shu Yi handed over the rings.","Xue Jingrui put the ring on Qi Ji's finger, and Qi Ji also put the ring on Xue Jingrui's finger.","\"Next, please let the groom kiss the bride.\"","Both Xue Jingrui and Qi Ji's hearts skipped a beat, they both forgot about this part. They hadn't even held hands yet, and now they had to kiss in front of so many people.","As time passed, the host felt a bit embarrassed, still wondering why they hadn't kissed yet and how he could salvage the situation. Suddenly, Xue Jingrui lowered his head and whispered, \"Is it okay?\"","Qi Ji didn't respond.","Xue Jingrui gently held the back of Qi Ji's head and softly kissed her lips.","Qi Ji was bewildered; this was unexpected for her.","Then the host spoke for a long time, and suddenly it was the bridesmaid's turn. He could see it now, the bridesmaid of the bride was actually the currently popular female celebrity.","It was unexpected that such a popular female celebrity would attend the wedding and act as a bridesmaid.","But upon closer thought, it was quite normal. This wedding was unusual, a power couple joining forces. With Shu Yi's appearance, her popularity would rise again, and people in the circle would also know that there was really someone behind Shu Yi.","Shu Yi stepped onto the stage, she had chosen the most ordinary bridesmaid dress, but still couldn't hide her temperament.","\"Hello, everyone, I'm very happy to be Qi Ji's bridesmaid at this wedding today. Although I haven't known Qi Ji for long, in my heart, she's like a little princess. She's simple, kind, always thinking of others. She's shy, adorable, always wanting to take responsibility. Today, sending her off, my greatest wish is that in the days to come, there will be someone to love her, cherish her, not let her down, and still treat her like a little princess, making her the only one, being the most carefree little girl.\"","Qi Ji was very moved because she knew that what Shu Yi said was all true. Shu Yi didn't mention Xue Jingrui throughout, but everywhere she reminded Xue Jingrui to treat her well. Shu Yi knew their relationship with Xue Jingrui, naturally understood that there was no love between them, so the best wishes were all expressed."]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: I took It.","paragraphs":["The groomsman delivered a speech, followed by the groom's vow, and the host omitted no step.","The wedding proceeded smoothly, with most of the guests below offering their blessings, except for a few.","Qi Yan was among those few. She didn't want to come, did she have to witness in person the man who once adored her marrying someone else?","The more glamorous the wedding, the angrier Qi Yan became. Qi's father Qi Shengwu, seated on the other side, also looked displeased. He had intended for his daughter to marry Xue Jingrui, which would help advance his own official career. If possible, he could even scheme a little to push Xue Kai aside.","But unexpectedly, Xue Kai had his son get married, and the bride was from the Qi family of Yang City, sharing the same surname \"Qi\". Why couldn't he marry his own daughter Qi Yan? Didn't Qi Yan say that Xue Jingrui liked her?","The more he thought about it, the angrier he became. When he received the Xue family's wedding invitation and learned that Xue Jingrui was marrying into the Qi family of Yang City, he smashed the cup in his hand onto the floor. When he asked Qi Yan, she already knew about this news.","He was even angrier.","He was the last to know, so how could he stop it?","When attending the wedding, Qi Shengwu brought Qi Yan along, dressing her up prettily. During the final segment when the bride was supposed to call out \"change of vows,\" he wanted Qi Yan to act frail, make an appearance, and incidentally make this wedding a hot topic. Since they were already married, and the situation couldn't be changed, he might as well let the Xue family's reputation hit rock bottom and give Xue Jingrui the persona of a heartbreaker.","\"Please have the groom escort the bride towards the front.\"","Qi Yan stood up. What her father asked her to do was also what she wanted. Why? Why did they treat her like this? If she was alive, no one would have an easy life.","From the beginning, Shen Yin had noticed Qi Yan, the young lady dressed particularly beautifully. Earlier, Shen Yin had intentionally stood in front of the young lady, blocking her view.","It wasn't until the wedding ceremony was about to end that she sat in the back row of guest seats. As soon as she sat down, Qi Yan stood up, so it seemed Qi Yan had deliberately avoided her.","Shen Yin wanted to see what Qi Yan intended to do, but two seconds later, she realized she couldn't just sit still.","Qi Yan was brewing with emotions, her face contorted, looking as if she was about to cry, as she took small steps towards the stage.","Shen Yin quickly went forward. Shu Yi, standing on the stage, had just noticed Qi Yan and felt a pang in her heart, wondering if she should go down and stop her. But given her own special status, and as a bridesmaid, going down would certainly draw attention. It wouldn't be good if this turned into another hot topic by accident.","Fortunately, Shen Yin had gone over. Shu Yi finally breathed a sigh of relief, otherwise the consequences of Qi Yan, that woman, making a scene would be unimaginable.","Damn, how could there be such a shameless woman? Shu Yi was furious. Earlier, Qi Yan had that pitiful look on her face as she walked over, as if someone had snatched her boyfriend.","No wonder Qi Ji, the young bride, felt guilty when they first met, thinking she had intruded on someone else's relationship.","Shu Yi felt a bit ashamed of herself. If her acting skills were as good as Qi Yan's, an Oscar would be hers sooner or later. No, she should say, not giving Qi Yan an Oscar for her superb acting skills would be an injustice.","\"Are you feeling unwell?\" Shen Yin approached and held Qi Yan's arm, asking with apparent sincerity. Qi Yan could act, and she could too.","Qi Yan turned her head, snapping back to reality, trying to break free from her grip. But her strength was no match for Shen Yin's. After all, even though this body of Shen Yin's was weaker, she could still easily handle this frail woman before her.","The expression on Qi Yan's face was no longer the pitiful, dejected look from before, but rather anger and unwillingness to accept.","Shen Yin didn't care what Qi Yan was thinking and continued, \"There's a tea room outside. Let me accompany you to have some hot water. I'm thirsty too.\"","Qi Yan glared at Shen Yin, her eyes filled with murderous intent. \"I'm not thirsty, you can go by yourself.\"","Shen Yin's expression had already turned indifferent, showing no emotion as she said slowly, \"I'm thirsty, so just come with me.\"","Deep down, Shen Yin was also afraid, afraid that Qi Yan would lose her temper and make a scene. So she stayed close to Qi Yan, gripping her arm tightly. If Qi Yan dared to speak up, she could knock her out with a punch from behind.","Qi Yan couldn't break free. She hadn't had much contact with Shen Yin before, but she hated Shen Yin intensely. She thought this woman, being younger than her, had a carefree attitude and wouldn't meddle in anything.","At this moment, although Shen Yin showed no expression, Qi Yan felt a sense of oppression.","She admitted she was afraid. Her arm was completely immobilized.","Qi Shengwu had been watching for a while, and when he saw that Qi Yan still hadn't made any move, he became a bit anxious and looked around.","He saw his daughter and another woman standing together, appearing quite intimate, and assumed they were plotting something, so he felt relieved.","Just as Qi Shengwu sat down, ready to watch the show, Shen Yin took Qi Yan out of the venue and into the tea room outside.","\"What do you want to do? Why did you have to drag me here?\" Qi Yan's anger had reached its peak. Her own matter wasn't settled yet, and she was interrupted. Earlier in the hall, she held back out of concern for appearances, but now, with only the two of them, she had to get an explanation.","\"Shouldn't I be asking you that question, Miss Qi? What did you intend to do?\" Shen Yin remained calm and composed, still appearing indifferent, leaning against the bar counter.","Qi Yan felt a little guilty but tried to remain composed. \"I didn't intend to do anything. It's you who insisted on dragging me here. I'll let it go since you're Xiu He's mother.\"","Shen Yin was amused by her shamelessness.","\"You call him Xiu He? So you know I'm his son's mother too.\" Shen Yin curved her lips, folding her arms.","\"I knew Xiu He before you did. He still has me in his heart, it's you who snatched him from me.\" Qi Yan argued.","\"Oh? I snatched him from you? He has you in his heart?\" Shen Yin raised her eyebrows.","\"Yes, you snatched him. He even went abroad to pursue me back then. He definitely has me in his heart.\" Qi Yan defended herself.","\"Hahahahahahaha, so I snatched him. What can you do about it? He's my husband now, the father of my child. What, do you regret it?\" Shen Yin stood up and walked towards Qi Yan, looking at her as she spoke.","\"Xiu He must have been deceived by you.\"","\"How did I deceive him? Tell me.\"","\"You must have seduced him.\"","\"Sister, are you sure he has you in his heart? If he really did, why would he marry me? If he was truly infatuated with you, why would he only pursue you once? He pursued you to save face. You rejected him, so I should be thanking you.\""]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: She's Gone Mad","paragraphs":["\"You...\" Qi Yan was at a loss for words, realizing she had underestimated this woman. Qi Yan felt a twinge of regret.","\"Me? What about me? I know I'm pretty, but thanks for the reminder. Thank you for the compliment,\" Shen Yin flicked her hair coquettishly, saying.","\"You shameless!\"","Shen Yin pretended to ponder for a few seconds before saying, \"My face is so beautiful, why would I need another one? Or perhaps you have multiple faces, each different.\"","Unable to retort, Qi Yan grew genuinely angry, staring at Shen Yin's face before her, so strikingly attractive. She felt jealousy creeping in, even entertaining the thought of ruining that face, raising her hand as if to strike.","Shen Yin grabbed Qi Yan's hand, applying some force, causing Qi Yan to grimace in pain.","\"See, now this face has changed again. Where did that pitiful face from the wedding venue go?\" Shen Yin leaned in close to Qi Yan, lifting her other hand.","Shen Yin grasped it again.","\"What were you trying to do at the wedding venue? A woman should not be so wicked, meddling in others' marriages. In ancient times, one would be punished with a pig basket.\"","\"Jing Rui likes me, not that woman outside who stole him,\" Qi Yan yelled hoarsely.","\"Oh, I see. Xiu He also likes you, Jing Rui also likes you. Does every man in the world like you? Men's eyes may be blind for a moment, but not forever. If Jing Rui liked you, where were you earlier? Now, I still have to thank you, on behalf of Qi Ji.\"","Shen Yin released Qi Yan's hand, lowered her head, and toyed with her fingers, taking a step back and leaning lazily on the bar as if the recent events had nothing to do with her.","Qi Yan grew impatient; she had to leave. Failing to accomplish what her father had entrusted her with meant her allowance would likely be reduced again.","As Qi Yan turned to leave, Shen Yin pulled her back. Qi Yan lowered her head, biting Shen Yin's arm.","Shen Yin winced, using her other arm to forcefully lift Qi Yan's mouth off. Losing her balance, Qi Yan sat down.","The door to the tea room opened, and Xiu He stood at the doorway, holding Zhengzheng.","Qi Yan seemed to see a savior, tears streaming down her face as she looked at Xiu He pitifully, \"Xiu He, look at her, she bullied me, she pushed me to the ground.\"","Shen Yin sighed, ran her hand through her hair, and hugged her arm, curious to see Xiu He's reaction. If he even slightly showed concern or blamed her, she would dare to file for divorce immediately.","Xiu He's initial reaction was to ask Shen Yin, \"Are you hurt?\"","Then, Xiu He noticed the bite mark on Shen Yin's arm, feeling a pang of heartache. He was afraid she would be in pain; every time they were intimate, he restrained himself from biting, but now, such a deep bite mark.","\"Does it hurt?\" Xiu He didn't dare to put Zhengzheng down, so he could only hold Zhengzheng with one hand while reaching for Shen Yin's arm with the other, examining the wound. The bite mark was quite deep, with faint traces of blood.","\"Mom, it hurts,\" Xu Yunzheng grimaced, then turned to look at Qi Yan on the ground and muttered, \"Bad woman.\"","Xiu He cast a sharp glance over.","\"Xiu He, you have to believe me, I didn't mean it, it's all my fault. I'm sorry to your sister,\" the woman sat on the ground, teary-eyed, continuing to feign fragility.","\"Nonsense, of course it's your fault. Even if she slapped you, you can't retaliate. Moreover, she is my wife, not your sister. You'd better behave yourself, biting people, you're more like a dog than a dog,\" Xiu He's tone was cold.","Qi Yan knew he was angry. But she still couldn't accept it: \"Xiu He, do you really not have me in your heart anymore? It was all my fault before. I shouldn't have left you alone to go abroad. I'm back now, we can start over.\"","Xiu He: \"Are you crazy?\"","Shen Yin was quite satisfied with Xiu He's reaction. At least, this man now was still worth her trust.","Shen Yin squatted down halfway: \"What doesn't belong to you, don't yearn for it every day. What isn't yours, you'll never get in the end. If Qi Ji is unhappy, you won't have it easy either.\"","After saying that, Shen Yin stood up. Qi Yan sat blankly on the ground, pondering what \"doesn't belong to her\" meant. As long as she wanted it, she must obtain it.","Qi Yan gritted her teeth, clenched her fists, and stood up.","Shen Yin walked out, Xiu He carried Xu Yunzheng and followed Shen Yin out.","\"Wife, does it hurt? I'll ask the waiter to bring some alcohol,\" Xiu He knew this was his responsibility, he came late and didn't protect Shen Yin well.","\"It's okay,\" Shen Yin said so, but in fact, she always repaid every grievance. She wouldn't let herself suffer a bit. Just now, she hit Qi Yan's chin with her elbow, and most likely, Qi Yan's mouth wouldn't open tomorrow morning.","Shen Yin rubbed her elbow. She had used some force just now, and her elbow was a bit sore.","\"What's wrong? Did she hit you elsewhere?\" Xiu He asked worriedly.","\"No, when I hit her just now, I used some force,\" Shen Yin turned her head to look at Xiu He's expression. She was testing, testing Xiu He's feelings for her, and the extent of his indulgence towards her.","Xiu He: \"!!!\"","\"Next time, when I strike, you tell me beforehand, I'll do it,\" Xiu He answered seriously.","\"Phew,\" Shen Yin felt she had won the gamble. He would feel sorry for her, not blame her.","\"Mom, I'll help you,\" Xu Yunzheng interjected.","Both of them had forgotten there was a baby in their arms.","\"Zhengzheng, we can't easily resort to violence,\" Shen Yin said.","\"But she's a bad woman, she bit Mom,\" Xu Yunzheng looked at the teeth marks on Shen Yin's arm.","\"If a dog bites us, should we bite back? We don't stoop to the level of bad people. We only resort to violence for self-defense, when it's absolutely necessary. Normally, when encountering bad people, we can find the police,\" Shen Yin's voice was warm and gentle, very different from her tone in the tea room just now.","In fact, she had several faces. Depending on who she was facing, if someone hurt someone she cared about, don't blame her for not showing mercy.","\"Dog? Dogs bite me, dogs have fur, I can't bite back. Mom, next time let Hua Hua bite back. Dad, bring Hua Hua next time. Let Hua Hua bite the woman badly.\" Xu Yunzheng glanced at Shen Yin, then at Xu Xiu He.","Shen Yin finally understood that Zhengzheng could also seize on words. He didn't hear anything about calling the police; his focus was solely on the dog biting incident. This point, probably, was influenced by Xu Xiu He.","\"What just happened? Why did you two go into the tea room?\" Xu Xiu He asked.","\"Did you see her outfit? Leaving aside the white dress, her outfit was full of schemes, obviously trying to steal the limelight from the bride. When the bride changed her mind, preparing to go on stage, I was afraid she would cause a scene at the wedding, so I pulled her into the tea room.\"","At this moment, Xu Xiu He's thought was that he must have been out of his mind to agree to be Qi Yan's partner.","This woman was too dreadful, 'shameless' would be an understatement. Luckily, he met Shen Yin.","\"How far along is the wedding?\" Shen Yin asked."]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Toast","paragraphs":["\"Wait for the toast. Qi Ji went to change clothes.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Shen Yin still wanted to go see her own work, to see how it looked when worn, perhaps this is a occupational disease for a fashion designer?","In the room, the makeup artist changed Qi Ji's hairstyle.","\"This toast dress is really beautiful. I've never seen a toast dress designed so ingeniously, like a small evening gown, elegant and generous,\" the makeup artist said as she helped Qi Ji zip up the back.","Shu Yi saw Shen Yin come in and quickly pulled her to the side.","\"What did that woman just want to do? I was afraid she would rush up on stage.\" Shu Yi was curious, she really admired it, how could there be such a bizarre woman in the world.","Shen Yin's voice was very low, so low that only the two of them could hear: \"She won't be able to open her mouth tomorrow morning.\"","Shu Yi looked admiringly at Shen Yin, \"Yinyin, you're so awesome, you're not going to smack her mouth to pieces, are you?\"","The two leaned on the sofa, and when Qi Ji turned around in her toast dress, they immediately made eye contact, stopping their discussion. It's a happy day, can't affect the bride's mood.","\"Wow, Qi Ji, you look so beautiful today,\" Shu Yi praised.","Which girl doesn't like compliments, especially a simple girl like Qi Ji, who was particularly happy at the moment, even if she didn't marry for love, she could still be considered grand and beautiful, the most beautiful bride.","\"Yinyin sister, this toast dress is so beautiful.\" Qi Ji ran up to Shen Yin and Shu Yi.","Shu Yi looked at Qi Ji, dressed so beautifully, envied or not, she couldn't help but envy.","Probably every girl's wish is to wear a beautiful wedding dress and marry her beloved, wedding dresses are easy to wear, but beloved ones are not easy to find.","\"So beautiful,\" Shu Yi sighed again.","\"Are you envious? If you get married, I'll design for you too,\" Shen Yin said with a smile.","\"Um, let's forget about that.\" Since entering the entertainment industry, Shu Yi had never thought about getting married in the future.","At noon, Xue Jingrui entered the room and said it was time for the toasts.","There were dozens of tables outside with only a few tables needing toasts, all elders, as well as some leaders from Rong City.","\"Wait, when you toast, just take a sip. You don't have to really drink it,\" Xue Jingrui reminded, afraid that this little girl was too sincere, she would drink as much as was in the cup.","\"We'll go out first. There's a table of food in the small room over there, you can eat if you're hungry, no need to wait for me,\" Qi Ji turned to Shu Yi, Shen Yin, and Yan Yan, and said.","After the two left, Shu Yi became curious again, about the unfinished topic from earlier, why Qi Yan wouldn't be able to open her mouth tomorrow morning.","Shen Yin tousled her hair, and suddenly Shu Yi saw the bite marks on Shen Yin's arm.","\"What's going on, it's not that crazy woman who bit you, is it?\"","Shen Yin didn't say anything, indicating confirmation, Shu Yi's temper flared up, she got up and walked out.","\"Shu Yi, where are you going?\"","\"I'm going to knock out that crazy woman's teeth.\"","Yan Yan: \"...\" Is this still the female celebrity she knows? After following Shu Yi for so long, it's the first time she's seen her curse.","Even the makeup artist was taken aback by Shu Yi's momentum. She usually interacts with people in the entertainment industry and knows that the image they present to the public is carefully crafted. But this young girl's image is too different. She must be mistaken. She's too aggressive.","\"Come back, we need to maintain our image.\" Shen Yin said with a smile, although she didn't want to. But Shu Yi was just too cute. Shen Yin walked over, pulled Shu Yi back, poured a glass of water, and handed it to Shu Yi, saying, \"Calm down, it's not worth it.\"","\"Shameless, despicable, and mean.\" Shu Yi used all the ugly words she could think of to describe the person, still feeling unsatisfied.","After taking a sip of water, she still wanted to continue cursing.","Shen Yin spoke up, \"She's not that beautiful, but she thinks she's so gorgeous every day. Now, she's even angrier than us. When I told her to relax, I used some force and hit her chin directly. It's probably going to hurt for a few days, she won't be able to eat tomorrow.\"","This finally calmed Shu Yi down a bit.","\"She's like a dog, she bites people. If there's a next time, I'll break her teeth.\" Shu Yi was still not satisfied.","\"Hahaha, why are you just like Zhengzheng? Zhengzheng said next time, she'll let Huahua bite back.\"","\"Zhengzheng is here too?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Xu Xiuhe and later brought Zhengzheng into the tea room.\"","\"Did that woman pretend to be weak? Apologize and cry with tears?\"","Shen Yin widened her eyes. \"How did you know? You weren't there just now.\"","\"Vicious supporting female characters in novels are like this, white lotus, green tea, using the act of being wronged to gain a man's sympathy, to make the man feel soft-hearted. She's quite good at this trick. By the way, how did your husband react?\" Shu Yi still didn't trust men.","Shen Yin recalled and said, \"He said I'm his wife, even if Qi Yan hit me, she can't fight back. He also said Qi Yan is more like a dog than a dog.\"","Shu Yi just wanted to say, Xu Xiuhe handled it well. Knowing Xu Xiuhe's words, Shu Yi was very happy, even happier than if she had broken that green tea's teeth.","Women, they understand what is the most deadly harm. Xu Xiuhe's words were like stabbing Qi Yan's heart with a knife. It hurts in the heart, which is more painful than physical pain.","At the venue, Xue Jingrui went table by table to toast with Qi Ji. Qi Ji couldn't drink, so when he sipped the wine, his expression was very painful. Xue Jingrui noticed and directly told the elders that he would drink on his behalf.","When it was Qi Shengwu's table's turn, Xue Jingrui said, \"Uncles and aunties, I toast to you. She just drank too much, so I'll drink for her.\"","Xue Jingrui drank two glasses in one go.","Qi Yan stood next to Qi Shengwu, and Xue Jingrui acted like he didn't see her.","The plan just failed, Qi Shengwu pretended to be happy: \"Nephew, you didn't become my son-in-law after all. Let's have a few more drinks, not only you, but the bride also needs to drink.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Qi Ji's expression changed. She had seen Qi Yan since she arrived at this table, looking pitiful, with her eyes fixed on Jingrui. Although she didn't care, on her joyful day, this person's attitude towards her seemed unpleasant, as if she had stolen her husband. Not very nice.","\"Uncle Qi is joking. Miss Qi is so outstanding, she won't have trouble finding a husband.\" Xue Jingrui retorted.","Qi Shengwu's face didn't look good, but he continued, \"Thank you for the compliment, nephew. Let's have a few more drinks.\"","Qi Yan's expression had slowly turned fierce, \"Miss Qi.\" Jingrui called her \"Miss Qi.\""]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Stop Pretending to Sleep","paragraphs":["\"Miss Qi is so outstanding, she must have many suitors. I hope Miss Qi can find her other half soon and get married,\" Jing Rui said.","Shu Yi and Sister Shen Yin both say she is innocent, and she is, but she is not foolish. She now knows that the woman in front of her is a bad woman, not only stringing along Brother Jing Rui but also trying to ruin Sister Shen Yin's marriage. She now dislikes this woman very much.","Qi Yan looked at the woman in champagne dress with jealousy and hatred, all because of her, she took away everything from her. If it weren't for this woman, she would have been the center of attention at this wedding, and this beautiful toast dress would have belonged to her.","Qi Yan held a wine glass in her hand, uncontrollably wanting to ruin the woman in front of her. With high heels on her feet, she tried to twist her ankle a bit, causing the wine in the glass to spill out. Jing Rui's eyes were quick, and he blocked it in front of Qi Ji.","The red wine spilled all over Xue Jingrui's back.","\"Sorry, Jing Rui, I didn't mean to,\" Qi Yan said, giving a provocative look to Jing Rui.","Xue Jingrui didn't see it, but Qi Ji did. Qi Ji was tired. Getting married requires getting up early, tiring. The wedding dress is too heavy, exhausting. The woman in front of her is too disgusting, annoying.","She was already socially anxious, and now she was trembling all over. Xue Jingrui hugged Qi Ji, clearly feeling Qi Ji's body trembling. He ignored everything else and said, \"Sorry for leaving, my wife is feeling unwell,\" then picked up Qi Ji.","This was the first time Xue Jingrui had physical contact with her. The woman, like a little cat, lay in his arms, soft, not moving.","\"Brother Jing Rui, I want to go home,\" Qi Ji's voice was also like a little cat.","Xue Jingrui listened, feeling a pang of heartache, \"Okay, I'll take you home.\"","And so the wedding ended.","Xue Jingrui first took Qi Ji back to the room. Shu Yi, Shen Yin, Yan Yan, they all hadn't eaten, waiting for Qi Ji to join them, but she was brought back instead.","Shu Yi and Shen Yin knew without thinking that the little girl must have suffered some grievance.","\"Qi Ji, have something to eat first, then go home. From early morning till now, you haven't eaten anything,\" Shu Yi said.","Shu Yi had been staying at the hotel with the little girl since last night. This morning, the little girl got up so early, barely opening her eyes before being dragged up for makeup, likely starving.","Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe were still at the venue, waiting to toast, but the groom just carried the bride away, so they had to follow to see what happened.","\"Mom, Yunzheng misses you,\" Xu Yunzheng pouted as soon as he entered the room, looking for Shen Yin.","Shen Yin took Yunzheng's hand, asking if he had eaten, to which Yunzheng replied, asking if he had eaten enough. Then he looked at the dining table in the room.","Xue Jingrui placed Qi Ji on a chair, sitting next to her.","The group sat down, including the makeup artist and Yan Yan. The meal was eaten in unusual silence, with no one mentioning what had just happened outside.","Only Yunzheng spoke occasionally.","After dinner, there were not many people left in the venue. Qi Ji, after finishing his meal, relaxed and apologized, \"I'm sorry, everyone.\"","\"No need to apologize, you haven't done anything wrong,\" Shu Yi said.","Qi Ji felt a bit comforted and finally smiled.","\"Really, Qi Ji, you're too tired today. Rest well when we get back later,\" Shu Yi advised.","Xue Jingrui drove Qi Ji back home. Their new house, a loft, had been cleaned a few days ago, and everything that needed to be prepared was done.","Cars left one after another at the entrance of Qingfeng Mingyue, and Xue Kai and Ye Rong secretly noted this down to settle the bill later.","\"Zheng Zheng, say goodbye to Auntie.\"","\"Goodbye, Auntie,\" Xu Yunzheng smiled, waving his hand, his big eyes spinning.","\"Auntie is going to start filming tomorrow, and it will be a while before we see Zheng Zheng again. What should we do?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Zheng Zheng will come to see Auntie,\" Xu Yunzheng replied.","Shu Yi was touched by this, leaned forward, squatted down, held Zheng Zheng's face, and planted a big kiss, \"It would be great if Auntie never aged, then I'll wait for my godson to marry me.\"","Shu Yi turned her face to the side, pointed to her cheek, and Xu Yunzheng planted a kiss.","The three adults present were shocked, \"Why are you eyeing your godson like that?\" Shen Yin joked.","Chang Zhiyuan: \"...............\"","\"Zheng Zheng, do you want to kiss Uncle goodbye before he starts filming tomorrow?\"","\"Uncle is going to act in a drama. Does Zheng Zheng want to kiss Uncle goodbye?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","The others were also curious about this question.","\"Yes, Uncle is going to act in a drama, and your Auntie is in the same crew. If Zheng Zheng misses us, just tell me, I'll come pick you up,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, looking at Shu Yi.","Shu Yi was already cursing in her heart. The new drama had changed its male lead, and she still didn't know who the male lead was, especially since there were kissing scenes, she cared about the other person's looks.","Now she was told that Chang Zhiyuan was going to join the crew. Thinking carefully, she wasn't stupid, she knew Chang Zhiyuan must have pulled some strings.","\"Mom, what does it mean to marry Auntie?\" Xu Yunzheng's questions were always unexpected, breaking their original topic.","\"Zheng Zheng can't marry Auntie. Marrying means getting married, living together with the person you love. Just like what Uncle Jingrui and Aunt Qi Ji just did, holding a wedding,\" Shen Yin explained strange questions every day.","\"Then Zheng Zheng loves Mom, Zheng Zheng wants to marry Mom, Zheng Zheng wants to marry Mom,\" Xu Yunzheng stomped his feet, clapped his hands, a little excited.","Shen Yin...","Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi burst into laughter.","Xu Xiuhe lifted Xu Yunzheng with one hand and walked towards the car. He felt it was necessary to educate his son on what marriage really meant.","\"Dad, Zheng Zheng doesn't feel well,\" Xu Yunzheng was carried by Xu Xiuhe with no sense of security, calling out for his dad.","Shen Yin also got into the car.","The last ones to leave the wedding were surprisingly Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi.","\"Where's your bouquet?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"Take it, by the way, you love children so much, do you want to have one with me?\" Chang Zhiyuan approached Shu Yi and whispered.","\"You rascal!\"","\"Is that being a rascal? What about when we were filming, uh, what should we do?\" Chang Zhiyuan's tone was teasing.","Shu Yi really wanted to punch him.","At night, Chang Zhiyuan sent a message in the group, asking if Xue Jingrui was happy on his wedding night.","Xue Jingrui was not happy, and didn't even want to reply to that message.","Since arriving home, Qi Ji took a shower, went into the bedroom, and slept until now without getting up. He still couldn't figure out what his relationship with Qi Ji was.","\"[You lonely single dog, are you bored? Jing Rui doesn't have time to deal with you.]\" Xu Xiuhe sent a message.","\"[Don't you have me? Aren't you still chatting with me?]\"","\"Oh? I'm also busy now, you can have fun by yourself.\"","After sending the message, Xu Xiuhe waited for Shen Yin to finish showering.","\"Zheng Zheng is already asleep, why aren't you sleeping?\" Shen Yin walked out of the bathroom, drying his hair.","\"I don't want to sleep yet.\"","Before Shen Yin could react, Xu Xiuhe picked up Zheng Zheng, went into the next room, and then returned.","\"Wife, your hair isn't dry yet, why did you lie down?\"","\"I'm tired, I want to sleep.\"","\"I'm not tired, wife, do you miss me?\"","Shen Yin pretended to be asleep.","Xu Xiuhe picked up the hairdryer, walked to the bedside, took strands of hair in his hand, and slowly blow-dried them.","Xu Xiuhe occasionally massaged Shen Yin's scalp.","\"Wife, stop pretending to sleep, your eyelids are still moving.\" Xu Xiuhe's hands were not honest, originally stroking the hair, but after it dried, it slowly moved downwards."]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Blow-drying Hair","paragraphs":["Shen Yin opened her eyes, and Xu Xiuhe suddenly got up, taking his hands off her body.","Shen Yin thought that Xu Xiuhe would let her off tonight, so she sat up, but she was mistaken. He had only grabbed a hair dryer to blow-dry his hair.","Later, Xu Xiuhe escalated his actions.","She was grateful that she had learned martial arts, and the original owner had practiced dance, otherwise, she would not have been able to endure it.","...","\"Wife, let me put a ring on your finger.\"","Xu Xiuhe took out a ring from the bedside cabinet and slid it onto Shen Yin's ring finger.","Exhausted, Shen Yin let Xu Xiuhe hold her hand and put on the ring. After he did so, she raised her arm, bringing her hand close to her face. \"When did you buy this ring?\" she asked.","The ring fit her perfectly, not too big or small, just right. It was exquisite, with a small but stunning pink diamond that sparkled beautifully under the light.","Shen Yin touched the diamond with her other hand.","\"About a month ago, custom-made from overseas,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Not long after he confirmed his feelings, he had someone purchase the pink diamond. Although not overly large, considering Shen Yin's career, an overly large diamond ring would be impractical for daily wear. So he specifically asked the designer to make the ring a bit smaller, and the remaining diamonds were made into a necklace.","\"It must have been expensive,\" Shen Yin said.","It was her first time seeing a pink diamond. Her knowledge was indeed limited. The Dasheng Dynasty also had such stones, called \"Vajra,\" but they were not as bright as this one.","\"Not expensive,\" Xu Xiuhe responded. For him, it was not expensive at all. The diamonds, plus the labor cost, had barely exceeded a hundred million. A ring and a necklace, especially as a gift for his wife, was certainly not expensive.","\"Thank you,\" Shen Yin said, pleased with the gift.","\"Don't thank me, I'm your husband. Giving you a ring is what I should do. You must wear it from now on, so others will know you are a married woman.\"","Xu Xiuhe then took out the necklace, which was stored in an exquisite little box. The diamonds on the necklace were large and pink, sparkling brightly under the light.","\"This is for you as well. Originally, it was a single large diamond, but the diamond for the ring would have been too big and inconvenient, so I had the remaining diamond made into a necklace.\"","Only he knew about this. If Chang Zhiyuan found out that he had cut such a large pink diamond, he would probably call him insane. Diamonds were more valuable the larger they were, especially a pink diamond of such fine quality.","Shen Yin opened her mouth to speak.","\"Don't say thank you. I'll leave this here,\" Xu Xiuhe said, putting the diamond box back in the bedside cabinet drawer.","\"Let me carry you to the bathroom.\"","Shen Yin felt a bit tired and did not want to move, having just bathed earlier.","\"Husband, I don't really want to bathe,\" she said, her large eyes looking pleadingly at Xu Xiuhe. His heart softened.","\"Okay.\"","Xu Xiuhe lifted Shen Yin slightly, took out a bedsheet, and laid her back down.","In this room, Shen Yin had always used two bedsheets, which Xu Xiuhe had discovered at some point.","When Xu Xiuhe returned to the bedroom, he brought a basin and a towel and walked over to the bed.","Shen Yin had fallen asleep, looking peaceful and deep in slumber. Xu Xiuhe wrung out the towel.","The bite marks left by Zhi Yuan on Shen Yin's arm had not faded, and Xu Xiuhe felt a pang of sadness. He wiped her arm gently with the towel, again and again, his expression growing increasingly grim.","After bathing himself, Xu Xiuhe changed Shen Yin's clothes and felt reassured.","Having completed these tasks, Xu Xiuhe lay down beside Shen Yin, adjusting the air conditioning temperature, and pulled her into his embrace.","In the distance, a few cicadas chirped. On this moonlit summer night, with his beloved by his side, lying quietly and sleeping peacefully, it was a beautiful moment."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: The Villain","paragraphs":["In the morning, the first one to wake up was unexpectedly Xu Yunzheng. Xu Yunzheng looked at his small bed and couldn't help but pout. How did he end up in this room again?","Xu Yunzheng lay on the bed, moved back towards the edge, the small bed was not high, his baby feet could easily touch the floor.","The floor in this bedroom was covered with blankets.","After getting out of bed, Xu Yunzheng first looked for his slippers, but after searching all around, he couldn't find them. His little pig slippers were under the bed.","A look of grievance appeared on his face again. He had been sleeping in this small bed recently, for some unknown reason. In the past, his dad would come into this room, change his clothes and shoes for him, but this time he woke up alone.","Barefoot, Xu Yunzheng walked to the door and found that it wasn't closed properly. Being short, he couldn't reach the doorknob, so he had to use his fingers to open the door.","There was no one in the living room. Barefoot, Xu Yunzheng walked back to the bedroom, but couldn't push the door open. This door was different from the previous one, it didn't open with just a push.","\"Mom, mom, open the door, Zhenzhen has no shoes.\" Xu Yunzheng clapped the door with his small hand and shouted loudly.","Shen Yin was suddenly awakened in the bedroom, sitting up. Xu Xiuhe was also disturbed.","\"What's wrong, did you have a nightmare? It's only six o'clock,\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin shook her head, \"It's even scarier than a nightmare.\"","The knocking on the door sounded again, and Shen Yin faintly heard Zhenzhen calling for his mom.","She rushed out of bed and opened the door.","The little one stood at the door, rubbing his eyes and said, \"Mom, there's a bad person.\"","\"Zhenzhen, did you have a bad dream? There are no bad people in the house.\"","Shen Yin looked at the baby, barefoot, standing on the floor, and asked, \"Why isn't Zhenzhen wearing shoes?\"","\"Zhenzhen can't find his little pig shoes. Zhenzhen didn't have a dream, Zhenzhen met a bad person,\" the baby said more and more aggrieved.","Shen Yin picked up Zhenzhen and carried him to the bed inside, Xu Xiuhe was very considerate and made room for his son.","\"How did Zhenzhen meet a bad person? Tell mom,\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Yunzheng lay down, turned his head to look at Xu Xiuhe, then turned back to Shen Yin and said, \"Zhenzhen always sleeps in that room, the bed in that room is small, Zhenzhen wakes up and is in that room.\" He even pointed to the room next door.","Shen Yin \"...\"","\"It must be a bad person, not letting Zhenzhen sleep with mom, so he used magic to put Zhenzhen on that small bed.\"","Shen Yin sat down, glanced at Xu Xiuhe, and Xu Xiuhe pretended nothing happened, saying, \"It could also be a good person, a good person wants Zhenzhen to grow up to be a man, so he let Zhenzhen sleep in a separate room. Zhenzhen used to sleep alone too.\"","Xu Yunzheng thought for a while, it was too long ago, did he used to sleep alone?","Xu Xiuhe felt it wasn't enough, \"Zhenzhen, you're growing up, you're a man now, you can't sleep with mom anymore.\"","\"It's a bad person, a bad person won't let me sleep with mom. Zhenzhen is not big, Zhenzhen is only two years old, Zhenzhen hasn't started school yet.\" Xu Yunzheng held up two fingers.","\"Zheng Zheng is amazing, next time Mom will definitely stop the bad guys, not let the bad guys, not let Zheng Zheng sleep alone in the small room.\"","Xu Xiuhe was a little anxious when he heard this. How could she still stop it? Shouldn't his wife be on the same front with him?","\"Mom, where are the bad guys, why didn't Zheng Zheng see them?\" Xu Yunzheng looked curious.","\"The bad guys wouldn't let Zheng Zheng see them. They are afraid of Zheng Zheng, so as soon as it gets light, they hide.\" Shen Yin didn't know if the little one in front of her would believe her explanation. Should she say to Zheng Zheng, \"Son, the bad guy is your father.\"","When Xu Yunzheng heard that the bad guys were afraid of him, he suddenly became happy and chuckled. \"Mom, Zheng Zheng wants to catch the bad guys tonight, will Mom and Dad help Zheng Zheng, okay?\"","Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe and said, \"Okay.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt helpless. What could he do? He was the bad guy now, and he had to catch himself at night.","\"Zheng Zheng, are you still sleeping?\" Shen Yin asked. Usually, the family of three woke up almost at seven o'clock.","\"Zheng Zheng is full, Zheng Zheng is hungry, Zheng Zheng wants to bring Huahua up at night.\"","\"Why bring Huahua up?\"","\"To bite the bad guys.\"","Xu Xiuhe stood up, turned his back to the mother and son, trying hard to hold back his laughter.","He fed Huahua every day. Could Huahua bite him?","\"Are you up?\" Shen Yin asked. The family of three usually woke up almost at seven o'clock.","Xu Xiuhe felt refreshed and said, \"I'm going to feed Huahua, what do you want to eat for breakfast?\"","\"I'm fine with anything.\"","After breakfast, Xu Xiuhe went to the company, and all the studio employees had arrived.","Shen Yin took Zheng Zheng downstairs and held a brief meeting with the employees, discussing some tasks.","\"Boss, there's an order this morning,\" Li Huanhuan said.","\"What order?\"","\"The photos of the toasting service at yesterday's wedding went viral, and many people are asking where the outfits were customized. So I used the official account to post a message, and we received a lot of orders.\"","Shen Yin thought for a while and said, \"Scarce items are valuable. The toasting outfit was made for a friend of mine, and we don't have that style anymore. You can tell the customers that we can make something else, but the custom price for our toasting outfit may be higher than regular outfits.\"","\"Okay, Boss, I got it.\"","\"You've all been working hard recently, so I'm going to raise your salaries this month.\"","Shen Yin finished speaking and took Zheng Zheng to the third floor.","The five employees couldn't believe their ears. They must have saved the world in their past lives to have such a good boss in this life. Come on, their salaries were already high before, with different salaries for several people, they understood, after all, the work they did was different, but it was already higher than others in the same industry, and now they were getting a raise again. Emmm, happiness came too suddenly.","Shen Yin was satisfied with her current life, but now she had handed everything over, she was a bit bored.","Wanting to paint, wanting to cultivate her sentiment. In Chinese painting, landscapes and figure paintings are very popular, with many outstanding works. She has also copied many of them, and she understands the techniques of landscape painting.","Emphasizing \"truth\" and \"reality,\" advocating a realistic style for landscape painting. Using silk more often, not only outlining meticulously and depicting rigorously, but also using ink to render the picture layer by layer, displaying a profound and serene beauty. It shows an unprecedented delicate, rich, and realistic painting style. There are several types of brush techniques alone, but this feeling is not what Shen Yin wants.","Shen Yin wants to learn modern Western oil painting techniques so that she can better record Zeng Zeng's growth. Oil painting is colorful, and Zeng Zeng will definitely like it.","In the small warehouse on the second floor, Xu Xiuhe bought a lot of painting supplies. Shen Yin searched online for tutorials but still felt a bit confused.","Suddenly remembered something."]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: Embroidery Competition","paragraphs":["It seemed that Qi Ji was an illustrator.","Shen Yin had Qi Ji's WeChat contact, and the three of them - Shu Yi, Qi Ji, and herself - were in a WeChat group.","Shu Yi was the group admin, and she had posted a message in the morning saying that she had joined a TV crew and telling the other two not to miss her.","Qi Ji, being an early riser, immediately replied: \"Beautiful sister, is acting fun? Will you really kiss the male actor?\"","Shu Yi: Uh...","She didn't care whether it was fun or not, as long as she could make money, she was satisfied. As for kissing, that dog man Chang Zhiyuan, instead of being a good entertainment company CEO, went to act in a TV drama. What the hell, just thinking about acting opposite Chang Zhiyuan made Shu Yi start to feel emo.","[Qi Ji, are you feeling better?] Shen Yin asked. The little girl must have been tired from getting married yesterday.","[No problem, sister. It feels like nothing has changed after getting married, except that there's one more person in the room. Other than that, it's the same as before - I just draw illustrations and sleep every day.] Qi Ji replied.","Shu Yi sent an envious emoji.","Shen Yin sent a smiling emoji.","Shu Yi...","[Yin Yin, you can't just send this emoji carelessly now.]","[Doesn't it express agreement and happiness?] Shen Yin asked, confused as to why she couldn't send such a cute emoji.","[Originally, the smiling emoji on WeChat was just used to represent a smile, a simple expression of a smiling face. But as time passed, this emoji has been given many other meanings. From a more unconventional perspective, the lower half of the 'smiling' emoji on WeChat represents a suppressed normal smile, conforming to the mouth expression of a smile. However, the upper half lacks contraction of the orbicularis oculi muscle, and the gaze is shifted downward, indicating that this smile is not only fake, but also reflects a negative attitude - a condescending, dismissive, and mocking expression of not wanting to pay attention or care about the other person. So this emoji doesn't have a good meaning now.] Shu Yi explained her understanding of the emoji to Shen Yin.","In her room, Shen Yin found it amazing that a simple emoji could have so many meanings. After this, she would have to study and keep up with the times - she was already a few hundred years behind, she couldn't fall further behind.","Shen Yin asked: [How did you learn all this?]","[Surfing the internet,] Shu Yi replied.","[Surfing?]","[Yin Yin, you must not go online much,] said Shu Yi. Her public persona was that of a cool, pure girl who was uninterested in and ignorant of the entertainment industry - she would act if she had a role, and travel if she didn't.","In reality, only the last two sentences were true. She was cool towards strangers, and she didn't want to get involved in gossip, but she was an avid gossip consumer.","She was online every day on her alt account, and being in the industry herself, Shu Yi felt like she was a skilled gossip specialist. However, she had managed to fool many people. Since entering university and the entertainment industry, she had emerged from her insecurity, and after meeting Shen Yin, her true nature seemed to have been exposed - she felt like she had the potential to be a funny girl.","Often, we fail to notice how encountering certain people and events can unconsciously change us - our personality, temper, and interests.","Shen Yin looked at the messages, feeling that there was a long way to go and she still had much to learn.","[Qi Ji, do you know anything about oil painting?] Shen Yin asked.","[I studied it in college,] Qi Ji replied.","Qi Ji had majored in design in college, so of course she had experience with oil painting and had spent a long time on it.","[Can you teach me?]","[Of course, beautiful sister. I'll come find you when you're free.]","[Okay, thank you Qi Ji.]","The chat ended there because Li Huanhuan had told Shen Yin that there was someone looking for her downstairs.","Shen Yin went downstairs with Zhengzheng, but didn't see anyone else - only Granny Su sitting on the couch.","\"Boss, this granny is looking for you,\" said Zhengzheng politely, before leaning against the couch and hoisting himself up onto it like a little adult.","\"Long time no see, Zhengzheng has grown taller,\" Granny Su said with a smile.","Shen Yin brewed some tea and handed it to Su Jin, then sat down as well.","\"Miss, the granny has something to ask you about,\" said Su Jin.","\"Yes, granny, please go ahead.\"","\"It's like this - our district is having an embroidery competition. Whichever city ranks highest will represent the district in the national competition. Rong City has quite a few participants this year, but I think your embroidery skills could easily win the national championship. Have you considered participating?\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin pondered for a moment. Seeing her hesitation, Su Jin continued:","\"Embroidery, as one of our intangible cultural heritages, has always been passed down. But embroidery is not simple - it requires technique and the patience to sit for long periods of time. In recent years, as traditional culture has been promoted, embroidery has also gained international recognition. The exquisite patterns and intricate needlework have made this art form precious. Many foreigners are eager to purchase our embroidery for collection. That's why I said last time that the value of your wedding dress is in the seven or eight figures.\"","Su Jin looked towards the wedding dress.","\"Outstanding culture needs to be passed on, and exceptional skills should not be buried. I think you should participate - not only will you bring glory to Rong City, but you'll also achieve personal success. The national champion's work will be collected by museums, and the champion herself will gain renown. If you do participate, your future works will reach the world stage. And since you're in fashion design, the combination of embroidery and clothing will increase the value even further. Why not give it a try?\"","Su Jin had said a lot. Shen Yin admitted that she was tempted - this was indeed a great opportunity for her to go beyond Rong City and reach the world. How wonderful would that be?","\"Granny, why do you think I would stand out in the district competition?\" Shen Yin believed her embroidery skills could crush the competition, but she was still curious as to why Su Jin had specifically sought her out.","\"Miss, I've lived for over half a century, but this is the first time I've seen such a young lady with such proficient and deft embroidery skills. Anyway, the granny has high hopes for you,\" Su Jin said slowly.","Shen Yin knew that Su Jin truly wanted her to participate.","\"Granny Su, when is the competition? And what is the format?\"","\"Late July, the competition will be held in Rong City. The national finals are in late August. The format is on-site embroidery with a given theme and required techniques.\"","\"And registration?\"","\"Online registration, deadline is mid-July. You can just search for 'embroidery competition' and you'll find it. The granny believes in you - the national championship belongs to no one but you.\"","Su Jin said, taking a sip from the water cup on the table, and exclaiming, \"This tea is truly remarkable, fragrant and rich in flavor. It's delicious, young lady. If you were to open a tea house, I reckon people would queue up.\"","\"You flatter me, Granny,\" Shen Yin smiled."]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Miss Dad","paragraphs":["Shen Yin dared not open a tea house, as it would be too tiring. It was better to accompany Zhengzheng, who was obedient and handsome.","After Su Jin left, Zhengzheng sat on the sofa, opened his big eyes, and asked, \"Mom, what is embroidery?\"","Shen Yin hadn't embroidered for a month or two, and the competition was less than a month away, so she decided to practice first.","\"Zhengzheng, shall Mom make tiger-head shoes for you?\"","\"Tiger's shoes?\"","\"Shoes that look like a tiger.\"","Shen Yin held Xu Yunzheng's hand and climbed the stairs. When they reached the second floor, Shen Yin stopped and didn't go in, as everyone had their own workroom, and she didn't want to disturb them. Instead, she found some thread, chose suitable fabric, took needles, and went up to the third floor.","On the sofa, Shen Yin tilted her head, threaded the needle skillfully, cut the fabric, and sewed, giving the shoes a rough outline.","\"Mom, Zhengzheng misses Dad,\" Xu Yunzheng suddenly said.","Shen Yin thought she had been too busy and neglected Zhengzheng, making him sad.","\"Sweetheart, I'm sorry. Mom was too busy earlier. Shall Mom take you to find Dad now?\"","\"Yes.\"","Shen Yin felt guilty and hugged Xu Yunzheng.","\"Mom is not sad or upset. Zhengzheng just wants to see Dad,\" Xu Yunzheng said, gently patting Shen Yin's back in her arms.","\"Then Mom will take Zhengzheng to find Dad now, okay?\"","\"Cook dinner first. Bring food for Dad,\" Xu Yunzheng said.","Shen Yin: \"?\"","Isn't the plan to find Dad? Why bring food now?","Shen Yin checked her phone and saw that it was almost time, so she could make it if she cooked quickly.","\"So, will Zhengzheng help Mom in the kitchen?\"","\"Zhengzheng will help Mom cook.\"","At 11:30 AM, the driver was waiting for Shen Yin downstairs.","Shen Yin carried the lunch boxes, as she and Xu Yunzheng hadn't eaten yet, and had put all the food in the boxes.","The driver parked the car in the underground garage, and Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng took the elevator straight to the top floor.","The office assistants eagerly took out their phones to record the moment, as they couldn't see such a cute child every day.","Shen Yin smiled at them as she passed by.","\"She's so beautiful.\"","\"Her aura is amazing.\"","\"I envy the President.\"","Xiao Li'er: \"...\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't seem surprised that Shen Yin would come, as if he knew, and hurried to welcome them.","\"Wife, you must miss me,\" Xu Xiuhe said, not avoiding Zhengzheng.","\"No, it was Zhengzheng who wanted to come.\"","Xu Xiuhe and Xu Yunzheng looked at each other, thinking that his efforts were not in vain, as the child was still obedient.","Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng and whispered, \"Zhengzheng is so good. Dad will keep his promise and help you tonight, so the bad guys can't take you away.\"","Xu Yunzheng clapped happily.","\"Come and eat.\"","Xu Xiuhe had been eating Shen Yin's cooking often lately, and found other food less tasty, so he had arranged for Zhengzheng to bring lunch and see him, while he would help Zhengzheng catch the bad guys in the evening.","\"Wife, your cooking is delicious.\"","\"Mom, your cooking is delicious.\"","Father and son both praised Shen Yin, making her happy.","\"Do you know what Mrs. Su does?\"","\"Why ask that?\"","\"She has an embroidery competition and recommended that I participate. I agreed,\" Shen Yin replied truthfully.","Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment and said, \"It's good to participate. She's probably not from Rong City, but the capital, and her status is likely not simple.\"","Shen Yin pondered and asked, \"Is Rong City considered very powerful nationally?\"","\"Pretty good, it's an economic hub.\"","\"Are you still tired?\" Xu Xiuhe suddenly changed the subject.","\"?\"","Shen Yin took two seconds to understand and signaled Xu Xiuhe not to say anything inappropriate with Zhengzheng present.","\"I want to learn oil painting, and Qi Ji happens to know how. She said she could teach me. What about Xue Jingrui and Qi Yan?\" Shen Yin asked tentatively.","\"Even without Qi Ji, they would never be together, as it involves family interests and status. Uncle Xue considers things more comprehensively, and he and Qi Yan's father will eventually be on opposing sides. So even if Xue Jingrui likes Qi Yan, it's impossible. Moreover, he doesn't like the current Qi Yan anymore.\"","\"Does he like Qi Ji then?\"","\"He probably does, or at least has a good impression of her. He seemed quite concerned about her yesterday. He just reacts slowly, but once he realizes his feelings, he'll be fine. I react quickly and immediately put my plans into action. Aren't I great?\" Xu Xiuhe started praising himself again.","Here we go again, Shen Yin thought. This man keeps finding ways to praise himself every day. Does Chang Zhiyuan know about Xue Jingrui?","\"Eat, don't talk. Look at Zhengzheng, he's eating so attentively.\"","\"Dad, don't talk while eating. You should learn from Zhengzheng.\"","Xue Jingrui sneezed from the kitchen as he brought out the dishes.","After moving here, they found a cook, but she fell ill on the first day. Qi Ji felt that since she was already married, she should learn to cook, so she went into the kitchen in the late morning even though breakfast was Xue Jingrui's responsibility. As housemates, she couldn't just let her brother-in-law do all the cooking.","Qi Ji had been spoiled since childhood and never cooked, even when living alone in college as her family had a dedicated maid.","This was her first time in a kitchen.","She looked up recipes on her phone, then there was a clatter of pots and pans.","Xue Jingrui rushed into the kitchen.","\"Qi Ji, don't go into the kitchen again.\"","Qi Ji thought Xue Jingrui was criticizing her for making a mess and immediately apologized, saying she would clean it up.","\"Qi Ji, your hands are meant for painting, not cooking. I'll do the cooking from now on,\" Xue Jingrui said, taking Qi Ji's hand and rinsing it under the tap before drying it with a paper towel.","\"Go out, I'll cook. There are snacks in the living room cabinet,\" Xue Jingrui instructed.","\"Thank you, Brother Jingrui,\" Qi Ji said sweetly.","Qi Ji returned to her room and continued working on her unfinished illustration on her iPad. Her family had spoiled her too much since childhood, providing her with everything she needed. She lived carefree until college when she started taking illustration jobs due to her talent and could now support herself comfortably every month.","On the dining table were two dishes and a soup, all cooked by Xue Jingrui.","They looked quite appealing, and Qi Ji praised him, \"Brother Jingrui, you really can cook.\"","Xue Jingrui asked, \"Really?\"","\"I thought you'd never been in a kitchen like me.\"","Before getting married, Xue Jingrui had never set foot in the kitchen. Prior to their marriage, Ye Rong told him that he wouldn't allow his wife to work in the kitchen in the future. He thought his mother was just saying that, but in reality, she hired a chef to teach him. He learned for nearly a week and became proficient in preparing basic homestyle dishes."]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Spoiler","paragraphs":["Qi Ji sat down at the dining table, and Xue Jingrui went back into the kitchen again. When he came out again, he was holding a plate of watermelon in his left hand and a plate of peaches in his right.","\"Seasonal fruits, just picked,\" Xue Jingrui said as he placed the fruits on the table.","The watermelon was pre-sliced into fresh, vibrant red pieces, seedless, and appeared juicy and tender, fit to be called the dream melon.","The young girl wore a white Peter Pan collar dress with pink overalls and had her hair tied up in buns. Her face was full of collagen, making her look like a middle school student.","Even while eating, she was graceful and deliberate in her movements.","\"Are you feeling better?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","This loft had two floors and a decent amount of space. It had three bedrooms alone, and Xue Jingrui hadn't entered the new room last night out of self-awareness.","After all, in the old house, although they stayed in separate rooms, he had been sleeping on the floor for almost half a month.","\"I'm fine now, it was my fault yesterday,\" Qi Ji said, putting down her chopsticks with a regretful expression. Her eyes were big and round like bronze bells, her mouth was small and plump, her nose bridge was high, and her cheeks were slightly chubby.","Xue Jingrui began to doubt himself, wondering if he had really married an underage girl.","\"It wasn't your fault, you're wonderful,\" he said.","As soon as the words left Xue Jingrui's lips, Qi Ji's mood instantly brightened, and she beamed with joy.","Sweet girls were just sweet girls. When she smiled, Xue Jingrui had no resistance. He lowered his head shyly, unable to look directly into Qi Ji's eyes.","In contrast, the young girl's smile was open and carefree. She even asked, \"Brother Jingrui, what's wrong? Have your meal.\"","\"Okay, let's eat, eat,\" Xue Jingrui said, feeling awkward as he picked up his chopsticks and took a bite of rice.","In Hai City, at a film and television production base, Shu Yi had just finished her meal and returned to her room for an afternoon nap.","Yan Yan poured her a glass of water.","After taking a sip, Shu Yi made a video call to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin was in the car, with the driver taking her and Xu Yunzheng back to their little house. When her phone vibrated, the first voice she heard was Xu Yunzheng's.","\"Mom, your phone's ringing,\" he said.","Shen Yin took her phone out of her bag and answered the call.","\"Yin Yin,\" Shu Yi said, pointing the camera at herself.","Xu Yunzheng couldn't see the video, but he recognized the voice and shouted, \"Auntie Mom!\"","\"Hey, do you miss Auntie Mom? Auntie Mom will bring you toys when she gets back,\" Shu Yi replied.","\"Thank you, Auntie Mom,\" Xu Yunzheng said contentedly, playing by himself.","\"Shu Yi, how was your first day there?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I flew here by myself. The filming doesn't officially start until this afternoon, but the environment here is quite nice. It's Hai City, right next to the ocean, so there's plenty of seafood,\" Shu Yi said.","\"So, is Chang Zhiyuan really the male lead?\" Shen Yin inquired.","Shu Yi's expression immediately turned distressed. \"Yin Yin, you don't know, this drama might be ruined.\"","\"Oh? Why do you say that?\" Shen Yin remembered Shu Yi had previously told her that this drama had good quality and a great urban-themed script, and might achieve high ratings.","Shen Yin had been keeping up with Shu Yi's previous drama 'Xian Xi Zhuan' as it neared its conclusion. She felt that Shu Yi was attractive, popular, and even had decent acting skills, so this new drama should be good too.","\"He's a young master, the CEO of a media company. How can he take directions from others when he's never acted before and has no acting skills? I just ran into him on my way here, walking with the director, who was completely deferential to him. Ah, it's over, it's ruined,\" Shu Yi lamented.","\"Hahaha, Shu Yi, don't think like that. With your great acting skills, you can overshadow the male lead. When it airs, the audience will criticize him instead, and then they'll feel sorry for you, which is great,\" Shen Yin encouraged her.","\"You're right, Yin Yin, you're so smart. I'll continue studying the script and memorizing my lines,\" Shu Yi said, feeling better.","\"Good, I'm looking forward to your new drama. Can you give me a spoiler for the ending of 'Xian Xi Zhuan'? I've been following it for so long, but it's not finished yet,\" Shen Yin requested.","'Xian Xi Zhuan' had become hugely popular, a major female-centric drama with daily Weibo trending topics. The epic life story of a woman, it should have attracted mostly female viewers, but since the lead was Shu Yi, the campus goddess, there were many male viewers too. Every day on Weibo, there were comments begging for more episodes, and some people were even willing to pay to watch the ending in advance.","However, Director Wang Ming refused to allow it, believing that a good drama should be savored slowly, and that there was joy in the anticipation of following a drama week by week. Releasing the ending all at once would change the nature of the viewing experience. He also didn't want to exploit the audience or profit from their impatience.","If the viewers knew this reasoning, they would undoubtedly bombard Wang Ming's Weibo, because the drama was too good, and they were willing to pay.","\"Yin Yin, the ending is a happy one. I don't have any insider resources, but your husband can probably get it,\" Shu Yi said, leaving it at that.","After hanging up, the driver spoke up, \"Madam, are you watching 'Xian Xi Zhuan' too?\"","\"Yes, I am,\" Shen Yin replied.","The driver usually didn't watch TV, but recently, his daughter and wife had been hooked on the drama, leaving him with no choice but to watch it too, and he had become engrossed in it himself.","\"Isn't the kid in the show Xu Yunzheng?\" the driver suddenly realized, remarking that the child looked familiar.","Shen Yin smiled and nodded in confirmation.","\"My daughter is totally obsessed with Xu Yunzheng now. I never thought I'd end up watching him every day too,\" the driver said with a proud expression.","\"We're not going back to Qinghe Street,\" Shen Yin instructed.","\"Then where to?\" the driver asked.","Shen Yin gave him the address of the Shen family villa.","The driver made a U-turn upon hearing the new destination.","Shen Yin hadn't been to the hospital for a while. Yesterday afternoon, she had planned to go, but Fang Yue told her that Shen Tianzheng had recovered well and had been discharged.","On the way, Shen Yin bought some nutritional supplements. She had dreamed of the original owner's memories a few times and had already made up her mind - Fang Yue and Shen Tianzheng were now her parents, and as their daughter, she needed to do her part.","When Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng arrived at the Shen family villa and knocked on the door, Fang Yue opened it, her face lighting up with surprise and delight. \"Yin Yin, Xu Yunzheng, what are you two doing here?\"","The woman's expression was gentle and warm, unable to hide her joy.","\"We're here to see how you and Dad are doing,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Your father has recovered very well, don't worry. Didn't you have work today?\" Fang Yue asked.","\"Grandma,\" Xu Yunzheng said, looking up at Fang Yue.","\"Grandma!\" called out Fang Yue, feeling dizzy and disoriented, unable to recall that she was supposed to pour water for Shen Tianzheng. She hugged and kissed Xu Yunzheng.","Seeing this, Shen Yin felt greatly relieved. The last time she saw Fang Yue, she had been in such a terrible state, her face weary and devoid of any will to live, as if the sky had fallen.","And wasn't that true? Shen Tianzheng was Fang Yue's entire world. Now that Shen Tianzheng had recovered, Fang Yue had also regained her spirits."]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Summer Comes as Promised","paragraphs":["Fang Yue held Zhengzheng and walked over to Shen Tianzheng's side. Shen Tianzheng also wanted to carry him, but considering that he had been ill and just discharged from the hospital, he was worried it might not be good for the child, so he gave up.","Fang Yue looked at Shen Tianzheng with envy, feeling heartbroken, she said, \"Zhengzheng, look, grandpa misses you too.\"","\"Mom, why don't you put Zhengzheng down? He's quite heavy, don't tire yourself out.\"","Fang Yue felt happy in her heart and didn't feel that Zhengzheng was heavy at all.","Instead, Zhengzheng, having heard Shen Yin's words, was afraid his grandma would get tired, so he said, \"Grandma, let Zhengzheng down. Dad often doesn't let mom carry Zhengzheng because he's afraid mom will get tired.\"","Zhengzheng's words sounded sensible, but his expression looked aggrieved, especially when he mentioned his dad not letting his mom carry him, it was as if he had been wronged.","Zhengzheng wanted to get down, and Fang Yue felt the baby's movement, so she put the little one down on the ground.","Once on the ground, Xu Yunzheng's little expression changed, smiling brightly. He walked over to Shen Tianzheng, held onto his knee and said, \"Grandpa, you're well now.\"","The little one's tone was sweet and endearing, and his words were comforting.","\"Zhengzheng, grandpa is well now, so we can swing together again.\"","\"No swinging, grandpa, the sun outside is too big and hot, Zhengzheng will get tanned.\"","Xu Yunzheng shook his head, his tone serious, his expression grave, as if he would turn into a little black person just by going outside.","\"Okay, no swinging.\" Shen Tianzheng went along with Zhengzheng's wish.","\"Grandpa, rest, you'll get well faster,\" Zhengzheng said again.","\"Did you hear that? I just told you to go lie down, but you wouldn't listen. Even Zhengzheng knows that resting more will help you recover faster. Go to the bedroom now!\" Fang Yue turned and said.","Shen Tianzheng was reluctant. He had finally seen his daughter and great-grandson, and now they were telling him to go back to his room. What was that all about?","\"Grandpa, Zhengzheng will help you.\" The little one pulled Shen Tianzheng's hand.","Shen Tianzheng stood up, letting Xu Yunzheng hold his finger and lead him.","Xu Yunzheng didn't know where Shen Tianzheng's room was, so when Shen Tianzheng stood up, he looked at Fang Yue for help.","\"Zhengzheng is so sensible,\" Fang Yue sighed.","Shen Yin didn't say anything, but she totally agreed with that statement. He was too sensible, too thoughtful, rarely causing her any worries, and always keeping her company.","If she didn't have Zhengzheng when she first came to this world, she might not know what kind of person she would have become.","\"Next April, Zhengzheng will be three years old,\" Fang Yue asked.","Shen Yin really didn't know, and suddenly felt apologetic that she hadn't paid much attention to Zhengzheng's birthday since coming here.","\"Yes.\"","Fang Yue continued, \"When you gave birth to Zhengzheng, I was actually outside the whole time. It's quite a coincidence that your birthday and Zhengzheng's are just one day apart.\"","One day apart, she remembered the original owner's date of birth on her ID card, and the date she was in Dasheng was also just one day apart. Could it be that she and Zhengzheng were born on the same day? Is this fate?","\"Next year, I'll make sure to celebrate your and Zhengzheng's birthdays properly. It's been years since I gave my precious daughter a birthday celebration. I know you may still resent what your father did to you, but it doesn't matter. All I hope for now is that you and your family stay safe and healthy, and that you can come visit us often.\" Fang Yue looked at Shen Yin.","In the journey of life, some things will never change.","\"Let's have dinner here tonight.\" Mom then asked the maid to cook.","\"No need, mom. Xiuhe and I have to go back tonight. I still need to be back by 5 PM for some work at the studio.\"","\"I see. Then whenever you have time, you, Xiuhe and Zhengzheng should all come over. Let your brother come back too, and we'll have a meal together.\"","\"Okay.\"","After Shen Tianzheng took a nap in the afternoon, Fang Yue kept chatting with Shen Yin. It had been years since she had a heart-to-heart talk with Shen Yin. Previously, when she came to pick up Zhengzheng, she didn't want to disturb Shen Yin's work, so she didn't say much.","\"Zhengzheng is just like you, not only in looks but also in personality, obedient and sensible. When you were in middle school, you would help me massage my shoulders every day. In high school, you never let me worry about your studies.\"","When people get old, they tend to reminisce about the past. People always feel more fortunate when approaching happiness, but become anxious when happiness is ongoing.","Fang Yue was like that.","Shen Tianzheng had recovered, Shen Yin was back to normal, and she became her little cotton-padded jacket again.","But she was afraid, afraid that Shen Yin might still harbor resentment towards her, afraid that the current situation would suddenly disappear.","So, she took Shen Yin to her old bedroom and told her that no one had touched the room all these years.","Shen Yin looked around the bedroom and could tell that when the original owner's mental state was still fine, she was a kind, gentle, cheerful, and lovely young girl.","Suddenly, she remembered the dream she had last time, a girl with such a personality would probably have a good life in that other world.","Fang Yue pointed to the certificates on the wall, trophies in the cabinet, and told Shen Yin about each one.","Awards for calligraphy competitions, piano competitions, dance competitions. As Fang Yue recounted these things, she seemed nostalgic, speaking eloquently, and Shen Yin listened with relish.","Before they knew it, time had passed through Fang Yue's gentle and detailed narration.","\"Mom, it's getting late. Zhengzheng and I should head back.\"","\"Okay, let me see you off.\"","The sun outside was not as scorching as it was in the afternoon.","Shen Tianzheng had also gotten up and joined Fang Yue at the door to bid farewell to Shen Yin.","As always, Zhengzheng blew a kiss goodbye.","\"Zhengzheng, meeting you is the greatest fortune of my life,\" Shen Yin said softly.","Because of Zhengzheng, she felt warmth and learned what a mother's love was. Because of Zhengzheng, she walked through an exceptionally difficult path.","\"Mom, Zhengzheng is also lucky.\"","Life is long, looking back and looking forward. Shen Yin felt that everything was for the best, no matter what happened, there was always a purpose behind it. She was fortunate to have met Xu Xiuhe and Xu Yunzheng, to have encountered love.","All things were luxuriantly growing in the summer, and she too must strive to grow.","When they returned to the small building, the employees had just gotten off work. Her relationship with them was not close, always maintaining a superior-subordinate relationship. But the employees were not afraid of her at all.","They greeted Shen Yin warmly, bidding her farewell. As they were leaving, Shen Yin, surprisingly, said, \"Have a nice weekend.\"","Have a nice weekend, how wonderful that sounded.","The cool evening breeze blew in, soothing the fatigue of the day. Inside the little house, the lights were bright and delicious aromas wafted through the air.","\"My dear wife, you've worked hard,\" Xu Xiuhe said as he embraced Shen Yin from behind.","\"Let's hire a maid to do the cooking.\"","\"Why is that?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I don't want you to be burdened,\" Xu Xiuhe said softly. He had been negligent before, until today when he saw the photo Xue Jingrui posted in their group chat.","[My mom says my wife shouldn't be in the kitchen. Look, brothers, aren't my cooking skills good?] Xue Jingrui had written, alongside a photo of the lunch he had made himself.","Seeing that message filled Xu Xiuhe with remorse for half a day."]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Encountering Scum","paragraphs":["He felt that he was an unqualified husband.","\"A good man should never let his wife into the kitchen,\" Xu Xiuhe said seriously.","\"Haha.\" Shen Yin laughed out loud. This man always came up with such ideas.","\"Do you think you're a good man?\" Shen Yin asked.","This question stumped Xu Xiuhe.","\"You are good, a good father, a good husband. As for entering the kitchen, it's not like you forced me to. I enjoy it myself, and I'm happy to cook for the one I love. It has nothing to do with whether you're a good man or not.\" Shen Yin spoke at length.","The one she loved, Xu Xiuhe caught the key point.","Love is a gentle stream, love is constant companionship, love is being happy just having you by my side.","After dinner, Shen Yin saw that the moonlight was perfect outside, and the evening breeze was pleasant, so she thought of going for a walk.","Xu Xiuhe naturally wanted to accompany her.","\"Shall we go down Qinghe Street again?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","The bluestone pavement of Qinghe Street was suitable for walking, but Shen Yin wanted to try a different street.","\"We walked there last time. Let's go a bit further this time and experience the pace of life in the surrounding area,\" Shen Yin replied.","Near Qinghe Street, there were residential areas, shops, and roadside stalls, the bustling atmosphere of daily life that could soothe one's heart.","At the roadside stalls, there was barbecue and dine-and-dash eateries.","A family of three walked hand in hand, a sight Xu Xiuhe hadn't seen in many years.","In the wind, there was the aroma of cumin and grilled meat.","\"Mom, it smells so good,\" Xu Yunzheng stood by the roadside, looking at the barbecue stall, unable to move.","\"Then Mom will take Zhengzheng out to eat next time, okay?\" Shen Yin asked.","Zhengzheng wasn't hungry; he had eaten a lot for dinner. But this place smelled so good, and it was the first time he had seen people casually setting up a table by the roadside to eat, so he couldn't help but be curious.","\"Okay, let's go, Mom.\"","Xu Yunzheng turned back.","\"There's an alley up ahead. Let's take a detour through there and head home,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"Okay.\"","The alley they were taking back was dimly lit, with almost no one around, in stark contrast to the bustling and prosperous atmosphere they had just left.","\"This area probably has more tenants, so there aren't many people out at this hour,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Listen, what's that sound up ahead?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe listened and picked up Zhengzheng. \"It sounds like a fight, a brawl.\"","\"I'll go take a look,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Xiuhe had actually thought it would be better to avoid trouble and just return the way they came, but seeing Shen Yin's expression of curiosity, he didn't stop her.","Shen Yin walked ahead, and Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng behind her. The sound grew louder and louder.","Not far ahead.","A young woman was being pinned down on the ground by two men, who were beating and even kicking her.","There was another young woman standing behind the two men, hitting them hard with her handbag.","\"Keep yelling, and we'll stuff your panties in your mouth.\"","\"What are you trying to pull, dressed like that late at night in a spaghetti strap top? You obviously wanted someone to follow you, so why are you resisting now?\" said the other man.","\"Let her go. I'm calling the police,\" said the woman with the bag, backing up and calmly taking out her phone.","\"Shut up, you dare call the police? I'd like to see you try.\" One of the men turned and grabbed the woman with the bag, lifted his foot and kicked her in the back of the knee. The woman cried out in pain and fell to her knees.","\"Minding other people's business, asking for trouble. You'll end up like her.\"","The two burly men swore as they tore at the dress of the woman on the ground.","This was the scene that Shen Yin witnessed upon arrival. The two men were like beasts, violently assaulting the two defenseless young women.","\"Stop it,\" Shen Yin spoke up.","\"Oh, look who's minding other people's business again. This one's not bad, quite a catch.\"","The other man turned his head upon hearing her, then revealed a lewd grin.","\"I advise you to leave and mind your own business. Otherwise, you'll end up worse than them,\" the man laughed lewdly, his voice dripping with grease.","Shen Yin felt disgusted and wanted to vomit.","Xu Xiuhe, who was behind her, heard this and his expression turned furious. He wanted to rush over and punch that filthy mouth.","But then he remembered he was holding Zhengzheng, so he took out his phone to call the police.","Xu Xiuhe was quite a distance away, but as he watched Shen Yin stretch, he suddenly didn't want to call anymore.","\"Zhengzheng, let's wait for Mommy together. Want to watch cartoons?\" Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng a little further away. He believed in Shen Yin.","Xu Yunzheng was delighted.","\"What if I refuse to mind my own business?\" Shen Yin calmly spoke, her tone cold. Truly, there were strange people everywhere, and all kinds of birds in a big forest.","Beasts, animals, scum.","\"Then don't blame us for being impolite. There aren't any surveillance cameras in this alley.\"","Shen Yin smiled. No surveillance cameras? Even better. She had noticed earlier, and Xu Xiuhe had probably understood her meaning. After this, she would have no reservations.","The two burly men approached. The two young women finally had a glimmer of hope and shrank back a little. They could run, but they didn't. One woman tried to reach for her bag to get her phone.","Shen Yin saw this and said, \"Don't bother calling the police.\"","\"Hehehehehehehehe.\" One of the big men turned and snatched the phone away, smashing it on the ground beside them.","The other man looked at Shen Yin's delicate frame and tried to use the same tactic, attempting to bring her down.","But Shen Yin was too quick and dodged to the side, causing the man to miss.","Enraged, he charged at Shen Yin with his fist raised.","Shen Yin dodged again.","\"Not bad, you move pretty fast, little girl. If you behave now, we'll let you enjoy it a bit later,\" said the man who had smashed the phone.","\"Screw off, you filthy dog. You think you can just grab anyone you want?\" Shen Yin swore for the first time.","Shen Yin was swift and nimble. This body had learned dance, so it wasn't difficult at all. As the man charged, she lifted her leg high and kicked him in a sensitive area.","The man cried out in pain, clutching himself down there and calling out, \"Bitch!\" before jumping back up.","The other man continued to approach, and Shen Yin moved behind him. With all her might, she kicked the back of his knee joint, just like the woman had kneed the other man's leg earlier.","The man fell to one knee.","Shen Yin kicked his other leg, and finally, this man was on both knees.","Shen Yin swung her elbow towards the man's neck, and then she stepped on his leg.","\"You two, come here,\" Shen Yin said, looking towards the two young girls crouched against the wall.","Then, thinking of something else, she asked, \"Are you able to stand up?\"","\"Yes,\" the woman holding a bag replied, rising to her feet.","The other woman, who had previously been pinned to the ground, also struggled to stand up, smoothing out her dress. Her face was swollen, her crying just having stopped.","\"What did they do to you just now? Why did you come back?\" Shen Yin asked them.","After saying this, she forcefully kicked one of the men, knocking him to the ground, while the other was still hopping around."]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Protect Yourself","paragraphs":["Shen Yin walked behind the bouncing man and, taking advantage of the man's jump, tripped him. The man stumbled forward, and Shen Yin followed through with another kick.","Shen Yin wasn't foolish. She was skilled in martial arts, but the disparity between men and women was still too great. She had to use clever techniques instead of brute force.","After the man fell, Shen Yin stepped on his head and asked, \"I'm meddling, so what can you do to me, call the police? Go ahead, I'll wait.\" Shen Yin crossed her arms and said nonchalantly.","\"Don't come back. They're a bunch of social scum, looking human but acting dishonorably to their ancestors.\"","Shen Yin turned to the two standing girls and said.","The two girls were a bit afraid.","\"Don't be afraid, you did nothing wrong. They're the ones at fault. There are no cameras here, so fight back. You were stalked and sexually harassed, can't you defend yourselves?\"","The two girls then walked forward.","The woman carrying a bag vigorously hit the man's face with her bag. The man tried to get up, but he didn't know why that frail woman was so strong that he couldn't get up at all.","\"Let me go, I was wrong,\" the man begged.","\"Yes, yes, I was wrong too.\"","\"You beast, if you knew it was wrong from the start, why did you still do it? What's wrong with me wearing a skirt?\" The girl with the swollen face cried.","\"Does me wearing a skirt justify you stalking me, molesting me, and using violence against me? Do women have to wear armor to go out?\"","\"This is a civilized society. I didn't expect to encounter such an incident. Don't take advantage of being drunk to do whatever you want and expose your true nature,\" said the woman carrying the bag.","\"It's you who's meddling,\" the man lying on the ground still wanted to argue.","\"I'm a woman. When I see another woman in trouble, I naturally lend a hand. As for you, do you really understand that you were wrong? If we hadn't met this sister, with your violence, would she and I still be alive?\"","\"Even knowing there are no cameras here, was this premeditated or just a spur of the moment?\" The woman carrying the bag had remained calm until now, but she was also in tears from the aftershock. No one wants to encounter such an incident, but when it really happens, who wouldn't be afraid?","If it weren't for this sister's help, would they have been killed by violence or assaulted?","Before, she had only seen such things online – girls being stalked for wearing skirts, girls being secretly photographed on the subway, girls being insulted for speaking up for themselves. At that time, it really did seem far removed from her own life.","But when it actually happened to her, she realized that for a girl, luck sometimes isn't about having the person you like liking you back, passing exams, completing work, or getting paid.","Rather, it's about not being stalked when walking at night, not being secretly photographed for wearing a short skirt, not being ogled for wearing a tank top, going out and getting home safely without encountering bad people, and being able to speak up for women on social media without being insulted.","With Shen Yin's backing, the two girls were emboldened by their anger and slapped the man repeatedly.","\"Scum, why don't you just die? How can you even call yourself human?\" The girl cursed as she hit him, but then had a thought - if they let him go today, wouldn't these lowlifes stretch out their evil hands to other girls tomorrow?","\"Aren't we really going to call the police?\" the girl with the swollen face asked Shen Yin.","\"Let's finish beating him first,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Are you sure there are no cameras?\" the girl asked again.","The girl carrying the bag looked around. She had lived in this area for a while but had never noticed any cameras. There were few residents here, not even street lights. \"No.\"","The girl with the swollen face walked over to Shen Yin and asked, \"Sister, can I hit him?\"","The man kept screaming, annoying Shen Yin. She looked at the girl carrying the bag and said, \"Do you have any paper in your bag?\"","The girl nodded, and Shen Yin took the paper from her, crumpled it into two balls, and stuffed them into the man's mouth.","The girl with the swollen face, wearing high heels, kicked the man. The man curled up his body, and the excess flesh on his legs jiggled with his movements.","The girl felt disgusted. Taking aim, she stomped down with her thin high heel.","Shen Yin inwardly exclaimed, \"Ouch!\" That kick was much more painful than the ones she had delivered earlier. That stomp was probably more painful than castration during the Dasheng Dynasty.","The other girl was also shocked but only for two seconds. They were the victims here. This was nothing compared to almost losing their lives earlier. She also imitated the other girl and stomped down.","The man made a sound, but with his mouth stuffed, he could only mumble.","Expressions of pain and shock occupied their swollen, bruised faces.","\"Sister, thank you. Without you, we would have been done for,\" the two girls expressed their gratitude.","Xu Xiuhe then came over, carrying Xu Yunzheng, and took out her phone to photograph the girls' faces.","\"No need to thank me. Any woman wouldn't turn a blind eye to such an incident.\"","\"What do we do next?\" the girl asked.","Shen Yin: \"Leave. They brought this upon themselves.\"","\"They will face legal consequences next,\" Xu Xiuhe spoke up.","\"Sister, have you practiced martial arts?\"","\"Yes, I've practiced a bit.\"","\"I want to learn too. I used to think this kind of thing wouldn't happen to me, but now I don't think that way anymore. I want to learn to protect myself.\"","\"Okay, then learn.\"","\"Where did you learn? You're so formidable.\"","\"It's a family tradition,\" Shen Yin replied, which was indeed the truth - her great-grandfather had taught her.","\"Could you teach me? I can pay tuition.\"","\"Me too.\"","Shen Yin: \"Write down my phone number. You can find me if you want to learn.\"","The two girls expressed their gratitude again.","\"Go back and treat your injuries. Get some rest.\"","After thanking her again, they left.","\"Wife, you weren't hurt, were you?\" Xu Xiuhe asked with concern.","He had been extremely worried over there.","\"No, you forgot I could take on five men alone?\"","\"Mommy, were they bad people?\" Xu Yunzheng didn't know what had happened, only seeing two people lying on the ground.","\"Yes, they were bad people who bullied girls, so Mommy beat them up just now.\"","\"Wow, Mommy is amazing!\" Yunzheng applauded.","\"Yunzheng wants to beat up bad people too.\"","\"That has to wait until Yunzheng grows up and becomes strong enough to defeat them. For now, Yunzheng needs to be kind to girls and not harm them. Mom is a girl, so Yunzheng must protect Mom,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Okay, Yunzheng will protect Mom and protect girls from now on.\"","\"So there were such beasts even in that era,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"You had them too in your time?\"","\"Yes, bullies who abducted and raped women.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought about it and realized she was right. Although Shen Yin came from a dynasty that never existed historically, it was still ancient times. Such things were quite normal back then.","\"My grandfather taught me martial arts from a young age, not to serve the country, but to defend myself from being bullied. I always thought there were no such incidents here. But today I encountered one.\"","\"Are these kinds of incidents common here?\" Shen Yin asked further."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: May we all be lucky","paragraphs":["This question stumped Xu Xiuhe. He knew the world didn't seem so good, and in the past when he was busy with work, he never paid attention to these kinds of incidents.","Occasionally, he would see trending topics pop up on his phone, but he would just scroll past them, letting the news pass by without leaving a trace.","Looking back carefully, it seemed like these kinds of incidents were not uncommon - being molested on the bus, having clothes stripped off on the subway, being murdered while out for a morning jog, or even being beaten bloody just for rejecting someone's advances.","Afterward, there would only be a temporary buzz in the news, and then nothing.","It would create a small ripple, but never a big wave no matter what.","\"The dark side is just too prevalent, and we are helpless,\" Xu Xiuhe reflected. He truly hadn't paid attention to these things before.","The two of them fell into a prolonged silence.","Finally, it was Zhengzheng who broke the silence.","\"Mom, the bad people are so bad.\"","\"Yes, bad people can be heartless, and they deserve to be severely punished. You could even say they are not really human.\"","\"Bad people need to be punished. When Zhengzheng grows up, I'll go catch the bad people.\"","\"Good, our Zhengzheng will grow up to be a real stand-up man.\"","After returning home and coaxing Zhengzheng to sleep, Shen Yin asked Xu Xiuhe: \"What should we do about tonight's incident? Those two men are probably crippled.\"","\"Tomorrow I'll have someone expose this incident. Jing Rui's father is a high-ranking official in the city, so at that time, they should step up social security efforts.\"","\"What about those two men?\"","\"They got what they deserved. Let them fend for themselves. I've already taken photos of them. Just now I sent the photos to Liu Bo and had him investigate them. They have criminal records.\"","\"Criminal records?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"No wonder these kinds of incidents are so common nowadays. It seems the punishments have been too lenient. They pay too little of a price, so they act with impunity,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Let's sleep for now.\"","The next day, photos of the two perverted men appeared on the local social media.","Indeed, Xu Xiuhe had paid to make the story a trending topic. Only by doing so could he draw people's attention and make them aware of the issue. Problems need to be solved, not avoided.","Soon, many people began voicing their opinions under the post.","[I was the victim in this incident. I was just wearing a dress and trying to go home when these two men started following me. They threatened me to 'know my place.' Then we ran into another girl who tried to help, and they assaulted us both. Luckily, a good Samaritan came and helped us. I know not every victim girl is as lucky as me. Was I wrong for wearing a dress? Was I wrong for trying to go home? I know this incident has been exposed, and there will still be many people blaming me, but I just want to say - the victim is not at fault.]","Below this post was a selfie of the girl, her eyes blackened, her lip split, and her face badly swollen.","More and more comments poured in, with many girls sharing similar experiences they had faced.","Soon, Shu Yi also reposted the story, and the Heyuan Group's official account also spoke up, even Chang Zhiyuan reposted it on his personal account.","[What exactly do they want girls to do?] became a trending topic again.","In the small group chat of Heyuan Group executives, messages kept pouring in praising their CEO.","Shu Yi inexplicably gained a wave of new female fans.","There were comments accusing her of riding the trend for publicity.","But within seconds, the people who made those comments were bombarded with abuse.","[Is she riding the trend? This is exactly the kind of trend that deserves to be ridden. We need people to speak up. Otherwise, the news will pass, and similar incidents will happen again.]","[Well said, why should we let scum in society off the hook?]","[I stand with those who speak up.]","Finally, netizens all wanted to find the 'good Samaritan' the girl mentioned.","After all, it was an incredibly brave act to rescue two girls. If he hadn't been there, would the two young girls have met a terrible fate?","Xu Xiuhe handled the information skillfully, revealing what was appropriate to reveal while keeping other details under wraps.","The law would punish those men, and many people commented that the punishment should be severe.","But did it end there? No, it didn't.","Shu Yi posted again on social media.","[I hope all girls can live safe and happy lives. Protect yourselves, and carry self-defense tools with you when going out. In case you can't get help from those around you when in danger, you'll be able to defend yourself.]","Watching the various discussions online, Shen Yin fell into contemplation. At her studio, all her employees were young girls, each as beautiful as a flower. If she couldn't protect others, she could at least protect those around her.","Shen Yin went online and purchased several anti-wolf alarms and small weapons, intending to give one set to each of her five employees.","Xu Xiuhe didn't go to work since it was the weekend, so he could accompany his wife. Seeing Shen Yin buy these self-defense items, he had the same idea.","He messaged Liu Bo, asking him to procure these self-defense tools and alarms for the female employees at Heyuan Group, one set for each.","Liu Bo was efficient, immediately contacting nearby factories. Two hours later, a large truck pulled up at the Heyuan Group office building.","Workers unloaded box after box, carrying them into the office tower.","Heyuan Group was on a rotating weekend shift, with only one-third of employees present. But with such a large workforce, those who saw the boxes labeled 'self-defense weapons' and 'alarms' immediately shared the news in the group chat, causing an uproar.","Soon, 'Heyuan Group' became a trending topic.","[Let's discuss how fortunate Heyuan Group employees are.] The post included photos of the self-defense items.","More and more comments flooded in.","[I'm so envious]","[How can I get a job at Heyuan Group?]","[I wish I had a boss like this too]","[The CEO's wife must be super blessed]","[I wish my boss could learn from this]","At the Qinghe Villa, the family of three had just finished lunch and was about to take an afternoon nap when Shen Yin picked up her phone to see a message from Shu Yi.","[Your husband is so awesome.]","Shen Yin [?]","What happened that she didn't know about?","[Check social media.]","Shu Yi forwarded the trending topic to her.","[Other people's bosses]","Shen Yin protested that Xu Xiuhe was just copying her. She was the one with an awesome boss, not the other way around.","[Woo woo woo, I'm the boss of someone else's company, he saw me buying these things to give to employees, so he bought them too, but he's more efficient.]","[Hahaha hahahaha, that made me laugh, Shen Yin you're so cool.]","[I hope the girls can be treated well.]","[Yeah.]","[How's your filming going?] Shen Yin asked.","[It's too hot today, the efficiency is a bit slow, you don't know how ridiculous Chang Zhiyuan is, he wants to change the script.]","[How does he want to change it?]","[Never mind, I'll tell you when I get back, I can't explain it clearly in a few words now.]"]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Bad people go to hell","paragraphs":["\"Xiuhe, why are you so efficient?\" Shen Yin spoke with a slightly spoiled tone.","Xu Xiuhe rarely heard Shen Yin use such a tone, feeling a bit smug. What man wouldn't be happy when the woman he loves acts spoiled with him?","\"Next time you have something to do, tell me, and I'll definitely be faster than you.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"You're really not going to the company today?\"","\"It's Sunday today.\"","Shen Yin...","She knew it was Sunday, but wasn't he the company president? He used to work on Sundays too, but now he's becoming more and more indolent.","\"Do you have anything planned for the afternoon?\"","\"Why?\"","\"Today is my mother's anniversary of passing. I want to go see her, and let her see you too.\"","\"I'm free.\"","At the cemetery, Shen Yin stood beside Xu Xiuhe, who was holding Zhengzheng in his arms.","\"Grandma,\" Zhengzheng called out.","Xu Xiuhe had brought him here last year too, but back then he couldn't speak yet. Unexpectedly, this year, without any teaching, he called out on his own.","\"Mom, I've come to see you. This time, your daughter-in-law has come too,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin looked at the photo on the tombstone, where the woman was smiling happily, with features resembling Xu Xiuhe's.","\"Mom, I've come to see you.\"","Shen Yin had been without a mother since she was young, until she met Fang Yue and experienced a mother's love, realizing the warmth of that word.","Now, she was a mother too. Looking at the photo, she couldn't help but be entranced.","\"Mom, you raised Xiuhe well. He's been good to me and to Zhengzheng, and even to the employees at the company. Thank you, Mom.\"","Xu Xiuhe probably didn't expect Shen Yin to say such words, and he turned to look at her.","\"Grandma, Dad is great, Zhengzheng is great too, and Mom is even better. Grandma must have been really great.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin smiled slightly.","\"Mommy, where is Grandma? Why has Zhengzheng never seen her?\" Zhengzheng asked curiously, looking at the tombstone.","\"Grandma is in heaven. She came to this world for a while to complete her mission, and now she has returned to heaven.\"","\"Is heaven a good place?\"","\"Yes, heaven is a good place.\"","\"Then Zhengzheng wants to go to heaven too!\" Zhengzheng clapped his hands excitedly.","\"Ahem, we shouldn't be saying that. Zhengzheng, people only leave this world when they grow old and pass away,\" Shen Yin corrected him.","\"Dear, children speak without restraint. Don't listen to your grandson's nonsense,\" Xu Xiuhe said, looking at the photo.","\"Oh, I understand. Good people go to heaven, but where do the bad people go?\" Children always have so many strange questions.","\"Bad people go to hell, where there are all kinds of punishments to make them understand that even after death, if they did wrong, they won't be at peace.\"","She didn't know if hell really existed, but she knew that there would be cause and effect, that bad deeds would be repaid. After all, she had even experienced the strange phenomenon of transmigration, so she believed that evildoers would face retribution.","\"Then will the bad people from yesterday go to hell? They bullied the girl, so they're bad people. Zhengzheng wants them to go to hell soon.\"","\"They will go to hell, it's just not their time yet. But Zhengzheng, we must know that people can't do bad things.\"","\"Mom, you must be doing well over there. Please bless Zhengzheng, Yin Yin, and I, to be safe, happy, and healthy. We'll come see you often. For now, we'll leave first.\"","\"Goodbye, Grandma.\"","\"Mom, goodbye. I'll definitely take good care of Zhengzheng and Xiuhe.\"","On the way back, Xu Xiuhe joked, \"Wife, you promised Mom you'd treat me well, so you can't go back on your word.\"","Shen Yin responded lightly, \"Sure, I won't go back on my word. Can you tell me about your mother? I don't know anything about your past.\"","\"My mother had a good temperament, gentle and gracious. Initially, she and my father made vows of eternal love, and she brought quite a dowry when marrying him. But after just a few years, my father had an affair. I always knew, but I didn't know if she knew. Until one day, she told me that if she wasn't around anymore, I must protect myself and not confront that man. Shortly after she passed away from illness, my father remarried someone else - Yang Cui.\"","\"So your childhood must have been very miserable.\"","\"It was alright, but you had it worse than me. We're a match made in heaven. I was a bit luckier, at least that woman didn't force me to marry an old man.\"","\"...\"","\"Don't worry, I'll never treat you the way that man treated you. I've said it before, the spouse spot in my life can only be you, and yours can only be me, unless I die. Understand?\"","Xu Xiuhe turned to look at Shen Yin in the passenger seat as he spoke.","When she heard the word \"die,\" Shen Yin suddenly covered Xu Xiuhe's mouth with her hand. \"Don't say unlucky things. Say blessings instead, like we'll both live long lives.\"","\"Okay, we'll definitely live long lives and grow old together.\"","\"Zhengzheng will live a long life too and grow old with us!\" The baby in the back suddenly piped up.","\"You're awake, Zhengzheng?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Mommy, I'm thirsty.\"","Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe, signaling him to stop the car so she could go to the back seat.","Shen Yin sat in the back, took out a water bottle from her bag, and held it to Xu Zhengzheng's mouth.","The little one gulped down a few mouthfuls.","Then Shen Yin's phone rang.","\"Hello?\"","\"Are you the sister who rescued me yesterday?\"","Shen Yin immediately recognized the voice of the girl who had been in trouble yesterday.","\"Yes, what is it?\"","\"I want to come learn some martial arts from you.\"","\"Sure, when are you free?\"","\"I'm free on weekends.\"","\"Then come to Qinghe Street on the weekend. There's a Yunyin Clothing Workshop here, I'll be there.\"","\"Okay, thank you, sister.\"","The phone was on speaker, so Xu Xiuhe clearly heard their conversation.","\"Will you be able to handle it?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yes, do you see me busy every day? Actually, I don't have much work on my hands right now. Teaching them some self-defense would be good. If I can help one person, that's one person helped.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't say more. Indeed, if you can help one person, that's one person helped. No one knows what might happen tomorrow, or if misfortune could befall them in the next second.","In the evening, Shen Yin continued embroidering the unfinished tiger head, and Xu Xiuhe was worried that Shen Yin would get tired, so he would occasionally bring her a cup of tea or a piece of fruit.","\"Xiuhe, do you feel like I'm working slowly?\" Shen Yin asked with a smile.","\"Not at all, it hasn't been that long, and you've already embroidered so much.\"","Shen Yin wanted to say that Xu Xiuhe was being too attentive and it was distracting her, but the man didn't seem to notice, and he didn't even pick up on the implied meaning in her words.","\"How's the online situation going?\"","\"It's still brewing.\"","\"That's good.\"","\"Indeed, I did buy a hot search trend.\"","\"Oh?\"","Shen Yin suddenly remembered that her clothing workshop had been trending for a while, and now it seemed that it was because of the man in front of her buying the trend.","Shen Yin suddenly wanted to tease Xu Xiuhe a little, so she asked, \"How many times have you bought it?\""]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Buying a House","paragraphs":["\"Hmm? Maybe just one time.\" Xu Xiuhe scratched his nose slightly abashed.","\"The studio's hot search last time, did you buy that?\" Shen Yin looked into Xu Xiuhe's eyes and giggled coquettishly.","\"Yeah, I support my wife's work. Is that not allowed?\"","\"It's allowed, but didn't a certain someone say before that he didn't want me to work?\"","\"I didn't, dear wife, you can't slander me. I just said that because I was afraid you'd get tired. Besides, I can afford to support you. I'll earn money to support the family, and you just need to look beautiful.\"","\"Your mouth is so sweet,\" Shen Yin smiled sweetly, her eyes seeming to sparkle like stars.","Xu Xiuhe gazed at Shen Yin, entranced. How fortunate he was to have met her.","\"I know you can afford to support me, but I don't want to be completely dependent on you. Although I came from the Dasheng Dynasty, the status of women there was higher compared to previous dynasties. Of course, it can't be compared to now, but it was very common for women to do business in the Dasheng Dynasty. I also know that in love, money doesn't matter, but from ancient times until now, having a good match has always been valued.\"","Xu Xiuhe couldn't help but stroke Shen Yin's beautiful hair, twirling a lock in his fingers.","Shen Yin continued, \"When I first came here, I read a poem from your era called 'To the Oak Tree,' which had a line: 'I will not be like the entwining climbing flowers that borrow your tall branches to show myself off; I must be the cotton tree standing close beside you, assuming my own true nature as a tree.' This poem is quite interesting. I think this should be the ideal state of love.\"","\"Alright, then we'll stand together, equal under Heaven and Earth,\" Xu Xiuhe said after hearing Shen Yin's words, feeling that his wife's thinking was even more progressive than modern people.","\"It's getting late, let's go to sleep. Tomorrow is Monday,\" Shen Yin reminded him.","As the myriad stars in the sky turned into a distant blue, Shen Yin realized that there was still a long journey ahead, but fortunately, she wasn't alone.","The next morning, when the studio girls arrived at Qinghe Villa, they were touched to see the items on the reception desk - today's dose of warmth was from the boss.","Recently, besides accompanying Zhengzheng, Shen Yin had been studying delicious foods, occasionally doing embroidery, keeping an eye on Kang Guopeng's progress, and sometimes visiting her parents.","Weekends came and went. At the counter, Li Huanhuan saw from afar five or six girls peeking in, too afraid to approach because of the five Tibetan mastiffs standing guard.","Li Huanhuan figured they must be there to order dresses, so she went out and said, \"Ladies, don't be afraid. They don't bite, they're very obedient.\"","At first, Li Huanhuan and Chen Nuan were also afraid of the massive dogs sitting in a row at the studio entrance. But over time, they found the dogs quite adorable. As long as you didn't mean them any harm, they would be well-behaved, greeting the girls as they arrived for work and seeing them off when they went home.","The girls outside saw that the dogs were indeed just sitting there peacefully, their expressions gentle. Reassured, they came inside.","There were sofas on the first floor, and at Li Huanhuan's invitation, the girls sat down.","\"Ladies, are you here to order dresses?\" Li Huanhuan asked as she poured them water.","\"No, I'm here to find someone - a very beautiful lady,\" one of the girls replied.","The girl had looked up Yunyin Studio online beforehand and, based on what she saw that night, guessed that the woman who had rescued her wasn't an ordinary person. She later saw the woman's husband and child, pieced everything together, and realized this woman was the wife of the Yuanchi Group's CEO.","The girl's feelings were conflicted - she didn't know what to do. Then another girl asked her when she had learned martial arts, so she decided to come here, although she hadn't expected the other girl to bring three more along.","Li Huanhuan caught the crucial point - a very beautiful lady must be referring to their boss - and called Shen Yin down.","When Shen Yin came downstairs, the girls rushed over to her excitedly.","Shen Yin immediately recognized two of the girls from the incident last Saturday.","The injuries on the girl's face had healed significantly, though there were still faint marks.","\"You came.\"","\"Yes, and I'm still very grateful. This is a specialty from my hometown,\" the girl said, handing Shen Yin a bag.","Shen Yin accepted it.","\"My name is Shen Meng.\"","\"I'm Lin Yaqi. These are my friends. After finding out what happened to me, they also got scared and wanted to learn some self-defense skills.\"","\"We're willing to pay tuition fees. Can you teach us?\"","Shen Yin... She had originally planned to teach these two girls whenever she practiced, without intending to charge fees. But now a whole group had shown up at once.","\"It's a bit crowded, this studio is too small for five people to practice together,\" Shen Yin said apologetically.","\"Then could you open a women's self-defense training center?\" Shen Meng suggested.","Shen Yin's eyes lit up. That wasn't a bad idea. Since she had to teach Zhengzheng and Shu Yi anyway, she might as well establish a dedicated venue that was more professional and comfortable.","\"Okay, I have your contact information. I'll notify you all when it opens.\"","The girls left excitedly after expressing their gratitude once more.","Shen Yin was a woman of action. She had been eyeing the vacant villa across the street for a long time and had been thinking about buying it.","No sooner said than done, Shen Yin contacted the local neighborhood office to get the owner's contact information for the villa at 47 Qinghe Villa.","She made a call.","\"Hello, are you the owner of the property at 47 Qinghe Villa?\"","\"Yes, that's me.\"","Shen Yin asked again, \"This house has been vacant for a while. Do you have any plans to sell it?\"","\"How much can you offer?\" the man on the other end asked.","The villa was nice and valuable, but its location was a bit remote, so the man had been wanting to sell it but hadn't found a suitable price. That's why it had remained vacant.","\"What price do you think is appropriate? For a villa like this, the normal price now should be around 10 million yuan. How about 12 million yuan?\" Shen Yin proposed.","\"That's a bit low. How about 13 million yuan?\" the man countered.","\"Alright, deal,\" Shen Yin said. \"Come over in the afternoon, and we'll take care of the paperwork. Once it's done, the money will be transferred to your account.\"","The man didn't expect the woman to be so straightforward and efficient. He had merely mentioned it, and selling for 12 million was a win for him. What was there to be unhappy about?","After finishing lunch, when Shen Yin came out again, the small building across the way had its doors open. Shen Yin crossed the stone bridge, leading Zhengzheng into Building No. 47.","There was no furniture inside. As Shen Yin entered, a man around 30 years old approached her.","\"Would you like to take another look before deciding whether to buy?\" the man suggested.","\"No need, let's just go through with the paperwork,\" Shen Yin replied."]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: My Money is All Yours","paragraphs":["Shen Yin had researched all the procedures for completing the paperwork earlier in the afternoon, so she went directly with the necessary documents to handle the formalities.","Signing the contract, transferring ownership, and paying the money.","The owner of building 47 had never seen anyone buy a house in this manner before. Fortunately, the money had already been transferred to his account, otherwise he would have thought he was being scammed.","As evening approached, Shen Yin walked around the small building across the street, looking at the property deed with her name on it, feeling very satisfied.","When Xu Xiuhe returned, he found the door of the small building was open, but there was no one inside. The five Tibetan mastiffs greeted him, wagging their tails excitedly.","Xu Xiuhe was a little worried, thinking they might have had an accident.","Xu Xiuhe took out his phone and immediately dialed \"520\". Shen Yin's phone rang from the counter behind him.","The phone was there, but she wasn't. The man picked up the phone, becoming more and more anxious as he thought about it, his expression growing tenser.","\"Flower, where are my wife and son?\" Xu Xiuhe was clueless and could only ask the dogs beside him.","\"Woof, woof, woof\" the dogs barked simultaneously towards the small building across the street.","Xu Xiuhe looked over and saw that the door of the small building, which had never been opened before, was now ajar.","The man crossed the bridge and entered the building.","\"Wife, Zheng Zheng?\"","No one answered.","Xu Xiuhe went upstairs, and halfway up, he finally heard Xu Yunzheng's voice, and his worries subsided.","\"Mom, dad is here,\" Xu Yunzheng said to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin turned around, a little surprised, \"Xiuhe, how did you know we were here?\"","\"Next time, wherever you go, take your phone with you. I get scared when I can't find you,\" Xu Xiuhe handed the phone to Shen Yin.","\"Look, what do you think of this small building?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"It's pretty good. Flower told me you were here.\"","\"Dad, did Flower talk to you?\" Xu Yunzheng looked a little disappointed. Why did they never respond when he talked to Flower and the others every day, but they spoke to his dad?","\"Zheng Zheng, when they bark, that's them talking. It's just that they're dogs, so Zheng Zheng can't understand what they're saying,\" Xu Xiuhe hugged Xu Yunzheng.","But Xu Yunzheng still looked puzzled: \"Why can Dad understand them? Is Dad a dog?\"","Shen Yin covered her mouth, laughing on the side. This child's logic was always on point, focusing on details, and being a curious little one. Sometimes adults really didn't know how to respond to him.","\"I bought this small building this afternoon. Look, the property deed has my name on it,\" Shen Yin opened the deed and handed it to Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe expressed that this was the first time he knew his wife could be so efficient. When she left in the morning, she didn't mention a word, but by evening, she had bought a building.","\"Why didn't you tell me?\"","\"What, do I need to report to you when I buy a building?\" Shen Yin was a little unhappy.","\"No, I mean, I should buy it for you. You don't have that much money.\"","\"I do have money. I've made a few million myself recently, and my card balance has been increasing. I don't know why it's increasing.\"","\"Company shares. Also, my money is all yours. I'll hand over my entire salary to you tonight.\"","\"No, I don't want that. Our money should be separate. I can make money myself. Do you know why I bought this building?\"","Xu Xiuhe really didn't know.","\"I plan to open a women's self-defense martial arts academy,\" Shen Yin said with determination.","Xu Xiuhe held his head in his hands. He felt like his wife could do anything - first clothing, then furniture, and now a martial arts academy. He didn't know what else she might do in the future. Suddenly, he felt like his future wealth might not surpass his wife's, and he might end up being a kept man.","\"So sudden?\"","\"Those two girls came today, and I originally planned to teach them. But then they brought three more people, and our space wasn't enough. Also, I want to teach Zheng Zheng in the future, not necessarily to a professional level, but enough for self-defense. I bought this building for Zheng Zheng, and opening the academy is just a side thing,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"What do you mean 'bought for Zheng Zheng', Mom?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"This small building is for Zheng Zheng. Zheng Zheng will practice martial arts here in the future. Doesn't that sound good?\"","\"Good.\"","\"Tomorrow I'll find someone to clean it up, and then do some basic renovations. We won't register it for now,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Okay, let's go home and cook dinner.\"","The family of three came out of the small building, crossed the stream, and the dogs at the front door wagged their tails, occasionally making some wuffling sounds.","\"Dad, what are they saying?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"They said they're hungry.\"","\"Wow, Dad, you're so amazing. But Zheng Zheng is hungry too.\"","Many years later, Shen Yin recalled that evening again, feeling only warmth, healing, and romance.","The sunset, cool breeze, stream, old town, and the happy family of three.","In the mortal world, they climbed mountains and crossed valleys, traveled through time and space to find each other. Wasn't that a kind of romance?","\"Next Wednesday, Zheng Zheng, will you go with Dad? Mom has a competition and can't take care of you,\" Shen Yin coaxed Xu Yunzheng.","\"Then Mom, do your best. Zheng Zheng will cheer for you too.\"","\"Okay, thank you, dear son.\"","Shen Yin was confident in her embroidery skills. With her enhanced abilities, she had nothing to fear.","Xu Xiuhe, on the other hand, was nervous and wished he could go help Shen Yin in the competition.","Shen Yin was anticipating the finale of the drama \"Yanxi Biography\". She had been looking forward to it for a long time.","In the drama, the elderly Yan Xi had become the First Lady, but sadly, Jiang Yuyang had died in battle long ago, though Yan Xi had been deceiving herself all along. Jiang Yu grew up to continue protecting the nation, while Yan Xi, after fulfilling her mission, retired to the mountains. Yan Xi's tumultuous life was tragic yet magnificent. Despite only a few scenes with Jiang Yuyang, Shen Yin saw Yan Xi's unwavering devotion to love.","The ending wasn't perfect, tinged with regret, making it more memorable.","So Shu Yi became popular again.","She portrayed a woman's strength exceptionally well. From Yan Xi's character, the audience saw the power of women again. Combined with Shu Yi's Weibo post last week, she gained many new fans.","Shen Yin was still savoring the plot while Xu Xiuhe looked up various information about embroidery for her.","Shen Yin wanted to laugh when she saw this.","\"Do you really not believe in my embroidery skills?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I do, but I'm still nervous.\"","\"I'm competing, why are you so nervous?\" Shen Yin said with a smile.","\"Shall I go and bribe the judges?\"","\"Huh? No way, the competition must be fair and square. How could we cheat? You have to trust me, I can do it.\"","\"Okay, I trust you.\" Xu Xiuhe pulled Shen Yin into an embrace.","Shen Yin's heart was pounding rapidly, and she could even feel the thumping sound. \"It's a bit hot.\"","\"Then let's go to the bedroom.\""]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: My Wife Always Wants Me to Go to Work","paragraphs":["The two were very close.","So close.","Close to the point of no distance.","They even became (plural) numbers.","Shen Yin lay on the bed, not wanting to get up. \"Bring Zhengzheng back, or else tomorrow morning when he wakes up, he'll go looking for trouble again.\"","Xu Xiuhe laughed lightly: \"Do I look like trouble to you?\"","The man's laugh was mischievous, with a hint of devilry. He bent down again and scooped Shen Yin into his arms.","\"Ah, I told you to carry Zhengzheng, not me,\" said Shen Yin. After the previous exertion, and having been vocal throughout, she didn't dare speak loudly now, her tone carrying a hint of coyness.","\"Mm, good girl. Before carrying him, I need to give you a bath.\"","\"Okay.\" Shen Yin was exhausted, agreeing to whatever Xu Xiuhe said.","\"What's that sound outside?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Whoosh...\"","\"The wind,\" Xu Xiuhe answered.","\"Why did the wind pick up so suddenly? It sounds quite scary.\" Shen Yin was placed in the bathtub by Xu Xiuhe.","The man then stepped in as well, the wind outside growing louder.","\"Is the window closed?\"","A bolt of lightning flashed, followed by a deafening clap of thunder.","Startled, Shen Yin cowered into Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","\"Zhengzheng,\" said Shen Yin, worried. She was afraid the child, being small, would be woken by the thunder if he fell asleep without them by his side.","If the little one did cry, there would be no one to soothe him.","They were nearly done with the bath, so Shen Yin grabbed a dry towel, quickly wiped herself, and before Xu Xiuhe could react, she had already donned her robe.","Outside, bolts of lightning continued to strike, illuminating the pitch-black night with brief flashes of light.","In the adjacent bedroom, Zhengzheng had not yet awakened, but his face showed signs of restless sleep, lips pursed, brows furrowed, occasionally letting out soft whimpers.","Xu Xiuhe entered as well. Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng, saying, \"You turn off the lights and close the door.\"","But Xu Xiuhe didn't listen to Shen Yin. Instead, he took Zhengzheng from her arms and headed for the bedroom.","Shen Yin likely understood that Xu Xiuhe didn't want her to strain herself, so she said nothing, turning off the lights, closing the door, and following the father and son into the bedroom.","The sounds of wind, rain, and thunder created a cozy ambiance inside.","Shen Yin lay beside Zhengzheng, gently patting him to help him feel secure, his brows unfurrowing. Soon, Shen Yin sensed the little one had fallen back into a deep sleep, no longer whimpering.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng is awake.\"","Shen Yin paused, her hand resting on Zhengzheng.","\"It's still early, Zhengzheng should go back to sleep,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Mommy, are there monsters outside? Zhengzheng is scared.\" Xu Yunzheng snuggled closer to Shen Yin.","\"No monsters, it's just raining and windy. Don't be afraid, Zhengzheng. Daddy and Mommy are here.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng turned and met Xu Xiuhe's gaze, the two staring at each other wide-eyed.","\"Quick, back to sleep,\" said Xu Xiuhe, who was already feeling sleepy, as it was nearly midnight.","The rain continued all night. The next morning, being a Sunday, when they usually woke around 5 AM to daylight, it was already past 8 AM before they opened their eyes.","On a rainy day, one doesn't feel like going out or getting up.","\"Not going to work again?\"","\"Nope, I'm rewarding myself,\" the man replied.","\"Why do you need a reward?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Because through my own merit, I got to sleep beside my wife and son. Isn't that great? Don't I deserve a reward?\"","\"Xu Xiuhe, don't you think you've been quite idle lately, barely going to work on Sundays?\"","\"Really? I don't think so. I work six days and rest one day to be with my wife. How is that idle?\"","Thinking about it, Shen Yin agreed. She no longer felt guilty, having worried that because of her, Xu Xiuhe's career would suffer, making her an eternal sinner.","\"I feel like even if I'm idle now, it's fine. My wife is capable enough to support me,\" the man joked.","\"My mommy is awesome. Mommy can support Zhengzheng,\" Xu Yunzheng chimed in.","Shen Yin...","\"What would you like for breakfast?\"","Shen Yin turned to the father and son, both looking at her expectantly.","\"Meat!\" Zhengzheng answered.","\"Meat,\" Xu Xiuhe echoed, though he had mouthed \"you\" instead.","Shen Yin's face reddened. So early in the morning, with Zhengzheng present, this lecherous man was thinking such thoughts.","Shen Yin swiftly got up, went to the walk-in closet to change, completely ignoring the father and son on the bed.","In the kitchen, Shen Yin surveyed the ingredients and cooked a pot of hot and sour soup, frying a few sesame flatbreads.","Likely lured by the aroma, the two emerged, freshly washed and dressed, just as the food was ready and placed on the table.","\"Mommy, is Zhengzheng handsome today?\" Xu Yunzheng ran to Shen Yin's side, twirling around.","His clothes had been chosen by Xu Xiuhe, but Shen Yin wanted to facepalm. Though it was a relatively cool day, there was no need to dress the child in long sleeves and pants.","\"Zhengzheng is the most handsome baby,\" Shen Yin praised.","Satisfied with the answer, the little one twirled some more, waving his arms about.","\"Time to eat, handsome Zhengzheng.\"","\"Is there meat?\"","\"No,\" Xu Xiuhe replied solemnly.","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng's face immediately fell.","Shen Yin poured the soup into small bowls. Catching the aroma, Zhengzheng no longer cared about the meat and hurried to take a seat.","\"There are shrimp,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Yay!\"","Xu Yunzheng's expression transformed in an instant, from disappointment to excitement and anticipation, the entire process taking mere seconds.","Shen Yin marveled inwardly at how swiftly the child's moods could change, faster than turning pages.","The rain continued pouring, the wind howling.","Shen Yin didn't even close the door to the small building today, staying busy with her handicrafts - tiger-head shoes.","Finally, after a day's work, her efforts bore fruit.","Xu Yunzheng donned the new shoes, showing them off to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Zhengzheng, these shoes were meticulously made by Mommy, stitch by stitch. Take good care of them,\" Xu Xiuhe reminded him.","Tiger-head shoes are extremely intricate, with the tiger head requiring embroidery, flower picking, and seed-beating techniques. The shoe's fabric also uses various colors - red, yellow, white, and more. The tiger's nose, eyebrows, and eyes are outlined with thick stitches, while the whiskers are sewn with thick black thread. Cute yet maintaining the tiger's fierceness.","For Shen Yin to complete them so quickly is a testament to her skilled embroidery and deft hands.","\"What made you think of making tiger-head shoes?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, recalling that these shoes were a thing of the last century.","\"When a child is one or two years old, adults often dress them in tiger-head shoes, believing that the tiger is the king of the forest and wearing such shoes will bless the child with health and growth. Although Zhengzheng is already two weeks old, this symbolism still holds true. Besides, these handmade shoes are comfortable to wear, so consider it a belated first birthday gift from me for the little one.\" Shen Yin explained.","The tiger-head shoes were indeed adorable. Shen Yin had crafted them realistically, with a cute cartoon tiger head.","The embroidery in various colors made it evident at first glance that a great deal of effort had gone into making these shoes."]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Start of the Match","paragraphs":["For those skilled in embroidery, they could tell at a glance that the person who made these tiger head shoes had superb embroidery skills.","Xu Xiuhe looked at the shoes with envy in his heart. His wife had never embroidered anything for him. The last time she made clothes for him, they were so exquisite and beautiful that he didn't even dare to wear them.","\"So beautiful, I'm envious.\"","\"Envious of what?\"","\"Dad is envious that Yunzheng has shoes, but he doesn't.\" Xu Yunzheng said while deliberately walking towards Xu Xiuhe and lifting his feet.","\"Yeah, the shoes are really nice. Wife, you're so talented.\"","\"Do you like them?\"","Xu Xiuhe nodded.","\"Then you can stop worrying about the competition the day after tomorrow. I can do it, you don't need to be anxious. I'll guarantee I'll bring you a championship.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Yay, Mom is a champion.\"","Rong City's competition was being held at the Rong City Museum. The venue was spacious, with a rich cultural heritage.","Rong City also had a long history and culture, with the museum housing many antiques and artifacts. On the day of the competition, the driver dropped Shen Yin off at the entrance of the museum.","Since arriving in this world, Shen Yin had never visited a museum, let alone seen any exhibits.","The museum was huge, and Shen Yin didn't know exactly which hall the competition venue was in.","\"Little lady, are you here to watch the competition?\" the security guard asked.","\"No, I'm participating in the competition,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Ah?\" The security guard didn't react immediately. He had been working at this museum for many years, and the embroidery competition had been held for several years, but he had never seen such a young lady participate.","\"Well, it's finally good to see a young person willing to engage with this embroidery culture. Good luck, little lady. The main thing is to participate and promote the culture.\"","Shen Yin followed the security guard into the museum.","\"Go in, turn left at the second hall, and that's the competition venue. It's still early, and not many people have arrived yet. Go in and rest for a bit, young lady.\"","\"Okay, thank you, grandpa.\"","Shen Yin entered the hall, where there were about 30 tables with a main stage, and a long table on the stage with five chairs behind it.","The audience seating was on either side of the hall, so the stage must be for the judges.","There were a few people in the audience seating and a few competitors in the designated area.","Shen Yin found her table based on the information provided and sat down.","On each table were various needles, threads, and a piece of white cloth.","Every table had the same setup. Shen Yin just glanced at it but didn't touch anything. People gradually started to arrive, and the hall became more crowded.","Later, two men and three women, all quite elderly, appeared on the judges' seats.","Most of the competitors were also not young, mostly around 40 years old. Shen Yin, who looked around 20, stood out starkly in this group.","\"All competitors, please take your seats.\"","Initially, the people in the audience seating were whispering among themselves.","After the host said those words, the hall fell completely silent.","\"Welcome, everyone, to this embroidery competition. This competition has been held for five years now, and we see new faces every year. Among the competitors seated here, I'm sure there are those participating for the first time, as well as those who have participated several times before. But that's not important. What's important is that we will be evaluating your embroidery skills, techniques, and speed.\"","Next, the President of the Literary Federation will give an address.","The man in his 50s on the main stage took the microphone.","\"Hello, competitors. Embroidery, or 'needle embroidery' as it was called in ancient China, is the art of using an embroidery needle to stitch colored threads onto textile fabrics, creating flower patterns and designs. Embroidery is one of China's ancient handicrafts, with a history dating back over 2,000 years. However, the truly legendary aspect of embroidery is not just its important role in Chinese clothing art, but also how, with the opening of trade routes like the Silk Road, the rich and exquisite Oriental style of silk and embroidery products gradually made their way into Europe, instantly becoming a favorite among wealthy merchants, nobles, and royal families. Now, embroidery has even taken the international stage, playing a significant role in the fashion world. All of you seated here are inheritors of this intangible cultural heritage, representing various cities. The top three winners of this competition will represent our region in the finals. So, I urge all of you to give your best performance, represent our region, and contribute to the preservation of this intangible cultural heritage. Of course, you will also be achieving personal success.\"","After the President of the Literary Federation finished speaking, the others on stage started applauding.","\"Okay, next I'll explain the competition rules,\" said the host.","\"The competition will last a total of five hours, from 10 AM to 12 PM, and then from 2 PM to 5 PM, with a two-hour break in between. During the break, no competitors are allowed to enter the venue.\"","\"There are no restrictions on embroidery techniques, but there will be a theme. Competitors can freely interpret the theme. The materials on each table are the same. Please look at the big screen now.\" The host pressed a remote control, and the big screen behind the judges' seats lit up.","However, the big screen only displayed two words: \"Summer.\"","\"Please take 'summer' as the theme and choose what you want to embroider. Of course, the subject matter is not limited. The competition will start promptly at 10 AM.\"","All 30 competitors, including Shen Yin, began to ponder. Although the judging criteria were embroidery skills, techniques, and speed, not the subject matter, a harmonious overall embroidered image required careful consideration of the theme and composition.","It's like painting a picture - in addition to painting skills, the content of the painting also needs to be considered. In the \"Six Principles\" of Chinese painting theory, one principle is \"Appropriate Positioning.\" The arrangement of elements in the composition is crucial, and this principle applies equally to embroidery designs.","Shen Yin wouldn't claim to be better than others, but she knew one thing - she had an advantage at the starting line when it came to the overall layout of the embroidered image. Having copied many paintings by literary scholars, she had a firm grasp on the proper positioning of elements.","So next, all she had to do was create a \"painting\" around the theme of \"summer,\" except instead of using a brush, she would use a needle and thread.","\"The competition has begun. Competitors, you may now pick up your materials and start,\" the host announced precisely at 10 AM.","Shen Yin picked up the white cloth and mounted it onto the embroidery frame.","Her mind, however, was pondering what theme to choose. \"Summer\" seemed a bit cliché; it was the same topic she had given when hiring staff.","In the sweltering summer heat, how could a painting convey the season while also offering a sense of coolness, and even beauty?","Shen Yin mused, until suddenly a brilliant idea flashed in her mind.","As Shen Yin threaded her needle, glancing sideways, she caught sight of the audience seats."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: The Competition Venue","paragraphs":["She unexpectedly spotted Xu Xiuhe and Zhengzheng in the audience.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe made eye contact, and Xu Xiuhe gave Shen Yin an encouraging look.","Suddenly, Shen Yin felt a surge of strength. Although she was confident and assured of winning the championship, feeling neither fear nor nervousness, seeing Xu Xiuhe and Zhengzheng at that moment made her realize that she was not alone—someone was supporting her from behind.","There was a clock in the venue, ticking away the seconds.","Shen Yin's movements quickened. After threading the needle and preparing the thread, Shen Yin began embroidering.","With a clear image in her mind and the needle in her hand, the rough outline of the embroidery took shape in no time.","There were two staff members patrolling the venue, walking back and forth, while the judges on the main stage occasionally descended to observe.","The director of the literary federation stopped beside Shen Yin and watched her work. To be honest, Shen Yin, who looked about twenty years old, was a rare sight in such a competition.","Shen Yin's movements revealed her deftness, like an embroiderer with decades of experience. Undoubtedly, her movements alone had caught the attention of several judges.","While others rushed to perfect the details, only Shen Yin calmly and steadily outlined the contours, neither hurried nor arrogant.","Several judges exchanged glances and walked onto the stage. Shen Yin checked the clock—it was 11:30. By 12 o'clock, she could outline the overall contours and the smaller inner contours.","At 12 o'clock, the host announced the end of the session on time, and the venue closed.","All contestants stopped their work, and the audience members left first.","\"Please exit in an orderly manner. The competition will resume promptly at 2 PM.\"","Shen Yin rose and walked briskly, leading the way out.","Several contestants, noticing how young Shen Yin was to participate in the competition, took a glance at her work as they left.","\"I told you, this craft demands experience and age.\"","\"Yes, she does seem a bit too young.\"","\"Exactly, you see, after two hours, she's only outlined the contours. I can't even tell what she's embroidering. How can she possibly finish it this afternoon?\"","The contestants left, murmuring their discussions.","The remaining host, patrol staff, and five judges on the main stage exchanged smiles and said, \"Shall we go out for lunch?\"","The judges picked up their water cups and descended from the stage.","The director of the literary federation asked, \"What do you all think of this year's Rong City Embroidery Competition?\"","One male judge beside him said, \"It's good to see fresh blood.\"","\"Yes, I agree with Teacher Xiao's view. As an intangible cultural heritage, embroidery must have successors.\"","\"So, what do you think of that young girl's embroidery skills?\" the director asked again.","\"In my personal opinion, for now, I've only seen the outlines she drew. I haven't seen her embroidery work or the technique she uses. It seems different from others. As for her skills, we'll have to wait and see the final piece.\"","\"Alright, then let's wait until tonight.\"","Shen Yin hurried outside early.","Xu Xiuhe, holding Zhengzheng, had been waiting for a long time.","\"Why did you come out?\" Shen Yin asked even before reaching them.","\"Of course, to cheer for you with my son,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Go, Mom! You're the best,\" Zhengzheng said sweetly.","\"Such a sweet mouth. Give Mom a kiss,\" Shen Yin leaned her face toward Zhengzheng.","As Xu Yunzheng turned his face to kiss Shen Yin's cheek, Xu Xiuhe suddenly lowered his head and kissed her instead.","\"Daddy's naughty,\" Zhengzheng pouted, displeased.","Shen Yin didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to suddenly kiss her in front of Zhengzheng either.","Seeing Xu Yunzheng's sullen expression, Shen Yin took him into her arms and gave him a loud kiss on the cheek.","The baby brightened up and mumbled, \"Let's eat.\"","\"Let me carry him. He's over two weeks old now and getting heavy,\" Xu Xiuhe said, taking Zhengzheng and leading the way to the parking lot.","\"Daddy, I can walk by myself,\" Zhengzheng protested, not understanding why his father insisted on carrying him.","\"Your legs are too short. By the time you reach the parking lot, your mom's afternoon competition will be over,\" Xu Xiuhe truly found Zhengzheng's walking too slow.","\"I'm just young. My legs aren't short,\" the baby objected, offended by the insinuation that his legs were short. Why not say he had eaten fewer years' worth of food?","Listening to the father and son's conversation from behind, Shen Yin found it amusing, realizing for the first time that Xu Xiuhe had a humorous side.","\"You'll grow taller as you get older,\" Shen Yin reassured Zhengzheng.","\"I want to grow up fast, grow long legs, and run faster than Daddy,\" the little one babbled, always having more to say than Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe combined.","It was unclear whose traits he had inherited—theirs or the original owner's.","\"The afternoon session starts at 2 PM, right?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yes, it starts at 2 PM and ends at 5 PM. The results will be announced at 5:30 PM.\"","\"Then let's not go elsewhere. We'll find a restaurant in the mall near the museum.\"","\"Okay.\"","In the afternoon, when Shen Yin returned to the museum, most of the contestants had arrived.","This time, there were noticeably more audience members than in the morning.","Unlike the morning, the contestants entered first this time. All contestants were in position just before 2 PM.","Shen Yin strictly followed the competition rules, keeping an eye on the time and only picking up the needle and thread when it was time.","With the image composition planned, she could now focus on embroidering the details. Under Shen Yin's nimble hands, the colorful silk threads wove in and out.","Each stitch seemed imbued with magic. Shen Yin worked quickly, while the other embroiderers were also immersed in their own embroidery worlds. When the judges came down again and saw Shen Yin's work, they nodded in approval.","Shen Yin's piece depicted a lady appreciating lotuses. The overall composition was neat and elegant, with fresh and graceful colors, intricate needlework, and delicate lines.","The piece appeared lifelike, as if painted. Inside the pavilion, a graceful lady stood holding a fan, looking expectantly toward the green lotus pond outside.","The upright lotus flowers, like timid maidens, hid among the leaves, waiting for the lady to discover them.","Shen Yin looked at the overall picture, put away the needle and thread. She took this piece of cloth off the frame.","When looking around, she noticed that many other contestants had also completed their works.","\"Time's up. Please lay the fabric flat on the table for the judges to score,\" a voice announced.","The venue suddenly became lively, as the five-hour competition came to an end. Some were joyful, others worried.","\"Contestants, please leave the venue. Come back in half an hour.\"","All the contestants left the venue. The five judges came down from the stage and began scoring the first work, with a maximum of 10 points. After removing the highest and lowest scores, they calculated the average of the three remaining middle scores as the contestant's final score."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Champion Winner","paragraphs":["\"This work is decent, the needlework is quite delicate, but the ending threads could have been secured better.\"","\"This one is not bad either, quite an artistic effect.\"","\"This one won't do, it's not even finished.\"","The five judges commented on the contestants' works while scoring them.","When they reached Shen Yin's piece, they were momentarily stunned.","\"This morning, did any of you figure out what this young lady was embroidering?\" asked the President of the Literary Federation.","They all shook their heads. That morning, there were only outlines, with scattered thread fragments - it was impossible to tell what it was. But now, they could see the outlines from earlier.","\"Setting aside the embroidery technique, the pattern itself is already a work of art. And the needlework?\"","One judge suddenly exclaimed in shock, \"The needlework is indeed exquisite.\"","Shen Yin had indeed employed various needlework techniques - satin stitch, stem stitch, knot stitch - one could see them all at a glance.","The requirements for embroidery craftsmanship are: smoothness, evenness, flatness, consistency, and cleanliness. Smoothness means straight lines are straight, and curves are rounded. Evenness means the stitches are uniform, with no uneven edges. Flatness means the motion is precise, the embroidery lies flat, and the threads are not skewed. Consistency means the stitches have a uniform distance, with no gaps or overlaps. Cleanliness means the embroidery surface is spotless.","Shen Yin's work met all these criteria. In such a short time, this outstanding piece featured an elegant and classic scene, with fine embroidery and lively needlework.","The judges sang their praises, agreeing that this work was worthy of competing in the national embroidery competition.","\"Teachers, if I say this young lady deserves the championship, do you have any objections?\" said the President of the Literary Federation.","\"No objections, no objections. More importantly, this young lady is still young, and will likely achieve even greater mastery in the future.\"","\"Exactly, she's so young. I can't imagine this piece being embroidered by a girl in her twenties - it's incredible! The new waves push the old waves on the Yangtze River. Our embroidery craft has no need to worry about finding successors.\"","The audience hadn't left yet. Seeing the judges lavish so much praise on one work, they naturally became curious about what kind of piece could elicit such unanimous acclaim.","\"Let's take a look at the other works first. There might be one even more stunning than this,\" said one female judge.","Unfortunately, no other piece enraptured them like this one.","The host wasn't just busy controlling the time and explaining the rules - now he had to tally the scores as well.","The judges displayed the top three works, and the contestants re-entered the hall, taking their original seats.","\"Now the audience can come forward and appreciate the beauty of embroidery up close.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng over to Shen Yin's \"Lady Admiring Lotus\" piece.","\"Mommy,\" little Xu Yunzheng pointed at the lady in Shen Yin's piece.","Xu Xiuhe took a closer look and indeed, the lady bore some resemblance to Shen Yin.","\"Light silken fan, white orchid flower, slender waist, jade belt, heavenly silk dance. Seems a fairy has descended, a smile outshining the stars.\"","The lady was beautiful, her green dress fluttering in the wind, making one wonder whether to envy her or admire the flower.","\"It is indeed lovely. The creator must have studied painting to embroider such a vivid, beautiful scene. The championship is well-deserved.\"","Praises poured in one after another - Shen Yin's championship was truly well-earned.","The other contestants had no retort, especially those who had commented on the young lady's age that morning - now they were rendered speechless.","This embroidery was simply too exquisite, beyond their ability.","Meanwhile, the Rong City Museum had a live broadcast capturing the awarding ceremony of the 5th Embroidery Competition.","The museum director, present for this significant occasion, was stunned upon seeing Shen Yin. After decades of studying fabrics and embroidery, he immediately recognized the exceptional talent - not only was the needlework lively, but the embroidery itself was imbued with spirit.","Shen Yin didn't want to be filmed, because she wasn't wearing her studio's uniform, missing another opportunity to promote her business in the public eye.","\"Young lady, how long have you studied embroidery?\" asked the President of the Literary Federation.","\"About five years, I suppose,\" Shen Yin replied offhandedly, not quite sure herself.","This response left everyone present - contestants and judges alike - utterly astonished. To reach such a level in only five years far surpassed their decades of study.","With a few more years of practice, her skill would be unimaginable.","\"Well, she's a natural talent - we can't compare,\" one contestant remarked.","The top three had been chosen, but the other two weren't pleased. If the champion were older, they might not have felt this way - but this girl was so young, robbing them of any sense of accomplishment.","The live broadcast's comments were filled with \"wow\" and \"incredible.\"","[Suddenly feel like I've been wasting my life all these years.]","[This embroidery champion is so young! And she's from our Rong City - suddenly I'm standing taller.]","[The one above, I'm standing taller too. Not only beautiful, but a bit familiar.]","[Oh yeah, she does look familiar.]","[I remember now, she looks like the wife of Heyuan Group's CEO.]","After this comment, others went digging through old social media posts, then returned.","[Case solved, folks - it's her! So incredible, no wonder as the elite wife, she's a master of all trades - running her own studio and skilled in embroidery.]","[To Heyuan Group's CEO: Husband, is there anything your wife can't do?]","Xu Xiuhe wasn't watching the broadcast at the time, or he would have echoed that very question.","The online comments ran the gamut, with some saying they wouldn't even dare dream of a CEO falling for them, because the current CEO wives were too accomplished in various skills. They couldn't measure up.","Shen Yin remained completely unaware of being dissected online once again.","She was exhausted and longed to sleep. Facing the cameras, she didn't have a hint of a smile.","[Doesn't she seem rather aloof? But beautiful sister, I love you so much.]","[Cool, reserved sister - beautiful but not talkative.]","[Sob, I wish Heaven would grant me a wife like her.]","[Folks, did you see? The camera panned over to that man holding a child - doesn't he look like Heyuan Group's CEO?]","[6666, fairy tale romance where the wife competes while the husband cheers her on!]","A post on local social media about an embroidery competition drew clicks from many people, including Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er was sitting in Liu Bo's office, helping him organize files. They had been working all day. Liu Bo had just stepped out, so she took the opportunity to check her phone, only to stumble upon some juicy gossip - a sweet piece of melon.","\"Finished already? You're just checking your phone,\" Liu Bo said as he walked back into the office, catching Xiao Li'er grinning at her screen."]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: The Reasons for Being Tied","paragraphs":["\"I just saw the CEO!\" exclaimed Xiao Li'er with excitement, completely forgetting that Liu Bo was her supervisor.","\"What's so exciting about seeing the CEO? He has a wife and kids, keep it modest. Wait, the CEO hasn't been at the company today, where did you see him?\"","Xiao Li'er waved her phone and said, \"Here.\"","\"Let me see too!\"","Liu Bo quickly ran over to Xiao Li'er's side.","Xiao Li'er was watching a live stream on Weibo.","\"Where's the CEO?\"","\"At the Rong City Museum.\"","Liu Bo covered his face. Oh heavens and earth, why treat him like this? He was just an assistant, yet lately he felt like the company was his.","The CEO now had time to visit museums but no time to care about his lifelong matter? Indeed, when it came to making grandiose promises, the CEO took the cake.","\"He has time to visit exhibitions but no time to bake me a pie.\"","\"The CEO wasn't visiting an exhibition. What do you mean by baking a pie?\" Xiao Li'er asked, looking up.","\"If he's not visiting an exhibition, why go to the museum?\"","\"His wife is participating in an embroidery competition at the museum. She even won the championship for this district and is now representing Rong City in the national finals.\"","\"The CEO's wife?\" Liu Bo exclaimed inwardly. Embroidery, isn't that a high-class and sophisticated art?","\"Is it over? I want to see it too.\" Liu Bo leaned over to Xiao Li'er's side, stretching his neck to look at her phone.","Xiao Li'er turned her head, intending to say it had just ended, but before she could speak, an awkward moment arose. Their noses were almost touching, and a slight misstep could have led to a kiss.","\"Ahem.\" Xiao Li'er immediately turned her head away and stood up.","There was a strange, awkward atmosphere between them.","Ever since the last time when Liu Bo got drunk and Xiao Li'er tied him to the bed, things had been strange between them.","To break the awkward silence, Xiao Li'er tried to change the subject. \"What kind of pie was the CEO going to bake for you? Is it edible? Can the CEO even cook?\"","\"How do you know it's edible? Do you think the CEO looks like someone who can cook?\"","Xu Xiuhe, who was driving, suddenly sneezed for no apparent reason.","\"Then what kind of pie was it?\"","\"The CEO made me a big promise, and the pie just kept getting bigger and rounder.\"","\"What did he promise you?\" Xiao Li'er asked.","\"He promised me a lot. He said he'd give me time to deal with personal issues and introduce me to potential partners,\" Liu Bo replied honestly.","\"Oh, well he didn't just make empty promises. Aside from not giving you time, he did introduce you to people, didn't he? At the last mixer, there were so many women there. Isn't that introducing potential partners?\"","\"I guess you could say that.\"","As soon as it was mentioned, Liu Bo became even more agitated. That day must have been one of the most frustrating days of his nearly 30-year life.","Not only was he called gay, but he was also tied up, for crying out loud.","\"Exactly, how could you not consider that as introductions? It's just that you didn't seize the opportunity,\" Xiao Li'er retorted.","\"Xiao Li'er, you have the nerve to say that when you also met your dream guy at the mixer. And by the way, don't you remember who tied me up?\" Liu Bo snapped back.","\"I remember, of course I remember. But you should know why I tied you up,\" Xiao Li'er replied cautiously.","\"I'd love to know why you tied me up. Was it because you couldn't trust me and were afraid that I'd lose control after getting drunk and take advantage of you?\"","Xiao Li'er's face turned red. This man was really something, able to say anything. She wasn't afraid he'd lose control after getting drunk - who would take advantage of whom was still undetermined.","\"Do you really want to know why I tied you up?\" Xiao Li'er asked.","\"Yes, tell me.\"","\"No regrets, a real man isn't afraid to own up to his actions. What's there to regret?\" Liu Bo's tone was as firm as his words, resolute and decisive.","\"You got drunk and started behaving crazily. You even ran to my dining table and sat on it. And you--\"","Before Xiao Li'er could finish, Liu Bo covered her mouth with his hand.","Reminded by Xiao Li'er, he vaguely recalled something.","\"Shut up. This incident stays buried forever. If a third person finds out about it, Xiao Li'er, you're done for. Get ready to be fired.\"","\"Mmm mmm, Liu Bo, how could you do this?\" Xiao Li'er mumbled through Liu Bo's hand over her mouth.","It was so unfair. Why was he treating her like this? Just a moment ago, he was the one saying a real man owns up to his actions, but within two seconds, he flipped and was threatening her with termination.","What had she done wrong to deserve this? At this workplace, she was being threatened left and right.","\"Wah wah, I might as well quit this job.\" Xiao Li'er started crying out of frustration.","Upon hearing this, Liu Bo realized he had gone too far. This little girl was actually crying.","The thing he dreaded most was a girl crying.","\"I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I didn't mean it. It's just that, as a man, crying while sitting on a dining table is so embarrassing, that's why I overreacted.\"","Liu Bo released his hand and pulled Xiao Li'er towards him, using his fingers to wipe away her tears.","\"Don't cry anymore, okay? I won't threaten you, and you don't have to quit.\"","\"But you were the one who said you had no regrets. I only spoke up because of that. Last time, out of consideration for your dignity, I didn't dare tell you the reason why I tied you up,\" the girl said through her tears.","Liu Bo couldn't stand seeing a girl cry.","With her tear-stained face, it was fortunate that the office was soundproof, or others might have thought he had done something to this little girl.","\"I was wrong. Don't cry anymore,\" he said, wiping away her tears and finding tissues for her to blow her nose.","\"I didn't... didn't hear...\" Xiao Li'er said between sobs, her words broken and interrupted.","\"Didn't hear what?\"","\"Didn't hear you apologize.\"","...","\"I'm sorry. I was wrong, I shouldn't have threatened you. I promise that as long as I'm at this company, you'll never have to leave your job.\"","This time, Xiao Li'er heard it clearly and suddenly burst into laughter.","\"How quickly you change your tune, faster than turning pages. It's getting late, let me treat you to dinner. You worked hard staying late with me today.\"","\"I want hotpot and barbecue.\"","Liu Bo glanced at Xiao Li'er's slender figure, privately doubting whether she could finish all that food.","At Qinghe Villa, Shen Yin sat on the sofa, eating the fruit prepared for her by Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe said he wanted to reward her today, so he went to the kitchen to cook, while Shen Yin and Zhengzheng obediently waited to enjoy the meal.","Shen Yin was indeed tired, so she let Xu Xiuhe cook while she and Zhengzheng enjoyed the fruit.","[Audio Audio, Niu Niu]","In their group chat, Shu Yi shared today's Weibo post.","\"Embroidery Competition Champion\"","[Audio Audio, you were amazing! I saw your work, it's so beautiful, even more beautiful than a painting.]","[@Miracle, if you can talk, say more.]","[@Audio Audio, what don't I know about women?]","Shu Yi tagged each of them one by one.","[\"What else can Sister Yin do?\"]","[\"She can cook, brew wine, fight, even cured my dysmenorrhea, and now she can do embroidery too.\"]","[\"Wow, wow. Is Sister Yin's day 48 hours long?\"] Qi Ji exclaimed in amazement.","[\"Your Sister Yin is so versatile, fights super coolly, able to take on five at once. Being with her must make you feel extremely safe, right?\"]","[\"I envy you, I want to learn how to fight too,\"] Qi Ji replied."]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Blind Date with Xiao Li","paragraphs":["[Okay, let me teach you]","[Shu Yi, I've opened a martial arts studio. You should come learn when you're free.]","[Great work, where did you open it? Shen Yin, I've noticed you're a woman of action.]","Shen Yin replied, The building across from the small building.","[Ah, that's so convenient. I feel like you could just buy out the entire Qinghe Street.]","[That would cost a lot of money, right?] Shen Yin felt a bit heartbroken.","When Shu Yi heard this, she thought this woman must really have such intentions. [Sister, I was just kidding.]","[Qi Ji can come this Saturday. The small building is already being renovated.]","[Wow, such speed, Sister Shen Yin really lives up to her reputation as a woman of action.]","Shen Yin looked at the message and smiled, replying [I'm going to eat.]","Then she put down her phone, took Xu Yunzheng's hand, and walked to the dining table, where Xu Xiuhe had prepared a plate of shredded potatoes, a plate of stir-fried shredded pork with green peppers, and a plate of scrambled eggs with tomatoes.","They were all homemade dishes, and Xu Xiuhe was quite pleased with himself, as he knew how to cook. He couldn't help but take out his phone and snap a photo, also taking a side view photo of Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng.","It was the first post he'd made on his friends circle in a long time.","There was no caption, only the side view photo of Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng, and the three plates of food on the table.","Chang Zhiyuan: The scene looks beautiful, but the dishes don't look like they're up to your wife's standard.","To clarify, Xu Xiuhe commented below: The dishes were cooked by me, of course they can't compare to my wife's.","Chang Zhiyuan: Wow, you all secretly learned cooking skills behind my back, are you still my good friend?","Xue Jingrui: The first criterion for a good man is knowing how to cook.","Chen Siming: Brother Xu, why don't you consider coming to work as a chef at my restaurant?","Xu Xiuhe's WeChat was his personal account with not many friends, only those he could talk to.","Xiao Li'er happened to see it and took a screenshot of Xu Xiuhe's friends circle post and sent it to Liu Bo.","[Ahem, who said the CEO can't cook? What's on that table?]","Liu Bo was cooking, and his phone in his pocket buzzed. He took it out and saw it was the CEO's friends circle post.","[Look, our CEO is truly a man among men. He knows how to cook.]","[Does that mean I'm not a good man? I know how to cook too.]","Liu Bo wasn't convinced and casually snapped a photo of the freshly cooked crayfish and cold cucumber salad he'd made, sending it to Xiao Li'er.","[I was going to invite you over for a meal, but who told you to suddenly be unavailable and leave?]","Xiao Li'er was also disappointed, as she could have had a good meal, but just as she was about to arrive at the restaurant, her mother had an urgent matter and summoned her back with a phone call.","Now, she was at the restaurant, but for a different reason - she was on a blind date.","If she had known it was this setup, she would never have listened to her mother, even if she was beaten to death.","At the table now, there were seven people, and she was the most awkward one.","\"Xiao Jun, why didn't you tell me in advance that this was a blind date?\"","Xiao Li'er leaned over and asked Xiao Jun in a low voice.","\"Sis, if I had known, how could I not tell you? I only knew that Mom and Dad said they were going to have a meal with friends, so I just came along. I only found out it was a blind date a few minutes before you did.\"","The siblings whispered to each other.","\"Li'er, Jun, this is Auntie Qin and Uncle Xu.\"","\"Hello, Auntie Qin, Uncle Xu,\" the siblings said in unison.","\"Ah, these two kids are so well-behaved. The last time I saw them was when they were little, now they've grown up so much. Li'er has really blossomed into a beauty at eighteen.\"","Xiao Li'er: \"Thank you, Auntie. Auntie Qin looks younger and younger.\"","The woman laughed heartily, her sweet little mouth did flatter. The more she looked at Xiao Li'er, the more satisfied she was.","\"Sis, were you really, really ugly when you were little?\" Xiao Jun said in a low voice.","\"Shut up!\" Xiao Li'er lowered her voice.","\"Li'er, you're 26 this year, old enough to get married, right? Your mom said you don't have a boyfriend yet,\" the woman across from them said.","Xiao Li'er smiled awkwardly.","The man called Uncle Xu continued, \"Our Zheyang is two years older than you, it would be perfect for you two to get to know each other. If it works out, you could get married by the end of the year.\"","Xiao Jun was drinking water and nearly choked.","Xiao Li'er held her water glass, her movements clearly pausing for a moment, as she finally looked towards Xu Zheyang.","The man seemed a bit old, and before she knew it, Xiao Li'er found herself comparing him to Liu Bo.","She felt he was older than Liu Bo, not as handsome as Liu Bo.","Xiao Li'er calmly drank her water, as if she wasn't the one being set up on this blind date.","\"Li'er, don't you remember? When you were little, you used to play with Brother Zheyang, he even carried you before.\"","Xiao Li'er shook her head, she really didn't remember.","\"Hello, my name is Xu Zheyang. I just returned from studying abroad and I'm now a professor at Rong City University of Science and Technology.\"","\"I'm Xiao Li'er, an assistant at the Heyuan Group.\"","\"I think we're quite suited for each other. What do you think of me? I believe my salary can support you, so after we get married, you won't need to work anymore.\"","Xu Zheyang spoke, taking Xiao Li'er by surprise with this question.","Was he being so direct? Although they did know each other as children, this was really the first time they'd met as adults, and he was progressing so quickly? And they were already talking about marriage? How could she not need to work anymore? Her monthly salary was nearly 30,000 yuan.","Xiao Jun couldn't help but laugh out loud next to her, leaning in to whisper gleefully, \"You're this old and still haven't had a boyfriend, now you're at a blind date, encountering all these weirdos.\"","\"Shut up, who said I don't have a boyfriend?\" Xiao Li'er wasn't willing to be mocked by her younger brother, stubbornly insisting she did have one.","\"If you have a boyfriend, go ahead and have him call you then,\" Xiao Jun didn't believe her sister could have a boyfriend.","Xiao Li'er had already said it, and if no one called her, she would lose face.","She unlocked her phone, the screen still displaying her conversation with Liu Bo, with an unread message from him.","[What was your rush earlier, leaving so abruptly?]","Xiao Li'er suddenly had an idea.","[Can you do me a favor? You don't need to treat me to a meal, and I'll forgive you for threatening me before.]","Xiao Li'er didn't have high hopes originally.","But to her surprise, Liu Bo replied instantly.","[Say it]","[I'm at a blind date, it's an awkward situation. Can you call me and pretend to be my boyfriend?]","[...]","Xiao Li'er took her phone off silent mode.","One minute later.","\"Come on, enjoy the moment, after all we have plenty of time~~\" The ringtone blared, causing Xiao Li'er to die of embarrassment. She usually kept her phone on silent mode, having no idea when she had set this particular ringtone.","The others also felt quite awkward, except for Xiao Jun, who was about to burst out laughing. His sister was just too much, with such a unique ringtone for her phone.","Xiao Li'er's face flushed red as she quickly answered the call and put it on speakerphone.","\"Babe, why didn't you reply to my messages?\" Liu Bo's voice was gentle.","That single \"babe\" made Xiao Li'er's heart skip a beat. She had never heard him speak in such a tender tone before, even more gentle than when he had comforted her after she cried earlier in the afternoon."]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Five Plus Seven Equals","paragraphs":["At the dining table, the other six people were all stunned, pricking up their ears, all wanting to hear the man's words clearly.","\"I'm eating, I didn't see my phone.\"","\"I see, where are you eating? I'll come pick you up.\"","\"No need to come over.\"","\"No way, I won't feel at ease. Send me the address.\"","Xiao Li'er gave him the address. Then she hung up the phone.","The people around the round table looked at each other, and Xiao Jun gave a thumbs up under the table.","His elder sister is really awesome. This way, Xu Zheyang probably wouldn't feel comfortable continuing what he was saying.","Xiao Jun just didn't understand. This Xu Zheyang had also returned from studying abroad, so he should have a more open mindset and be more gentlemanly. But he started by saying that after Xiao Li'er got married, she wouldn't need to work. If it were Xu Zheyang becoming his brother-in-law, he would be the first one to object.","\"Sis, is your husband coming to pick you up?\" Xiao Jun asked.","Xiao's Father and Xiao's Mother looked doubtful, as they didn't know when Xiao Li'er had started dating someone.","The family of three sitting across from them also suddenly looked unhappy. It was an extremely awkward meal, and it ended abruptly.","Xiao Li'er remained absentminded until she went out of the restaurant entrance. She saw Liu Bo standing in front of a car, looking at her.","The six people who came along also looked over. So there really was a boyfriend after all.","\"Brother-in-law!\" Xiao Jun shouted excitedly.","Liu Bo walked over from beside the car. He was a bit confused too, as he thought Xiao Li'er was going on a blind date by herself, but looking at it now, there were almost enough people for two tables of mahjong.","\"Is it over?\"","Liu Bo walked up beside Xiao Li'er.","He also felt quite awkward. So this was directly meeting the parents? If Xiao Li'er had told him, he definitely wouldn't have come.","\"You really came?\"","Liu Bo leaned close to Xiao Li'er, speaking in a voice only the two of them could hear: \"Why didn't you tell me your parents were here?\"","\"You didn't ask either. What do we do next?\"","\"Brother-in-law, have you eaten?\" Xiao Jun asked with a smile, not caring about Xu Zheyang's feelings behind him.","Xiao's Father tugged at Xiao Jun's clothes. This kid really didn't mince his words.","\"Who is this?\" Xiao's Father asked, looking at Liu Bo.","\"Dad, this is—\" Xiao Li'er paused, unable to say it in front of Liu Bo that he was her boyfriend.","\"Uncle, auntie, hello. I'm Li'er's boyfriend.\" Liu Bo said.","Hearing this, Xiao Li'er really wanted to praise Liu Bo for being a capable senior assistant, able to handle any situation with ease.","\"Oh, oh.\" Xiao's Father and Xiao's Mother looked Liu Bo over.","The young man looked upright and talented, with a nice tall figure.","\"It's getting late. Let me drive you all back,\" Liu Bo said.","\"No need, no need. Your uncle is driving. You can take Li'er back. Come over to our place another time when you're free.\" Xiao's Mother said.","Liu Bo and Xiao Li'er left first. Xiao's Mother kept apologizing to Xu's Mother, as she really didn't know that her daughter had been dating someone in secret.","Although the Xu family wasn't happy, there was nothing they could do. The girl already had a boyfriend, so even if they liked her, it was useless.","In the car, Xiao Li'er covered her face, feeling troubled. She had only wanted him to help her out of that situation, but now he had even met her parents.","\"Sorry, I made you go through the trouble of coming over,\" Xiao Li'er said guiltily.","Liu Bo didn't say anything. When he heard she was going on a blind date, his heart had suddenly felt unsettled.","He wasn't sure what his feelings for Xiao Li'er were. At first, he had just seen her as his subordinate, but after the resignation incident, the drunken episode, and now this, it seemed like something had slowly changed.","\"It's okay.\"","\"You don't need to worry about that. After some time, I'll tell my parents that I broke up with you, so you won't have to come over to their place.\"","\"Huh? You broke up with me? Why can't I be the one breaking up with you?\"","\"You're older.\"","\"Come on, do you have to put me down like that? I'm only three years older than you. Weren't you being pressured by your family to go on blind dates? At least no one is forcing me to get married.\"","Liu Bo said the last part casually.","Xiao Li'er suddenly remembered Liu Bo's background and didn't continue speaking.","After a few days of renovation, Shen Yin's small building had taken on the appearance of a martial arts school.","On Saturday, Qi Ji arrived early at Shen Yin's small building.","The five dogs sitting at the entrance were sent by Xue Jingrui. When Qi Ji arrived, she called Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe hadn't gone to work yet and was just about to head out. After answering the call, he saw Xue Jingrui and Qi Ji at the entrance.","He then hung up and asked, \"You guys?\"","\"Qi Ji came to find sister-in-law.\"","\"Yeah, they won't bite people for no reason. Just go on up.\"","\"You go up first. I'll come pick you up in the afternoon, so rest at noon and don't eat anything cold.\"","\"Okay, then I'll go up. Drive safely on your way back.\"","The little girl waved and ran upstairs.","\"How's it going? It's been almost a month since you got your marriage certificate. What's it like being a married person?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"She really doesn't treat me like her husband. She calls me 'Brother Jingrui' every day, without any sense of being in a romantic relationship.\"","\"What about you? How do you feel?\"","\"I feel like her father.\"","\"She lives every day like a child, carefree and untroubled. Now, every day for me is like raising a daughter.\"","The little girl was too delicate, and Xue Jingrui worried every day about whether she was eating enough or sleeping well. He made sure she had fresh fruit every day, afraid that she might not be comfortable.","Inside the small building, Shen Yin was teaching Zhengzheng arithmetic. The little doll could usually count from one to twenty, and he knew addition and subtraction within ten, but no more than that because he didn't have enough fingers.","\"Zhengzheng, what's five plus seven?\" Shen Yin sat on the carpet with Zhengzheng.","The little one heard his mother's question and started counting on his fingers, one by one. Five fingers, plus seven more fingers. He stopped when he reached ten.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng doesn't have enough fingers.\"","Zhengzheng looked up at Shen Yin, a bit troubled. Why did he only have ten fingers?","\"Mommy, can you lend your fingers to Zhengzheng?\"","\"How about borrowing auntie's hands?\" Qi Ji said, walking in from the entrance.","Shen Yin and Zhengzheng looked up at Qi Ji when they heard her voice.","Qi Ji hadn't seen Zhengzheng for almost half a month, and she felt that the little doll had become even more handsome.","\"Auntie.\"","\"You're not calling me a stranger anymore.\"","Qi Ji squatted down and stretched out her hand. \"Let's do the math.\"","Xu Yunzheng took Qi Ji's hand and continued counting as he had before, adding two more of Qi Ji's fingers.","\"Mom, five plus seven equals twelve.\"","\"Excellent, what about five plus eight?\"","This time, Xu Yunzheng did not count on his fingers. Instead, he pondered for a few seconds before saying, \"Thirteen.\"","\"Six plus seven?\"","\"Thirteen.\"","\"Zhengzheng is so smart.\"","\"He's very intelligent and has strong logical thinking. His little mind works quickly. It's all my fault for not taking better care of him before. Otherwise, he would have already mastered addition and subtraction within fifty by now.\""]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Sing Twinkle Twinkle","paragraphs":["\"Auntie Qi Ji, shall we do some math together?\"","\"Sure.\"","\"Sister Yin Yin, will you be working later?\"","\"I don't have any work to do. I'll take you to visit the martial arts school across the street later.\"","\"Great.\"","Zhengzheng, with his childlike innocence, was having a super fun time with Qi Ji. Shen Yin felt like she was a bit out of place in their conversation.","\"Auntie, I can sing 'Twinkle Twinkle Little Star,' you know?\"","\"Can you sing it for Auntie?\"","\"Yes, but Zhengzheng hasn't sung it for Mommy yet. Zhengzheng will sing it for Mommy first, and then for Auntie, okay?\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Ji felt a pang of envy. Zhengzheng was truly Shen Yin's protective jacket.","Not only did it shield her from the wind, but it also provided her with immense warmth.","Shen Yin was incredibly touched by Zhengzheng's words. Even though he was having a blast with his new friend, he didn't forget to share his good times with her first.","\"Mommy's here, Zhengzheng. You can sing now.\" Shen Yin approached Zhengzheng and Qi Ji.","Zhengzheng cleared his throat like a little adult, \"Twinkle, twinkle, little star, how I wonder what you are.\"","As Zhengzheng sang, his small body started to move, standing up from the carpet.","\"Well done, Zhengzheng! Nice!\" Qi Ji clapped her hands.","Shen Yin had never taught Zhengzheng to sing, so she had no idea why he could.","\"Zhengzheng, your song is so beautiful. Mommy wants to learn it too.\" Shen Yin spoke up.","Zhengzheng looked a little troubled: \"Mommy, that's all Zhengzheng knows.\"","Qi Ji was almost dying of laughter on the side. She thought Zhengzheng could sing the whole song, but he only knew these three lines.","\"Zhengzheng, who taught you this?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"It was the TV.\" Zhengzheng pointed at the television.","\"There were babies like Zhengzheng on the TV, asking their daddy, 'Can you sing Twinkle Twinkle Little Star?' And Zhengzheng heard it.\"","\"What a smart baby! You remembered it after just one listen, Zhengzheng. You're definitely going to be a top student.\"","\"Auntie, what's a top student?\"","Qi Ji realized that the Zhengzheng in front of her was still a baby.","\"Well, a top student is when Zhengzheng goes to school, takes exams, and then becomes the best, the number one, that's a top student. Do you understand?\"","Zhengzheng seemed to understand a little as he nodded and turned to Shen Yin: \"Mommy, Zhengzheng wants to go to school.\"","\"Alright, Zhengzheng, when you're a little older, you can go to school.\"","\"Yay, Zhengzheng will go to school and become a top student.\"","Qi Ji looked at Zhengzheng with admiration and a smile on her face.","\"Do you feel envious? Are you planning on having one yourself? Having a little girl, being a 'little cotton-padded jacket' is quite nice.\"","Qi Ji blushed, shaking her head with a smile.","\"Zhengzheng, shall Auntie teach you 'Twinkle Twinkle Little Star?'\"","\"Sure.\"","\"Auntie will sing it once first, and you just listen.\"","The little one nodded his head again.","\"Twinkle, twinkle, little star, how I wonder what you are, up above the world so high, like a diamond in the sky. When the blazing sun is gone, when he nothing shines upon, then you show your little light, twinkle, twinkle, all the night.\"","Qi Ji, who naturally had a childlike voice, sang the nursery rhyme as if she was a little kid herself.","Zhengzheng listened attentively and then started to imitate her.","\"Mom, does Zhengzheng's rendition of 'Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star' sound nice?\"","\"It sounds lovely!\"","\"Then Zhengzheng will sing it for Dad tonight.\"","\"Good, let's go across to the little building and have a look.\"","Shen Yin and Qi Ji, hand in hand with Zhengzheng, entered the building across the street.","\"Sister Yin Yin, the space inside here is vast.\"","\"That's necessary for our martial arts training.\"","Not only did Xu Xiuhe decorate the little building beautifully, but he also arranged all the equipment.","\"Your Sister Shuyi said she would be back tonight. Let her come over tomorrow, and together with Zhengzheng, we will all strengthen our bodies.\" Shen Yin said.","\"Wow, that's great! Can we all go out for a meal tonight?\"","\"Sure, why not.\"","Time flew quickly. The meal Qi Ji had at noon, prepared by Shen Yin, was so delicious that he couldn't stop praising it.","He kept flattering Shen Yin: \"Sister, can I come to see you often? The food you make is so delicious.\"","\"Is the food cooked by Xue Jingrui not tasty?\"","\"Wow, Sister, you're amazing. How do you know that Brother Jing Rui cooks every day?\"","Shen Yin chuckled, of course, she knew from Xu Xiuhe.","\"I calculated it. Do you believe me?\"","\"I do!\" Qi Ji admired Shen Yin even more. Indeed, Sister Yin Yin was as multifaceted as Sister Shuyi had described—she knew everything and could even tell fortunes.","Seeing Qi Ji's innocence and naiveté, Shen Yin couldn't help but laugh: \"You believe everything I say, don't you?\"","\"Because Sister is super amazing. Sister, can you predict when Brother Jing Rui and I will get divorced?\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin could not laugh. Why would this little girl think of divorce? Has Xue Jingrui been mistreating her and making her upset?","\"What happened? Did Xue Jingrui bully you?\" Shen Yin was a bit worried. This little girl is so pure. If she is bullied and doesn't dare to speak out, that would be troublesome.","\"He didn't bully me. Brother Jing Rui treats me very well, just like a real brother. But he's so nice to me that I'm afraid I'll get addicted. I worry that I'll have trouble adjusting after we divorce. So, I want to know when we can get divorced.\"","Qi Ji sighed, and continued: \"Actually, the sooner, the better. That way, I won't feel so lost. I feel that I'm already a bit reluctant. He cooks for me every day, prepares snacks and fruits for me, and even covers me with a blanket at night. I'm becoming dependent on him.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin realized that Xue Jingrui was like a father spoiling his daughter. Wait a moment, he goes to her room to cover her with a blanket at night?","\"Don't you two sleep in the same room now?\" Shen Yin asked. This was very similar to when she first arrived here.","Back then, she and Xu Xiuhe were not in the same room. Xu Xiuhe was also very kind to her. Well, not as kind as Xue Jingrui, but this little girl, like her, was thinking about divorce.","Qi Ji seemed somewhat bewildered, shaking her head. They had previously shared a room where Brother Jing Rui had also slept on the floor.","\"Do you like him?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I don't know, I think he is really great. When he is at home, I am very happy because I don't have to do anything,\" Qi Ji replied.","Recalling the conversation she had with Shu Yi, Shen Yin suspected that Qi Ji was also likely to have feelings for Xue Jingrui.","However, what was Xue Jingrui thinking? Was it as Xu Xiuhe had said, that he no longer liked Qi Yan, and that his slow reaction and lack of expression were just his way of dealing with the marriage?","\"So, Sister, can you figure out when he and I will divorce?\" Qi Ji asked, her eyes wide open, her face serious.","Shen Yin, who always had a low threshold for humor, found Qi Ji's earnest response to her offhand joke rather amusing. She wasn't a psychic; how could she possibly know when they would divorce?","\"Qi Ji, marriage and feelings aren't something that can be calculated, they are nurtured by two people together,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"I see.\"","But did Qi Ji really understand?"]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: Learning to Paint with Oil Paints","paragraphs":["She herself didn't know how to operate it, how to operate it after all.","\"Sister Yin Yin, I heard from Sister Shu Yi that you and your husband were also in an arranged marriage?\"","\"Yes, Zhengzheng and I were also in an arranged marriage. Our feelings for each other have only been cultivated in the past few months.\"","\"Wow!\" Qi Ji exclaimed in disbelief. Zhengzheng was already two years old, and their feelings had only developed in the past few months.","\"Surprised, isn't it? Actually, it was your Sister Shu Yi who opened my eyes, allowing me to face my own feelings. Let me tell you, I'm incredibly insensitive when it comes to emotions.\"","\"Sister Shu Yi is amazing!\"","\"She's the most rational and clear-headed person. Tonight, when you see her, you can ask her for advice about your emotional issues.\"","\"Okay, what shall we do next?\"","\"Zhengzheng is asleep, and I want to learn oil painting.\"","\"Great, Sister Yin Yin. After seeing your embroidery works, I think you have an excellent foundation in painting, so learning oil painting should be easy for you.\"","Shen Yin led Qi Ji to a small storage room on the second floor. Inside was an easel, various oil paints, watercolors, acrylics, and ink.","\"Sister Yin Yin, is your family planning to open a painting studio? These supplies are so comprehensive,\" Qi Ji exclaimed in surprise.","She had a limited perspective; she never imagined there would be so many painting supplies in one room.","These painting supplies were arranged by Xu Xiuhe himself, though she had not paid attention to this room before. Who would have thought there would be so many supplies—it seemed like a new shipment had arrived.","\"Sister Yin Yin, let's start!\"","Oil painting is neither easy nor difficult. Shen Yin had a foundation in painting, so she just needed to learn the techniques.","Qi Ji first found the paints, oil painting brushes, palette knives, palettes, mediums, canvas boards, and other necessary items from the pile of supplies.","\"Goethe said, 'If you want to escape from this world, there is no more reliable way than art; if you want to connect with the world, there is also no more reliable way than art.' I used to want to escape, but since meeting you and Sister Shu Yi, I feel like I've changed a lot,\" Qi Ji said as she organized the painting tools.","\"Throughout our lives, we encounter all kinds of people. They influence us—some make us stronger, some cause us to change, and some become lifelong regrets. You feel you've changed after meeting me and Shu Yi. What about after meeting Xue Jingrui?\"","Qi Ji pondered for a moment. \"After meeting Brother Jingrui, I also feel like I've changed.\"","\"How did you change?\"","\"I've become lazier, which is not a good change,\" Qi Ji said with a serious expression.","\"Qi Ji, did you know you're just a happy nut?\" Shen Yin felt that Qi Ji could make her laugh with every sentence.","\"If Sister Yin Yin feels happy being with me, then I'll come and keep you company often.\"","\"Such a sweet talker.\"","\"Sister, you must be familiar with composition, so I'll just introduce you to the tools used for sketching.\"","\"Mmhmm, okay.\"","\"Charcoal sticks, charcoal pencils, pastel and wax crayons, watercolors and acrylics.\"","Qi Ji then introduced some specific uses and steps for using the tools. Her content was very detailed and informative. Shen Yin listened attentively.","\"For oil painting, color is the most crucial aspect. Through the development of oil painting, we can see that the beauty of color layers is constantly being explored and created. Transparent and opaque colors, the dark effects on the canvas—all have their techniques.\"","As Qi Ji spoke, she demonstrated various techniques like dabbing, kneading, brushing, and scraping for Shen Yin.","\"So interesting,\" Shen Yin marveled. Indeed, it was a different style from Chinese painting, each with its own charms.","\"You give it a try. Do you have any photos of Zhengzheng on your phone? We can start by painting Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin took out her phone and found a photo of Zhengzheng eating.","She began sketching...","With Shen Yin's existing painting foundation, her intelligence, and Qi Ji's guidance, she produced a delightful little portrait of Zhengzheng. The overall composition was aesthetically pleasing, to the point where it could be framed and sold as an artwork.","During the painting process, Qi Ji went upstairs from time to time to check on Zhengzheng in case he woke up and couldn't find them.","Later, when Zhengzheng woke up, Shen Yin started painting directly from him as the model.","\"Sister Yin Yin, you're truly an all-rounder. This first oil painting you've done is better than those painted by people who have done it a dozen times.\"","\"Mommy, this is Zhengzheng,\" Xu Yunzheng said, pointing at the painting.","\"Yes, it's Zhengzheng,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Zhengzheng looks so handsome, and Mommy's painting is also beautiful,\" Xu Yunzheng complimented himself and Shen Yin.","Qi Ji smiled on the side.","Shen Yin sighed helplessly. He was already so narcissistic at such a young age, clearly inheriting the trait from Xu Xiuhe.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng is thirsty and hungry,\" Xu Yunzheng whined.","Shen Yin checked the time, and it was indeed late, past five o'clock.","\"Okay, let's go out for dinner.\"","Shen Yin and Qi Ji took Xu Yunzheng and got in the car.","Qi Ji had already told Xue Jingrui in the afternoon that she would be having dinner with Sister Yin Yin and Sister Shu Yi in the evening.","Shen Yin had also informed Xu Xiuhe.","The driver parked the car in front of the restaurant Shu Yi had booked.","The three of them got out and entered the private room Shu Yi had reserved.","As soon as they opened the door, Shu Yi ran over and hugged Xu Yunzheng.","\"Zhengzheng, did you miss Auntie?\" Shu Yi had been away filming for almost half a month and really missed Yin Yin and the others.","\"I missed Auntie,\" Xu Yunzheng replied.","Upon hearing this, Shu Yi couldn't resist and hugged Xu Yunzheng tightly, planting kisses on his little face.","\"Auntie, Mommy said Zhengzheng can't let girls kiss him randomly,\" Xu Yunzheng said as he touched the spot on his face where Shu Yi had just kissed him.","\"Oh no, does that mean Auntie has been rejected by Zhengzheng?\" Shu Yi said dramatically, almost to the point of tears.","Xu Yunzheng didn't know what to do and turned to Shen Yin for help. He didn't mean it; why was Auntie crying?","\"Auntie is just acting,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"Auntie, I'm sorry. Zhengzheng will give you a kiss,\" Xu Yunzheng said as he hugged Shu Yi's neck and gently patted her shoulder.","Shu Yi smiled through her tears.","\"Will Zhengzheng give Sister a kiss too?\" Qi Ji thought it was amusing and joined in the fun.","\"Yes.\"","\"Alright, enough standing around. Let's sit and chat,\" Shen Yin suggested.","A few people sat down on the chairs. The restaurant was a high-end establishment, with elegant decor and a cozy atmosphere. Shu Yi had reserved a private family dining room, making it feel warm and intimate.","After they were seated, Shu Yi asked Shen Yin and Qi Ji to order the food while she played with little Zhengzheng.","\"Shu Yi, how long will you be staying this time?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Just two days, then I have to leave again. I likely won't be back until late September.\"","\"That must be so tiring for you, Sister Shu Yi.\"","\"It is, but I plan on taking a vacation after I finish filming this movie!\"","\"What about that matter you mentioned last time, when you said you'd tell me more details when you returned?\" Shen Yin inquired."]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: Emotional Analysis","paragraphs":["If Shu Yi didn't mention it, she'd be fine, but once she did, she just wanted to poke fun at it. A good urban romance drama turned into a comedy by Chang Zhiyuan's improvisation.","He acted as he pleased, and the director not only dared not object but also had to keep laughing along with him.","\"The more I talk about it, the more teary I get. I'm super afraid of Chang Zhiyuan getting close to me now,\" Shu Yi said, her expression turning impatient when mentioning Chang Zhiyuan.","\"What about the kissing scenes?\" Shen Yin asked curiously.","This drama was not only Shu Yi's first on-screen kiss, but also her very first kiss in real life.","Shu Yi's face turned red as she said, \"We've shot it twice now.\"","\"Ah! Sister Shu Yi has filmed a kissing scene!\"","Qi Ji's exclamation made Shu Yi even more embarrassed.","So the kisses in TV dramas are real, huh? She had thought they were all post-production effects.","\"I'm seriously fed up with him now. He could have nailed the kissing scene in one take, but he kept messing up. I seriously suspect he's doing it on purpose.\"","\"Does Chang Zhiyuan like Sister Shu Yi?\" Qi Ji asked.","This question left both Shen Yin and Shu Yi silent.","Shen Yin didn't know the answer, and Shu Yi, as the person involved, was even more puzzled. As the saying goes, \"The bystander sees most of the game.\" This was true for Shu Yi.","After some hesitation, Shu Yi said with an uncertain tone, \"I don't know. He's a playboy, and sometimes I really get annoyed with him.\"","Shen Yin didn't know how to help Shu Yi with this kind of issue either.","Shu Yi was sensitive and cautious when it came to matters of the heart.","\"So did Chang Zhiyuan deliberately want to film the kissing scene with Sister Shu Yi?\" Qi Ji asked.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin felt like laughing. Not just deliberately—he had probably plotted it for a long time. Otherwise, why would the original actor have been replaced for no reason? And this media tycoon just happened to take over the role.","\"He's your boss, Sister Shu Yi, and he's never acted before, has he?\" Shen Yin asked Shu Yi.","\"Yeah, he's never acted before. This is his debut performance.\"","When Qi Ji heard this, her first reaction was that Chang Zhiyuan would be criticized for having no acting skills and ruining the drama with his terrible acting.","Shen Yin also remembered Shu Yi's previous worries and asked, \"So how's his acting? Can you continue working with him?\"","Shu Yi waved her hand dismissively. \"I can't keep working with him. If the penalty for breach of contract wasn't so expensive, I'd have quit already.\"","\"Is Chang Zhiyuan's acting that cringeworthy?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"No, no, his acting is quite good. He's just being himself—shameless, constantly saying flirtatious lines. I can't keep up with his improvisation. He's turned a good drama into his own personal playground.\"","Shu Yi was exhausted. If she could, she would complain nonstop for three days and three nights.","\"I think if this drama actually airs, I'll be the one getting criticized.\"","\"Let's take it one step at a time. Let's eat first. If anyone criticizes you when it airs, I'll scold them back for you,\" Shen Yin said, thinking that eating was the only way to reduce Shu Yi's suffering for now.","\"Don't worry, Sister Shu Yi. I'll also scold them back for you. If I can't win the argument, I'll hire internet trolls to support you,\" Qi Ji chimed in.","\"It's so nice to have you two,\" Shu Yi said, almost forgetting that the few people in front of her were all young millionaires. She was so lucky to have two millionaire friends.","\"By the way, how have you both been while I was away? Little Qi Ji, are you enjoying your newlywed bliss?\"","Qi Ji blushed and nodded. She seemed to be happy every day, without a care in the world. Aside from drawing illustrations, she had nothing else to do but eat, watch shows, and read comics.","\"Wow, I'm jealous. Being happy is the most important thing.\"","\"Yeah, Zheng Zheng is also very happy,\" Xu Yunzheng said as she gnawed on a pork rib.","Upon hearing this, Shu Yi suddenly remembered something. \"Little Qi Ji, have you considered having a cute little baby like Zheng Zheng?\"","\"I've thought about it a little. Zheng Zheng is so adorable and warm,\" Qi Ji replied.","\"If you want one, go for it. I hope I can hold another godson by April next year,\" Shu Yi said excitedly, imagining herself holding a baby in each arm as she strolled around.","Qi Ji fell silent. She did love babies and really wanted one.","\"She's still a child, though. Xue Jingrui is treating her like a precious daughter right now,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"Whoa, that's so cool! Is that what a 'dad husband' is like? I'm envious,\" Shu Yi said, her mind filled with all sorts of imagined plotlines. She felt like she could write a book about it.","\"Sister Shu Yi, since Sister Shen Yin says you're knowledgeable about matters of the heart, could you help me analyze something?\"","\"You've come to the right person.\"","In the next room, Xue Jingrui, Xu Xiuhe, and Chang Zhiyuan sat together, sipping tea and sighing.","\"Why didn't they invite us when the three of them are having a meal together?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked indignantly.","\"Shut up. My son's wife is there, and I haven't even complained,\" Xu Xiuhe said calmly as he drank some water.","\"Exactly. My wife is there too. By the way, who do you have a connection with in there?\" Xue Jingrui added.","That stung. Chang Zhiyuan felt that the two men in front of him were inhumane. How could anyone say such things? Were they bullying him for not having a wife?","\"My godson is there, and so is my fiancée.\"","\"Enough, why did you decide to take on this acting role?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Jingrui, you don't understand. I don't want to suffer on set either, but could I bear to watch that woman kiss another man? I couldn't.\"","\"Couldn't you have just changed the script?\" Xue Jingrui suggested.","\"Xiuhe, can't you see? He just wanted to kiss her, which is why he took on this role. By the way, can you even act?\" Xue Jingrui questioned Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Of course I can act. Who knows, maybe after this drama, I'll become an overnight sensation and switch careers to become a big star,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, starting to become self-absorbed. He felt he was simply a gifted natural, even praised by the director. He was born to be an actor.","\"We've strayed from the topic. When did those three become so close?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","He had always known that Shu Yi and Shen Yin had a good relationship since they had known each other for a long time and had worked together on a set before. But when did his little wife become so close with them? They had only met a couple of times, right?","\"Women's relationships are mysterious. As long as they're not competitors, they treat each other like sisters,\" Chang Zhiyuan explained.","\"What do you think they're talking about?\" Xue Jingrui wondered.","In Shen Yin's room, Shu Yi was trying to analyze the situation.","\"Qi Ji, are you afraid that you'll become too dependent on Xue Jingrui?\"","Qi Ji nodded.","Shu Yi truly didn't know how to advise Qi Ji. Qi Ji's situation was different from Shen Yin's – she had no good feelings towards Xue Jingrui, and was beating around the bush without clearly explaining things. Her judgment had been so poor before.","\"Qi Ji, I don't really know how to advise you. I'll reserve my opinion, but if he continues to treat you so well, it's not impossible. Sometimes, girls need to be more clear-headed. Don't think that love is everything, that you must possess it. If we never meet the one we love in this life, and there's someone who treats us exceptionally well, even without romantic love, over time it could develop into a familial affection. So on this point, you need to think about what you want.\""]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Strategizing","paragraphs":["Qi Ji was perplexed, wondering if she would ever meet the person she loves.","In the next private room, Xu Xiu and Shen Yin were questioning him.","\"Jingrui, what feelings do you have for Qi Ji?\"","Chang Zhiyuan also pricked up his ears, very curious about this question, as Xue Jingrui himself had said he understood.","\"I don't know. I feel she's too young to marry me, it would be a loss for her. I just want to treat her well and spoil her.\"","\"Brother, you're doomed, you're done for.\" Chang Zhiyuan mocked his misfortune.","\"What does she see you as?\" Chang Zhiyuan brought up the topic again.","\"She calls me 'brother' every day.\"","Chang Zhiyuan felt envious, wondering when Shu Yi would sweetly call him 'brother' too.","\"What, you mean you've been calling Xue Jingrui 'brother'?\" Shu Yi couldn't believe it.","\"Yes, I've always called him brother, from the day we got married until now, that's what I call him.\" Qi Ji nodded, her eyes as big as copper bells, blinking repeatedly to affirm what she said.","\"So now he sees you as a younger sister, and you see him as a brother? Oh my, is there any romantic feelings between you two?\" Even with all the novels Shu Yi had read over the years, she was at a loss regarding their relationship.","Qi Ji also wore a bewildered expression.","\"Sister Shu Yi, Sister Shen Yin said you awakened her. Can you now awaken me too? I don't know what to do next.\" Qi Ji asked.","Shu Yi wanted to say that the relationship between Shen Yin and Xu Xiu was a bit different from that of Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui.","\"Your relationships are different. Yin Yin and her husband do have Zhengzheng.\"","Xu Yunzheng was enjoying his meal when he heard his nickname and chimed in, \"Where's Zhengzheng?\"","\"Sister Shu Yi, do you mean that I need to have a child for my relationship with Brother Jingrui to be like Sister Shen Yin's?\"","Shu Yi was thrown into confusion. Oh dear, this was getting too complicated.","In the next private room.","\"Brother, let me tell you, since she calls you 'brother', you have to make a move! You can't be so wooden.\"","\"What move?\"","\"She calls you brother, meaning she's not resistant to you but trusts you instead. Now is the time to seize the opportunity. Look how fast Xiu and I were? I taught him.\" Chang Zhiyuan thumped his chest, boasting.","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiu looked puzzled. Really? He didn't remember Chang Zhiyuan teaching him. If his memory served, it was always his company's little assistant Xiao Li'er who advised him. Of course, it was also because of his own quick wit and thick skin that he won over Shen Yin. What did Chang Zhiyuan have to do with it?","\"Ahem, you can take me as a successful case study, but a certain someone shouldn't flatter himself, since among the three of us, only one is single.\"","\"What about me? When did I flatter myself? Can you say I never gave you advice?\"","\"If I have to say why my wife and I are so blissful today, the biggest contributor is Zhengzheng.\" Xu Xiu felt proud, his boastful tone making it obvious even to a fool.","After saying that, Xu Xiu suddenly missed Zhengzheng, not having seen the little one for a day, wondering if he was missed too.","\"So, the key is that I need to have a child first for my relationship with her to progress?\"","\"Buddy, wake up. The question now is what you need to do to have a child.\"","\"You're all wrong. My having Zhengzheng was an accident, an accident that others can't imitate. Jingrui's problem now is how to take his relationship with Qi Ji one step further. Having a child, can he decide that by himself? He can't give birth.\"","After Xu Xiu finished speaking, the three fell silent.","They started eating.","\"What do you think they're discussing over there?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"Clothes, bags, jewelry, lipstick?\"","In the other private room.","\"Qi Ji, did you ever like someone before?\" Shu Yi asked.","Qi Ji shook her head.","\"Actually, apart from Xue Jingrui's poor eyesight before and being a bit wooden, he's quite alright in other aspects.\" Shen Yin chimed in.","\"Do you like children?\" Shu Yi asked again.","Qi Ji nodded. Of course she did. Babies were adorable, chubby and innocent. Treat them well and they'll treat you well too. Who didn't like them?","\"If all else fails, have one.\" Shu Yi said solemnly.","\"With who?\" Qi Ji asked sincerely, as she truly liked babies.","\"Xue Jingrui.\"","...","\"How do you have one?\"","Shu Yi held her head, feeling that Qi Ji was too naive.","In the other private room.","\"Now, you should tell her you like her, not see her as a younger sister,\" Chang Zhiyuan spoke up.","\"You could learn from me, be a bit thick-skinned. The first step is to sleep in the same room.\"","\"On what pretext?\"","\"Jingrui, on this matter, Xiu and I can't help you anymore. Feelings are between you and her. We can only give you some strategies, but the actual implementation depends on you.\"","\"Obviously with you two.\" Shen Yin didn't finish her sentence.","Shu Yi continued, \"Have a physical relationship.\"","Qi Ji blushed, feeling a bit shy, and took a tactical sip of water.","Suddenly, someone knocked on the private room door.","Shen Yin looked at Shu Yi and asked, \"Did you order something else?\"","Shu Yi was also puzzled. She thought Shen Yin had ordered more dishes but Shen Yin was asking her, so she shook her head.","\"Then who could it be?\"","\"Let me open the door.\" Qi Ji, who was closest to the door, stood up to open it.","Qi Ji opened it a crack but quickly closed it again.","Shu Yi: \"Qi Ji, who is it? Why did you close the door again?\"","Qi Ji turned around, looked at Shen Yin and Shu Yi, patted her chest and said, \"It's Brother Jingrui and the others.\"","Shen Yin and Shu Yi looked at each other, then asked together, \"The others?\"","\"Also Sister Shen Yin's husband and Chang Zhiyuan.\" Qi Ji was a bit startled. The two sisters had just told her about 'having a physical relationship', and they came so soon.","Outside, the three men didn't understand what had just happened. Was it an illusion? Did they see wrong in that split second when the door opened?","They knocked again.","Qi Ji quickly opened the door, then hurried back to her seat.","\"How did they know we're here?\" Shu Yi asked.","Shen Yin shook her head, \"Not me, I didn't say where.\"","Qi Ji immediately shook her head, she hadn't said anything.","The three of them entered the private room one after another.","Xu Yunzheng looked up: \"Dad, Dad.\"","Xu Xiu walked over to Xu Yunzheng and picked up Zhengzheng. \"Dad, Zhengzheng hasn't eaten enough yet.\" Zhengzheng was reluctant to put down the chopsticks in his hand, as he had just been eating and playing around, not really eating enough.","Hearing this, Xu Xiu put Zhengzheng down and sat down next to him."]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: Back to the Old House","paragraphs":["\"How did you know we were at this restaurant?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"If Shu Yi is somewhere, I'd certainly know as her boss,\" Chang Zhiyuan said without treating it as a question. If he wanted to know where someone was, it was too easy.","Shu Yi was speechless.","\"Have you eaten?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"No,\" said Shen Yin.","\"Yes,\" said Jing Rui.","\"Not finished,\" said Xiu He.","Three people, three different answers. Now not only Shu Yi was speechless, but the other two didn't know what to make of it either.","Why didn't they coordinate their lines?","\"It's like this, I haven't eaten, I met Jing Rui who was in the middle of eating, and then the two of us met Xiu He who had finished eating,\" Chang Zhiyuan made up a lie on the spot.","\"Jing Rui, where were you eating that you got pulled out halfway through?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"Um...\" Jing Rui scratched his head, not saying a word. If he said he was eating in the next private room, would they believe him?","\"It's like this, we happened to come out to eat too, happened to be next door to you, happened that Chang Zhiyuan hadn't eaten, Jing Rui ate halfway, and I just finished eating,\" Xiu He explained.","...","\"What a coincidence, three coincidences, very very very good,\" Shen Yin smiled, these three brothers were quite amusing.","Chang Zhiyuan sat down next to Shu Yi, who had nearly finished eating, after all female celebrities still needed to maintain their figures.","Chang Zhiyuan took Shu Yi's chopsticks and started picking up dishes from the table.","Not only Shu Yi, but also the people across from them were stunned.","\"What are you looking at? Keep eating. With so many people watching me eat, I'm not used to it. Jing Rui, you haven't finished either, so you eat too. Xiu He...\"","Chang Zhiyuan's words were cut off by Xu Xiuhe: \"Just eat, there's no point talking to a chatterbox like you.\"","Chang Zhiyuan started eating. There were no spare chopsticks on the table, so Jing Rui, seeing that Qi Ji had stopped eating, took her chopsticks instead. He wasn't hungry, but he just wanted to use Qi Ji's chopsticks.","Xu Xiuhe watched with an expression of \"the student has surpassed the master.\"","Qi Ji: \"Jing Rui, there are chopsticks at the counter over there, let me get you a pair.\"","\"No need, using an extra pair is just wasteful,\" Jing Rui said.","\"Exactly, look at me using Shu Yi's chopsticks. We need to save, not waste. Be frugal, everyone is responsible. Join the 'clean plate' campaign,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, then picked up Shu Yi's bowl which still had some rice left.","\"Hey, that's my bowl, I didn't finish it,\" Shu Yi said anxiously.","\"I don't mind,\" Chang Zhiyuan replied.","Shu Yi was speechless.","Shen Yin smiled inwardly, now she understood why Xu Xiuhe was so thick-skinned - there was an even thicker-skinned one.","\"Jing Rui, do you want more rice? If so, let the server refill it.\"","\"No need, I'll just have a bit,\" Jing Rui said. He wasn't hungry, he just wanted to see how Qi Ji would react to him.","The little girl still cared about him, so his gifts of fruit and snacks weren't for nothing.","\"It's Saturday today, my parents want us to stay over at the old house for a night, is that okay?\"","\"Of course, it's been a while since we went back.\"","After dinner, everyone went their separate ways.","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng and held Shen Yin's hand to the car.","Shu Yi had her own car, so Chang Zhiyuan drove behind her.","Jing Rui drove, with Qi Ji in the passenger seat.","\"Did you have fun today?\" Jing Rui asked.","Qi Ji hugged her plushie and nodded: \"Yes, Shen Yin is really amazing, she knows everything, even fortune-telling. The Martial Arts Club she runs is great too, can I come back tomorrow?\"","\"Of course, I'll drop you off in the morning,\" Jing Rui replied.","But what was on his mind was Shen Yin's fortune-telling talent. Fortune-telling, surely it was fake? Did people still do that nowadays? Shen Yin must have been joking, and this little girl just believed it.","He had wanted to tell the little girl that Shen Yin might not actually be able to tell fortunes and not to believe everything she said. But seeing her so excited, he gave up.","At the family compound, the Xue house had its gates closed.","Jing Rui knocked on the door.","It was opened by the family's maid.","\"Auntie, are my parents asleep?\" Jing Rui asked.","\"No, they just went upstairs,\" the maid replied.","\"Okay, then Qi Ji and I will head up too.\"","\"Sure, get some rest early. Fresh sheets in your rooms, sleep well.\"","\"Thank you auntie,\" Qi Ji said sweetly.","The maid watched them go upstairs, smiling to herself: \"How lovely, a handsome couple. When will I have such an obedient daughter-in-law?\"","Upstairs, Xue Kai and Ye Rong were watching TV. Hearing the sounds from the staircase, they were surprised - the maid didn't usually come upstairs at night.","When Jing Rui and Qi Ji appeared, Ye Rong stood up.","\"Jing Rui, Qi Ji?\"","Before she could say more, Jing Rui cut her off.","\"Mom, were you and dad waiting for us?\"","Having been in business for years, Ye Rong understood what her son meant.","\"Yes, yes, your mom hasn't seen my daughter-in-law for so long and missed her. Daughter-in-law, how have you been lately? If Jing Rui bullies you, let me know and I'll support you,\" Ye Rong said warmly, taking Qi Ji's hands.","\"Mom, Jing Rui has been very good to me, he doesn't bully me,\" Qi Ji replied.","\"That's good, that's good. It's getting late, you should rest up and try to give me a grandchild soon,\" Ye Rong smiled, as if she could hold her grandchild tomorrow.","Hearing this, Qi Ji's face reddened again, just like what Shu Yi had told her earlier that evening.","Jing Rui, on the other hand, wasn't embarrassed at all. He turned to look at Qi Ji and saw her blushing, secretly delighted - did this mean she wasn't completely indifferent to him?","\"Mom, I'll go take a shower first,\" Qi Ji said, having been out all day, a shower would be refreshing.","After Qi Ji entered the bedroom, only the three of them remained in the living room.","\"Jing Rui, out with it, what's going on that you suddenly came back?\" Xue Kai spoke from the sofa.","\"Nothing, I just wanted to come see you,\" Jing Rui replied.","\"That's for the best; we can't let this girl be wronged. I didn't mention to you what happened at the wedding last time, that woman is no good. You should be cautious of her in the future.\"","\"I understand, Dad.\"","\"It's good that you understand, it's good that you understand. Jingrui, tell your mom, how are things going between you two now? Are you trying for a baby?\"","Ye Rong pulled Xue Jingrui's arm again, with an inquisitive look on her face.","\"Mom... yes, we're trying.\" Xue Jingrui said somewhat unnaturally.","Ye Rong thought her son was just being shy, and she looked delighted. \"Let me tell you, I've been through this myself. During your trying to conceive period, you must take it seriously.\"","Xue Jingrui was afraid of Ye Rong launching into a long lecture, so he quickly cut her off."]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Cooking in the Kitchen","paragraphs":["In the bedroom, Qi Ji walked to the side of the bed after taking a shower.","When Xue Jingrui came in, he had laid out a mattress on the floor, but his mind was already brainstorming.","He thought of several ways to get to sleep on the bed, but one by one they were rejected. He originally thought of pretending to look pitiful, saying his back and waist were aching and uncomfortable sleeping on the floor.","But then he thought, he was older than Qi Ji after all, so if he said his body wasn't doing well, how would Qi Ji look at him in the future?","Suddenly, Xue Jingrui's eyes lit up when he saw a cup of water on the table nearby. Could he...?","\"Qi Ji, do you want some water?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Big Brother Jingrui, I drank some earlier tonight, I'm not thirsty now,\" said Qi Ji, lying down and pulling the thin blanket over herself, ready to sleep.","If she wasn't thirsty, then he was relieved.","Xue Jingrui walked over to the table, picked up the cup and said, \"I'm a little thirsty.\"","Qi Ji was engrossed in reading a comic on her phone at an exciting part and didn't have time to pay attention to Xue Jingrui.","Seeing that Qi Ji didn't respond, Xue Jingrui carried the cup of water and walked toward his mattress. As he was about to reach it, he pretended to stumble, lurching his body forward and throwing the cup out of his hand.","Not a single drop was left in the cup - all the water splashed onto the blanket. The commotion was so loud that Qi Ji looked over.","\"Big Brother Jingrui, are you okay?\" Qi Ji got out of bed.","\"I'm fine, but my blanket isn't.\"","The cup had landed on the blanket, leaving a large wet patch around it that wouldn't dry anytime soon.","\"How will you sleep now, Big Brother Jingrui?\"","Upon hearing this, Xue Jingrui felt like crying for a moment. How would he sleep? Of course he wanted to sleep on the bed. He was puzzled - shouldn't the young lady let him sleep on the bed?","\"It's okay, I'm young and my body is sturdy. Sleeping in a damp blanket for one night is no big deal.\" Xue Jingrui's words sounded tough, but his expression made him seem pitiful.","Qi Ji couldn't bear it anymore.","\"If it really doesn't work out, you can sleep on the bed.\"","At Qinghe Villa, a family of three lay on the bed.","Xu Xiuhe glanced at his phone, then turned to look at Shen Yin, who was coaxing their son Xu Yunzheng, and asked, \"Hey? Wife, can you tell fortunes?\"","Shen Yin looked bewildered at first, then realized and laughed, \"Xue Jingrui asked you that? I was just joking with Qi Ji, but she took it seriously. Qi Ji is so adorable.\"","Xu Xiuhe also smiled. What Shen Yin didn't know was that in his eyes, she was the most adorable.","\"Mommy, isn't Yunzheng adorable too?\" Little Xu Yunzheng was almost asleep but had heard his mom praise Auntie Qi Ji for being adorable. He thought he was adorable too.","\"Yes, Yunzheng is the most adorable,\" said Shen Yin, gently patting Xu Yunzheng's tummy. The little one soon grew sleepy.","Shen Yin also fell asleep, but she didn't sleep well that night. The nightmare attacked her again, and this time in the dream, a man had kidnapped her. She couldn't see the man's face.","She was tied up in an abandoned, dirty factory full of garbage, with rats scurrying around occasionally.","She wanted to escape, but she wasn't bound by ropes, but rather iron chains.","She couldn't see the man's face, but she felt that he had wicked intentions toward her.","\"No one will come to save you. You already have a child, why resist so much? If you can give birth for other men, why not for me?\"","Shen Yin suddenly woke up, the dream too realistic. She realized this dream, like the previous two, was a premonition.","The nightmare had left her drenched in cold sweat. After waking up, she couldn't fall back asleep. She was completely baffled, unable to figure out who had kidnapped her and how that person could have succeeded in tying her up.","She tossed and turned, struggling to sleep. Luckily she had woken up – she dared not imagine what might have happened next, even though it hadn't occurred yet, the thought alone sickened her.","Perhaps her movements were too much and disturbed the man beside her. Xu Xiuhe turned on the light and saw Shen Yin lying flat, eyes wide open staring at the ceiling with a worried expression.","\"What's wrong? Another nightmare?\" Xu Xiuhe rubbed his eyes, his voice soft and gentle. For a moment, Shen Yin wanted to tell him about her dream, but she couldn't - he would worry.","\"No, I was just a bit hungry and it woke me up,\" Shen Yin made up an excuse.","\"Just wait,\" said Xu Xiuhe, putting on his slippers and walking out of the bedroom.","Shen Yin sat up, her mind still on the events of her dream. She had no clue who had kidnapped her or when this would happen. She had always thought herself vigilant and smart, acting cautiously, but never imagined she could be so helpless in her dream.","Luckily it hadn't happened yet. Luckily there was still time.","Shen Yin walked out of the bedroom toward the kitchen, where the man was chopping vegetables as the water boiled in the pot. She had never imagined there would come a day when a man would cook for her in the middle of the night just because of something she said.","The man was about to blanch the chopped vegetables when Shen Yin entered the kitchen, hugging him from behind and pressing her face against his back. Xu Xiuhe paused for a moment - this was the first time Shen Yin had been so proactive with him.","\"What's wrong?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin didn't answer, just hugging him tightly, her face against his back. So she could be vulnerable and afraid too.","\"Easy now, what happened?\" At this point, Xu Xiuhe couldn't believe Shen Yin was just hungry.","\"Nothing happened, I just feel you're so, so good and I want to...\"","Seeing Shen Yin's actions, Xu Xiuhe naturally understood what she wanted.","For the first time she was taking such initiative - how could he refuse?","The man turned off the stove, and they stayed in the kitchen.","Xu Xiuhe felt Shen Yin's passion.","\"Don't worry, no matter what happens, I'll be by your side.\"","\"Okay.\"","Outside, the sky was gradually brightening - the first light of summer at 4am.","The two of them finished.","\"Am I really silly?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe kissed Shen Yin's neck, his voice slightly hoarse but unbearably gentle, \"How could my wife be silly? She's the smartest, most capable woman in the world.\"","Shen Yin looked at the half-cooked meal and asked, \"Shall we continue making it?\"","\"Of course, the water has cooled down. I'll reboil it and make you some clear noodle soup. Eat it, then take a shower and get some rest.\"","Shen Yin put on her clothes, folded her arms, and leaned against the wall, watching Xu Xiuhe's every move.","In 10 minutes, a bowl of fragrant clear noodle soup was placed on the table, and Shen Yin walked over.","\"The noodles smell so good.\"","\"My mom used to make them for me all the time, so I learned how to make them over time.\"","Shen Yin took a sip, and it tasted delicious.","\"I can't finish it all. Come and share it with me.\""]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: The Future Son-in-law","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe walked over, and the two finished a bowl of noodles.","\"Later we'll take a shower, and then you can sleep some more. I have to go to work today.\"","\"Okay.\"","After the shower, the two laid on the bed. It was only 5 a.m., but Shen Yin finally fell asleep in Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","When she woke up again, Xu Xiuhe was no longer by her side. Only Xu Yunzheng was lying next to her, motionless, watching her.","\"Mommy, you're awake?\" Zhengzheng asked.","\"Where's Daddy?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Daddy told Zhengzheng not to disturb Mommy.\"","Shen Yin glanced at her phone. It was already past 8 o'clock.","\"Is Zhengzheng hungry?\"","The little doll nodded.","Shen Yin got up.","On Sunday, no one came to work at the studio. She had previously notified Shen Meng and her friends that they could come over today, and she had also told Qi Ji and Shu Yi yesterday.","While Shen Yin was preparing breakfast for Zhengzheng, Qi Ji and Shu Yi came upstairs.","\"Smells so good. I should've skipped breakfast and just come over to mooch off you,\" Shu Yi said.","\"I ate a lot this morning. Last night I went back to Brother Jing Rui's place, and Mom made me a lot of food. I'm stuffed,\" Qi Ji said.","\"You went back to the old house last night,\" Shu Yi said with interest.","\"Yes, Brother Jing Rui said Dad and Mom missed us. So we went back.\"","\"How did you two stay there?\"","Qi Ji looked very embarrassed and bashful. \"We stayed in the same room.\"","\"And?\" Shen Yin asked. From her experienced perspective, since they stayed in the same room, they were not far from sharing a bed.","\"We slept in the same bed,\" Qi Ji said.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin couldn't be bothered with anything else, and Shu Yi also looked at Qi Ji in shock. Only Zhengzheng was eating the little pancakes Shen Yin made, oblivious to their conversation.","\"Damn, sis, you move that fast?\" Shu Yi exclaimed.","\"Who suggested it?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I did,\" Qi Ji replied.","\"Qi Ji, you're so brave!\" Shu Yi said admiringly.","\"No, no, it's not like that. Last night he was sleeping on the floor, and when he was holding a cup, he spilled water all over the bedding. It got really wet. I was afraid he'd get sick sleeping like that, so I let him get in the bed,\" Qi Ji hastily explained.","\"How did he react?\"","\"He didn't say anything. He slept very properly, and we just slept on our sides.\"","\"Not bad, not bad.\"","\"Do you really want to have a baby?\"","Qi Ji nodded.","\"What do you think about men? Do you care?\"","Qi Ji shook her head. But it seemed she understood what she needed to do next. As the saying goes, the one who falls in love first will suffer the most.","So she couldn't fall in love first. She had to stay lucid, but she wanted a child. Brother Jing Rui met all the criteria and would make a good father.","As for her, she was financially independent, her parents loved her, and she had a small fortune saved up, which would be enough for her and the baby's future. So why couldn't she make the first move?","\"I want to have a baby,\" Qi Ji said seriously.","\"Have you really thought it through?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Mm-hmm.\"","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng's done eating,\" Zhengzheng said after taking a sip of soup, looking at the three of them.","\"Then let's go to the small building across the way. A few more people are coming, and then we'll practice some basic moves.\"","\"Okay! Zhengzheng wants to become a superhero and beat up the bad guys who bully girls,\" Zhengzheng said, raising his fist.","\"My future son-in-law is awesome. I wonder which lucky little girl he'll make his wife someday,\" Shu Yi mused.","\"Mine,\" Qi Ji said unexpectedly.","\"Whose little girl, Auntie?\" Zhengzheng asked innocently.","\"Auntie is going to have a little girlfriend for you, Zhengzheng. Then you'll be my son-in-law,\" Qi Ji said lightly, skipping down the stairs.","\"She's already decided on her future son-in-law while he's still a child,\" Shu Yi laughed as she followed Qi Ji down.","\"She's probably just joking with a childish mindset. Having a baby is not that easy. She's still too young. She can wait a couple more years,\" Shen Yin said gently.","\"Yin Yin, don't be a hypocrite. How old were you when you had Zhengzheng?\" Shu Yi asked pointedly.","Ah, Shen Yin calculated... It seemed she was about the same age as Qi Ji.","\"Alright, alright, Qi Ji isn't that young,\" she conceded.","In the small building across the way, a few girls greeted them as they entered.","While Shen Yin was chatting with Shen Meng, Shen Meng asked about the cost of learning martial arts. Shen Yin never intended to make money from the martial arts studio, so the fees were not high, even lower than ordinary studios. As a result, more than five people showed up today.","Shu Yi took one look and thought, \"Well, well, we've got the Seven Fairies gathered here.\"","Shen Yin was more casual about it. She had them line up inside and stretch their muscles.","\"Has anyone practiced martial arts before?\" Shen Yin asked sternly.","The girls shook their heads.","Adding Zhengzheng, there were a total of 10 students.","\"Does practicing the Eight Brocade Qigong in college count?\"","\"Does practicing Tai Chi with my grandfather count?\"","\"Zhengzheng learned the horse stance when acting.\" The little guy had a good memory and even demonstrated the stance, using all his strength to squat down, successfully making everyone there laugh.","\"Since none of you have any foundation, let's start from the beginning. The most important things in martial arts are the flexibility, agility, and strength of the legs. So today we'll start with the legs.\"","\"First, the front leg stretch.\"","Shen Yin placed her left heel on the railing, toes hooked up, both legs straight, hands supporting her left knee, and leaned her upper body forward, trying to touch her head to her toes. She alternated between legs.","\"Keep your legs straight and lean your upper body forward,\" Shen Yin emphasized.","The girls imitated Shen Yin, raising and straightening their legs.","\"Ow, that hurts.\"","\"It looks so easy, but it's so hard to do.\"","Shen Meng struggled to lift her leg onto the railing.","Shen Yin went around correcting each person's form.","\"This is just the beginning. This railing isn't that high. Once you get used to it, we'll move to a higher one,\" Shen Yin said.","Zhengzheng was pouting nearby, thinking to himself that the railing was already too high for him, while the girls had lifted their legs onto it.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng can't reach,\" Zhengzheng said, walking back and forth under the railing.","Shen Yin...","Oops, she hadn't considered this little guy's height.","The other girls couldn't help but laugh, even as they tried to hold it in, straining with their legs raised.","\"Zhengzheng, be a good boy and do the horse stance over there, okay? Since you're a boy, the training will be different from the girls'. Just squat in the horse stance and count to 60.\"","\"1, 2, 3, 4, 5...40, 41, 44.\"","Qi Ji couldn't help but interject, \"What about 43?\"","Shen Yin looked towards Qi Ji and Shu Yi, who were standing at the very edge. The two of them hadn't noticed the celebrity behind them yet.","Qi Ji and Shu Yi were doing the exercises quite properly, holding the positions for a considerable amount of time, suggesting they likely had some dance training.","When they reached sixty, Zhengzheng came running over, and Shen Yin instructed the girls to switch to the other leg.","Zhengzheng looked around, left and right, and some more time passed.","\"Alright, let's move on to the next exercise.\""]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Seeing a Doctor at the Hospital","paragraphs":["In the afternoon, Shen Yin let them practice the moves again.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng's tummy is itchy,\" Zhengzheng ran up to her, lifted up his shirt, and revealed his pale belly, which had a few scratch marks.","\"When did it start itching?\" Shen Yin looked anxious.","Zhengzheng pondered for a moment, rubbed his tummy, and said, \"At noon.\"","The little one scratched occasionally, and the scratch marks grew more numerous. Shen Yin's mind went blank; she had never faced such a situation before. Little Bao was too young, and although she had some medical skills, she did not know how to handle this.","Shen Yin immediately called Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe also became anxious. Zhengzheng had been relatively healthy from a young age and had rarely fallen sick.","\"Okay, don't panic for now. The driver is outside, and I'm also driving to the children's dermatology hospital. Don't worry.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin hung up the phone and turned to her students, saying, \"You guys keep practicing. We'll have a group chat later. I have something to take care of, so I'll be gone for a bit.\"","Shen Yin held Zhengzheng and got into the car.","\"Zhengzheng, don't scratch, or you'll get scars.\"","Zhengzheng nodded.","Shen Yin held Zhengzheng with one hand and took out her phone with the other to search on Baidu.","\"Why does a baby's tummy itch?\"","There were many answers, and Shen Yin read one of them.","[A baby's itchy tummy can have many reasons. It could be a bacterial infection, a skin condition, or even an allergic reaction.]","Shen Yin recollected that Zhengzheng had not been exposed to anything abnormal recently, and even the pets were bathed daily.","The driver sensed Shen Yin's anxiety and drove rather quickly. When they arrived at the hospital, Xu Xiuhe was already there, having arranged for a doctor.","Several doctors came out to greet them.","Soon, the diagnosis was out: urticaria.","The doctor explained the treatment while applying ointment to Zhengzheng's rash.","\"Don't let the baby scratch, as it will only make the itching worse. The main reason is that scratching raises the local temperature, causing the blood to release more histamine (allergen), which will further aggravate the condition.\"","Shen Yin began to blame herself, wondering if she had not taken good enough care of Zhengzheng, leading to this illness.","Xu Xiuhe noticed Shen Yin's distraction and gently patted her shoulder, reassuring her not to blame herself too much.","The doctor, perceptive as well, continued, \"Urticaria in a two-year-old child is a swelling reaction caused by dilation and increased permeability of small blood vessels in the skin and mucous membranes. The main causes for a two-year-old child are infection, genetic factors, and physical stimuli. Infections can include viruses, bacteria, fungi, and parasites, such as viruses causing upper respiratory infections or hepatitis viruses, which can alter the body's reactivity and cause urticaria.","Genetic factors: If the baby's family has a history of urticaria, the baby's serum may contain a high concentration of a specific protein called IgE immunoglobulin, which is an intrinsic pathogenic factor for acute urticaria.","Physical stimuli: These include cold, heat, light, water, and mechanical pressure, such as immediate and delayed dermographic urticaria and delayed pressure urticaria. About 4% of people have dermographism, where firm stroking of the skin causes wheals and erythematous flares.\"","After all that, the only thing Xu Xiuhe heard was \"genetic.\"","If he remembered correctly, Xu Guimin, his biological father, had suffered from urticaria when Xu Xiuhe was young, and his mother had applied medication for Xu Guimin.","The difference was that Xu Guimin's urticaria had been on his back.","At the thought of it being genetic, Xu Xiuhe felt guilty, wondering why it wasn't passed on to him instead of having this young child suffer.","\"Don't worry too much. The baby's condition is not severe, and it was caught early. A few days of applying the ointment, and it will be fine. During the illness, the baby should minimize outdoor activities, as wind, cold, sweating, or friction can worsen the condition.\"","\"Will it recur?\" Shen Yin asked worriedly.","\"No, our chief is an authority in pediatric dermatology, and he personally developed this ointment,\" a younger doctor chimed in.","\"Does the baby need to follow a special diet?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"During the urticaria period, the baby should avoid spicy, stimulating, and high-protein foods like fish, shrimp, milk, chicken, garlic sprouts, mangoes, etc. Cucumber, carrots, sesame, apples, and bananas are suitable,\" the doctor replied.","Upon hearing the doctor's words, Xu Yunzheng, lying on the bed with his tummy exposed, immediately sat up.","\"Daddy, Mommy, Zhengzheng is no longer itchy. Zhengzheng is better,\" Xu Yunzheng said anxiously, wondering why he couldn't eat meat.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe naturally understood what the little one was thinking.","\"Zhengzheng, if you don't listen to the doctor, you'll get itchier,\" Shen Yin walked over and picked up Zhengzheng.","Zhengzheng became unhappy, tightly hugging Shen Yin's neck and burying his head in her shoulder.","Shen Yin felt sorry for him, gently patting his back and saying softly, \"In a few days, when you're better, we can eat meat again. Zhengzheng is a smart, good boy. As soon as you felt uncomfortable, you told Mommy. It's not severe, and you'll get better soon.\"","\"Mommy,\" Zhengzheng whimpered.","\"Don't worry, Mommy will make you something even more delicious than meat.\"","\"Okay.\"","The doctors watched the family of three, not daring to speak. This man was frequently in the news as a wealthy person. They dared not be negligent, as a single word of displeasure from him could result in him buying the hospital and firing them.","On the way back, it was getting late. Xu Xiuhe drove, while Shen Yin and Zhengzheng sat in the back.","Shen Yin had no time to think about the dream she had the previous night. Her mind was preoccupied with how to take care of Zhengzheng and prepare delicious meals for him.","\"Don't worry, everything will be fine,\" Xu Xiuhe reassured.","\"Okay.\"","\"You don't need to feel guilty. If anyone should feel guilty, it's me. My biological father had this illness, so it's not because you didn't take good care of Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin felt a little less guilty upon hearing this, but she still felt distressed, as what mother wouldn't worry about her child?","\"You and your father?\" Shen Yin asked cautiously.","\"He's only my father in name,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Do you have any feelings for him?\"","\"It's complicated. He used to treat me well, but ever since he brought his other son back...\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't finish, but Shen Yin could empathize with his situation.","They really do seem like it.","\"Yang Cui?\"","\"She was my father's former secretary.\"","Shen Yin recalled the woman she saw at the cafe when she first arrived here.","Indeed, she had a nice appearance and looked quite young, and seemed rather calculating.","\"She has ties with Zhou Man, or more precisely, Zhou Man and Xu Zhengyang have an unusual relationship.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin felt shocked. Indeed, the matter was not simple and was becoming increasingly complicated."]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: Carrot","paragraphs":["Shu Yi and Qi Ji sat slumped on the sofa. They had practiced all day at the Martial Arts Club, which also had a bathroom. After taking a shower, they realized Shen Yin had left with the Baby.","The other students said Shen Yin had taken Zhengzheng to the hospital, causing the two women to worry.","With no response to their messages, they didn't dare call Shen Yin, afraid of disturbing her, so they quietly waited.","As the students left, they approached Shu Yi for autographs. After the previous Weibo incident, they had all become her die-hard fans. They never expected to be in the same room as their idol, learning together—what a celestial experience!","There was a frenzy of idol-worshipping, each more intense than the last, calling out \"Wife!\"","Qi Ji was dumbfounded beside her. Well, Shu Yi was dumbfounded too. Previously, only her male fans called her \"wife,\" while her younger female fans called her \"daughter.\" But now, what was this about even the female fans calling her \"wife\"? What the heck?","\"You two haven't left yet.\"","Shen Yin entered the room, seeing the two looking dejected.","Upon seeing the family of three back, the two women immediately perked up, standing and running over to Shen Yin.","They gently pinched Zhengzheng's chubby little cheeks.","Zhengzheng showed no reaction.","\"What's the matter? Zhengzheng isn't happy?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"He's not happy. The doctor said he can't have any meat in the afternoon, and he's been unhappy since hearing that—hasn't said a word,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"What's wrong with him?\" Qi Ji looked concerned. The little guy was calling her \"Auntie\" yesterday and singing \"Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star.\" How did he get sick today?","\"Hives. He can't leave the room for a while. Luckily, the doctor said it's not serious and he'll be fine in a couple of days,\" Shen Yin said.","Hearing this, Qi Ji and Shu Yi felt relieved. A child so young, it would be heartbreaking if he suffered.","\"Then we'll head back,\" Shu Yi said.","\"Take it easy,\" Shen Yin advised.","\"Got it. Little Zhengzheng, get well soon. When you're better, Auntie will take you for meat every day,\" Shu Yi said.","\"Qi Ji, let me give you a ride.\"","Being taller than Qi Ji, Shu Yi put her arm around her.","\"Xue Jingrui is so lucky to have married a little wife like you. I envy him,\" Shu Yi joked.","\"Shu Yi, I envy your height so much. I dream of being tall,\" Qi Ji said.","As they chatted, they reached the carport behind the small building.","\"Petite and dainty, how lovely.\"","\"Sis, I want a Baby. I plan to climb into Xue Jingrui's bed tonight,\" Qi Ji said.","\"Whoa, girl!\" Shu Yi wanted to say she should think it over and not be so impulsive.","\"Qi Ji, time to go home.\" Xue Jingrui got out of the car and walked over.","Qi Ji waved at Shu Yi. \"Shu Yi, I'll head out first.\"","\"Yeah, be careful.\"","In the car, Qi Ji kept thinking about how to have a Baby.","Having read many comics, she knew what to do. But first, she needed an excuse, not to appear too obvious.","\"Xue Jingrui, are we going to the Old Mansion today?\" Qi Ji asked.","If they were staying at the Old Mansion tonight, it would be so convenient. She regretted not acting on the good opportunity last night.","\"What's on your mind? You seem so deep in thought,\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"Thinking of you,\" Qi Ji replied absentmindedly, without thinking.","Those two words completely flustered Xue Jingrui, who slammed on the brakes.","\"What's wrong, Xue Jingrui? There are cars behind us. Emergency braking like that isn't safe driving,\" Qi Ji reminded him.","\"It's nothing,\" he said, though his mind was racing. How could it be nothing when a sweet girl sitting beside him, her voice soft and sweet, said she was thinking of him?","What man could resist that?","Qi Ji didn't realize what she had just said. After Xue Jingrui restarted the car, she was still thinking about her little scheme.","When Shen Yin got home, she went to the kitchen. Zhengzheng couldn't have any chicken, fish, meat, or eggs now.","Recalling the doctor's advice, Shen Yin thought of carrots and cucumbers, which were in season, fresh, and inexpensive.","But Zhengzheng had never liked carrots, so Shen Yin came up with an idea. She took a fruit knife and carved for a while.","Soon, a little rabbit emerged.","Shen Yin boiled some carrot, taro, and red date porridge. The carved carrots were steamed and coated with desiccated coconut.","Banana cakes, apple puree, carrot porridge, fried cucumbers, mushroom and Chinese cabbage, and broccoli—the table was filled with vegetarian dishes, not a single meat dish.","When Zhengzheng sat at the table and saw no meat, he realized his mother wasn't just saying it—she really wasn't giving him any meat.","\"Ah!\" The baby sighed, his last glimmer of hope gone.","\"Zhengzheng, look at this. What is it?\" Shen Yin brought over the steamed carrots.","Little white rabbits in various poses were resting on the plate, looking adorable.","\"Little white rabbits, so white and bouncy, so cute!\" Zhengzheng clapped, finally smiling.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Zhengzheng, have a taste and see if it's good,\" Xu Xiuhe said, putting one of the rabbits on Xu Yunzheng's plate.","Xu Yunzheng patted the rabbit's head, then withdrew his hand. \"The rabbit is so cute. Why should I eat it?\"","Shen Yin...","\"Zhengzheng, this isn't a real rabbit. Your mom carved it from vegetables,\" Xu Xiuhe explained, not daring to say \"carrots\" directly.","\"What vegetable?\"","Shen Yin: \"Carrots.\"","\"Wahh, rabbits love carrots. But the carrots turned into rabbits. How can the rabbits eat carrots if the carrots are rabbits and the rabbits are carrots?\" Xu Yunzheng covered his face, staring at the plate of rabbits, lost in thought.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were also perplexed. Carrots are carrots, rabbits are rabbits. The carrots turned into rabbits, so they were eating the carrot-turned-rabbits.","After figuring it out, Xu Xiuhe didn't mind whether Xu Yunzheng ate it or not. He would eat them himself—they were too cute not to eat.","Xu Xiuhe took one for himself.","The carrots were steamed for a long time, making them slightly soft. The desiccated coconut coating melted in the mouth, while the unseasoned boiled carrots had a slightly sweet taste without being greasy.","Xu Xiuhe was not fond of eating, but today he surprisingly ate, and ate quite a bit.","Xu Yunzheng, watching his father eat so heartily, finally couldn't resist. He lowered his head and took a bite off the carrot \"bunny's\" head.","Unexpectedly, it didn't taste bad.","The little one picked up the whole carrot and munched it down, bite by bite.","\"Mommy, the bunny carrot is kind of tasty.\"","\"How about compared to meat?\"","\"Meat is better!\" The toddler didn't even think twice. Nothing could compare to meat; meat was always the most delicious.","...","In the end, Xue Jingrui didn't take Qi Ji back to the Old Mansion, fearing his mother would constantly feed him nourishing soups, which would make him have nosebleeds that he couldn't withstand."]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: All set","paragraphs":["After dinner, Xue Jingrui cleaned up everything, prepared fruits for Qi Ji, and got the water ready that Qi Ji would drink later that night. When he returned to his room, he reminded Qi Ji to go to bed early.","\"Okay, I got it, Brother Jingrui,\" Qi Ji said, but she was not paying much attention, as she was still thinking about her plans for the night.","In the group chat with the three of them, only Shen Yin and Shu Yi were chatting enthusiastically.","[Yin Yin, our little friend Qi Ji is going to take action tonight.]","[What action?]","[She said she wants to have a baby.]","Upon seeing the message, Shen Yin's first reaction was to @ Qi Ji.","[@Little miracle, come online for a bit.]","Two minutes passed, but there was still no reply.","[Oh wow, this little rascal must have really taken action, not even looking at her phone now.]","Shen Yin [.............]","[What should we do, Yin Yin? Is Qi Ji being too impulsive?]","Shen Yin thought Qi Ji was being a bit impulsive, but the choice was hers to make. Life's path is one that each person chooses for themselves, and no one else can make that decision for them.","[Qi Ji is a girl with her own thoughts, don't worry about her.]","After sending the message, Shen Yin went to apply medicine to Zhengzheng, to prevent the little one from scratching his belly with his hands.","When they returned in the afternoon, as soon as they reached the third floor, Xu Xiuhe had trimmed Xu Yunzheng's fingernails.","In fact, both of them kept their eyes on the little one, taking turns watching him, afraid that he might scratch himself and make his condition worse.","\"Zhengzheng, bear with it a little longer. We'll put the medicine on and then you can go to sleep and rest. You'll be fine in a couple of days,\" Shen Yin said soothingly as she applied the ointment to Zhengzheng.","At 11 PM, Qi Ji estimated that Xue Jingrui should be ready to sleep soon.","She tiptoed from the living room to Xue Jingrui's bedroom door, gently twisted the doorknob, and to her surprise, it wasn't locked.","In fact, she had already found the keys and considered various methods, afraid that her plan might not succeed.","Qi Ji felt that after finally mustering up the courage, she couldn't back down now. For the sake of the baby, she had to make some sacrifices and not hesitate.","With a burst of determination, Qi Ji approached the bedside. By the moonlight from outside, she could see where Xue Jingrui was lying on the bed.","She quietly climbed onto the bed, silently chanting to herself, \"Don't be nervous, you've done your homework, this is the only chance, just this one time, and you'll have the baby.\"","As Qi Ji motivated herself, she slowly inched closer to Xue Jingrui.","The air conditioning was on in the room, and Xue Jingrui was covered with a blanket. It wasn't until Qi Ji pulled the blanket that he sensed something.","He was in a daze from sleep, only waking up a bit when someone tugged at his blanket. Could it be Qi Ji's cat wandering into his room at night?","\"Watermelon, don't move, I want to sleep,\" the man said as he pulled the blanket back, intending to go back to sleep.","Qi Ji didn't dare move, thinking that Brother Jingrui had woken up, but little did she know that he had mistaken her for the cat.","After a few seconds, when Qi Ji felt that the man had fallen asleep again, she continued her actions, being even more careful than before.","She had even deliberately worn a spaghetti strap dress, and wasn't wearing any underwear, fully prepared for the endeavor, leaving nothing to chance.","After covering herself with the blanket, Qi Ji inched closer to Xue Jingrui, until she was right next to him.","Xue Jingrui didn't react, so she dared to move even closer, until their bodies were pressed together.","Her fingers lightly brushed against the skin on Xue Jingrui's waist.","Perhaps feeling a bit ticklish, Xue Jingrui turned over, facing Qi Ji.","What should she do next? Qi Ji wondered, as she had only planned up to this point, but hadn't thought about how to proceed.","Qi Ji curled up, like a little kitten, not daring to move.","Thinking it was Watermelon the cat again, Xue Jingrui reached out his hand, intending to push the cat aside, but coincidentally, his hand landed on Qi Ji's head.","At the same time, he seemed to realize that Watermelon's fur had never felt like this before.","\"Watermelon, Watermelon,\" he called out.","\"Meow, meow,\" Qi Ji responded in a falsetto voice, imitating Watermelon's usual meows.","Xue Jingrui felt it again, lightly patting it, until he finally realized something was off.","Opening his eyes, he said, \"Qi Ji?\"","Qi Ji felt a bit embarrassed, having been recognized so quickly.","\"Brother, you're not asleep yet? How did you know I wasn't Watermelon?\" Qi Ji's voice was small and soft.","Xue Jingrui replied, \"I'm not stupid.\"","A grown person like her, he should have realized it earlier. Moreover, he could still tell the difference between hair and a cat's fur.","\"It's so late, why did you come to my room?\"","\"Um, Brother Jingrui, I, I...\" Qi Ji stammered, unsure of how to explain herself.","\"What's wrong with you? Is the air conditioning broken in your room? Why are you feeling so hot?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"No, no, the air conditioning is fine.\"","\"Did you have a nightmare then? Are you scared?\"","\"Ah yes, yes, I had a nightmare, I was scared, Brother Jingrui, you're so perceptive.\"","Xue Jingrui felt pleased and accomplished.","But he felt that he might not be able to sleep tonight, with this little girl lying next to him, and after he had consumed so many nourishing soups during the day, his body was even hotter than Qi Ji's.","\"Don't be afraid, sleep peacefully. Dreams are the opposite of reality. I'm right here, no need to be scared,\" Xue Jingrui said as he shifted to the side. So that was Qi Ji's hand on his waist earlier.","He couldn't think about it, or the more he thought, the worse it would become.","\"Brother Jingrui, why don't you ask me what kind of dream I had?\"","\"What kind of scary dream did Qi Ji have?\"","\"I dreamed that I couldn't have children, it was so terrifying. Wah wah wah, babies are so adorable, why can't I have one?\"","Xue Jingrui's heart sank. What the hell, that's such a weird dream.","\"Dreams are the opposite of reality. Qi Ji is healthy, how could she not be able to have babies?\"","\"Really?\"","\"Really.\"","\"So when can I have a baby?\"","Xue Jingrui: \"...........\"","\"When does Qi Ji want to have one?\"","\"Now.\"","Upon hearing this, Xue Jingrui's heart skipped a beat. Was she implying something?","\"Does Qi Ji really like babies that much?\"","\"Yes, babies like Zhengzheng are so cute, calling me 'auntie' and singing songs for me.\"","Xue Jingrui...","\"Having a child is a decision between two people.\"","\"I know, that's why I came to find you. What's wrong, Brother Xue Jingrui? Don't you want to have a child? I'm sorry, I was too selfish and didn't consider your thoughts carefully.\" Qi Ji seemed a little lost. Well, this was her fault, she hadn't asked Brother Xue Jingrui's opinion.","Qi Ji got up from the bed, preparing to return to her own room. It seemed that the dream she casually made up came true, and she really couldn't have a child.","Qi Ji knelt on one knee, stretching out one foot to find her slippers.","The white figure showed a sense of loss.","It took Xue Jingrui several seconds to react. He grabbed Qi Ji's ankle, not meaning what she thought.","\"Qi Ji, you misunderstood me. I do want to have a child.\""]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: The East Wind has Arrived","paragraphs":["\"Have you thought it over?\"","\"Is it okay? If it's a girl, we'll bring Zhengzheng over later. Having such a daughter-in-law would be great. Don't let the good water flow outside.\"","Xue Jingrui...","He found himself struggling to keep up with Qi Ji's thought process.","\"Are you ready?\" Xue Jingrui still felt that Qi Ji was a bit too young, and if he really...","wouldn't it be a bit beastly?","\"Anything for the baby,\" Qi Ji said.","Xue Jingrui hesitated for a moment. He originally wanted to know if Qi Ji was doing this solely for the sake of a child, but then he recalled the conversation from the previous day.","He also thought about the example of Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin. Feelings can be cultivated slowly. For now, they could take it one step at a time, and figure out the rest later.","With a tug from Xue Jingrui, Qi Ji landed back on the bed.","\"Brother Jingrui, I checked my dates on the Mei You app. It's very suitable, with a high probability.\"","\"What dates?\"","\"Ovulation period.\"","\"But what if it doesn't work the first time?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","This question stumped Qi Ji, as she hadn't considered this possibility before. She thought she should have no trouble getting pregnant. Is it really that difficult to conceive? She hadn't looked into it.","\"I'm healthy, sleep and wake up early, and have a regular routine. There shouldn't be any problems,\" Qi Ji explained.","Xue Jingrui...","So it would come down to his own ability. If she couldn't get pregnant, would it be his fault?","If that's the case, he would have to perform well. His body wasn't bad, and he wasn't too old. If it didn't work the first time, they could try again.","\"Wait for me here, I'll turn on a light.\"","\"Brother Jingrui, don't turn it on!\" Qi Ji exclaimed.","Xue Jingrui...","Could he say he wouldn't be able to do it?","\"Okay, no lights. Wait for me, I'll go drink some water.\"","Qi Ji nodded.","Xue Jingrui took his phone and stepped outside, frantically searching online. He regretted not acquiring more knowledge earlier.","That way, he wouldn't have to learn everything at the last minute.","\"Don't rush, don't be hasty, be gentle, be tender...\" The answers flooded in.","After a few minutes, when Xue Jingrui felt he had learned enough, he returned to the bedroom.","Qi Ji had been waiting obediently.","There was still a difference between theory and practice, but Xue Jingrui studied diligently.","\"I've never done this before, so I need to learn.\"","Hearing this, Qi Ji felt inexplicably happy.","\"Brother Jingrui, where's the watermelon?\"","\"The watermelon is outside.\"","Xue Jingrui took the opportunity to lower the air conditioning temperature.","\"It's summer now, be mindful of the heat. Drink more water. Keep me at the top of your contacts list.\"","Qi Ji understood immediately.","She no longer felt uncomfortable.","She wanted the baby herself, so no matter how difficult or tiring it became, she had to persevere. One shouldn't abandon something halfway.","\"Can the baby's father be anyone, or only me?\" Xue Jingrui asked, clearly concerned about the answer.","Qi Ji's last trace of consciousness remained. She hadn't considered this question before. Now that Xue Jingrui had asked, she pondered it. There was no one else, she hadn't thought about anyone else.","\"Only you.\"","Hearing this, Xue Jingrui...","\"You must be tired. That's enough for today.\" Xue Jingrui didn't continue. After several attempts, following the advice he had found online, it was more than enough.","Instead of rushing Qi Ji to take a shower, he placed a pillow under her lower back.","\"Brother Jingrui, is it over?\" Qi Ji's voice was soft and gentle.","In the moonlight, Xue Jingrui could see Qi Ji's expression.","He couldn't bear to continue, the poor girl was so delicate.","\"You're almost out of it, Qi Ji,\" he said softly.","\"We don't need to finish everything in one night. We have a long way to go, let's take it slow. Don't rush.\" Xue Jingrui reassured her.","Qi Ji nodded with difficulty, she was too tired.","Xue Jingrui went to the bathroom, filled a basin with water, and brought a towel to wipe Qi Ji's body.","He still didn't turn on the lights, afraid the brightness would disturb her sleep.","The next morning, before Qi Ji woke up, she felt something on her body.","Did Xue Jingrui's words from the previous night turn out to be lies?","\"Reinforcing it will help with getting pregnant.\"","Later, when the man went to work, Qi Ji sat on the couch for a long time. When she opened her phone, she saw 99+ notifications in the group chat.","She scrolled through them one by one, finding that most were calling for her. Feeling ashamed, she replied immediately.","[Sisters, I was a bit busy last night and didn't have my phone. I think Zhengzheng is about to become my daughter-in-law.]","[Wow, Qi Ji, you move so fast?]","[I'm a woman of action. Just wait, Zhengzheng will be my daughter-in-law.]","[Mother-in-law @Shen Yin]","[Qi Ji, have you considered that you might be carrying a baby boy right now?] Shu Yi remarked.","[Sister Shu Yi, I think it's probably a little girl.] Qi Ji replied.","[......] Shen Yin sent a string of ellipses.","[How many times?]","Qi Ji looked at Shu Yi's message and carefully recalled last night.","And this morning too.","[4 times]","[6 times, that's way too much.] Shu Yi exclaimed.","Qi Ji blushed, hugging the watermelon, \"Watermelon, you're going to have a little sister.\"","Shen Yin had been keeping Zhengzheng company in the small building. Since winning the embroidery competition, her studio had received a large influx of business.","Shen Yin felt she couldn't handle that many gown orders, so she imposed a limit. Now, appointments were booked until the Mid-Autumn Festival.","With about 20 days left until the national embroidery finals, Shen Yin wasn't in a hurry. Her skills were evident, and she wasn't worried at all. The most important thing now was taking good care of Zhengzheng and helping her recover.","There was also the matter of the dream she had the other night. She had no clue about it, so as a precaution, she decided not to go out for the time being.","With five dogs guarding the entrance, the house was very safe.","Wang Nannan sent a message, and Shen Yin, carrying Zhengzheng, went upstairs.","\"Boss, there's a custom gown order with quite a few requirements. I'm not sure if the design I sketched meets the specifications. Could you please take a look?\" Wang Nannan showed the design to Shen Yin, who also reviewed the customer's requirements.","\"Modify the neckline a bit, no shallow V-neck, a deep V-neck would be better. Use embroidery for the skirt. I'll embroider it later, then have them sew it on.\"","\"Got it, thank you, Boss.\"","Wang Nannan had learned a lot working at the studio recently, and of course, her salary was high too.","This boss, Shen Yin, was truly skilled. Wang Nannan eagerly anticipated the upcoming national competition.","As long as Shen Yin wins the national competition, she and her studio will gain nationwide fame, and her customers will no longer be limited to just those from Rong City.","Working with an excellent boss like this, Wang Nannan believes her prospects are promising. As long as she works hard, one day she too will become an excellent designer.","Just like her boss's embroidery, which is renowned nationwide.","Shen Yin has applied more medication to Zhengzheng's tummy. Today she examined Zhengzheng's belly and found it looking a little better than yesterday. She believes in a few more days, Zhengzheng will have fully recovered.","\"Is Zhengzheng's tummy still itchy today?\""]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: The Purpose of the Body","paragraphs":["\"Itchy, mommy, Zhengzheng's tummy feels so itchy.\"","\"Then let's cover Zhengzheng's tummy with clothes, and it won't be itchy anymore.\" Shen Yin adjusted Zhengzheng's clothing properly.","Zhengzheng was two weeks and three months old now, and Shen Yin decided that she couldn't waste Zhengzheng's intelligence. As the saying goes, parents are a child's best teachers, so she thought she'd teach Zhengzheng some knowledge first.","But then she reconsidered and decided on early education games instead.","Shen Yin immediately went online and searched for some early education games for two-week-old babies, including games to train memory and physical abilities.","Shen Yin recalled her own childhood, well, she had no memories before the age of four or five, except for going to pick pears from the tree in her uncle's backyard with her cousin, and then falling off. Both of them were chased and beaten by her grandfather.","A clearer memory was her grandfather teaching her martial arts.","There were all sorts of early education games online, and Shen Yin found them quite interesting.","\"Zhengzheng, how about we play a game together?\"","\"Okay.\"","\"This game is called 'Body Parts and Their Uses'. I'll point to different parts of your body, and you tell me the name and what it's used for, alright?\"","\"If Zhengzheng answers correctly, will there be a reward?\" Xu Yunzheng looked up expectantly for Shen Yin's response.","Shen Yin smiled. This little kid already knew how to bargain at such a young age? And he even knew to ask for rewards, just like his father Xu Xiuhe.","\"What kind of reward does Zhengzheng want?\"","\"Mommy, will you promise Zhengzheng?\"","Shen Yin dared not agree rashly. Nine out of ten times, this kid would probably want meat for lunch as a reward. If she promised but couldn't deliver at lunchtime, wouldn't that be going back on her word in front of the child?","\"Let mommy guess what reward Zhengzheng wants, okay?\"","Zhengzheng nodded.","\"Does Zhengzheng want to have some meat for lunch?\"","Zhengzheng opened his eyes wide in disbelief. He hadn't said anything, so how did his mommy know?","\"Mommy, how did you know? Mommy is so amazing.\"","\"Because Zhengzheng is mommy's precious baby, and we share the same blood flowing through our veins, so mommy understands Zhengzheng and can immediately tell what Zhengzheng is thinking.\"","\"Then why can't Zhengzheng know what mommy is thinking?\"","\"That's because Zhengzheng is still little. When Zhengzheng grows up, he'll be able to know what mommy is thinking too.\"","Zhengzheng nodded, half understanding and half not. \"Mommy, can you promise Zhengzheng then?\"","Shen Yin shook her head and chuckled, \"Baby, we can have it once your tummy isn't itchy anymore.\"","The little one looked a bit disappointed, but recovered a few seconds later, saying, \"Mommy, let's play the game. If Zhengzheng wins, he gets rewarded with reciting a poem.\"","Shen Yin: \"Hmm?\" What a treat that would be. It seemed her little treasure was eager to learn.","\"Let's start the game.\" Shen Yin pointed at Xu Yunzheng's nose.","\"Nose.\"","\"What's the use of a nose?\"","\"Zhengzheng's nose can breathe.\"","\"Besides breathing, what else is it used for?\"","Xu Yunzheng sniffed his nose and said, \"Besides breathing, I haven't smelled any fragrance yet.\"","Shen Yin then pointed at Zhengzheng's eyes.","\"These are eyes. Eyes can see people. If I cover them, I can't see mommy anymore.\" Xu Yunzheng covered his eyes with his hands.","\"Anything else?\"","\"Eyes cry when they're not happy.\"","\"Hahahahaha.\" The child's description was so amusing that Shen Yin laughed for a while before saying, \"It's not that the eyes are unhappy, but rather the heart is unhappy, and the eyes express that. The eyes, you see, are the windows to the soul. Eyes are extremely, extremely important for us, so Zhengzheng must protect his eyes well.\"","\"Windows to the soul?\""]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: The Lin Family of Yangcheng","paragraphs":["\"Mom, Zhengzheng understands.\" Zhengzheng nodded, his little hands moving with his nodding motion.","Shen Yin didn't know if Zhengzheng really understood, but looking at the baby doll's little expression, Shen Yin suddenly felt very satisfied.","As long as Zhengzheng was healthy and happy every day, she didn't hope for anything else.","\"Mom, your phone is ringing,\" Zhengzheng said suddenly.","Shen Yin listened carefully, and it was indeed ringing. Zhengzheng's little ears were sharper.","\"Okay, Mom will take the call.\"","Shen Yin picked up the phone and answered.","On the video call, Fang Yue's complexion had improved significantly compared to before.","Shen Yin hadn't been to see them since her last visit, and Fang Yue probably missed her.","\"Yin, how have you been recently?\" Fang Yue asked on the other end of the call.","\"Mom, I've been doing well. How about you? How's Dad's health?\"","After Shen Yin asked, another person suddenly appeared in the video.","\"Yin, don't worry, Dad is fine. Dad's health has mostly recovered,\" said Shen Tianzheng with a slightly excited tone.","Zhengzheng ran over, pulled Shen Yin's hand, gesturing for her to sit down. Shen Yin sat on the sofa, and Zhengzheng leaned in, his little face taking up the entire screen.","\"Grandma, do you miss Zhengzheng?\"","Hearing this, Fang Yue's face lit up with joy. \"Let me see, I miss my precious grandson.\"","Fang Yue leaned towards the camera again, adjusting her position to look at Zhengzheng.","\"It's Zhengzheng! Grandma misses Zhengzheng so much, so very much. Does Zhengzheng miss Grandma?\"","\"Grandma, Zhengzheng misses Grandma too, and wants to eat the meat that Grandma cooks.\"","Saying this, even Shen Yin, who was next to him, never expected that a child's next words could be so unpredictable.","\"Is that so? Then Grandma will come and cook meat for you to eat tomorrow.\"","\"Okay. Thank you, Grandma.\" Zhengzheng was overjoyed, nodding vigorously.","\"Yin, have you been very busy recently? Your dad has mostly recovered, so I can go over and help take care of Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin: \"Mom, you just take care of Dad. I'm not too busy these days and can take care of Zhengzheng. Someone needs to be with Dad, you don't need to come over.\"","\"What?\" Fang Yue looked puzzled and turned to Shen Tianzheng.","\"Yin, I heard from your brother that you participated in an embroidery competition and won an award. It must have been very strenuous, right?\" Fang Yue felt a little sorry for her daughter.","She knew that Shen Yin had never been exposed to embroidery since childhood, so if she could do embroidery now, she must have learned it only after going abroad.","In just three or four years, she had already won an award. It must be because of her exceptional talent. Fang Yue knew her daughter was intelligent. However, embroidery is a technical and artistic craft. To achieve success, one needs to practice diligently. She estimated that her daughter Yin must have endured many hardships, practicing every day to win the award.","\"It wasn't too strenuous.\"","\"Your dad and I will go and see you and Zhengzheng. It's been too long since we last saw you.\"","\"Yes, we'll go and see you,\" Shen Tianzheng chimed in.","\"Mom, no need. Dad's health has just recovered, and he needs to rest. I'll take Zhengzheng to visit you both after some time.\"","\"Mom, why do we have to wait some time before we can go?\" Zhengzheng asked from beside her.","Fang Yue and Shen Tianzheng also wanted to know, as they couldn't wait to hold their grandson.","\"Zhengzheng forgot, you can't go out for a few days,\" Shen Yin turned and told Zhengzheng.","\"What happened? Did something happen to Zhengzheng that he can't go out?\"","Fang Yue looked worried in the video.","\"It's nothing major, just a few rashes on his tummy. The doctor said it's not serious, but it's better not to go out.\"","\"I see. Well, let Zhengzheng rest properly then,\" Fang Yue said, though she had other plans in mind.","After hanging up, Shen Yin pondered what to make for lunch.","\"Mom, Grandma said she'll come and cook meat for Zhengzheng tomorrow.\"","\"You little glutton, just hold on for a few more days. Once it's better, Grandma has to take care of Grandpa, so she won't have time to come over tomorrow.\"","Zhengzheng's little expression showed a momentary disappointment, but then he quickly recovered. If he hadn't mentioned the rash, would the outcome have been different?","\"Mom, the food you make for lunch will be even more delicious than meat. Does Zhengzheng believe it?\"","Zhengzheng nodded.","Shen Yin decided to show off her cooking skills. She couldn't let the little one down.","Meanwhile, at the company, Xu Xiuhe was thinking about his son and wife.","There was a knock on the door.","\"Come in.\"","\"Sir, please sign these documents.\"","Xu Xiuhe signed them without even looking.","\"Sir, aren't you going to take a look?\" Liu Bo asked.","\"You've been working with me for so many years. Can't I trust you? You handle things well, and you even have a stake in the company. What do I have to worry about?\"","Liu Bo realized, he was right. He did handle things reliably.","\"Sir, regarding our recent collaboration with the Lin Group in Yang City, it was supposed to be a done deal, but right before we were about to sign the contract, the Lin Group suddenly said they need to reconsider.\"","Xu Xiuhe: \"We've been working on this collaboration for a long time, and everything was going well. Why the sudden reconsideration right before signing the contract?\"","This was the main reason Liu Bo had come to see Xu Xiuhe. The collaboration was indeed important, and it was understandable that the Lin Group wanted to reconsider, but if they reconsidered right before signing the contract, he had to be more cautious.","\"Sir, we've got a new competitor all of a sudden.\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe twirled his pen, signaling Liu Bo to continue.","The Xu Group had been developing well in Rong City. In just a few years, this enterprise had made a name for itself nationwide. However, there was one shortcoming – the Xu Group's industries were too concentrated in Rong City.","For an enterprise to develop and prosper in the long run, it must expand and extend its industries to neighboring cities.","The Xu Group, as a rising star, had already become quite strong. Xu Xiuhe had established a solid foundation in Rong City. The next step was to develop the industries in other cities, which required collaboration.","The Lin Group, as an old and well-established local enterprise in Yang City, had enjoyed remarkable development in recent years.","Enterprises need innovation, and as times progress, enterprises must also advance. Many old-school enterprises had stagnated in their development.","After extensive research, the Lin Group in Yang City has indeed proven to be the best choice for a partner with the Heyuan Group.","\"This competitor is none other than the Xu Group.\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe paused briefly. Ah, so that's what this was all about. He understood everything now.","The Xu Group had been deliberately trying to undermine the Heyuan Group's business for the past couple of years, sticking their nose into every deal. Whenever the Heyuan Group acquired land or a project, the Xu Group would also bid on it.","Although the Xu Group hadn't won very often, their persistent meddling was like a stubborn rash that couldn't be scratched away, utterly vexing."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Helping Each Other","paragraphs":["\"As always, do everything to the best of your ability, and make them admit defeat wholeheartedly,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Got it, so the estimated time for signing the contract will likely be pushed back,\" Liu Bo replied.","\"No problem. Efficiency is important when doing things, but quality and stability are also crucial. Many things can't be accomplished with a single push. Including finding a partner for you - don't rush it, I'm already searching for you. Take it slow.\"","Liu Bo...he had nothing to say, only hoping that the CEO wouldn't bring up this matter again. He was still pondering over it.","Yesterday, while working overtime, he overheard Xiao Li'er answering a call. Her parents, Mr. and Mrs. Xiao, told Xiao Li'er to bring her boyfriend home this Friday evening.","He thought Xiao Li'er would come to find him, devise a way for him to pretend to be her boyfriend again. But he waited all day, and that woman acted as if nothing had happened, carrying on as usual.","Why didn't she come to him? Would he refuse? He was a kind-hearted, helpful young man. Moreover, Xiao Li'er was his subordinate employee. If she asked him for help, he would certainly oblige.","Why did she even bother getting him involved in the first place? Now her parents had already met him and knew he was her boyfriend. If he stood them up again, wouldn't that be rude and leave a bad impression?","Liu Bo left Xu Xiuhe's office and walked to the assistant's work area, saying, \"Xiao Li, come to my office for a moment.\"","Xiao Li'er watched Liu Bo's retreating figure entering the office.","The other assistants in the work area joked, \"We've noticed that Special Assistant Liu always looks for our Li'er whenever he needs something. Our little Li'er has really been working hard lately.\"","Yang Mo chimed in, \"That's right, our Li'er has been so busy lately.\"","As Xiao Li'er entered the office, Liu Bo was looking at his computer, not raising his head.","In reality, the moment Xiao Li'er walked in, he had glanced at her from the corner of his eye.","\"Special Assistant Liu, you were looking for me?\"","\"Yeah, there's a table over there. Take a look at these documents and point out any unreasonable parts.\"","Xiao Li'er went over and sat down, resigned to her task.","In the office, Xu Xiuhe was on the phone, speaking respectfully.","\"Xiuhe, you're not busy now, are you?\"","\"No, Mother, I'm not busy.\"","\"I'm interrupting you - I just spoke with Yin this morning. There's something I need your help with.\"","\"Mother, tell me. If I can help, I certainly will.\"","Now that his relationship with Shen Yin had changed, Fang Yue was truly kind to Shen Yin. Since his mother-in-law was asking for his help, he had to agree.","\"It's nothing major. Xiuhe, do you have any talented, accomplished young friends around your age?\" Fang Yue clarified further.","\"It's like this, you see. Yin has a cousin, my niece, who's already 27 but has never dated before. I was thinking of arranging a blind date for her, but she has high standards. She's met many potential matches so far, but none were suitable. So I wanted to ask you - as an outstanding individual yourself, you must have many men around you who are just as exceptional.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt pleased as his mother-in-law praised him.","\"Alright, let me ask around. I'll get back to you tonight.\"","\"Okay, thank you for the trouble, Xiuhe.\"","\"Mother, it's no trouble at all.\"","Sometimes, what you think about comes true. For instance, he had just told Liu Bo that he would find him a partner, and now an opportunity had presented itself.","The issue was, he had never met the woman. What if she wasn't very impressive? He couldn't go and set Liu Bo up for disappointment.","Adhering to the principle of not betraying those around him, Xu Xiuhe called Shen Yin.","\"Have you eaten?\"","\"Just finished. What's up?\"","\"I miss you.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Daddy, Zhengzheng misses you too. Zhengzheng has been a good boy and listened to Mommy. Zhengzheng ate vegetables for lunch and played games with Mommy.\" The little one rattled off several sentences at once.","Xu Xiuhe waited for the child to finish before praising Zhengzheng.","\"Wife, do you remember your cousin?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin thought for a few seconds before saying, \"Fang Ningning? Why are you suddenly asking about her?\"","\"Are you jealous?\" Xu Xiuhe teased.","Shen Yin's face flushed. Who was jealous? She certainly wouldn't be jealous.","\"No, don't accuse me. How did you conclude that I'm jealous? I'm just normally curious.\"","\"Fine, my mistake. It's because Mother called me and asked if I had any accomplished young men around my age to introduce to your cousin. I thought Liu Bo would be a suitable match.\"","Shen Yin searched her memory for her impression of Fang Ningning. She vaguely recalled something.","\"She's quite attractive and capable, just a bit spoiled. Otherwise, she's alright. When I was in high school and she was in college, she would often buy things and come to my school to see me.\"","\"Then why hasn't she found a partner at 28 years old?\"","\"I'm not too sure about that.\"","\"Well, as long as she's not a bad person, that's fine. I'll tell Mother to introduce Liu Bo to her. Don't underestimate Liu Bo just because he's a special assistant. In fact, he's been with me since I started the company and even has shares.\"","\"I couldn't tell,\" Shen Yin replied.","Xu Xiuhe felt a sense of pride as he made a call to Liu Bo. He wanted to prove that he wasn't just making empty promises earlier - he was taking action, and he had indeed found a potential match.","\"Boss.\"","\"Liu Bo, get ready for a blind date in the coming days.\"","This was the first time Liu Bo felt that Xu Xiuhe wasn't just making empty promises.","\"A blind date?\" Liu Bo purposely said out loud.","At the desk nearby, Xiao Li'er perked up her ears.","\"My wife's cousin, a year younger than you. She's not bad. Find some time to meet her.\"","\"Your wife's cousin?\"","Xu Xiuhe suddenly realized that if they ended up together, Liu Bo would become his cousin-in-law. He would have to address Liu Bo using a lower honorific.","\"Yeah, find some time to meet her. I'm such a great boss that I'm even introducing my sister-in-law to you.\"","Liu Bo glanced at Xiao Li'er, who happened to be looking at him as well. Their eyes met briefly before Xiao Li'er averted her gaze.","\"Thank you, Boss. As you know, I've been busy with the contract negotiations lately. Let's discuss this in a couple of days.\"","\"You make time for it. You must go. If you don't want to, give me a valid reason by tonight.\" Xu Xiuhe hung up abruptly.","Liu Bo was taken aback by the abrupt end to the call, his expression showing disbelief.","Xiao Li'er acted as if nothing had happened and continued reviewing the documents.","\"Ahem, ahem. Don't you have anything to say?\" Liu Bo asked.","In response, Xiao Li'er shook her head.","\"You didn't receive a call from your parents, asking you to bring me home? How did you respond to them?\"","Xiao Li'er said at the time that she was too busy with work and brushed it off.","\"I told them I was too busy with work and didn't have time.\"","\"Nothing more?\"","Xiao Li'er nodded.","\"You heard the call just now. I need to find a suitable excuse. How about this - you pretend to be my girlfriend, and I'll pretend to be your boyfriend. That way, we can both get by.\""]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: A Journey to Yang City","paragraphs":["Xiao Li'er was pondering the feasibility of this plan.","\"Okay, let's do it this way. You keep looking at the files.\"","Liu Bo left the office and knocked on Xu Xiuhe's office door again.","\"Come in.\"","\"President.\"","\"You're here. Have you found a good excuse or decided to go to the blind date?\" Xu Xiuhe looked up and asked.","\"President, I have a partner now,\" Liu Bo said carefully.","\"Oh?\" Xu Xiuhe didn't quite believe it, his tone full of doubt.","\"Tell me, who is it?\" Xu Xiuhe asked again.","\"Xiao Li'er.\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe's expression changed immediately, which was completely different from what he had imagined.","\"Didn't you tell me last time that you two could never be together? It's only been a few days. Did I hear it wrong?\"","Liu Bo dared not make a sound. Sometimes things couldn't be judged too early, and feelings couldn't be foreseen.","\"Should I believe you?\" Xu Xiuhe asked again.","\"Believe me.\"","\"Alright, you can go back.\"","Xu Xiuhe's tone was indifferent, and his emotion couldn't be read. He didn't want to talk anymore. The two of them had been arguing not long ago, and now they were together right under his nose.","Was it because he hadn't been paying attention to his employees' lives recently, or had they hidden it too well from him?","Xu Xiuhe couldn't stop thinking about this matter even when he returned home that night.","\"What's the matter? What are you thinking about? You seem absent-minded,\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I was going to introduce Liu Bo to your cousin for a blind date, but today he said he has a partner.\"","\"Who is it?\" Shen Yin was also curious.","\"Xiao Li'er. They were arguing just a while ago, and now they're together. Do you think it's true or false?\"","Shen Yin...","She knew that Xu Xiuhe was quite gossipy, but she didn't expect him to be so gossipy at heart.","\"Did Liu Bo tell you himself?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, yes. I suspect he's just using Xiao Li'er as an excuse to avoid the blind date.\"","The more Xu Xiuhe said it, the more he felt he was right. It must be like that.","\"No quarrel, no acquaintance. Maybe they are just a pair of fated lovers,\" Shen Yin said.","\"You make a good point.\"","\"Let's eat.\"","\"Daddy, Xu Yunzheng played a game with Mommy today.\"","\"What game was it? Can Xu Yunzheng tell Daddy about it so Daddy can learn and play with Xu Yunzheng next time?\" Xu Xiuhe responded to Xu Yunzheng.","\"The use of the body.\"","Xu Yunzheng ran to Xu Xiuhe's side, pointed to Xu Xiuhe's mouth, and asked, \"Daddy, what is this?\"","\"Mouth.\"","\"What can the mouth do?\" The little one's voice was soft and sweet, and his expression looked like he could speak.","\"The mouth can eat and talk.\"","\"Anything else?\" Xu Yunzheng touched his own mouth.","\"It can also taste the flavor of food and breathe fresh air.\"","\"Daddy is so great.\" The little one looked admiring and clapped his hands.","\"What about the eyes?\"","\"The eyes can see all kinds of beautiful things. Like Xu Yunzheng's eyes are telling Daddy that Xu Yunzheng is hungry now.\"","\"Wow!\" Xu Yunzheng exclaimed. He didn't say he was hungry, but his eyes were talking, how amazing!","\"Mommy said the eyes are the windows to the soul. Mommy told Xu Yunzheng to protect his eyes.\"","\"Mommy is right. We should protect our eyes.\"","Father and son chatted casually.","Shen Yin didn't want to interrupt and quietly brought the food to the dining table.","\"This Saturday, I need to go to Yang City.\"","\"On a business trip?\"","\"Yeah, there's a collaboration with a company in Yang City that requires me to go there in person.\"","\"Xu Yunzheng should have recovered by then. I'll go too and check on Master Kang's furniture progress.\"","\"Okay, then we'll go together.\"","\"Mommy, Xu Yunzheng wants to go too.\"","\"Sure, how could we leave you behind? We'll definitely take you with us.\"","At the dining table, Xu Yunzheng was happy and even ate a lot of vegetables. Xu Xiuhe's tone was full of praise for Shen Yin's delicious cooking, and even simple words could create a unique flavor.","\"Then what about your cousin? I'll have to reject her tonight since Liu Bo has a partner now.\"","\"What about Chen Siming?\" Shen Yin suddenly asked.","Xu Xiuhe shook his head.","\"No, no, Chen Siming is too young, only 25 years old. Your cousin definitely won't agree.\"","\"You guys are quite into brother-sister relationships these days, aren't you? Who knows, maybe it will work out. But what kind of person is Chen Siming?\"","\"He's okay, I guess. I'll ask him later and let your mom know tonight.\"","\"Okay.\"","On Saturday.","Shen Yin dressed Xu Yunzheng early. Without calling a driver, Xu Xiuhe drove the car, and the family of three headed to Yang City.","\"I'll go with you to Master Kang's house first. We'll leave at noon, and then you can accompany me to meet a client and discuss a contract in the evening.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin didn't inform Kang Guopeng in advance that she would visit. When she arrived at Kang Guopeng's house, Kang Guopeng was working with two apprentices, sawing wood under a shed.","Seeing Shen Yin coming, Kang Guopeng instructed the two apprentices to be careful when carving and then came over to talk to Shen Yin.","\"Who is this?\" Kang Guopeng asked, looking at Xu Xiuhe.","\"My love,\" Shen Yin explained with a smile.","\"He's my daddy.\"","\"Oh, I see. You're here to check on the furniture progress, right? Come in and take a look.\"","Shen Yin walked in front, with Xu Xiuhe carrying Xu Yunzheng behind her, entering the shed.","The initial models of the bed and cabinets had been made. Kang Guopeng pointed to the bed and said, \"This one, I'm about to carve out the details and then apply the paint.\"","Shen Yin didn't understand the specific process but knew that doing this work required patience and meticulousness.","\"Uncle Kang, just follow the drawings. Since I've chosen you, I'll trust you.\"","\"Okay, you guys have lunch here. I'll ask your aunt to buy some groceries.\"","\"Uncle Kang, no need, no need. We have other things to do in Yang City, so we won't eat here. It's quite hot today. Be sure to take precautions against the heat when you're working.\"","\"Got it.\"","Shen Yin just wanted to check on the progress, and now that she had seen the concrete models, she felt reassured. She told Xu Xiuhe that they should leave.","Xu Xiuhe naturally agreed, and the family of three went to a restaurant in the city.","\"Mommy, Xu Yunzheng is no longer itchy. Can he eat fish and meat now?\"","\"Alright, little greedy cat, you can eat, but don't eat too much, okay?\"","\"Okay, thank you mommy.\"","Xu Yunzheng excitedly nodded his head.","\"Where are we going in the afternoon?\"","\"Why don't we take Xu Yunzheng to see a movie? We haven't gone to watch a movie together yet.\"","\"Yay, Xu Yunzheng wants to go watch a movie, Xu Yunzheng has never seen a movie before.\" Xu Yunzheng stopped eating, too excited to continue.","In Yang City, not many people knew this family of three. Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng, led Shen Yin to the largest cinema in this shopping mall.","Shen Yin deliberately chose an animated film, finding the animated films of this era quite interesting. Although not real people, they could synthesize various movements and sounds. She couldn't help but marvel at how advanced modern technology really was."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Two Brothers Meet","paragraphs":["Cartoons are truly enjoyable for all ages. Not only did Xu Yunzheng understand them, but Shen Yin also found them novel and fascinating, like a shadow puppet show, with little characters moving around on the screen, making her feel engrossed.","As a child, Xu Xiuhe was too busy with his studies to have any exposure to cartoons. Now that he watched them, he found them quite interesting too.","In any case, Xu Xiuhe was quite proud of himself, as he was so wise.","In the evening, they booked a private room at an upscale restaurant. When Xu Xiuhe arrived, the private room was empty.","After the server led the family of three into the room, they left.","\"Mom, why is there no one here?\" Xu Yunzheng asked, puzzled since he knew from the beginning that his father was going to meet someone, but no one else was there.","\"It's because the clients haven't arrived yet. We want to cooperate with them, so we must show sincerity by not making them wait. That's why we come early, which is more polite,\" Xu Xiuhe explained.","The little one nodded.","\"What kind of cooperation is it?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"To extend our business to Yang City, but since we don't have a foothold there, we need to cooperate with other companies.\"","\"I see,\" Shen Yin understood roughly.","\"This cooperation was almost settled, and we were about to sign the contract. But suddenly, a competitor emerged. I suspect that the people coming soon are not only the Lin Group that Heyuan Group wants to cooperate with.\"","As Xu Xiuhe finished speaking, a man walked into the private room.","\"What a coincidence, big brother is here too,\" the man said.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin looked up at the man.","Their eyes met, and the man was smiling, but his eyes were as cold as a poisonous snake, showing ill intent despite the smile.","\"Big brother,\" Shen Yin immediately realized who this man was and understood who the competitor Xu Xiuhe mentioned earlier.","Shen Yin lowered her head, then glanced at Xu Xiuhe again. Xu Xiuhe did not react at all, as if an irrelevant person had just walked in.","The man didn't seem to mind either and sat down casually.","\"Big brother, you're here to discuss cooperation too, right? Mr. Lin hasn't arrived yet.\"","Xu Xiuhe acted as if he didn't hear him.","The man then looked at Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng and asked, \"So these are my sister-in-law and nephew. Big brother, you didn't even introduce them to me.\"","\"Who are you?\" Xu Yunzheng asked, looking at Xu Zhengyang.","\"Nephew, didn't your father tell you? I'm your uncle.\"","Then, Xu Zhengyang turned to Xu Xiuhe and said, \"Big brother, you really didn't introduce his uncle to your son. Look, he's so grown up now and doesn't even recognize his own uncle. It would be so awkward if he ran into me somewhere and couldn't recognize me.\"","Xu Xiuhe took a sip of water and ignored Xu Zhengyang.","Xu Zhengyang didn't find it awkward and kept talking to himself.","\"What's your name?\" Xu Zhengyang asked Xu Yunzheng.","The smart kid, seeing that his parents didn't engage with this person, didn't respond either.","\"Uncle is asking you, what's your name?\"","\"Mom and Dad said I can't talk to strangers,\" Xu Yunzheng played with the chopsticks and bowl in his hands.","\"You're all here. Sorry to keep you waiting.\" The door to the private room opened again.","A young man walked in.","\"Mr. Lin is here. We just arrived, so you didn't wait long,\" Xu Zhengyang stood up eagerly.","Lin Zhe sat down.","He picked up the menu, flipping through it and ordering dishes.","However, his eyes kept glancing at Shen Yin from time to time.","Xu Xiuhe was a bit displeased, wondering if this young Mr. Lin had ill intentions toward Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe had a sour expression the whole time, which Lin Zhe naturally noticed.","\"How coincidental that you two gentlemen share the same surname, Xu. Could you be from the same family?\" Lin Zhe asked pointedly.","\"Lin Zhe is so smart. This is my big brother. He left home to make a name for himself at a young age and hasn't been back for a long time. Now his company is one of the top ones in Rong City,\" Xu Zhengyang said.","\"I see,\" Lin Zhe roughly understood their relationship. As a businessman, he knew that if a young man abandoned his family business, either he was indifferent to worldly affairs or had a falling out with his brothers from different fathers but the same mother.","Clearly, from their demeanor, they belonged to the latter case. This made things more interesting.","\"So since you're brothers, it doesn't matter who you cooperate with, as you're still family. Let's eat first,\" Lin Zhe said deliberately.","Throughout this, Lin Zhe kept glancing at Shen Yin with an inquisitive gaze. Shen Yin was also perplexed, as this was their first meeting, yet Mr. Lin kept looking at her.","Xu Xiuhe was also observing Lin Zhe closely and even considered leaving the private room with Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng, forgetting about the cooperation.","\"Who is this?\" Lin Zhe asked, looking at Shen Yin.","\"Mr. Lin, this is my love, and this is my son,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"So Mr. Xu had a son at such a young age,\" Lin Zhe remarked.","Xu Zhengyang's expression changed instantly.","\"Excuse me for asking, but has Madam Xu ever been to Yang City before?\" Lin Zhe asked Shen Yin again.","\"Yes, I've been there twice before for work.\"","\"I thought you looked familiar,\" Lin Zhe said.","\"Really? But I don't find you familiar, Mr. Lin.\"","\"Hahaha, well, let's talk business then. Our company has limited capabilities, so we can only cooperate with one company. I've reviewed the terms you both offered, and for my own benefit, I think choosing the Xu Group would be slightly better.\"","Xu Zhengyang smiled, \"Rest assured, Mr. Lin. Cooperation is a win-win situation, and choosing the Xu Group will definitely not disappoint the Lin Group.\"","Xu Zhengyang deliberately glanced at Xu Xiuhe, as if boasting.","Xu Xiuhe smiled back.","\"Mr. Lin, I think my company's development is no worse than the Xu Group's. Why don't you consider us, Mr. Lin?\" Xu Xiuhe tapped his fingers on the table lightly.","\"Mr. Xu, the Heyuan Group has indeed developed well in recent years, surpassing many companies. But it was established too recently, so we can't choose it carelessly. For the long-term, since the Lin Group itself is an old-established company, we naturally prefer to choose the equally old-established Xu Group.\"","Xu Xiuhe was about to say something else.","The door to the private room opened again.","Three people walked in, two adults carrying a very small child.","\"Let me introduce you, this is my lover, and my child,\" Lin Zhe said, his eyes looking towards the slightly younger woman."]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: Life Savior","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe looked towards the woman and the infant in her arms, and let out a sigh of relief. With this, it seemed unlikely that Lin Zhe's gaze towards Shen Yin had any ill intent.","The woman who entered looked around, and her gaze finally settled on Shen Yin. Shen Yin also looked back at her, with her good memory instantly recognizing the woman.","The woman walked towards Shen Yin with the baby in her arms and said, \"Do you remember me? This baby, the first person he saw after being born was you.\" The woman seemed a little emotional.","Shen Yin looked at the baby, who was a little over a month old, lying in the woman's arms.","The baby had grown quite a bit since birth, the grandmother's baby's features had also opened up a little, and it was evident that the baby was healthy. Shen Yin was happy, after all, she had welcomed this new life into the world.","\"The baby is getting more and more handsome,\" Shen Yin said as she reached out and touched the baby's little face.","This action and statement undoubtedly acknowledged that she was the one who had delivered the baby.","\"No wonder I couldn't find you in Yang City, turns out you're from Rong City, and you're even Xu's wife. What a coincidence,\" Lin Zhe spoke up.","The woman was quite emotional. At that time, she felt like she had been through the gates of hell. Outside, the sky was pitch black, the rain was pouring like thunder, and she felt like she was nearing the end of her life, hopeless and helpless, her abdomen aching and breathing difficult.","And Shen Yin's appearance was like a ray of light, or an angel, pulling her out of the darkness, rescuing her from the gates of hell.","It was just that, after the delivery, she was too weak to even have the energy to thank her.","And Lin Zhe was delayed by the heavy rain, only returning to the hotel the next morning. At that time, she had just woken up again, and when she tried to find Shen Yin again, she was told by the hotel staff that Shen Yin had checked out.","\"I've been wanting to thank you in person, but I couldn't find you. My husband checked the surveillance cameras in the hotel lobby and hallways, but the angles weren't very good, and we couldn't find you in Yang City,\" the woman explained.","\"I was in a hurry back then, so I left rather hastily.\"","\"I didn't expect that just coming here to sign a contract, I'd encounter you. Truly a fateful connection.\"","The woman sat down next to Lin Zhe, holding the baby.","Xu Zhengyang saw this and felt that the situation was unfavorable for him, so he immediately smiled and said, \"Sister-in-law is truly kind-hearted. I'm so envious of my brother now.\"","Shen Yin smiled perfunctorily and did not respond.","\"Mom, is that a little baby?\" Xu Yunzheng pointed at the baby in the woman's arms and asked.","The baby in the woman's arms was so small, just a little over a month old, and didn't recognize strangers yet. His little eyes rolled around before finally looking at the woman.","\"Oh, ah, oh la,\" the infant babbled in a way that no one sitting there could understand.","\"Can Zheng understand what his little brother is saying?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Little brother?\"","\"Yes, a little brother. The baby and Zheng are the same gender, both boys.\"","\"Lin is so young, yet has achieved success in both family and career. I'm truly envious,\" Xu Zhengyang tried hard to assert his presence.","\"You flatter me, Xu. Xu himself is quite accomplished at such a young age, becoming the general manager of the Xu Group.\"","The two men complimented each other.","Lin Zhe ordered some more light and nutritious dishes.","\"Lin, what about our cooperation deal?\" Xu Zhengyang asked, sounding a little anxious, as if he had a premonition that he might not be able to secure this contract.","\"Let's eat first, no business talk during meals. We'll discuss after we finish eating,\" Lin Zhe said as he served dishes for his wife.","Lin Zhe's family of three and Xu Xiuhe's family of three chatted among themselves, in a harmonious atmosphere.","\"Mom, can Zheng eat this shrimp?\"","\"Yes,\" Shen Yin said, then picked up a shrimp and put it on Xu Yunzheng's plate.","\"Dear, have some of this soup,\" Lin Zhe said next.","The dishes at the high-end restaurant were delicious, but Xu Zhengyang found this meal as tasteless as chewing wax, filled with anxiety and unease.","Finally, all seven of them finished eating.","Lin Zhe's wife leaned in and whispered something in his ear, which the others couldn't hear.","A few minutes later, the woman walked towards Shen Yin again with the baby and said, \"The child is asleep, so I'll take the baby home first. Now I know who you are, as the savior of my child and me, I will surely express my gratitude properly another day.\"","\"It's nothing, it was only natural. Since I know how to deliver babies, I couldn't just ignore a situation like that.\"","After the woman left with the baby, the private room became quiet again, to the point where even the sound of a spoon hitting a ceramic bowl could be heard.","Xu Zhengyang looked worried and gloomy. He had worked so hard to get this opportunity to sign the contract, and he couldn't fail now, could he?","\"Mom, will the little brother come back?\" Xu Yunzheng was the first to break the silence.","\"The little brother is still too small, he needs to rest more to grow taller. He went home with his mother,\" Shen Yin patiently explained, as if there were only her and Xu Yunzheng in the room.","\"Thank you again, Mrs. Xu, for saving my wife's life. If it weren't for you, she might not have made it. I can never repay such a great debt of gratitude. When my wife left earlier, she specifically reminded me not to neglect you.\"","\"Let's sign the contract,\" Lin Zhe said abruptly.","Not only was Xu Zhengyang caught off guard, but even Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were surprised by Lin Zhe's decisiveness.","\"Lin, didn't you just say you were going to choose the Xu Group? Why the change of heart now?\" Xu Zhengyang asked impatiently, clearly on the verge of success.","If he could secure this contract, his father would certainly look upon him more favorably, and might even trust him more than Xu Xiuhe due to his greater ability.","\"Wouldn't Lin reconsider?\" Xu Zhengyang continued to ask.","\"My apologies, Xu, although there's an old saying that 'a gentleman's word once given is as unchangeable as a galloping horse,' there's also another saying that 'a drop of kindness should be repaid like a gushing spring.' And for the wife of the president of Heyuan Group, what she did for me was far more than a drop of kindness - she saved my life.\"","\"My wife and I are devoted partners, deeply in love with each other. To me, she is the most important person in my life. Therefore, I have made a new decision. Even if it means not being a 'gentleman,' I must follow my wife's wish. So I have decided to choose Heyuan Group.\"","Xu Zhengyang's eyes revealed a fierce determination, and he argued vehemently, \"But Heyuan Group has only been established for a few years, and can't compare to the Xu Group in any aspect.\"","\"No problem, I trust Heyuan Group, and Mr. Xu who leads it. I have also carefully considered, and the fact that Heyuan Group has developed to its present scale in such a short period of time shows that Mr. Xu's leadership is effective, and that Heyuan Group has great potential. Moreover, with the group's president having such a capable and kind-hearted wife like Xu Xiuhe, who is highly skilled in medicine and extremely capable, Mr. Xu's career is bound to flourish. It's a win-win situation, how could I not choose it?\" Lin Zhe's words were reasonable and well-structured.","Xu Zhengyang could not refute him.","However, Xu Xiuhe was delighted to hear this, not for any other reason, but simply because Lin Zhe had just praised his wife."]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Marriage Relationship","paragraphs":["\"It's an immense honor for Heyuan Group to collaborate with the Lin Group,\" [Xu Xiuhe] said.","\"Well then, let's move to the next private room and sign the contract,\" Lin Zhe stood up and gestured for them to proceed.","Xu Xiuhe picked up Xu Yunzheng, while Shen Yin carried her bag. Lin Zhe led the way as the group exited the room.","Xu Zhengyang watched their retreating figures, his gaze growing increasingly malicious. He clenched the water glass in his hand so tightly, it seemed as if it would shatter any moment.","Why, why did he lose again? He was so close, just one final step away from achieving his goal. Then he would no longer be looked down upon by the company, he would have gained his father Xu Guimin's approval, he would have inherited the Xu Group.","Why the change? It was all because of that woman, damn Shen Yin. If not for her, Xu Xiuhe wouldn't have had a son. If Xu Xiuhe didn't have a son, Xu Guimin wouldn't still be fixated on Xu Xiuhe.","If this woman hadn't saved Lin Zhe's wife, he would have been the one signing the contract. None of this would have happened with Xu Xiuhe.","\"That's right, it's all because of this woman, ruining my plans,\" Xu Zhengyang became agitated and suddenly stood up, forcefully pushing the plates off the table. Unsatisfied, he hurled the glass in his hand with all his might.","\"One day, I'll make sure this woman suffers a miserable death.\" The man's eyes were red, his expression twisted like a demon's.","In the other private room, an air of harmony prevailed. After signing the contract, Xu Xiuhe and Lin Zhe exchanged pleasantries.","\"Mr. Xu, it's getting late. You're not going back, are you?\" Lin Zhe asked.","Xu Xiuhe checked his watch. It was almost 9 PM, indeed too late. Little Zheng was already yawning non-stop, it was his usual bedtime.","\"No, I won't go back,\" Xu Xiuhe glanced at Shen Yin.","Shen Yin nodded in agreement.","\"Perfect timing then, I assume you haven't booked a hotel yet? The hotel where Mrs. Xu stayed last time, the same one where my wife gave birth, they handled things quite well. I ended up acquiring it. If you don't mind, you can stay there.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't hesitate and readily agreed.","\"Alright, I'll take you there.\"","\"No need, I can find my way,\" Shen Yin spoke up.","\"It's not a problem, I need to stop by the hotel anyway, it's work-related,\" Lin Zhe insisted.","Upon arrival at the hotel, Lin Zhe took the lead as the owner, with the staff treating him with utmost respect.","\"Prepare the presidential suite for this gentleman and lady,\" Lin Zhe instructed the receptionist at the front desk.","The receptionist, recognizing her boss, lowered her head and swiftly arranged for the presidential suite without a word.","Inside the suite, Xu Xiuhe was working on documents while Shen Yin had bathed little Zheng and tucked him into bed, the child sleeping soundly, not even stirring during his bath.","Relieved, Shen Yin headed for the bathroom herself, only to find Xu Xiuhe joining her, insisting they bathe together.","\"Now, now, it's just bathing, don't get any other ideas,\" Shen Yin warned with a mischievous smile.","\"What else could I possibly do? It's just bathing,\" Xu Xiuhe replied, grinning playfully.","Indeed, circumstances had changed, but it was within Shen Yin's foresight.","\"Wife, you're truly remarkable. You casually save someone and become the wife of the Lin Group's president.\"","\"Or perhaps I'm just lucky,\" Shen Yin teased, playing with Xu Xiuhe's hair.","Xu Xiuhe pondered her words. His wife's background was extraordinary, her experiences unlike any other. Even her dreams could foretell difficulties. With such good fortune, it was no surprise she had established two or three business ventures in just three or four months.","Suddenly, Xu Xiuhe seemed to remember something and asked while embracing Shen Yin, \"You haven't had any nightmares lately, have you?\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin recalled the vivid yet bizarre dream she had a few nights ago.","Vivid, as if it had truly occurred, yet bizarre because she couldn't see the face of the man harming her in the dream.","Shen Yin didn't immediately respond to Xu Xiuhe's question, causing him to grow concerned.","\"You had a nightmare? What was it about?\"","\"Yes, I had a nightmare. I dreamt that I was kidnapped by a man, but I couldn't see who he was,\" Shen Yin finally admitted.","Xu Xiuhe fell silent. If he hadn't asked, would she have told him? This woman, she always tried to shoulder everything herself, to solve problems on her own. Didn't she think of him at all?","\"Shen Yin,\" Xu Xiuhe's tone suddenly grew serious, calling her by her full name instead of the usual pet names.","\"Yes? What's wrong?\" Shen Yin looked at him innocently, unaware of what she had done to prompt his change in demeanor.","\"I'm your husband, your spouse. We are one. We are the most intimate people in this world. You need to share everything with me. You can't bear the burden alone. Think about it, if I hadn't asked, would you have told me about this?\"","Xu Xiuhe had seen through her, and Shen Yin couldn't refute his words. She hadn't spoken up because she feared worrying him.","\"I'm sorry, I didn't want you to worry,\" she apologized.","\"Yin Yin, I'm your husband. Of course I'll worry when you tell me, but have you considered how I would feel if you kept it bottled up inside? A couple should trust and be honest with each other. Even if you mean well, what if something really happens to you? If I'm unaware, I'll only worry more.\"","Xu Xiuhe spoke earnestly, his words carrying weight.","\"Oh, I was wrong,\" Shen Yin pouted, snuggling into Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","Seeing her expression, Xu Xiuhe couldn't bring himself to scold her further. He tightened his arms around her and gently kissed her forehead.","\"I may have been too harsh earlier, but it's for your own good. Nothing has happened yet, so there's still a chance to prevent it. But if the nightmare comes true, what would I do? Little Zheng is still so young, he can't be separated from you. What would become of him?\" Shen Yin's heart sank upon hearing his words.","\"It won't happen again. I'll tell you everything from now on.\"","\"That's right.\"","\"Let's sleep now and think about this tomorrow.\"","Xu Xiuhe coaxed Shen Yin to sleep, but he remained awake, pondering over who could be behind this.","Was it targeting him, or Shen Yin? Shen Yin had only been here for over three months, and the enemy could only be Qi Yan. Xu Xiuhe wasn't sure whether it was her.","If it wasn't Qi Yan, then it was targeting him, his adversaries over the years - some in business, and also the mother-daughter pair of Yang Cui and Xu Zhengyang.","There was also the possibility that it was simply a kidnapping for ransom. Xu Xiuhe considered all the possibilities one by one."]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: Visit from Su Jin","paragraphs":["When the family of three returned to Rong City, Xu Xiuhe became more vigilant.","Logically speaking, since Shen Yin had been with Zhengzheng all along, why was there no Zhengzheng in Shen Yin's dream? This meant that when Shen Yin was kidnapped, Zhengzheng was not present.","\"Don't go out if you don't have to during this period,\" Xu Xiuhe told Shen Yin.","\"Okay,\" Shen Yin agreed.","\"Then I'll go to the company first. The studio should be safe.\"","Shen Yin nodded.","There was no one at the studio today. After Xu Xiuhe left, just as Shen Yin was about to close the door, Su Jin walked up to Shen Yin's studio.","\"What's up? Not open today?\" Su Jin joked.","\"Mother-in-law, indeed, we don't open on Sundays. But you are still welcome,\" Shen Yin opened the door wide again and led Su Jin inside.","\"Ah, I'm the kind of person who doesn't go to the Three Treasures Temple for no reason. But this time, I came to see you for no particular reason.\"","\"Ah?\"","Shen Yin didn't expect this twist from Su Jin. She thought Su Jin would say she came to see her for some particular matter.","\"No reason, Mother-in-law can visit me even if there's no reason,\" Shen Yin said.","Zhengzheng came over from the side and, upon seeing Su Jin, politely called out \"Mother-in-law.\"","Su Jin was usually a serious person, but for some reason, whenever she faced this mother and son, she felt happy, and her expression became more tender than usual.","\"Ah, it's been a while since I've seen Zhengzheng. Did Zhengzheng miss Mother-in-law?\" Su Jin bent down and patted Zhengzheng's head.","Shen Yin suddenly realized that she had heard this question countless times, almost every person who knew Zhengzheng would ask this question when they saw him again.","And Zhengzheng, as if used to this question, answered it without hesitation.","\"I missed Mother-in-law. Did Mother-in-law also miss Zhengzheng?\" Zhengzheng asked with a smile.","\"Oh, I missed you, I missed you. Zhengzheng is so handsome and adorable, Mother-in-law thinks about you every day.\"","Hearing Mother-in-law praise him like that, Zhengzheng was delighted. He hurried over to the side of the tea table and reached for the teapot. However, being small with short arms, he couldn't quite reach it no matter how hard he tried.","If you can't reach it, find a way. Zhengzheng stood on his tiptoes, stretching his arm to reach the pot. Finally, with great effort, he managed to grab it with one hand, but then realized he couldn't move it at all.","As an experienced mother, Shen Yin noticed Zhengzheng's little actions while chatting with Mother-in-law Su Jin and couldn't help but be amused.","\"Zhengzheng, don't move, it's too heavy for you to carry. Let Mom pour,\" Shen Yin walked over.","When Zhengzheng saw his mother coming, he stepped back to make way for Shen Yin.","\"Was Zhengzheng trying to pour water for Mother-in-law?\" Mother-in-law Su Jin also walked over.","\"Mother-in-law, please take a seat first,\" Shen Yin handed the water cup to Su Jin.","\"Thank you, Yin Yin,\" Su Jin took the cup and drank a sip.","Then she said, \"I saw your final piece from the last competition. It was indeed excellent, just as I expected.\"","Shen Yin smiled without saying anything.","Su Jin continued, \"I think you were still holding back your true abilities. Your skills are far beyond that.\"","Shen Yin didn't expect Su Jin to notice that she hadn't shown her full potential.","\"Mother-in-law noticed, huh?\" Shen Yin also took a sip of water.","\"Hahaha, after all, I'm older and have been in the embroidery business for decades, so I can still tell the quality of embroidery.\"","\"Mother-in-law is indeed impressive.\"","\"Not at all, you're still so young, and your skills have already reached this level. To be honest, I think my skills don't measure up to yours. You were born with exceptional talent, destined for this craft.\"","Shen Yin smiled. She wasn't born with exceptional talent; at most, she was a little clever and paid attention to details, plus she had the advantage of having transmigrated here.","\"Indeed, each generation is stronger than the last. In the future, Chinese embroidery will be able to flourish,\" Su Jin sighed.","\"Mmhmm, many crafts are worth promoting. Outstanding cultures need to be carried on.\"","\"Good, good, I never expected to hear such words from a young person's mouth. Indeed, our traditional culture is profound and extensive. Many cultures have flowed continuously throughout history, lasting until today. They cannot be lost. Culture is the blood, crafts are the flesh, and those who inherit them are the bones. None can be dispensed with.\" Su Jin went on.","She usually didn't talk this much, but when facing a young person like Shen Yin with both thoughts and skills, she couldn't help but speak at length.","\"Mother-in-law, I understand. I will never abandon the craft of embroidery.\"","\"I may have said too much. Don't find it bothersome. I'm just like this. When I meet someone I click with and resonate with, I can't help but talk more.\"","\"Not at all, not at all. You didn't say too much,\" Shen Yin still showed respect to her elders, especially someone who valued promoting outstanding culture. If she looked at it from an ancient person's perspective, she would be very gratified.","\"Alright, you must work hard for the finals. Mother-in-law believes in you, and the championship will definitely be yours.\"","\"Thank you, Mother-in-law. I will definitely try my best and not let Mother-in-law down.\"","\"Good, then Mother-in-law will head back.\"","Shen Yin saw Su Jin off. While they were talking, Zhengzheng had been playing on the side. Now, hearing that Mother-in-law was leaving, he hurried over with his little steps to see her off as well.","\"Zhengzheng, Mother-in-law is leaving,\" Su Jin waved.","\"Goodbye, Mother-in-law. Mother-in-law, be careful on your way back.\"","\"Okay, Mother-in-law is leaving.\" Su Jin turned back to look at them multiple times as she left.","\"Mom, where does Mother-in-law live?\" Zhengzheng asked.","Shen Yin knew Su Jin lived next door, but she didn't seem to see Su Jin often, so perhaps Su Jin didn't often stay there.","\"Mother-in-law Su probably has several homes like Zhengzheng.\"","\"Oh oh.\"","Shen Yin closed the door again, and no one else came in this time.","\"Zhengzheng, what do you want to eat for lunch?\"","\"I want to eat crab.\"","Shen Yin: ...","It seemed they didn't have any crabs at home. She had been buying groceries online before.","Sometimes she would take Zhengzheng to the farmers' market to buy some vegetables.","Shen Yin ordered some fresh seafood and vegetables online. Xu Yunzheng had been craving for so long, so Shen Yin decided to let him have a good meal.","\"Mom, Zhengzheng is so happy today.\"","\"Why is that?\" Shen Yin took Zhengzheng upstairs to the third floor.","\"Just happy.\"","Zhengzheng played in the living room while Shen Yin cooked the rice in the kitchen.","Soon after, she received a delivery call asking her to go downstairs to collect the order.","\"Zhengzheng, you play over there for a while, don't touch anything dangerous. Mommy is going downstairs to get the dishes.\" Shen Yin changed her shoes.","\"Okay, Mommy, Zhengzheng won't move around, Zhengzheng will be good and listen.\" Xu Yunzheng's gaze shifted from the picture book in his hand to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin walked downstairs. Usually, the front door was never closed, after all, there were five dogs outside.","Today, the five dogs had all been led inside by Xu Xiuhe."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: Abducted","paragraphs":["Shen Yin walked to the door and pressed her fingers against it. As the door opened, she suddenly blacked out and lost consciousness.","A man wearing a black cap and a delivery worker's uniform hurried over and asked, \"Madam, what's wrong with you? Wake up.\"","The man placed Shen Yin on a nearby electric scooter, then mounted it, allowing her to lean against him, and drove away.","The electric scooter wound through one alleyway after another, taking a circuitous route.","Xu Yunzheng had been waiting for a long time on the third floor, but he didn't see Shen Yin coming up. Feeling hungry, he took small steps down the stairs.","When he came downstairs, he found the front door on the first floor wide open, and the five dogs were still there.","\"Flower, where is Mommy?\" little Zhengzheng asked.","The five dogs looked left and right but made no sound.","The little one started to panic, tears streaming down his face. But he seemed to realize that it was no use.","Helpless, he could only obediently go back upstairs to find a solution.","It took the little one a long time to finally make it back to the third floor. Shen Yin's phone on the dining table started ringing.","The little one walked over to the table, trying to reach it, but no matter how he tried, he couldn't.","The phone kept ringing with its ringtone. Zhengzheng wanted to answer it but could only try to reach the phone.","He was too short, and even standing on tiptoe, he couldn't touch the table surface.","Seeing a chair nearby, the little one had an idea. He tried hard to climb onto it, attempting various positions until he finally managed to stand on the chair.","Imitating how Shen Yin had answered the phone before, he tapped the green answer button, and Xu Xiuhe's face appeared on the screen.","Xu Xiuhe was startled to see Zhengzheng standing on the chair, as it was far too dangerous for a child just over two years old.","Suddenly, Xu Xiuhe realized something was amiss. If Shen Yin were there, she would never have allowed Zhengzheng to do something so risky.","\"Zhengzheng, sit down and don't move. Where is your mother?\" Xu Xiuhe asked urgently, grabbing his car keys, ready to rush back.","\"Daddy, Mommy is gone,\" Zhengzheng said, sitting down and crying.","Xu Xiuhe's suspicion was confirmed by the child's words. He strode out quickly, almost running.","He hurried, rushing as if he could fly.","The phone in Xu Xiuhe's hand was still connected.","\"Zhengzheng, how did your mother go missing?\" Xu Xiuhe asked in the elevator.","\"Mommy told Zhengzheng that she was going downstairs to get groceries and told Zhengzheng to be good upstairs. But Mommy was gone for a long time, and Zhengzheng got hungry, so Zhengzheng went downstairs to look for Mommy. But Mommy wasn't there.\"","\"What about the door? What happened to the downstairs door?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"The door was open, and Mommy was gone. Zhengzheng asked Flower and Furball, but they didn't tell Zhengzheng. Daddy, Zhengzheng misses Mommy, Zhengzheng is hungry.\"","Xu Xiuhe was more anxious than anyone, wishing he could fly home and find Shen Yin.","\"Zhengzheng, listen to Daddy. Stay on the chair and don't move. Daddy will be home soon, and you wait obediently for Daddy.\"","Zhengzheng nodded.","Xu Xiuhe immediately sent a message to Xue Jingrui.","[Shen Yin is missing, likely kidnapped. I don't know who is behind it. Can you check the surveillance footage at my house entrance? I'm on video with Zhengzheng, so it's not convenient for me to look.]","Surprised by the message, Xue Jingrui had just finished lunch and was doing the dishes in the kitchen on his day off.","Earlier, he had asked why Qi Ji hadn't gone to the Martial Arts Club today and hadn't met with Shen Yin.","Qi Ji said Shen Yin was in Yang City and wouldn't be back until around noon, so she wouldn't be teaching classes this week. She would make up for it by teaching two days next week.","But it was just past noon, and Xu Xiuhe was telling him that Shen Yin had been kidnapped.","After receiving Xu Xiuhe's surveillance password, Xue Jingrui logged in.","\"Qi Ji, we need to go out for a bit. Shen Yin may have been kidnapped. I'll go check it out. Do you want to come?\" he asked.","Hearing this, Qi Ji grew anxious. Of course she had to go. Shen Yin was so kind to her, and she had to find out what happened.","\"What about Zhengzheng?\" she asked.","\"Xiuhe said he's on video with Zhengzheng, so Zhengzheng is probably still at home. He asked me to help check the surveillance footage first.\"","Qi Ji immediately gathered her things and went with Xue Jingrui.","\"You watch the footage first, and let me know if you see anything. I'll drive,\" Xue Jingrui said, handing Qi Ji his phone to view the surveillance.","Qi Ji took the phone and pulled up the morning's video.","\"Shen Yin saw off an elderly woman and then closed the door. Then she probably ordered groceries on her phone on the first floor. After that, she went upstairs to the third floor with Zhengzheng. A little while later, Shen Yin came back down alone.\"","\"And then?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Then she opened the door and collapsed. The delivery man rushed over and tried to wake her up, saying, 'Madam, wake up.'\" Qi Ji narrated, turning to face Xue Jingrui.","\"Switch to the outdoor surveillance now,\" Xue Jingrui instructed.","Qi Ji did as he said.","\"What happened?\"","\"Look, Brother Jingrui, this man sprayed something at Shen Yin, and that's why she passed out,\" Qi Ji said, holding the phone in front of Xue Jingrui's eyes.","On the video, the delivery man took out a small spray bottle and sprayed it at Shen Yin several times as she opened the door. Then he pretended to try to wake her up before placing her on the electric scooter. The delivery man rode the scooter away from Qinghe Street.","\"It's a kidnapping. That delivery man was probably an imposter,\" Xue Jingrui guessed.","At the same time, he also relayed the information to Xu Xiuhe.","Both cars sped up, heading toward the Qinghe Apartments.","Xu Xiuhe rushed upstairs and picked up Zhengzheng.","Xue Jingrui and his wife stood at the entrance, examining the scene. They found that the fake delivery man had left no clues behind.","Xu Xiuhe came down and told them, \"It's a kidnapping. I just had Liu Bo check on this guy, but with the mask and cap, it's hard to identify him. There's no result yet.\"","\"Any suspects in mind?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"What do you think? Could it be Qi Yan?\" Xu Xiuhe asked in return.","Everyone fell silent.","\"Daddy, where did Mommy go? Does she not want Zhengzheng anymore?\" The little one started crying.","\"No, Mommy had something to take care of. She didn't abandon Zhengzheng. Auntie will hold you,\" Qi Ji said, reaching out to take Zhengzheng.","Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe stepped outside.","\"I don't think it was Qi Yan,\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"Why? You're not defending her again, are you?\"","\"No, she shouldn't have the guts for that.\"","\"Not necessarily. At your wedding last time, the two of them got into a fight,\" Xue Jingrui had some doubts.","\"What should we do now? Should we report to the police?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"No, it hasn't been 24 hours yet. I'll keep tracking the delivery person on my end, and you help me check if Qi Ji can take care of Zhengzheng for now,\" Xu Xiuhe said."]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: Identity of the Kidnapper","paragraphs":["The group quickly took their positions, with Xu Xiuhe comforting Zhengzheng, who was still hungry.","Xu Xiuhe was anxious, as Liu Bo had some news, and Xue Jingrui had also utilized his connections to help search.","When Xue Jingrui had just asked whether to report to the police, Xu Xiuhe was initially inclined to agree, but he felt that relying on themselves would be better than relying on others.","Xue Jingrui felt that more people meant more strength.","Xue Jingrui reported the case to the police and began checking various surveillance videos. He discovered that the perpetrator was very familiar with that area, riding an electric scooter that appeared in the videos only at the beginning and then disappeared.","This indicated that the kidnapper had avoided all surveillance, causing them great difficulty.","On Liu Bo's side, he had gathered a lot of information. He sent people to find those who had seen the delivery person based on the order's starting location.","People from the vegetable market said that this delivery person had been in the area for a few months, didn't talk much, and they were unaware of his character.","Upon learning this, Xu Xiuhe spent a significant sum to obtain surveillance videos of the area and hired many people to watch them. After over an hour, they finally located the kidnapper's residence.","Xue Jingrui also brought two police officers and rushed to the kidnapper's home to meet up with Xu Xiuhe and the others.","In front of the police officers, Xu Xiuhe kicked open the old wooden door of the dilapidated house.","Inside, the floor was littered with instant noodle cups and mineral water bottles.","The bedding was bundled into a heap, nestled together. The entire room had a strange odor, both foul and sour, even with a hint of musty dampness.","The two police officers covered their noses, looking disgusted.","\"You two, search and see if there are any suspicious items,\" Xue Jingrui instructed.","The two police officers immediately sprang into action, quickly searching the premises.","They found a bag of powder under the table, and one of the officers smelled it and said after opening the powder, \"It's not poison.\"","The other officer said, \"But it seems like one of those powerful sedatives that have appeared recently. If sprayed, it would cause immediate unconsciousness and make someone pass out.\"","Xu Xiuhe and Xue Jingrui exchanged glances.","\"Take this back as evidence first,\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"What about you two?\" The two police officers looked at each other, unsure what else they needed to do besides taking the powder back.","When they came, the chief had specifically instructed them not to neglect the person surnamed Xue.","The two police officers did as instructed.","Xu Xiuhe continued rummaging through the room and found an ID card in the drawer of the bedside table.","Confirming the identity would make things easier.","Liu Bo was also continuing his investigation.","\"This person's name is Wang Zhihao. Do you know him?\" Xue Jingrui asked Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe held the ID card and stared at it for several seconds but had no recollection. Of course, he wouldn't know the perpetrator personally, as who would want to harm someone and do it themselves?","\"From Yang City?\" Xue Jingrui muttered.","\"Yang City?\" Xu Xiuhe suddenly thought of something.","He immediately sent the photo to Liu Bo, and Xue Jingrui also sent it to the people at the police station.","Soon, they received a response from the police station.","\"We've got it. This person has a criminal record and has been in prison before,\" Xue Jingrui told Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe suddenly remembered that Shen Yin had mentioned she had a childhood sweetheart.","That guy had been in prison before, so could it be that he's now seeking revenge on Shen Yin, for money or for something else?","Xu Xiuhe didn't have time to think too much. He had to find Shen Yin as soon as possible.","Xu Xiuhe took the man's ID card and left the damp, dirty, and musty rental room.","Liu Bo's call came in at that moment.","\"Any progress?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"A little. He was in prison before and only came to Rong City three months ago. He's been delivering around Qinghe Street. I found a technician who tracked his movements over the past ten days and discovered he visited an abandoned factory in the north of Rong City.\"","\"Send me the location of the factory. I'm going there now.\"","Upon hearing this, Liu Bo sent the location to Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe was about to drive there, but he panicked. Several thoughts flashed through his mind again.","The kidnapper hadn't called him yet, and he was afraid. If it was for money, he wouldn't be this worried, as he could solve any problem with money.","\"I'll drive,\" Xue Jingrui said, worried that Xu Xiuhe's panic might cause an accident on the road.","\"Contact the police and have them go to this address too,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Xue Jingrui opened his phone and dialed a number.","\"Head to an abandoned factory in the north of Rong City. The kidnapper may be there.\"","In the abandoned factory in the north of Rong City, Shen Yin was still unconscious, her hands and feet bound tightly with iron chains.","The man stood in front of Shen Yin, looking at her with a predatory gaze.","He took a bottle of mineral water, unscrewed the cap, and tilted it over Shen Yin's head, pouring the water down.","The entire bottle of water flowed through Shen Yin's hair.","Shen Yin opened her eyes and looked at everything in front of her, slightly dazed, wondering if she was dreaming again. This time, she saw the kidnapper's face.","\"You're awake.\"","The water from her hair dripped down, wetting her clothes. Shen Yin realized this wasn't a dream, but what had happened in her dream had actually occurred.","Shen Yin began to recall that she had gone downstairs to retrieve a food delivery when she lost consciousness, and the next time she woke up, she was here.","\"Who are you, and why did you kidnap me?\" Shen Yin had a special quality of being able to remain calm in difficult situations.","\"Sweetheart, do you really not know who I am? Think about it. You can figure it out.\"","Shen Yin did rack her brain, but she genuinely couldn't remember who this man was, she swears she tried her best.","Shen Yin defiantly raised her head, \"I don't know you.\"","\"Baby, how could you not know me? We have a marriage agreement.\" The man's face moved closer.","Shen Yin felt disgusted, the man's breath was even more foul than his words.","\"I don't have a marriage agreement. I'm already married,\" Shen Yin remained calm.","The situation had now changed, differing slightly from the dream, as the man didn't immediately resort to violence.","\"No, you're engaged. You unfaithful woman, how could you forget me? I'm your fiancé.\" The man continued to say.","Shen Yin realized with a start that she thought this matter was over, but she didn't expect this person to come looking for her again.","\"I don't know. If I'm not mistaken, we had agreed that if I got married before the age of 22, the childhood engagement would be canceled. Now my child is already two months and four weeks old. And I just turned 24. So please don't talk nonsense.\""]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: The Fiance","paragraphs":["\"Ha ha ha ha ha ha, ha ha ha ha ha ha, I'm just rambling, I'm rambling nonsense, I never agreed, you're just my fiancée.\" The man suddenly burst into maniacal laughter.","\"Calm down first,\" Shen Yin said, thinking that if she could buy more time, the better.","\"Calm down? How do you expect me to calm down when my fiancée is already married with a child? As her fiancé, tell me, how am I supposed to calm down?\" the man asked.","Shen Yin...","\"By the way, I still don't know your name.\"","\"Remember, your fiancé is called Wang Zhihao.\"","Shen Yin...","\"Mr. Wang Zhihao, as you can see, I don't even know your name, and you know I'm married with a child, so how can you be my fiancé?\"","\"I don't care, I say you're my fiancée, and you are.\" The man became furious and raised his voice.","Shen Yin was truly frightened, but she tried to remain calm, wondering if what happened in her dream was about to unfold.","\"Mr. Wang, you must know my husband's identity. My husband is very wealthy, and if you let me go, he will definitely reward you generously,\" Shen Yin said, not knowing what she was saying herself, just trying to buy more time.","\"Ha ha ha ha ha ha, what is your husband's identity?\" Wang Zhihao asked.","\"My husband is rich and powerful,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Woman, are you short of money? Do I lack the ability? I'm just a little poorer than him, why did you choose him?\" Wang Zhihao was utterly bewildered.","Shen Yin felt like cursing at him. What kind of delusional man was this, where did he get such confidence?","\"Of course I'm short of money, how could I not be?\" Shen Yin answered.","\"Sweetheart, money isn't everything. Although I'm not as rich as him, I love you more than he does,\" Wang Zhihao suddenly changed his expression in a theatrical manner, looking greasy yet inexplicably affectionate.","Shen Yin, who was usually well-mannered, felt like rolling her eyes to the heavens at that moment.","\"Being poor is absolutely unacceptable. My husband loves me very much. He cares for me, sends me flowers, respects me, and makes money for me to spend. Mr. Wang, tell me, what exactly is love if this isn't it?\"","\"Shut up, shut up or I'll kill you,\" the man said fiercely, as if he wanted to devour Shen Yin in the next second. Shen Yin's stomach growled, and she looked around the abandoned factory they were in, with a thick layer of dust everywhere.","Shen Yin glanced outside and guessed from the position of the sun that it was around 4 p.m.","Xu Xiuhe must have known she had been kidnapped by now. Her hands and feet were tightly bound with iron chains, and she couldn't break free.","With Xu Xiuhe's intelligence and wisdom, he should be able to find her, right?","Thinking of this, Shen Yin felt much calmer.","\"What's the matter, not talking now?\" the man spoke up again.","The line from her dream hadn't happened yet, so Shen Yin wasn't afraid for the time being.","Wang Zhihao looked at Shen Yin and asked, \"Are you hungry?\"","Shen Yin ignored him, keeping her eyes closed.","\"Woman, answer me when I'm talking to you, damn it, answer me,\" the man cursed angrily.","Shen Yin now seriously doubted that this man had mental issues, not only was he delusional, but also obsessive and even had a persecution complex. Fang Yue had said this man had been in prison before, but Shen Yin couldn't remember if it was for theft or assault.","\"Answer me, damn it, I'm talking to you. Are you deaf or blind?\" the man yelled.","Shen Yin still didn't respond.","The man became furious, \"Other men can have you, but I can't? You filthy whore, is that ugly face just for show?\"","Shen Yin panicked, feeling a bad premonition.","\"I'll show you right now if I can have you or not,\" the man said as he stripped off his own clothes and approached Shen Yin, about to tear off her clothes.","\"Stay right there and don't move,\" Xu Xiuhe suddenly charged in.","Wang Zhihao turned to look at Xu Xiuhe, smirking, \"Well, well, so this is the husband you said loves you.\"","The man's tone was full of provocation.","Wang Zhihao sneered, \"Apart from being a little more handsome than me, you've got nothing better. I might even be better than you in bed.\"","Shen Yin felt nauseous and wanted to vomit. Suddenly, Wang Zhihao moved closer, holding a fruit knife that appeared from somewhere, pressing it against Shen Yin's throat.","\"Take one more step, and she's dead,\" Wang Zhihao shouted at Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe looked anxious, not daring to make any rash moves.","\"Put down the knife first. Whatever your conditions are, tell me, and I'll agree to anything,\" he said.","\"Really, anything?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Then I want your company. Do you agree?\" Wang Zhihao asked.","Upon hearing this, he considered for a moment, his heart wavering, even asking, \"Really?\"","\"Really, put down the knife and let her go,\" Xu Xiuhe said calmly, trying his best not to agitate the man.","\"Ha ha ha ha, like I'd believe you. If I let her go, I'm done for.\"","\"If you don't let her go, you're even more done for.\" Several police officers seized the chance while Wang Zhihao was distracted talking to Xu Xiuhe and snuck in from another side, quickly snatching the fruit knife away.","Xu Xiuhe was startled, as this rescue was too risky. If there was the slightest mistake, Shen Yin's life would be in danger.","Wang Zhihao's knife was taken away, and immediately, several officers restrained him from behind.","Wang Zhihao tried to struggle, but the strength of one person was no match for three.","He was pinned to the ground, completely immobilized.","\"Let me go,\" the man continued shouting despite his inability to move.","The officer who took the fruit knife found Wang Zhihao's shouting annoying and instructed the other three officers to gag him.","Then, the leading officer crouched down, found the key to the iron chains on the man, and unlocked Shen Yin's chains.","Xu Xiuhe immediately ran over and embraced Shen Yin, who lowered her head and tightly hugged his neck, burying her face in his shoulder.","\"I'm sorry I was late. Were you scared?\" Xu Xiuhe gently stroked Shen Yin's hair to comfort her.","\"Thank you,\" Xue Jingrui walked over and said to the lead officer.","\"No need to thank us, we were just doing our job,\" the officer replied.","\"Xiuhe, let me introduce you, this is Tan Xiao from the Rong City Special Police Squad,\" Xue Jingrui introduced.","Xu Xiuhe nodded in gratitude. Thanks to him, Shen Yin was rescued from danger, although his methods were a bit extreme, but at least Shen Yin was saved.","\"I'm Tan Xiao. The lady may need to go to the police station to give a statement later.\"","\"Okay,\" Shen Yin agreed.","\"Let's make it tomorrow,\" Xu Xiuhe said."]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Rescued","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe was worried that Shen Yin might get scared, so he carried her out of the abandoned factory.","Shen Yin came around and leaned on Xu Xiuhe's shoulder, and Xu Xiuhe hugged her again.","\"Were you scared?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, looking at Shen Yin.","Shen Yin shook her head and then nodded.","Seeing her like this, Xu Xiuhe felt reassured. Although Shen Yin's martial arts skills were formidable, she was still a woman, and she would naturally feel afraid in such a situation.","\"This place is quite remote,\" Xu Xiuhe said, trying to divert Shen Yin's attention and help her forget what had just happened inside.","Shen Yin looked around. It was indeed remote, with desolate surroundings, fields in the distance, and weeds growing near the factory.","\"I made you worry,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Don't say that. It's my fault. I didn't expect your dream to come true so quickly, and I was careless when we left,\" Xu Xiuhe said, beginning to feel scared. He didn't dare think about the consequences if he had arrived late...","If Tan Xiao hadn't acted so quickly, what would he have done?","\"His name is Wang Zhihao, the arranged marriage partner I was supposed to marry at birth according to the midwife.\"","\"Yeah, I figured as much,\" Xu Xiuhe said, remembering that Liu Bo had mentioned Wang Zhihao had been in prison before, which matched what Shen Yin had told him about the one-child policy being enforced when she was born.","\"He's quite daring to find such a remote place,\" Shen Yin commented.","Xu Xiuhe...","His wife's focus was indeed different from others'. Now, instead of expressing her fear and seeking comfort in his arms as he had expected, she was commenting on the location.","\"This place is secluded with no surveillance cameras. He's not stupid,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"He seems to have some mental issues,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Xiuhe suddenly stopped walking, then continued.","\"What's wrong?\"","\"I was just thinking that if he claims to have mental issues later, his punishment might be reduced.\"","\"Ah?\"","\"But I won't let that happen. He kidnapped you, and I will make sure he pays the price.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin to the car, fastened her seatbelt, and secured her in.","\"You must be hungry. Let's go home first.\"","At Qinghe Villa, Qi Ji was coaxing and cajoling Zhengzheng, trying to keep the baby from crying since she arrived in the afternoon.","Ever since she came, Zhengzheng had been saying she was hungry, and Qi Ji had to find a way to get her something to eat.","The problem was that Qi Ji didn't know how to cook. She had never set foot in the kitchen when she was young, and she didn't know the details of Shen Yin's situation, so she didn't dare order takeout.","After Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe left, Qi Ji locked the door from the inside and carried Zhengzheng upstairs.","Zhengzheng was not happy and kept asking Qi Ji over and over where her mother had gone.","Qi Ji patiently explained each time that her mother was busy with work but would be back that night.","In front of Zhengzheng, Qi Ji didn't dare call Xue Jingrui to ask about Shen Yin's situation.","It was the first time Qi Ji had been in a kitchen, cooking for a child. She was really worried about what would happen if she gave the baby something that made her sick.","\"Zhengzheng, what would you like to eat?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"Mommy said she would make crabs for Zhengzheng.\"","Qi Ji...","She didn't even know how to cook rice, let alone how to prepare crabs. And there weren't any in the fridge.","There were eggs on top of the fridge.","\"Zhengzheng, would you like some eggs?\" Qi Ji coaxed, taking the eggs out of the pan.","Zhengzheng was hungry too, so she nodded.","Qi Ji poured in some water, put the eggs in, and carefully turned on the fire.","Finally, the eggs were boiled, but Zhengzheng was still hungry.","The little one was hungry, with a sour expression, following Qi Ji around like a little tail. Qi Ji felt terrible.","\"Grr, grr, grr.\"","Xu Yunzheng's stomach kept rumbling.","Qi Ji noticed some baby formula on the kitchen counter and got the idea to make some for Zhengzheng. She looked up how to prepare it on her phone.","[For a two-year-old baby, the normal ratio for baby formula is 30ml of water to one scoop of powder, so 120ml would need 4 scoops of powder. It's recommended that babies eat more fruits and vegetables and drink more water as appropriate.]","Following the instructions, Qi Ji mixed the formula and tested the temperature before giving Zhengzheng the bottle.","Then she washed and cut up some fruit into small pieces on a plate and placed it on the coffee table for Zhengzheng to eat.","After she had eaten and drunk her fill, Zhengzheng thought of Shen Yin again.","Qi Ji had no choice but to try to put her to sleep.","She sang songs and told stories, but suddenly Zhengzheng turned to her and asked, \"Where is Mommy? When is she coming back? Zhengzheng misses Mommy.\"","Qi Ji was almost in tears too. She also wanted to know when Shen Yin would be back and what her situation was after being kidnapped.","\"Zhengzheng, take a nap first, and when you wake up, Mommy will be back. If you don't sleep, Mommy won't be able to come back.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng immediately went to sleep.","After Xu Yunzheng fell asleep, Qi Ji couldn't sleep, so she passed the time by drawing.","When Zhengzheng woke up again, she said she was hungry once more.","Qi Ji was also a little hungry. But she had no idea what to do for the two of them. If only Xue Jingrui were there, she wouldn't have to worry about what to eat.","\"Auntie, I'm hungry. There are small dumplings in the fridge,\" Zhengzheng said.","Zhengzheng had remembered the small dumplings her mother had put in the fridge.","\"Okay, I'll boil some small dumplings for you, Zhengzheng.\"","Xu Yunzheng followed Qi Ji, going wherever she went.","Qi Ji did know how to boil dumplings—it was just like cooking instant noodles, adding some ingredients until they were cooked. It was even simpler than boiling regular dumplings.","Just as the dumplings finished cooking, Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin upstairs.","Xu Yunzheng heard the noise while eating dumplings.","\"Mommy!\" The little one ran straight toward Shen Yin.","Shen Yin squatted down and hugged Zhengzheng.","\"Mommy, where did you go? Zhengzheng missed you so much. Zhengzheng thought Mommy didn't want Zhengzheng anymore,\" Zhengzheng started whining as soon as she saw her mother.","\"Zhengzheng, be good. Mommy was busy today and didn't tell you before leaving. That was Mommy's fault. Will you forgive Mommy?\" Shen Yin explained.","\"Zhengzheng forgives Mommy, but Mommy has to tell Zhengzheng next time she goes out, or Zhengzheng will worry about Mommy and miss her.\"","\"Okay, Mommy promises Zhengzheng.\"","Qi Ji came out of the kitchen when Shen Yin arrived and saw the mother and daughter reunited, feeling happy for them.","\"Thank you for your hard work, Qi Ji,\" Shen Yin said.","\"No problem, as it should be. Is Shen Yin all right now?\"","\"I'm all right, you see, I'm standing right here, don't worry.\"","\"Zhengzheng, go eat dumplings with Aunt Qi Ji first. Dad needs to talk to Mom about something.\"","Xu Xiuhe continued, \"Xue Jingrui will probably come over soon, could you please look after Zhengzheng for a bit?\"","\"Sure.\"","Qi Ji sat down at the dining table, and she noticed while cooking that these dumplings smelled exceptionally fragrant."]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: News Received","paragraphs":["Shen Yin entered the bathroom and took a shower. She scrubbed herself over and over again, almost wanting to scrape off her skin, feeling so dirty. She could guess that she must have been touched by Wang Zhihao.","Just thinking about that arrogant and narcissistic man, Shen Yin felt vexed, wondering what gave him the audacity.","\"Are you done?\" Xu Xiuhe called out.","Shen Yin had been in the bathroom for quite a while, so Xu Xiuhe couldn't help but worry. While Shen Yin was showering, Xu Xiuhe kept in contact with Xue Jingrui.","Tan Xiao brought Wang Zhihao to the police station. Given the circumstances, the chief directly locked Wang Zhihao up.","\"Well then, I'll head back to the team.\" Tan Xiao said to the chief.","\"Good, good, thank you Captain Tan for your courage and bravery. This smooth operation is really thanks to your team's efforts.\"","After Tan Xiao left, Xue Jingrui said to the police chief, \"This case is quite serious. In the following investigation, I hope your team can be more diligent. Hopefully, he will spend the rest of his life in prison.\"","\"Yes, yes, we will follow your instructions.\" The chief naturally knew that Xue Jingrui's identity was not ordinary, so he dared not neglect him.","\"I'll come back tomorrow. The victim will also come to give her statement. I have other matters to attend to, so I'll leave now.\"","\"Mr. Xue, let me see you out.\" The chief followed Xue Jingrui.","Xue Jingrui headed to Qinghe Villa to pick up Qi Ji. It had been half a day since he last saw the little girl, and he didn't know how she was doing or if she had missed him.","When Xue Jingrui arrived at Qinghe Villa, he called Qi Ji from the lobby. Qi Ji immediately rushed down.","\"Brother Jingrui.\"","\"Slow down, don't trip and fall. Are you tired?\" Xue Jingrui patted Qi Ji's head and asked.","\"No, I'm a big girl now. I won't fall. I just ate the delicious little dumplings that Sister Shen Yin made.\"","\"Yeah, but you still need to be careful.\"","Xu Xiuhe then came downstairs with Shen Yin and Zhengzheng.","\"Did everything go well over there?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yeah, more or less. You and your wife can go over tomorrow to give your statement, and the case should be settled. Don't worry, he won't be able to use mental illness as an excuse.\"","\"That's good. Just be careful when you're driving.\"","Xue Jingrui nodded, got into the car, but Qi Ji still looked at Shen Yin with concern.","\"Sister Shen Yin, get some rest soon.\"","\"Okay, don't worry about me. I'll sleep in a bit.\"","Only after Qi Ji said a few words did she get into the car.","\"Brother Jingrui, let's go.\"","Xue Jingrui started the car.","\"Brother Jingrui, who kidnapped Sister Shen Yin?\" Qi Ji asked curiously.","\"She was kidnapped by a madman. He might have had a delusional disorder, thinking Shen Yin was his fiancée.\"","Qi Ji was almost furious at the shameless person who did this.","\"Don't get upset. The bad guy has been caught. You can't get agitated, what if there's a baby in your belly now?\"","\"Ah, is there a baby in my belly?\" Qi Ji touched her stomach, unable to imagine it.","\"It's not clear yet, but what if there's an embryo?\"","\"Oh yeah. Then I won't get upset.\" Qi Ji touched her stomach again.","Qi Ji lowered her head and picked up her phone. After being busy all day, she hadn't checked her phone and saw that Sister Shu Yi had been sending a lot of messages in the group chat by herself.","[I got angry at Chang Zhiyuan on set today.]","[Guess when I'll be back in Rong City.]","[I'll be back in a few days and can rest at home for a while.]","[Why aren't you guys saying anything? I've been talking to myself for so long.]","[@Miracle @Shen Yin, are you both busy now?]","After a long time, there was still no reply in the group chat.","[Alas, no one is paying attention to me.]","Seeing this, Qi Ji immediately replied.","[Sister Shu Yi, we were held up by something this afternoon, sorry we didn't respond to your messages.]","[Oh, what happened?]","Qi Ji wanted to reply but was afraid that Shen Yin would be reminded of the bad memory, so she didn't respond.","But who is Shu Yi? Since they both didn't reply to her for so long, it must have been something serious.","Shu Yi immediately sent a private message to Qi Ji.","[Qi Ji, what happened to you guys?]","[I'm not too sure about the details either. Basically, Sister Shen Yin was kidnapped by a deranged man.]","[What the hell, something so serious happened and you didn't tell me?]","[I was busy and forgot. Xu Xiuhe and Xue Jingrui went to rescue Sister Shen Yin. I stayed behind to look after Zhengzheng, who kept missing his mom. I had to comfort him all afternoon.]","[How is Sister Shen Yin now? Is she okay?]","[She came back in the evening. I'm in the car with Brother Jingrui going home now.]","[Okay, you should rest too. You must be exhausted.]","Shu Yi was anxious. Something so major happened, and she was the last to know. But even if she had known earlier, she wouldn't have been able to rush back.","After thinking it over, Shu Yi decided to ask for leave.","It was still early, so Shu Yi checked the time on her phone and planned to ask the director for leave. But then the question arose - with Chang Zhiyuan, the boss, there, would the director agree?","Shu Yi sent the director a message, saying she wanted to rush back home tomorrow.","She initially thought the director wouldn't agree, but the director replied immediately, saying okay, and even gave her the new schedule.","Shu Yi started packing her luggage. The director then informed Chang Zhiyuan about Shu Yi's leave.","Seeing the message, Chang Zhiyuan was also quite surprised.","\"Did she say what happened?\"","\"No,\" the director replied.","The director had been in the industry for many years. How often do media company CEOs come to act? He could tell at a glance that this Chang Zhiyuan had a special relationship with Shu Yi. How could he not agree to Shu Yi's leave request?","After hanging up, Chang Zhiyuan rushed to Shu Yi's room and knocked on the door.","Shu Yi opened the door, clearly annoyed. It was already tiring enough facing him on set during the day. Why did she have to deal with him again after work?","\"What is it? It's after working hours now.\"","\"You're asking for leave to go back?\"","Shu Yi wasn't too surprised. She had guessed that the director would inform Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Yeah, there's an emergency.\"","\"What emergency? I'll go back too.\"","\"Shen Yin was kidnapped this afternoon.\"","\"What? How did you find out? Why didn't I receive any notification?\"","Upon hearing this, Shu Yi suddenly didn't feel as sad anymore. She wasn't the last one to find out, and there was still someone else who was even more in the dark.","\"As Qi Ji said, it just means you're a bit behind on the news.\"","\"I should head back too. Shall we leave tomorrow morning?\"","\"Yeah, I've packed my bags.\"","\"Okay, I'll come pick you up in the morning.\"","Shu Yi didn't refuse. There was quite a distance between Hai City and Rong City, and she hadn't driven over this time. She hadn't had a chance to book a ticket yet, so since Chang Zhiyuan was driving, she might as well hitch a ride. It wouldn't be too much to ask her boss to give her a lift, would it?"]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: How Can I Live Without You","paragraphs":["Shu Yi was very worried. With such a big incident happening, she could not imagine how Shen Yin was able to face this situation on her own.","Shu Yi sat in Chang Zhiyuan's car, her heart pounding. She took out her phone and sent a message in the group chat.","[Shen Yin, how are you doing?]","Shen Yin was also sitting in a car, except that Xu Xiuhe was driving her to the police station to give a statement.","\"Mommy, where are we going?\" asked Zhengzheng.","\"We're going to the police station to see the police officers.\"","\"Who ish the powice offi-thur?\" the little one asked, her words not fully formed.","\"Police officers are good people. They catch bad people so the bad people can't do bad things anymore,\" Shen Yin explained.","Zhengzheng clapped her hands, her eyes sparkling.","\"Mommy, thirshty.\" Zhengzheng looked up at Shen Yin.","\"Okay, Zhengzheng will have to wait a minute.\" Shen Yin rummaged through her bag and took out Zhengzheng's sippy cup. She unscrewed the cap and placed the cup at Zhengzheng's lips.","The little one gulped down several mouthfuls before pushing the cup away. \"Mommy, all done. No thirshty.\"","Shen Yin screwed the cap back on and put the cup in her bag. Just then, her phone screen lit up, prompting her to take it out.","She had gone to sleep early last night and hadn't had a chance to check her phone. Opening it now, she saw many messages in the group chat, the most recent one being Shu Yi's: [Shen Yin, how are you doing?]","Shen Yin figured that Shu Yi must have heard about the incident and was now worried.","Shen Yin immediately called Shu Yi.","Shu Yi had been watching her phone and answered right away.","\"Shen Yin, how are you? I was so scared,\" Shu Yi said anxiously, her voice full of concern.","\"I'm fine. I'm chatting with you right now, aren't I?\" Shen Yin reassured her.","But Shu Yi was still afraid, knowing nothing about Shen Yin's kidnapping.","\"The bad guy captured you, right? Why did he kidnap you?\" Shu Yi continued asking.","Shen Yin also wanted to know why the man named Wang Zhihao had kidnapped her. Was it simply because he wanted her to be his fiancée? But they had never met before.","\"They caught him. It's a long story - I'll tell you the details later. I have to go to the police station to give my statement. I'll tell you everything when I get back.\"","\"Okay, I'll be in Rong City this afternoon anyway, so I'll come find you.\"","\"What? So suddenly? I thought you said you wouldn't be able to come back for a while.\"","\"You almost got killed! Of course I have to come back and see you. I requested leave. Let's meet this afternoon.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had been waiting for Shu Yi to get off the phone before speaking up. \"It should be fine, right? With Xu Xiuhe there, Shen Yin shouldn't be in any danger.\"","\"You trust Xu Xiuhe that much?\"","\"Of course. He's my brother - we grew up together. If I don't trust him, who can I trust?\"","Thinking about it, Shu Yi realized he was right. Xu Xiuhe had been so good to Shen Yin, so he definitely wouldn't let anything happen to her.","At the police station, Shen Yin recounted the events of the previous day.","\"Around what time were you kidnapped yesterday?\" an officer asked.","Shen Yin pondered for a moment, unable to recall the exact time.","\"It's on the surveillance footage. You can check that,\" Xu Xiuhe answered from the side.","The man's presence was so commanding that the junior officer didn't dare meet Xu Xiuhe's gaze. He silently instructed someone to pull up the surveillance footage and record the kidnapping time.","\"The drugs used during the initial kidnapping have already been taken by two officers for analysis. You can examine those yourselves,\" Xu Xiuhe added.","\"Yes, Mr. Xu,\" the officer replied.","\"Mrs. Shen, can you tell us specifically what the suspect said to you after the kidnapping?\"","\"He woke me up by splashing water on me. Then he told me his name and said he was my fiancé, but that's not true - we have no relationship.\"","The officer asked some more questions, which Shen Yin answered.","After it was over, the police chief also came out and promised Xu Xiuhe that they would handle this case seriously.","\"We appreciate that,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"No, no, it's our lack of vigilance that allowed this to happen. We're here to serve the people, so we'll give this case our full attention.\"","\"I hope he never gets a chance to see my wife again,\" Xu Xiuhe stated.","The police chief immediately understood the implication and readily agreed.","Kidnapping, attempted rape, threatening with a knife, not to mention his prior criminal record - any one of those charges was serious enough. And he had done them all.","\"Understood. We'll be going then.\"","After leaving the police station, Xu Xiuhe saw that it was getting late and decided to take mother and child out for a meal.","Shen Yin felt that this incident was now over and could relax. She really did seem fortunate to be able to overcome difficulties every time.","\"Thank you,\" she said to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Mommy, why you thank Daddy?\" Zhengzheng asked.","\"Because Daddy loves Mommy and helps Mommy solve problems every time.\"","\"Zhengzheng love Daddy Mommy too. Zhengzheng want pee-pee.\"","Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin just stared at their daughter, amazed at how she had combined two completely unrelated topics into one sentence.","\"Is there a restroom nearby?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"There's a mall close by. But Chang Zhiyuan just messaged me - he's waiting for us at Qingfeng Mingyue.\"","\"Shall we ask them to come over then? We can go to the mall restroom, or they can wait a bit longer while we take Zhengzheng first. It's not good for her body otherwise.\"","\"Okay, Zhengzheng can wait two more minutes.\"","Xu Xiuhe quickly parked the car, then carried Zhengzheng and accompanied Shen Yin to the mall restroom.","\"I'll take him into the men's room,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","Shen Yin took out some tissue paper from her bag and handed it to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Once he's done, we'll all go to Qingfeng Mingyue together.\"","\"Daddy, pee-pee,\" Zhengzheng said.","In the restroom, Xu Xiuhe stood in the stall, unsure of what to do. At home, Zhengzheng used a dedicated infant toilet seat.","But here in the public restroom, there were only adult squatting toilets, and Zhengzheng's legs were too short to straddle the toilet bowls properly.","\"Daddy, hurry!\" Zhengzheng urged.","It wasn't Xu Xiuhe who was in a hurry - it was Zhengzheng.","With no other choice, Xu Xiuhe held Zhengzheng up with both hands. He couldn't help but wonder why this mall didn't have any facilities for young children to use the restroom.","\"Daddy, all done,\" Zhengzheng turned to Xu Xiuhe after relieving herself.","\"Okay, don't move. Daddy will wipe you,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Zhengzheng stayed still while Xu Xiuhe used up the entire pack of tissues that Shen Yin had given him to clean up.","When it was time for Qingfeng Mingyue, Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi had been waiting for a long time.","Upon seeing Shen Yin enter, Shu Yi rushed straight towards Shen Yin, and it was fortunate that Shen Yin had some martial arts skills, or else she could have been knocked over by Shu Yi.","\"You scared me to death! If it wasn't for Qi Ji telling me about this matter of yours, I wouldn't even have known about it. Yin Yin, what would I do if something really happened to you?\"","Xu Xiuhe followed behind, carrying Zhengzheng, and upon entering, she heard \"What would I do without you?\""]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: Progress of Pursuing Qi Ji in Episode 0162","paragraphs":["...............","\"How could I live without you?\" Wasn't this what he was supposed to say to Zhengzheng? He was Shen Yin's husband, but he hadn't said it yet.","\"Shu Yi, you're holding Shen Yin too tight,\" Chang Zhiyuan hurried to pull Shu Yi away from Shen Yin.","\"Sorry, Yin Yin, I was really too scared.\" Shu Yi was on the verge of tears.","\"Zhengzheng is here, it's not convenient. Let's not talk about it this time. I'm safe now.\"","\"How did you rescue her?\" Chang Zhiyuan was more concerned about this.","\"Based on the information of the suspect, I had Liu Bo track the suspect's recent movements and found the location where Shen Yin was held captive. But the one who ultimately rescued Yin Yin was Tan Xiao.\"","\"Tan Xiao?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"Yes, the captain of the SWAT team, Tan Xiao. I was terrified by his actions at the time, as he directly snatched the knife from the kidnapper.\"","\"It really was him.\"","\"What, you know him?\"","\"Not just know him. My sister has been chasing after him for years without success.\"","\"Sister Ning Jing, chasing after Tan Xiao?\" Xu Xiuhe looked incredulous.","\"Yeah, I didn't know how these two completely unrelated people even met. You may not believe it, but my sister is a strong woman. In reality, she's still a romantic at heart. As far as I know, she has liked that man for 6 years already. She hasn't gotten married or gone on any blind dates, all because of that man.\" Chang Zhiyuan had an expression of exasperation.","He just couldn't understand why, with so many men in the world, his sister had to hang her hopes on such a twisted tree.","Well, he admitted, Tan Xiao wasn't exactly a twisted tree, but Tan Xiao was upright and straightforward, as tough as steel.","\"Sister Ning Jing has good taste,\" Shen Yin changed the subject.","Xu Xiuhe immediately became alert, looking at Shen Yin. He didn't understand what she meant by that sentence. Could it be that because Tan Xiao rescued her once, she...","Shen Yin quickly realized what he was thinking. \"Of course, my taste is good too.\"","Only then was Xu Xiuhe satisfied.","\"The food is here, let's eat first.\"","Xu Yunzheng didn't care what the adults were talking about. All he could see was the food.","He ate one piece of meat after another, and Shen Yin was a little worried that the kid might have indigestion.","\"Here, Zhengzheng, eat some vegetables.\" Shen Yin put a piece of greens to Xu Yunzheng's mouth.","\"No.\" Xu Yunzheng shook his head, though his mouth was already empty. But he still smacked his lips, as if savoring the taste of the meat.","\"Eat a piece of vegetable, okay? Or else mom will be upset.\" Shen Yin softened her tone, almost coaxing.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe felt it was unbelievable. Shen Yin had never spoken to him like that, but she was using that tone with this kid, who didn't even appreciate it.","\"Xu Yunzheng, don't upset your mom.\" Xu Xiuhe's tone was stern.","Zhengzheng looked at Shen Yin, realizing that her expression did seem a little unhappy. The little one realized he was wrong and began to apologize.","\"Mom~my, Zhengzheng was wrong. Zhengzheng shouldn't have upset mommy. I'm sorry.\"","After saying that, the little one lowered his head and ate the greens. It didn't taste bad, but he still didn't like eating it.","To avoid upsetting his mom, Xu Yunzheng voluntarily asked for more greens.","Seeing Zhengzheng like this, Shu Yi couldn't help but stifle a laugh.","\"My dear son-in-law, you can't upset your mom. Otherwise, your dad won't let you off the hook, and your auntie won't be able to help you then.\"","Xu Yunzheng looked up at Shen Yin again, sincerely.","\"Mommy, don't be upset. Zhengzheng didn't mean it. Zhengzheng won't make mommy angry.\"","Shen Yin was deeply gratified. To have such a child, what more could a mother ask for?","\"Mommy's not upset.\" Shen Yin said to Zhengzheng.","The little one giggled.","\"Mommy.\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Mommy!\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Mommy!\"","Xu Yunzheng called out three times.","\"Zhengzheng, mommy can hear you. You don't need to keep calling. If you keep calling, your throat will get hoarse.\"","The little one finally stopped and continued eating.","\"Shu Yi, when are you going back to the production crew?\" Shen Yin asked.","Shu Yi thought about it. Originally, she had requested leave until tomorrow night before going back. She was supposed to start working again the day after tomorrow. She had just become popular, so she couldn't let the entire crew wait for her.","\"Since you're fine now, I'm relieved. I was planning to go back tonight.\" Shu Yi said, glancing at Chang Zhiyuan.","Chang Zhiyuan was focused on his meal until he heard about going back tonight, then he looked up.","\"Why tonight? Didn't you request leave until tomorrow night? Do you think the commute is too long?\"","Shu Yi: \"Ahem, I'm worried about delaying the filming progress just because of me. That's why I planned to go back tonight. I only came back to see how Yin Yin was doing and if she was okay. Now that I've seen her, I'm relieved. But I can't keep delaying everyone else.\"","\"Shu Yi, did you get something wrong? I'm still here, you know. Who am I? I'm the male lead of 'I Just Want to Be With You'. If both the male and female leads are absent, who exactly are you delaying?\"","\"The others.\"","\"Exactly, the others.\" Shu Yi insisted.","\"You silly girl, are you being foolish? The others would be grateful if you took a break. They haven't been home in so long.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Really, I guarantee it. Not only am I your boss, but I'm also an investor in this drama. Of course, what I say goes.\"","\"Well, if you say so, I'm not being a diva.\"","\"I said so.\"","\"It's a pity Xue Jingrui didn't come today for us to get together. What a shame.\" Chang Zhiyuan sighed.","Xu Xiuhe didn't say anything.","Actually, Xue Jingrui was going to join them today, but he felt it was too much trouble. There wasn't much left to do, and he could handle it himself. So he just let Xue Jingrui go to work today.","\"By the way, how's his progress in pursuing Qi Ji?\" Chang Zhiyuan's mouth seemed to have no filter. He didn't know that Shen Yin, Shu Yi, and Qi Ji had a small group chat.","So he just blurted it out so casually. If he hadn't said anything, it wouldn't have mattered. But once he did, Shu Yi and Shen Yin's ears perked up.","What did they hear?","Xue Jingrui pursuing Qi Ji?","The development was a bit unexpected, yet also within expectations.","Unexpected in that Xue Jingrui would actually pursue Qi Ji. Expected in that the young lady Qi Ji was so sweet, beautiful, and well-behaved – which man wouldn't be moved by her charms?","\"I don't know. I didn't get a chance to ask yesterday, but they did come together.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","...","\"Ah, being a lone old monk is truly miserable. When will I be able to get married, have children, and live happily ever after like you two?\"","Chang Zhiyuan said this while deliberately glancing at Shu Yi.","His gaze was fixated directly on Shu Yi.","Shu Yi felt embarrassed being stared at, and lowered her head to eat from her bowl.","The Shen Yin family of three was eating dinner nearby, while the two adults were engrossed in watching their interactions with keen interest."]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: Portrait Photography","paragraphs":["Shu Yi changed the subject, \"This drama will be over soon, and I'm going to travel!\" She had no idea what this man would say next.","\"Where are you going?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I haven't decided yet. I want to go somewhere far away. It's been too long since I last went out to see places. Maybe I'll go to the Tibetan City.\"","\"Tibetan City?\" Shen Yin remembered that the Tibetan City was very far from Rong City. The Tibetan City was at the westernmost edge of the country, on the border, with an altitude of over 4,000 meters, known as the roof of the world.","\"It's a faraway place. I've wanted to go and see how mysterious it is for a long time.\"","\"Wow, that's amazing! You'll have to take lots of beautiful scenery photos when you go.\"","\"Of course! I'm super good at photography. I even got a photography certificate.\"","\"Impressive,\" Shen Yin praised.","\"Zheng Zheng wants to take pictures too.\"","\"Then Auntie will take photos of Zheng Zheng this afternoon and definitely capture all 360 degrees of my handsome nephew's charm without any blind spots. Oh, by the way, Yin Yin, you don't have anything going on this afternoon, right?\"","Shen Yin thought for a moment. It seemed she didn't have any plans.","\"Do I have anything this afternoon?\" Shen Yin turned to Xu Xiuhe with a dazed expression.","Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan couldn't get a word in earlier when those three were chatting so happily, as if they didn't exist at all.","Now that Shen Yin suddenly asked him, Xu Xiuhe immediately straightened his back.","\"No, but I'll be with you all.\" After what happened yesterday, he couldn't let Shen Yin out of his sight.","Xu Xiuhe looked at the mother and son.","\"Okay, but what about work? Today is Monday, and you haven't been to the company for several days.\"","\"Liu Bo is there. Now that he has a girlfriend in the same department, he's more than happy to show off his abilities to her during work hours.\"","At the top floor office of Yuan Group, Liu Bo sneezed loudly.","\"Someone's thinking of you?\" Xiao Li'er asked as she organized the documents.","\"What?\" Liu Bo didn't hear clearly.","\"If you suddenly sneeze, it must mean I'm thinking of you.\" Xiao Li'er half-sang.","\"You're thinking of me?\" Liu Bo looked astonished.","\"You're not actually developing feelings for me, are you?\"","...","\"If you suddenly sneeze, it must be because I'm thinking of you. If your phone wakes you up in the middle of the night, ah, it's because I care. I often wonder if the things you say have some other intention. I really want to believe, but I can't help but doubt. In your heart, am I the only one? Love is just me always bothering you.\" Xiao Li'er sang.","\"It's a song by Sweet Heart. You must have heard of her, right? I was just humming the song. I wasn't thinking of you, so don't be so conceited,\" Xiao Li'er explained hastily.","Of course Liu Bo knew Sweet Heart. But he didn't react immediately when Xiao Li'er suddenly half-sang it just now.","\"You sing quite well. This song suits you. Sweet and sweet.\"","Xiao Li'er's face turned red. Was her boss complimenting her?","\"The song's nice, but it doesn't suit me. I wasn't thinking of you. I was just joking around, but you didn't catch on. You probably sneezed because something got into your nose, and it felt uncomfortable.\"","\"Hmm, I know. Sweet and sweet suits you. I'm thinking of you suits me.\" Liu Bo put down the documents in his hand and looked at Xiao Li'er, his words intentional or not.","Xiao Li'er's face turned even redder than before. \"Don't say it like that. We're just pretending. If you say it like that, I'll start overthinking.\"","\"Hmm, it's my mouth on my face. I can say what I want. Your thoughts are your own. You can think however you want. I won't stop you.\" Liu Bo laughed lightly.","\"You...\" Xiao Li'er couldn't argue with him. She took the stamped documents and left Liu Bo's office.","Liu Bo watched Xiao Li'er's annoyed back as she left and smiled contentedly.","At Chang Zhiyuan's company studio, all kinds of filming equipment was available. Shu Yi didn't go home and brought her own gear.","Chang Zhiyuan specifically had his staff clear out a studio for them. From noon until now, he finally found his existence.","\"Call me if you need anything. I'll go buy some water,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","\"Thanks for the trouble,\" Shen Yin felt quite embarrassed.","\"It's no trouble at all for my nephew's photo shoot.\"","Xu Yunzheng stood inside while Shen Yin held a water bottle. Xu Xiuhe stood outside with the baby bag.","\"Isn't the air conditioning too low? Zheng Zheng is little. Will he be uncomfortable?\" Shen Yin asked.","It was hot outside at 35 degrees Celsius, but the studio's air conditioning was set to 16 degrees Celsius. The temperature difference was too large, and it felt quite cool inside.","Xu Xiuhe found the air conditioning remote and adjusted the temperature to 24 degrees Celsius.","\"Adjust? Daddy adjust air conditioning,\" Xu Yunzheng pointed at Xu Xiuhe and looked at Shen Yin.","\"Right, Daddy adjusted the air conditioning for Zheng Zheng. What does Zheng Zheng want to say?\"","\"Thank you, thank you Daddy,\" Xu Yunzheng looked up at Xu Xiuhe and smiled.","Shu Yi stood in front of the tripod and took the camera off it. Since she wasn't shooting video and Xu Yunzheng was just a child, a tripod wouldn't be suitable for his photoshoot. Shu Yi decided to hand-hold the camera for the shoot instead.","As expected, there was nothing cheap at Chang Zhiyuan's company. Shu Yi was interested in photography and had taken a class in her free time to learn some skills. She had also seen a lot of photographers in the entertainment industry, so she had gained quite an understanding of cameras.","The filming equipment in this studio was all high-end. The camera in her hand, combined with all these lenses, must have cost at least 150,000 yuan. The quality felt completely different.","Her own equipment only cost 100,000 yuan. As Shu Yi held this camera now, she decided she wanted to buy one for herself and take it to the Tibetan City to shoot some epic photos.","After familiarizing herself with the camera, adjusting the focal length and light sensitivity, and setting the parameters, Shu Yi finally pointed the camera at Xu Yunzheng.","\"Zheng Zheng, look at Auntie,\" Shen Yin helped pose Xu Yunzheng.","Shu Yi snapped some shots.","\"Come on, Zheng Zheng, smile at Auntie,\" Shu Yi half-crouched.","Xu Yunzheng revealed a few teeth and smiled.","\"Zheng Zheng, is Auntie beautiful? Is she pretty?\" Shu Yi walked over to Shen Yin and asked Xu Yunzheng.","\"Beautiful, prett-wine,\" Xu Yunzheng said, mispronouncing the last word.","\"It's 'liang' not 'niang', sweetie,\" Shen Yin corrected.","Xu Yunzheng sat on the chair with one leg dangling down, striking a cool pose. After hearing Shen Yin's words, he smiled and said, \"Is 'niang', not 'liang'.\"","\"Dad, go hug Zheng zheng and let's take a picture together,\" Shu Yi said.","\"Me?\" Xu Xiuhe said in disbelief. Apart from doing interviews, he hadn't taken many photos.","\"Yes, we'll take a father-son portrait. I'm quite good at taking photos. Don't you trust my skills?\"","Xu Xiuhe put down the baby bag he was holding and walked over to Xu Yunzheng.","\"Dad, hug,\" the little one stretched out his arms, wanting Xu Xiuhe to hold him.","Xu Xiuhe bent down, gripped the little one with both hands, and lifted him up over his head."]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: Return to Purple Joy Courtyard","paragraphs":["Shu Yi had a good shot captured.","\"Yin Yin, come take a look, isn't it beautiful?\" Shu Yi put down her camera and looked at her work.","Shen Yin leaned in closer.","In the picture, Xu Yunzheng's legs were bent backward, his arms naturally at his sides.","It was a warm photo, and what was particularly precious was that Xu Xiuhe was smiling in the picture, even showing his teeth.","\"It's really beautiful,\" Shen Yin praised, not sure if she was complimenting the person or the photo.","\"Of course, my composition is great, and the angle is perfect. I wasn't lying when I said I've studied photography before. If I can't make it as an actor in the future, I'll open a photo studio and take portraits for people,\" Shu Yi flipped through a few more photos.","Shen Yin looked at each one carefully. Indeed, the scenes were all harmonious, and the little people in the pictures were lively.","\"Come on, let me take a family portrait of you three.\"","\"I'll pass.\"","\"Come on, you'll be my first female model.\"","Shen Yin...","So Shu Yi wanted to use her as an experiment, the first time taking portraits of a woman.","\"Okay, I'll be your model and help you fulfill your dream of being a photographer.\"","Shen Yin walked over and stood there. Nobody needed to look to know they were a family of three.","\"Mommy, hold me,\" the two-year-old baby whined in a cute, slightly spoiled voice.","Shen Yin took the little baby from Xu Xiuhe and kissed Xu Yunzheng's cheek.","\"Mommy, act,\" Yunzheng looked towards the camera.","\"This isn't acting, we're taking photos together to record Yunzheng's growth. When you grow up, you can look back at your childhood and reminisce.\"","\"Yunzheng wants to grow up fast. Yunzheng wants to protect Mommy.\"","While they were talking, Shu Yi captured many photos, each one suitable for use as a wallpaper.","\"Okay, we're done. That was great,\" Shu Yi admired her work, not noticing Chang Zhiyuan approaching her.","\"I want you to take some photos of me too. When will you be able to do that for me?\"","Shu Yi jumped, nearly dropping the company's camera.","\"Why do you walk so quietly?\" Shu Yi complained.","\"I do make noise, you were just too engrossed. You almost dropped the company's camera.\"","\"But I didn't drop it, and even if I did, I could afford to replace it,\" Shu Yi stepped back.","Shen Yin's family of three came over.","\"Aunt, record growth,\" Xu Yunzheng stretched out his head, wanting to see the photos.","Shu Yi brought up the photos she had just taken and showed them to Xu Yunzheng one by one.","\"Beautiful, beautiful,\" the little one pointed at the pictures.","\"So you're not going back to the crew today?\" Shen Yin asked Shu Yi.","Shu Yi looked at Chang Zhiyuan, who didn't say anything or show any obvious expression.","\"I'll go back tomorrow,\" Shu Yi said.","\"What's next? Yunzheng didn't take a nap today, so he'll probably sleep soon. We should head back.\"","\"Sure, I'll transfer the photos to my phone, then I'll go see my parents. It's been a while since I visited them.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's phone kept ringing, and everyone looked over. Chang Zhiyuan glanced at the screen and put his phone away.","A few seconds later, it rang again.","\"Is it your parents or Chang Ningjing?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"It's Chang Ningjing, probably calling me to go home again.\"","\"Are you going back?\"","\"I'll go check it out. Here, you two take this water. I'll drop Shu Yi off first, and you take your time getting home.\"","Chang Zhiyuan handed the water to Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin, and he also bought milk for Xu Yunzheng.","In the car, Chang Zhiyuan was driving with a complicated mood.","\"Is it the sister you saw last time?\"","\"Yeah, she's my sister,\" Chang Zhiyuan replied.","Shu Yi remained silent.","\"Sorry, she might have upset you last time, but she's not a bad person. She's very good to me, but my parents value sons over daughters. They think she'll eventually get married, so they don't want her to join the company. She's very career-driven and capable, and she's been especially good to me. I'm worried my parents will force her into an arranged marriage, so I've been unwilling to go home and take over the company. That way, she can stay at the company.\"","Chang Ningjing was indeed capable. For a young woman to manage such a large company was not easy.","Hearing this, Shu Yi felt that although Chang Zhiyuan seemed frivolous, he was quite responsible.","\"It's okay, I didn't take it to heart.\"","Chang Zhiyuan...","Sure enough, before they got home, the little one fell asleep in the car, leaning against Shen Yin's chest as she gently patted Xu Yunzheng's back.","\"You go to work tomorrow. This matter is over, and I'm no longer in danger. You've seen it several times - I dreamed of the danger, and each time I was able to resolve it.\"","Although she said that, Xu Xiuhe was still worried. So what if she dreamed about it? This time they were lucky, but what about next time? He dared not think about it. If he had been a few seconds late this time, what would Shen Yin have done? What would he have done?","\"Next time you have a dream, tell me about it. Don't try to solve it yourself. We're husband and wife - we should face difficulties together and share the bitterness.\"","\"Okay, I'll tell you next time.\"","Back at the small building, the employees had just gotten off work. When they saw Shen Yin, they all greeted her.","\"Be careful on your way home,\" Shen Yin reminded them.","\"We know, boss.\"","\"Why don't we move back to Ziyue Manor sometime? It's spacious and secure, and the business here seems to be doing well. I feel like I rarely need to worry about it with you in charge.\"","Shen Yin considered it for a few seconds, weighing the pros and cons, before agreeing.","One reason was that the environment at Ziyue Manor was decent, with plenty of space and convenience. The other was that five dogs were indeed too many for the small space here.","\"Okay, let's take three dogs with us - Huahua, Piqiu, and the others. We can't take them all since we need to ensure the safety of the girls at the studio.\"","\"Got it, we'll do as you say. We can move back tomorrow. We don't need to bring much since we have everything there, and we've left things here too. When you're not busy, you don't need to come here. On weekends, if you come to teach classes, I'll stay with you guys. We can alternate between the two places.\"","\"Okay,\" Shen Yin agreed.","\"How long will it take to move over there?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Not long at all. In fact, you don't need to bring anything, as everything is available there. Plus, someone has been cleaning the place every day, so you can move right in.\"","\"Okay, then I'll take Xu Yunzheng to visit my mom tomorrow. She mentioned missing him recently. I didn't dare take him over after that dream I had, but now that this matter is resolved, I'll take him to see her.\"","Xu Xiuhe had forgotten about his promise to Fang Yue until Shen Yin brought it up. He hadn't even thought about it."]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Tomato Shrimp Congee","paragraphs":["\"Okay, when you go tomorrow, tell Mom about a friend of mine who's decent.\"","\"Who?\"","\"Chen Siming.\"","\"Got it.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't want Shen Yin to overwork herself, so after entering the small building, he went straight into the kitchen. He put on Shen Yin's pink floral apron.","Shen Yin stood at the doorway, watching Xu Xiuhe wear her pink apron, and felt no sense of incongruity.","\"You're going to cook?\"","\"Yeah, you've been working too hard. Take a rest tonight. I'll cook, though it won't be as delicious as yours, but it'll be edible. You'll have to make do.\"","Zhengzheng ran from behind Shen Yin and entered the kitchen.","\"Dad, food, Zhengzheng will help Dad cook.\"","\"Good, Dad thanks Zhengzheng.\"","\"Thank you Zhengzheng,\" Zhengzheng repeated to himself.","Shen Yin walked into the kitchen and carried Zhengzheng out.","\"Zhengzheng, let's not disturb Dad. Mom will take Zhengzheng for a bath first, okay? Smell yourself, are you not smelly?\"","The little one lowered his head, pulled his clothes, and sniffed, but couldn't smell anything. Then he lifted the other side of his clothes.","\"Mom, not smelly,\" the little one sniffed, his expression exceptionally sincere.","Shen Yin felt softened and amused again.","\"Okay, Zhengzheng is not smelly, but Zhengzheng will smell nice after a bath.\"","Xu Yunzheng toddled into the bathroom.","Shen Yin followed behind, but before she entered, the little one stuck his head out from behind the door.","\"Mom, hurry hurry.\"","Shen Yin took big steps into the bathroom and closed the door, adjusting the bathroom temperature.","\"Zhengzheng, take your hat off first,\" Shen Yin said to Xu Yunzheng as she adjusted the water temperature.","Zhengzheng took off his hat, then his decorative little backpack, and tried to pull his T-shirt over his head.","\"Mom mom, can't see.\"","Just two seconds after Shen Yin had adjusted the water temperature, the little one said he couldn't see. Shen Yin hadn't even turned off the faucet yet, but immediately turned around.","\"What's wrong?\" Shen Yin panicked. Just a few days ago, she had told him that the eyes were the windows to the soul. How could he suddenly tell her he couldn't see now?","Xu Yunzheng's shirt was stuck around his neck, and he tried to pull it off.","\"Covered mom.\"","Shen Yin exhaled. She had thought he really couldn't see. Zhengzheng was still so young, what if he really...","\"Zhengzheng, your eyes were just covered by the shirt, not that you can't see.\"","\"Zhengzheng's eyes were covered, not that he can't see,\" Xu Yunzheng imitated Shen Yin's words, even adopting a similar tone.","Shen Yin turned off the faucet, carried Zhengzheng to the baby tub, took off his pants, and put him in the tub.","\"Mom, little ducks,\" Zhengzheng pointed at the toys in the cabinet.","Shen Yin took out all his little ducks and put them in the water.","\"A group of ducks swam under the bridge in front, come come and count them, two four six seven eight,\" Shen Yin sang teasingly.","\"Quack quack quack, two four six seven eight,\" Shen Yin was genuinely shocked. Why was there such a big difference from the last time with Twinkle Twinkle Little Star? She even doubted if it was the same person singing.","Did Xu Yunzheng lack a musical gene? Not a single note out of the nine words was in tune.","\"Zhengzheng, let's learn to dance in the future. You can't sing in front of others, but you can sing in front of Dad and Mom. Except for Twinkle Twinkle Little Star.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin applied bath gel on Zhengzheng, and the little one rubbed a few times, producing bubbles.","\"Mom, bubbles. Fragrant.\"","\"Yeah, Zhengzheng will be fragrant too in a bit.\"","Shen Yin rinsed the bubbles off Xu Yunzheng and dried him with a towel.","\"Don't want skirt,\" Xu Yunzheng said unhappily.","Recently, Shen Yin had come across a particularly soft fabric, pink and not too large.","She had originally planned to make a sleepwear for Xu Yunzheng, but there wasn't enough fabric to cut. So she directly made the fabric into a sleep dress.","When worn, it looked like a girl's dress. The first time Xu Xiuhe saw Xu Yunzheng dressed like this, he was dumbfounded. He asked Shen Yin if she wanted a daughter. Next time they had another child, they could have a girl for a complete family with both son and daughter.","Shen Yin...","Could they really decide whether to have a son or daughter? That should happen naturally.","\"Wear it to sleep. Can't go around with your privates exposed,\" Shen Yin said.","It was only then that Xu Yunzheng obediently put on the pink dress.","Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng out. Xu Xiuhe was placing the stir-fried dishes on the dining table.","\"Look, you and Dad are matching in pink dresses,\" Shen Yin joked.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe looked down at his own pink floral apron, then up at Xu Yunzheng. Indeed, their dresses looked alike.","\"Smells nice, Zhengzheng hungry, want food,\" Zhengzheng commented.","Shen Yin placed Xu Yunzheng in the high chair, and Xu Xiuhe served him a bowl of porridge.","Xu Yunzheng picked up the spoon, took a sip, and put it in his mouth.","\"Tasty, Mom drink, tasty.\"","Shen Yin glanced at the porridge in the bowl, which contained tomatoes, rice, and shrimp.","\"Looks quite tasty,\" Shen Yin sat down too.","Xu Xiuhe continued bringing out the dishes.","Fish-flavored shredded pork, green pepper with eggs, and shredded potato.","\"Just home-cooked dishes. I haven't learned any new ones yet. We'll have to make do with these.\"","Shen Yin also took a sip of the porridge. It was indeed delicious, not too salty, but very fresh.","It exceeded her expectations for how tasty it would be.","\"Wow, that's amazing. This porridge is so delicious. How did you make it?\"","Xu Xiuhe started to feel proud. Maybe he was just gifted and managed to reproduce the dish after glancing at an online recipe.","\"Tasty, right? It's my first time making it. Am I a natural talent?\"","\"How did you make it?\"","\"It's simple. I kept the fresh shrimp heads and peeled the shrimp tails, setting the tails aside.\"","\"Then what?\"","\"Then I stir-fried the shrimp heads first to release the oil, then added the diced tomatoes and stir-fried them together. I added some seasonings, water, and rice, and simmered it for half an hour. When it was almost done, I added the shrimp tails. Finally, I added scallions and cilantro.\"","\"You're quite skilled,\" Shen Yin praised sincerely.","It was really delicious. She felt that with this skill, Xu Xiuhe could open a take-out store. So this was the result of pondering over food. She loved pondering herself, but didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to have picked it up too. Not bad.","\"Eat more if it's tasty. I'll make it for you often in the future.\"","\"You're not going to cook the porridge directly in a pot on the gas stove, are you?\" Shen Yin asked, shaking her head. Although she hadn't been there long, it was the first time she had seen someone cooking porridge in a frying pan. Xu Xiuhe could certainly be considered talented.","Xu Xiuhe nodded innocently. \"What's wrong? Can't I do that?\"","\"Well, you can,\" Shen Yin said. \"But as you just said, I've made a note of it. I'll do it too. Believe me, the next time I make it, it'll taste even better.\""]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Untitled","paragraphs":["\"Of course I believe you, after all your ability has always been very strong,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Is that a compliment?\" Shen Yin asked in return.","\"Of course it is. Actually, sometimes, I always felt that you don't seem like someone from your place. Your ability to adapt is amazingly fast, your thinking is very strong, and you're also very independent. It's different from what I always imagined. If you hadn't mentioned it before, I would have thought you had a mental illness, a split personality.\"","\"I don't have any illness. Do you want me to tell you about the Dasheng Dynasty?\"","\"Can you? I've always wanted to ask, but was afraid you didn't want to talk about it.\"","\"Of course I can. My Dasheng Dynasty should be from the same period as the Great Song, except that we didn't appear in history. It could be a parallel space of the Great Song, but the Dasheng Dynasty was slightly better.\"","Xu Xiuhe indeed only knew about the Song Dynasty. The Song Dynasty was the most prosperous period in Chinese history in terms of economy, culture, and education, reaching the peak of feudal society.","The capital, Bianliang, located in the center of the Yu Dong Plain, was also known as Bianliang or Bianjing. It was the capital of the Song Dynasty for 168 years, through the reigns of nine emperors, and was the famous center of culture, economy, art, and politics at that time. Its prosperity was unmatched in later times.","Additionally, the Song Dynasty valued civil over military pursuits, so there were many literati paintings and calligraphies. Emperor Taizu of Song also adopted the policy of restraining military power while promoting civil culture, co-governance between the ruler and officials, and raising the status and sense of responsibility of intellectuals.","Shen Yin continued, \"Although it's said that the ancients valued men over women, you should also know the status of women in the Great Song Dynasty, right? In ancient times, women had the highest status during the Song Dynasty. Women in the Song Dynasty had the right to inherit property. Even after marriage, they could still inherit property. Moreover, married women in the Song Dynasty could remarry, they could choose to divorce, and they would not be discriminated against. Women in the Song Dynasty could also go out and do business, they would open restaurants, make tea, and supplement the family income. Except for not being able to take the imperial examination, they weren't much different from men.\"","Xu Xiuhe asked in puzzlement, \"How do you know all this so clearly?\"","\"I'm not dumb. When I suddenly ended up in a new place, I naturally needed to learn and understand the history. It took me many days of study to figure it out. I always thought I was from the Great Song, but later I realized I was from the Dasheng Dynasty, a dynasty that didn't exist in history. It's just that the two were from the same period, but not in the same space. The lifestyles, cultures, and so on were still quite similar. So the status of women in our Dasheng Dynasty was not low, even a bit higher than in the Great Song. Otherwise, how could I adapt so quickly to living in this era?\"","\"You really are quite remarkable.\"","\"Of course. Do you remember, there was a period when I liked watching TV every day, even the commercials? That was the fastest way for me to access this place.\"","Xu Xiuhe...","He couldn't help but marvel. She really was exceptionally intelligent. Indeed, even to this day, looking at the ancient cultures, the ancient buildings left behind, one still couldn't help but be in awe. In the long river of history, human wisdom was the most indispensable. From the Dujiangyan Irrigation System, the Great Wall, to the Terracotta Warriors, and then to the cultural achievements of the Qing Dynasty, each one told the story of the wisdom and patience of our ancestors.","It can be said that without the groundwork laid by our ancestors, there would not be today's technological achievements.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng also wants to watch TV,\" the little one pointed his finger towards the living room again.","\"Okay, watch after you finish eating.\"","\"Are you going in the morning?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin nodded.","\"Alright, pack up what you need to bring, let the staff here know, then you don't need to come over tonight, I'll pick you up directly.\"","\"Okay, there's not much to pack.\"","\"I've noticed that you all quite like Song Dynasty culture now. Today on the street, I saw several young ladies wearing Song-style clothing. I felt quite gratified.\"","\"Yeah, it's our own outstanding culture. We have to promote it ourselves.\"","\"There's no rush for the furniture over there, things at the martial arts hall are proceeding in an orderly manner, and even the clothing studio's business is very stable now. I'm thinking of designing some Song-style clothing. I've discovered that we don't lack luxury goods, it's just that our luxury goods are all in museums. So I think I might understand these better, after all I've worn them for 16 years. If the clothing studio wants to grow and become stronger, it can't just make formal dresses.\"","As Shen Yin turned on the TV for Zhengzheng, she continued, \"Okay, whatever you do, I'll support you. Just don't overwork yourself.\"","\"Alright.\"","As Zhengzheng watched the cartoon, he became sleepy. Sitting on the sofa, he nodded off with his head down and the remote still in his hand.","His little head bobbed, and Xu Xiuhe carried him to the small bed. It had been a long time since he and Shen Yin had felt that way.","As soon as Shen Yin saw Xu Xiuhe, she knew what he was thinking, but she didn't say anything. With this kind of thing...","In bed, after Xu Xiuhe tossed aside his tools and gave Shen Yin a shower, he lay back in bed and asked, \"When should we have a baby?\"","Shen Yin had been feeling tired, but upon hearing that, she perked up.","\"Zhengzheng is still young, and my career has just started. Let's wait two years, by then Zhengzheng will be almost five and able to understand a bit.\"","\"Okay, I want a daughter, she'll definitely look like you, beautiful.\"","If Xu Xiuhe hadn't brought it up, all would have been fine, but once he did, Shen Yin recalled the song Zhengzheng had sung while bathing that evening.","Shen Yin propped herself up on her elbow, lying on the bed with her legs swinging lightly.","\"Can you sing? I want to hear you sing.\"","Xu Xiuhe suddenly felt embarrassed. Rarely did anyone listen to him sing. He seldom went to KTVs, and only knew one or two songs to get by. As for the rest, they were simply unlistenable.","It had taken him who knows how long to learn the one or two songs he knew.","\"Let's just sleep.\"","\"Hahahahaha, you can't sing, so that's why Zhengzheng's singing was so indescribable. Like father, like son, I see.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt even more embarrassed. \"You've heard Zhengzheng sing? He's only two years old, he can't even pronounce many words clearly, how could he possibly sing songs?\"","\"You haven't heard him?\" Shen Yin laughed even harder, as if the fatigue from before had completely disappeared.","Xu Xiuhe shook his head.","\"He sang while bathing tonight. I sang 'A big bridge in front of the gate, a flock of ducks swam under, come quick and count them, two four six seven eight.' Then he sang 'Ga ga ga, two four six seven eight,' not a single syllable in tune. I really cracked up.\"","\"I can sing,\" Xu Xiuhe insisted. \"There's one song I sing particularly well.\"","He was too prideful to admit he couldn't sing, or that he had only mastered one song after practicing it for a long, long time.","\"I'd love to hear it, husband,\" Shen Yin said coyly, calling him 'husband' to coax him.","Xu Xiuhe cleared his throat, determined not to let Shen Yin think less of him."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Going to the Shen Family in the 167th","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe picked up his phone, searched for accompaniment music, and cleared his throat.","\"My hawthorn tree romance, only with you can it be pure, I can abandon my bottom line, locking my gaze on you. My hawthorn tree romance, forever standing by your side, I promise my love won't change, sharing eternity like a dancing butterfly. Every time I regret that we didn't meet sooner~~~\"","Xu Xiuhe had a naturally pleasant voice, and singing this song \"My Hawthorn Tree Romance\" gave it a special feeling.","\"How was it?\" Xu Xiuhe asked after singing.","\"Beautiful, why didn't you sing for me before?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"You never asked to hear it before,\" he replied.","\"If I don't ask, you won't sing for me?\" Shen Yin questioned.","\"Honey, I was wrong,\" Xu Xiuhe immediately apologized.","\"Then you'll sing for me every day from now on,\" Shen Yin demanded.","Xu Xiuhe wanted to agree to this request, but could he admit he only knew this one song?","\"What, you won't agree?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Do you want the truth?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Tell me.\"","\"I only know how to sing this one song.\"","\"Only this one? Nothing else?\" Shen Yin couldn't believe it.","\"There's also 'Twinkle Twinkle Little Star,' which I learned as a kid,\" Xu Xiuhe answered honestly.","\"Hahahahaha, as expected from father and son. You both know 'Twinkle Twinkle Little Star,'\" Shen Yin laughed uncontrollably.","\"I'm a little better than him. Besides 'Twinkle Twinkle Little Star,' I also know 'My Hawthorn Tree Romance,'\" Xu Xiuhe defended himself.","\"Aren't you ashamed? You're even comparing yourself to your son. Why don't you mention that you're over 20 years older than him?\"","\"I'm not ashamed. I have a wife, and he doesn't,\" Xu Xiuhe said proudly.","Hearing this, Shen Yin wanted to kick this man out of the bed. He was being so shameless, and Xu Yunzheng was still so young.","Unfortunately, Shen Yin was too tired and couldn't stay awake any longer, and her eyes gradually closed.","Xu Xiuhe brought Xu Yunzheng back.","They had a good night's sleep.","The next morning, Xu Xiuhe went to work early, and after Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng finished breakfast, they packed two bags and went downstairs.","After instructing Li Huanhuan, Shen Yin carried Xu Yunzheng into the car.","\"Where are we going?\" Driver Big Brother asked.","\"Mommy, where are we going?\" Xu Yunzheng also asked.","\"We're going to Grandma's house.\"","\"What about Dad?\"","\"Dad went to work to earn money. If Dad doesn't work, he won't be able to earn money to buy food for Xu Yunzheng.\"","Overhearing this, Driver Big Brother thought to himself, they don't have money? Even if the CEO didn't work now, he'd already earned enough money for them to spend for the rest of their lives.","His monthly salary was an amount they could never reach in their entire lives, yet she said they didn't have money to buy food.","Driver Big Brother wept.","\"You can just drop us off at Yuelan Manor, and go home. This afternoon, Xu Yunzheng's dad will pick us up. You may have to travel farther in the future, as we'll be moving back to Ziyue Manor,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Not far, not far,\" Driver Big Brother hurriedly replied. This job paid much better than driving a taxi, was easier work, and had a high salary. A little extra distance meant nothing, as long as they didn't leave the city.","\"Mommy, are we moving?\" Xu Yunzheng asked from Shen Yin's embrace.","\"Yes, we're going back to our old home. Is Xu Yunzheng happy?\" Shen Yin asked.","The little one thought for a while before showing some recognition. After all, children forget things easily, and they had been living in Qinghe Villa for so long. It was normal for Xu Yunzheng not to remember.","\"Big, the old house was big,\" Xu Yunzheng said, gesturing with his hands.","Shen Yin was taken aback. This child was indeed smart. Not only could he speak so much now, but his memory also exceeded her expectations.","\"Mommy, Hua Hua,\" Xu Yunzheng suddenly thought of his little friends.","\"Hua Hua and Qiu Qiu will come with us. The other two friends will stay at the villa to watch over our home for Xu Yunzheng, okay?\"","Xu Yunzheng clapped his hands, revealing a few small milk teeth.","\"Grandma's house,\" Xu Yunzheng pointed at the Shen family's villa.","\"Wow, Xu Yunzheng even remembers Grandma's house,\" Shen Yin wanted to praise her baby again.","\"Big Brother, we're here. We'll go in first. It's hot outside, so you can go home,\" Shen Yin said.","Driver Big Brother smiled and opened the car door, watching the mother and son enter the house.","Shen Yin knocked on the door.","Shen Lv opened it.","\"Brother.\"","Shen Lv looked dumbfounded. His sister, who he found annoying, had actually come back of her own accord and called him \"brother.\"","\"Xu Yunzheng, let Uncle hug you,\" Shen Lv stretched out his arms.","Xu Yunzheng looked at Shen Lv's face, then at Shen Yin.","\"It's Uncle, Mommy's older brother,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Yunzheng reached out to Shen Lv, who immediately picked him up.","\"Brother, where's Mom?\" Shen Yin asked.","Fang Yue happened to be coming downstairs and saw Shen Yin with a delighted expression.","\"Yin Yin, you're here! I told your brother not to go to the office today so he could stay home with your dad. I was planning to visit you today.\"","\"Well, now that both your grandson and daughter-in-law are here, it's like we had a psychic connection. You don't need to go anymore,\" Shen Lv said.","Shen Lv took Xu Yunzheng to play, while Fang Yue pulled Shen Yin aside to look her over.","\"Yin Yin, how have you been lately? Not too tired, I hope,\" Fang Yue asked with concern.","\"No, everything's been great recently. Work hasn't been busy, and Xu Yunzheng has been well-behaved,\" Shen Yin replied, not daring to mention the kidnapping to Fang Yue.","\"Mom, what about that childhood engagement I had? What happened to that person?\" Shen Yin asked indirectly.","\"What about him? Thinking of asking him now? I told you before, if you got married before 22, the engagement would be nullified,\" Fang Yue said.","\"No, I was just curious what that man looks like,\" Shen Yin said.","This made Fang Yue nervous, not for any other reason, but because she was afraid Shen Yin might have some strange idea again.","\"Yin Yin, let me tell you, that man is no good. He's been to prison, and just that alone is a deal-breaker. Plus, you have a child now, and your life will only get better from here. Xiuhe is a really nice man, good-looking and talented, and knows how to make money. I can see he treats you well, too. I even asked him to introduce a friend to your cousin last time,\" Fang Yue said a lot in one breath, worried that Shen Yin might do something rash again with her history.","\"Mom, you're overthinking it. I was just curious and asked,\" Shen Yin tried hard to explain.","\"That's good, Mom is telling you, my eye for judging men is really not bad, very accurate. Xu Xiuhe is a good man, it won't be wrong,\" Fang Yue emphasized again.","\"I know, Mom, Xu Xiuhe is a good man.\"","\"Mom heard from Xu Xiuhe that he has a single friend called Si Ming. Do you know him? What kind of person is he? Could your cousin take a liking to him?\" Fang Yue got curious.","\"I'm not close with him, but he seems quite wealthy. I've seen him a few times. He has a private restaurant, and the food is pretty decent, I suppose.\""]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Shen Lv is Pressured to Get Married","paragraphs":["\"Alright, when do you want your cousin to go and see?\" Fang Yue had made up her mind.","\"How's my dad doing?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"He had a check-up a few days ago. The doctor said he's recovering well, so there's no need to worry too much. Your dad is quite resilient.\"","For Shen Yin, she was always very worried about Fang Yue. But now that Shen Tianzheng is out of danger, the weight on Fang Yue's heart can finally be lifted.","In Shen Yin's view, if something were to happen to Shen Tianzheng, Fang Yue would likely follow him.","People spend their entire lives searching for two things—value and a sense of belonging. During the day, we immerse ourselves in work, engaging with the world. At night, we return home, sleeping next to the one we love. \"Some are heading to the ends of the earth, while I am heading in your direction.\"","Sometimes, rather than saying we are seeking love, it's more like we are seeking a precious sense of belonging in someone. Upon seeing each other, we immediately envision a home in our minds.","Just like Shen Tianzheng, who has taken care of Fang Yue for so many years, while Fang Yue has silently accompanied Shen Tianzheng the same.","Shen Yin admired such a relationship. How wonderful it is. No matter how turbulent the world is, the loved ones know someone is creating warmth in the house, waiting for them to return home under the light.","Her love with Xu Xiuhe will be like this, won't it? She will wait for him to come home, and he will always think of her.","Shen Yin was very satisfied with her current marital status, a family of three, living peacefully and happily.","\"Uncle, Zhengzheng also wants to play.\"","In the living room, Shen Lv was fighting with Zhengzheng over toys.","Cars, bulldozers, these were all bought by Shen Tianzheng before he fell ill. He thought that one day Shen Yin would bring her child home, so he prepared these just in case the child wanted to play.","Unexpectedly, they really did wait for this day, Shen Yin really brought her baby back, and their family finally reunited.","\"Zhengzheng, let uncle play for a bit more.\"","A big and a small one kneeling on the living room carpet, Shen Lv was controlling the little car with the remote control. Zhengzheng knelt and watched, also eager to try to hold the remote control.","However, Shen Lv was too engrossed. He never realized how fun children's toys were before, even more fun than driving. This remote control, wherever you want the car to go, it goes. The key point is, this car can even do flips.","He must not have played with these kinds of toys when he was young, that's why he...","\"Uncle, Zhengzheng also wants to play.\" Zhengzheng squatted up, looking enviously at Shen Lv.","\"Zhengzheng, wait for uncle for two more minutes, uncle will be done soon.\"","Fang Yue couldn't stand it anymore, Shen Lv was so big, yet he was fighting with his nephew over toys, it was embarrassing to even speak of it.","\"Shen Lv, are you still a child? Quickly give the remote control to Zhengzheng, you're an adult now.\" Fang Yue walked over and said unhappily.","\"Uncle, quickly give the remote control to Zhengzheng.\" Xu Yunzheng moved closer to Shen Lv, getting in front of him with a begging look.","\"Shen Lv, you should go back to the company, we don't need you at home.\" Fang Yue added.","Shen Lv handed the remote control to Zhengzheng. He initially wanted to teach Zhengzheng how to operate it, but the kid was sharp. After watching for a while, he managed to get the little car moving on his own.","\"Mom, how could you do this? You're just like Zhong Wuyan when you need something, but Xia Yingchun when you don't.\" Shen Lv stood up.","\"You take a look at yourself. Do you think you're comparable to Zhong Wuyan? Where's your pride? Zhong Wuyan can lead soldiers into battle. Can you do that? You're already a grown man, yet you don't even have a wife. You're still acting like a child and taking my grandson's toys. Just leave, your presence annoys me.\" Fang Yue gestured dismissively.","Shen Yin stifled a laugh. As expected, no matter how old you got, you could still be scolded by your mom. Not only was he scolded, but he was also being urged to get married.","\"Mom?\" Shen Lv cajoled.","\"Don't call me.\" Fang Yue was still steaming. Shen Lv was already so old and he still didn't have a partner. Could she not be angry?","\"Just go to work now.\"","\"Zhengzheng, Grandma is chasing Uncle away. Uncle wants to play with Zhengzheng. Can you plead on Grandma's behalf, please?\" Shen Lv put on a mournful face.","Zhengzheng, who was having fun, had just gotten the little car to do a somersault. Hearing Shen Lv's words, the little one lifted his head to look at Shen Lv.","Seeing Shen Lv's pitiful expression, the little one turned his head towards Fang Yue and said, \"Grandma, Uncle will play somersaults with Zhengzheng.\" The little one's eyes were wide open as he pointed at the somersaulting little car.","\"Alright, Grandma promises Zhengzheng.\" Fang Yue grinned.","Upon hearing this, Zhengzheng crouched down and continued playing.","Fang Yue looked at Shen Lv, her face changing faster than flipping through a book, there was no trace of the smile now.","\"I'll let you off this time, for the sake of my grandson.\"","Able to stay at home, Shen Lv finally let out a sigh of relief.","\"Yin Yin, sit down here for a while. I'm going upstairs to check if your dad is awake.\"","\"Okay.\"","Fang Yue went upstairs.","Shen Yin had been standing for a while too, so she went to sit on the couch next to the carpet. Propping up her chin, she watched Zhengzheng play with his car.","After Fang Yue left, Zhengzheng was engrossed in his toys again. Downstairs, it was just her and Shen Lv. Suddenly, things got a bit awkward.","\"How have you been doing recently?\" Shen Lv broke the silence.","\"Bro, it's okay when mom asks this, but why does it sound like you're asking an ex-girlfriend when you do?\" Shen Yin retorted.","On thinking about it, Shen Lv found that to be true.","\"I'm doing quite well. Zhengzheng is obedient, work is going smoothly, and I'm in good health.\"","\"Haha, that's really good indeed. I heard your studio is doing well, and you've even made it to the finals. You really live up to being my sister, good at everything you do.\"","\"Erm, bro, if mom heard this, she would definitely say you're good for nothing and always trying to flatter yourself.\" Shen Yin didn't mince her words.","\"Darn it, how did you know mom would say that about me? She's always nagging at me, urging me to get married. I haven't been home in so long. I finally come home for once, and she chases me away.\" Shen Lv complained.","Shen Yin laughed, \"Who else would she nag at if not you? My child is already two years old, and you still don't have a partner.\"",".....","\"Can we have a proper conversation now?\"","\"Don't you have a lot of girlfriends on your phone?\" Shen Yin still remembers when she first came here. When Shen Lv took her to see the doctor, she inadvertently saw his chat screen.","\"You can't just say that, I don't have many girlfriends, this is defamation.\"","\"Last time, Jiaosjiao, Rourou, Mengmeng, Diedié, I saw several.\"","\"Pooh, Pooh, Pooh, they don't count. They're just potential interests, not yet official.\"","\"I don't care. I will still keep Zhengzheng away from you in the future. What if you corrupt Zhengzheng?\" Shen Yin looked at Zhengzheng again.","\"That doctor of yours is not bad.\"","\"Doctor Ji?\"","\"Hmm, yes, Ji Qingyan. I added her as a friend, but every time I reach out to her, she just brushes me off.\"","\"Brother, you used the wrong word. She doesn't want to deal with you. The meaning of 'brushing off' implies treating people insincerely or doing things half-heartedly. It is generally used in the context of work or dealing with people you're familiar with, you're not familiar with her.\""]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Various Cuisines","paragraphs":["...","\"Little sister, is that how you talk about your own older brother? Brother is looking for a sister-in-law, you should support me.\"","\"Sister-in-law~, looking for a sister-in-law.\" Zhengzheng was operating a remote control, and upon hearing this, he mumbled with a cute tone.","\"Zhengzheng, that's not a sister-in-law, that's an aunt.\"","\"Old mom? Don't want an old mom, want a new mom, want mommy.\" Zhengzheng crawled up and ran to Shen Yin's side, hugging her legs with both hands.","\"Don't want an old mom, don't want an old mom.\"","\"It's uncle's lover, you should call her aunt,\" Shen Yin explained as she picked up Zhengzheng.","\"Zhengzheng, uncle will definitely find you a beautiful aunt,\" Shen Lv tried to take Zhengzheng from Shen Yin's arms.","Fang Yue happened to be coming downstairs: \"Shen Lv, do you even know how to hold a child? If my grandson feels unwell, you're not having lunch today.\"","Shen Lv's outstretched hand froze in mid-air, not knowing whether to put it down or hold the child.","\"Mom, I'm your son.\"","\"A son isn't as important as a grandson.\"","\"Yin, what would you like for lunch? We have everything at home, mom will cook for you,\" Fang Yue ran over to Zhengzheng.","\"Mom, why don't you ask me what I want to eat?\" Shen Lv asked.","Fang Yue didn't even bother responding to Shen Lv, not even looking at him.","\"Grandma, Zhengzheng wants meat.\"","\"Okay, grandma will make it for you. You stay with mommy, grandma is going to the kitchen right now.\"","Fang Yue walked into the kitchen, where there were maids cooking, but she wanted to personally cook a meal for her daughter.","\"Play with cars.\" Zhengzheng wanted to get down, so Shen Yin let him down.","The little one actually pulled Shen Lv's hand and ran to the carpet area. He handed the excavator to Shen Lv, while he himself held the cool red car that could flip over.","\"Race.\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Lv didn't understand what Zhengzheng meant, so he turned to look at Shen Yin.","If it was when Shen Yin had just arrived, she wouldn't have known what \"race\" meant either. But now it was different, she had been taking care of Zhengzheng for so long that she understood his every action.","\"He wants to race with you. You use the excavator, he uses the little car, and you two race to see who's faster and who can knock the other one over.\"","\"Wow, how did you know that?\" Shen Lv looked shocked.","\"Ahem, there's a kid here. If you use your brain, you can figure it out. You play with Zhengzheng, I'll go to the kitchen and help mom cook.\"","Shen Yin turned and entered the kitchen, leaving Shen Lv dazed. Did his sister just imply that he's brainless?","Shen Lv didn't accept it. How could he be brainless? Hadn't the company been running smoothly under his management lately?","When he came to his senses and wanted to retort, Shen Yin had already gone into the kitchen.","\"Zhengzheng, look at your uncle. Uncle has such a low status in the family - dad doesn't love me, mom doesn't love me, and even my sister thinks I'm brainless. Wah wah wah, you're the only one who treats uncle well now.\"","\"Race,\" Zhengzheng handed the excavator to Shen Lv.","\"Okay Zhengzheng, uncle will race with you. From now on at home, you protect uncle.\"","\"Okay!\" The little one responded loudly.","The two reached an agreement and started playing happily.","In the kitchen, the maid had prepared all the ingredients. After Shen Yin came in, she said, \"Mom, let me do it, you can assist me.\"","\"Great. I feel so blessed now, my daughter is so capable. If your brother was half as worry-free as you, I'd be content,\" Fang Yue sighed.","Shen Yin: \"I used to cause you even more worry before.\"","\"Ah, you were different. You were just sick back then. You used to be so obedient and sensible, always thinking about your parents. Much better than your brother, who has been causing trouble since he was little. He's already so old but still doesn't have a partner.\"","\"The right time hasn't come yet. He'll get married naturally when it does.\"","\"Look at you, still defending your brother,\" Fang Yue stretched her neck to look into the living room.","She continued, \"If it weren't for Zhengzheng willing to play with him, I would have chased him out to the company.\"","Shen Yin laughed: \"Mom, you may complain about him, but in reality, you still worry about him and care for him, don't you?\"","\"You're right.\" Fang Yue brought the washed vegetables to Shen Yin and asked, \"What are you preparing to make?\"","\"Golden Chicken.\"","\"I've never seen such a complicated method for cooking chicken.\"","Shen Yin smiled without responding. Golden Chicken is a famous dish from the Zhejiang and Fujian regions. Its color resembles gold, hence the name. To make Golden Chicken: Use boiling water to remove the chicken feathers, then add sesame oil, salt, and water to boil the chicken with scallions and Sichuan peppercorns. Once cooked, cut into cubes. The original broth can be used separately. If paired with rice wine, one can taste the joy Li Bai described in his poem when he was summoned to the Tang capital by Emperor Xuanzong: \"White wine freshly brewed, returning from the mountains. Yellow hens plump on buckwheat in autumn. Call a lad to cook the hen, pour white wine. Children laughing, tugging at my robes.\"","The chicken Shen Yin was holding had already been defeathered, so she simply washed it and followed the recipe from memory.","\"And what's this?\" Fang Yue saw Shen Yin holding a sea bass and realized that her daughter's every action was beyond her expectations.","\"Zhengzheng likes fish, so I'm making sea bass for her.\"","\"This way of cooking is also so complicated. Mom has never seen anything like it. Where did you learn it from?\"","\"I read it in a cookbook - it was a book of ancient recipes. I was bored every day with nothing to do, so I studied it. This is called 'Sea Bass Delicacy', a traditional famous dish from the Song Dynasty in Suzhou and Hangzhou. According to records in the 'Tai Ping Guang Ji' by Li Zhan and others from the Song Dynasty, to make Sea Bass Delicacy, one must use sea bass caught in the 8th or 9th lunar month when the first frost arrives. Select those around 3 feet or smaller to make dried sea bass. After salting it, wrap it in cloth to drain the water, then lay it on a plate. Separate it with fragrant osmanthus flowers and leaves, finely chopped, and toss everything together. The sea bass caught after the first frost has flesh as white as snow and doesn't have a fishy smell. As the Tang Emperor said, 'Golden Delicacies are delicacies from the Southeast region.' The purple flowers, green leaves, and white sea bass delicacy laid out separately on the plate look fresh and lovely. It's not the right season now, but since the sea bass is still quite fresh, I'm using a different cooking method, but the taste should still be good.\"","As Shen Yin spoke, she placed the sea bass on a plate and poured the prepared sauce over it.","\"It's not even cooked yet, but I can already feel how appetizing it is. My little daughter-in-law is really too brilliant,\" Fang Yue praised her profusely.","Shen Yin made a few relatively simple dishes, but the golden chicken she had just cooked was now ready.","Golden yellow in color, it looked appetizing, and the aroma was mouthwatering.","A small and a large person came running into the kitchen from the living room.","\"Mom, it smells so good, what are you cooking?\" Shen Lv asked.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng smelled the meat scent, Zhengzheng is hungry,\" the child said.","\"Your noses are so keen that you could smell it as soon as it came out of the pot?\" Fang Yue asked.","\"Smells good, Zhengzheng is hungry.\""]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Five People Eating Dinner","paragraphs":["\"Mom, do you intentionally keep the good food from me? Why haven't you made a meal like this before?\" Shen Lv complained, now more convinced than ever, that his mother must have been hiding her culinary skills.","\"Go away, your sister cooked today's meal.\"","\"What?!\" Shen Lv was shocked.","Fang Yue lightly slapped Shen Lv's arm.","Shen Lv immediately realized his mistake, he couldn't help but blurt out a curse, but Zhengzheng was still around, it wouldn't be good to set a bad example.","Shen Lv covered his mouth, and slapped himself.","\"A slip of the tongue, a slip of the tongue.\"","Fang Yue glanced at Shen Lv and said, \"It's not mealtime yet, what's your hurry? The kitchen is small, you get out first.\"","Reluctantly, Shen Lv left the kitchen, standing at the kitchen door, poking his head in to look.","Fang Yue picked up Zhengzheng, took a pair of chopsticks, picked up a little chicken, blew on it, and fed it to Zhengzheng.","\"Come, grandma will feed Zhengzheng.\"","Xu Yunzheng opened his mouth and swallowed the chicken.","\"It's delicious, I want more.\"","Fang Yue picked up another piece.","Shen Lv was stunned, this was favoritism.","\"Mom, you're treating us differently. You kicked me out, but let me watch him eat. Mom, tell me, am I really your son?\"","\"No, you were picked up from the trash.\" Fang Yue turned around and said irritably.","\"When you get married and have children, I'll recognize you as my son.\"","Shen Lv emo, leaning against the door frame, looked at the kitchen with a face of melancholy. The three of them were happy and joyful, while he was alone outside the door, pitiful and sad. Ah, he's not loved anymore.","\"Go up and call your dad, it's almost time for dinner, and bring down his medication.\"","Upon hearing it was time to eat, Shen Lv ran faster than a rabbit, dashing upstairs.","\"He's such a big person, and he's not steady at all.\" Fang Yue said.","\"Uncle is not steady.\" Zhengzheng, who was eating happily, followed Fang Yue's words.","At two years old, children are just learning to talk, and they repeat whatever adults say every day.","\"Zhengzheng seems to speak clearer and more than his peers.\" Fang Yue sighed.","\"Yes, just recently, he suddenly started to say a lot more, and his speech is indeed clearer.\" Shen Yin said.","Over this period, Zhengzheng really has been saying a lot every day. This is a lot better than when she first arrived here, back then, Zhengzheng was unwilling to talk, only saying simple words like dad, grandma, rice, meat.","Now, looking at him, he's improved a lot.","\"He can even recite poetry.\" Shen Yin said.","\"Can he recite a poem for grandma?\" Fang Yue teased the baby.","Zhengzheng struggled to get down, indicating that he wanted to get off.","Fang Yue put Zhengzheng down.","Zhengzheng, not knowing who he learned it from, cleared his throat. \"In front of the bed a pool of bright moonlight, suspected frost on the ground. Looking up at the bright moon, looking down I think of home.\"","\"Wow, that's amazing, Zhengzheng is so smart. Grandma will give you a kiss.\" Fang Yue was ecstatic, her grandchild was so smart, he recited the poem without missing a single word.","\"Zhengzheng, come here, let grandpa see you.\" Shen Tianzheng was coming down from upstairs when he saw his grandchild standing in the kitchen, standing obediently.","\"Grandpa Nao.\" After Zhengzheng finished reciting, Fang Yue rewarded him with a piece of meat. He chewed and answered Shen Tianzheng's question.","\"It's grandpa, not Grandpa Nao.\" Shen Tianzheng corrected.","\"It's Grandpa Nao, not Grandpa Nao.\" Zhengzheng repeated, his mouth full of food, still unable to speak clearly.","\"Mom, are we ready yet? I've cleaned up the table.\" Shen Lv approached from behind Shen Tianzheng and peeked around.","\"You're the one in a hurry. Come and carry the bowls, Zhengzheng, you go with grandpa to the dining room outside. We'll be ready to eat soon,\" Fang Yue bent over and told Zhengzheng.","\"Okay, Grandpa Nao, let's go sit on the chairs.\" Xu Yunzheng reached out, took Shen Tianzheng's hand, and Shen Tianzheng was so moved that he almost shed tears.","\"Mom, I'll carry the dishes.\" Shen Lv walked into the kitchen.","\"You carry the rice. I don't trust you with the dishes.\" Fang Yue looked disgusted, fearing Shen Lv would finish the food before it got to the table, even though it was only two steps away.","Shen Lv replied, \"Okay, I'll listen to mom.\"","Once everyone was seated, Shen Lv could hardly wait.","\"Alright, let's eat.\" Fang Yue gave the signal, and only then did Shen Lv dare to pick up his chopsticks.","Shen Lv had been yearning for the golden chicken, so he picked that first.","\"It's so delicious.\" He wasn't exaggerating at all.","Out of everyone at the table, only Shen Lv hadn't tasted Shen Yin's cooking, so he was the one making a fuss.","\"Uncle is choking.\" Xu Yunzheng didn't touch his chopsticks, he just watched Shen Lv eat.","After all, he hadn't seen such a wolf-like eating habit before.","\"Your uncle isn't choking.\" Fang Yue told Xu Yunzheng.","\"Uncle, have some water.\" Xu Yunzheng passed his water cup to Shen Lv.","Shen Lv was touched. Finally, someone cared about him.","\"Zhengzheng, your uncle will give you a big red envelope for the New Year.\" Shen Lv didn't drink the water.","\"Slow down, you're eating like you haven't had a meal in hundreds of years. When have you ever lacked food at home?\" Shen Tianzheng looked disgusted.","Shen Lv muttered to himself that he wasn't lacking food at home; he just couldn't get back home.","\"It's so delicious. Little sister, can I live at your place? I'll pay for my living expenses.\" Shen Lv picked up another piece of fish.","\"With your ambition, you're already so old and still relying on your sister to cook for you.\" Fang Yue couldn't understand how her son was becoming more and more lacking in ambition. She and Shen Tianzheng weren't like this.","\"Hurry up and eat, then leave. Don't disturb me and my precious grandson.\" Fang Yue looked disgusted.","Shen Lv ate a lot, \"If you can't do it, just open a restaurant. I'll eat there every day.\"","Fang Yue, hearing this, hit Shen Lv's arm again.","\"Your sister doesn't lack money. She already has a studio. Why would she open a restaurant? Can she stand cooking for others every day? If your sister runs out of money, you have to support her.\"","\"Okay, support. As long as she cooks for me, I'll support her for a lifetime.\"","\"What do you mean by that? If your sister doesn't cook for you, you won't support her?\" Shen Tianzheng spoke again.","Shen Yin, watching Shen Lv being lectured, almost died of laughter. It was really funny. Why did she feel like Shen Lv was a mouse that everyone despised at home?","\"Uncle, take care of me,\" Zhengzheng suddenly looked up.","\"You have a dad, let your dad take care of you. Your dad is richer than your uncle. Your uncle doesn't even have financial control. All the money is with your grandparents.\"","\"But Uncle just said he would give Zhengzheng a red envelope.\"","Shen Lv was taken aback...","What, this kid has such a good memory. He remembered what he had casually mentioned earlier. Not only does he have a good memory, but his logic is strong too.","\"Sweetie, tell your uncle honestly, how old are you?\"","Zhengzheng counted on his fingers and then looked towards Shen Yin.","\"Zhengzheng is two years old.\"","\"Only two years old and such a good memory. Be honest with your uncle, did you not drink the Meng Po Soup?\""]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: Untitled 02","paragraphs":["\"He doesn't know what Meng Po Soup is,\" reminded Shen Yin.","\"Meng Po Soup, Zhengzheng wants Meng Po...\" Before he could finish his sentence, the child's mouth was covered by Fang Yue.","\"Eat meat.\" Fang Yue fed a piece of fish to Xu Yunzheng.","This desire for Meng Po Soup could not be spoken of. Fang Yue directly glared at Shen Lv, who was always talking nonsense.","\"Tasty.\" Zhengzheng danced with excitement.","Shen Lv had just finished eating. Before he could take a nap, he was driven back to the company by Fang Yue.","Fang Yue escorted Shen Tianzheng upstairs, Shen Yin played with Zhengzheng in the living room for a while until Zhengzheng felt sleepy.","Shen Yin saw Zhengzheng's eyes blink, blink, and blink, and in a short while, the little one lost his spirit.","Shen Yin carried Xu Yunzheng upstairs to her room.","Fang Yue came out: \"Yin Yin, you can sleep peacefully in your room. The maid cleans it every day, and the sheets and quilt covers are changed every week.\"","Shen Yin said okay, and then put Zhengzheng on the bed.","\"I'll turn on the air conditioner for you, and you can take a nap. After all, there's nothing to do this afternoon.\" Fang Yue walked into the room, took out the remote from the bedside table, and adjusted the temperature.","Shen Yin was indeed sleepy. After Zhengzheng fell asleep, Shen Yin also lay down.","\"You guys sleep first, call me if you need anything.\"","After leaving Shen Yin's bedroom, Fang Yue sat down in the small living room on the second floor, picked up the knitting needles next to her, and started knitting a sweater.","When she had nothing to do, she would have tea with her sisters. Since Shen Tianzheng became ill, she hadn't gone out much, staying at home with Shen Tianzheng.","Watching TV, scrolling through her phone, and when she got tired, she would knit. She had already knitted Shen Yin's sweater, and now she had two more in her hands, one for Zhengzheng, and one for Xu Xiuhe, both of which were nearing completion. She took advantage of the mother and daughter's nap time to finish them up. Once they returned home that night, she could let Shen Yin take them home.","By three o'clock, both sweaters were finished, and Fang Yue inspected them again. Her skills hadn't deteriorated. She had been a housewife for so many years, and all she knew was knitting. Many of Shen Yin's sweaters were knitted by her during her school days, and sometimes they looked better than the ones bought from the store.","Fang Yue was a bit worried. She wasn't sure if Shen Yin would dislike them now. When Shen Yin was in school, she liked wearing them. After all, a mother's handmade knit is love. But now, Fang Yue was unsure. Shen Yin was married, and there had been a gap between them for several years. She didn't know what Shen Yin's reaction would be when she saw these sweaters again.","While thinking about this, Fang Yue leaned on the sofa and fell asleep.","When she woke up, it was already late. Shen Yin had woken up, or more accurately, Xu Yunzheng had woken up first. She went downstairs with Zhengzheng.","Fang Yue opened the door to Shen Yin's room and saw that the bed looked like it hadn't been slept in.","She initially thought the mother and daughter had gone home and hurriedly ran downstairs to check.","In the living room downstairs, Shen Tianzheng was playing with Zhengzheng, and Shen Yin had dived back into the kitchen.","\"Grandpa, Zhengzheng can sing songs.\"","Shen Yin was in the kitchen when she heard what Zhengzheng said, she was startled. All Zhengzheng knew was the song \"Twinkle Twinkle Little Star\"; everything else was beyond words. Perhaps the tune of \"Twinkle Twinkle Little Star\" had grown on Zhengzheng.","\"What can Zhengzheng sing? Sing for grandpa.\" Shen Tianzheng was sitting on the sofa, with Zhengzheng standing barefoot on it.","Shen Yin immediately came out of the kitchen, still holding a kitchen knife in her hand.","\"Zhengzheng, recite a poem for grandpa, or we can play a game.\"","\"Okay!\"","Fang Yue walked to Shen Yin's side and said, \"Why are you still holding a kitchen knife? It's quite scary. You can let the maid cook, why are you in the kitchen again?\"","\"I'm free anyway, actually, I quite enjoy cooking.\" This was the truth. She really loved exploring various cuisines.","\"Is Xu Xiuhe coming tonight?\"","In the living room, grandfather and grandson were laughing and chatting, while in the kitchen, mother and son were having a sporadic conversation.","\"He's coming. I've sent the driver back. He'll pick up Zhengzheng and me tonight.\"","\"Isn't it too late at night? Won't you spend the night here?\" Fang Yue asked.","\"Maybe next time. I plan to move back to Ziyue Manor tonight.\"","\"You're not staying in the small building anymore?\"","\"The studio has stabilized now. The small building is a bit cramped, and Zhengzheng is growing up. It's not suitable to stay in the small building all the time.\"","\"Alright, then move back to Ziyue Manor. It's spacious and comfortable, and most importantly, it's safe.\"","Shen Yin was taken aback, almost cutting her hand while chopping vegetables. She hadn't told Fang Yue because she was afraid Fang Yue would worry. She hadn't revealed the most crucial reason yet.","But Fang Yue mentioned safety directly.","\"What's wrong?\" Fang Yue, seeing Shen Yin's movement with the knife, paused for a moment and asked worriedly.","\"Nothing.\"","\"Daddy!\" Zhengzheng walked barefoot towards the door.","\"Xu Xiuhe is here. You wash your hands and go out first. I can take care of the kitchen.\"","Shen Yin hadn't seen Xu Xiuhe all day. Hearing Fang Yue's words, she washed her hands by the sink.","In the living room, Xu Xiuhe picked up Xu Yunzheng. Seeing Shen Yin coming out of the kitchen, he smiled.","\"Xiuhe is here.\" Shen Tianzheng also stood up from the sofa.","\"Dad, how's your health?\" Xu Xiuhe walked towards the sofa.","\"Much better, there's no big problem now.\"","\"Sit.\"","Shen Tianzheng moved a bit on the sofa to make room for Xu Xiuhe.","After dinner.","When Shen Yin was saying goodbye to Fang Yue, Fang Yue suddenly remembered that the sweater she had knitted was still upstairs.","\"Wait a moment, I'll go upstairs and get something for you.\"","Fang Yue moved quickly, went upstairs to get the sweater, and quickly came back down.","\"Mom, what is this?\" Shen Yin saw Fang Yue carrying several pieces of clothing.","\"I knitted these sweaters for you. Autumn is just a month away, so when I had some free time, I knitted a sweater for each of you three. I don't know if you'll wear them.\"","\"Thank you, mom.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin was also touched. She hadn't been spoiled by a mother since she was a child, and her father didn't love her later on. Fang Yue was really good to her.","\"What are you thanking me for? As long as you don't find it bothersome.\"","\"Mom, we don't find it bothersome.\" Shen Yin hugged Fang Yue.","Fang Yue was pleasantly surprised.","\"Don't worry, the wool used is the best and softest, it won't be uncomfortable against the skin.\"","\"Mmm, it's autumn, so I'll definitely wear it. Mom, we'll head back first.\"","\"Alright, drive carefully on your way back, and message me once you're home.\" Fang Yue, showing concern, reminded them.","Shen Yin agreed wholeheartedly.","Once they got into the car, Xu Xiuhe started it, and Shen Yin, sitting in the backseat, started to arrange the three sweaters that Fang Yue had just given her.","The sweaters were indeed soft, not inferior to those bought from stores. Shen Yin felt them and compared the three.","They were like matching outfits for the family of three - in a light blue color, warm and comforting.","\"Mom has put in a lot of effort.\" Xu Xiuhe, glimpsing Shen Yin's actions in the rearview mirror, remarked.","\"Mmm, she's indeed been very good to me. By the way, why did you get off work so late today, later than usual?\" Shen Yin asked."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Liu Bo Meets the Parents","paragraphs":["\"Liu Bo had something to attend to in the evening, so he went back a little early, and I took care of the remaining documents.\"","Liu Bo was also driving, still on the road, with Xiao Li'er sitting in the passenger seat.","After pretending to be a couple, they hadn't had a chance to visit Xiao Li'er's family yet. In recent weeks, the company had been quite busy after collaborating with the Yang City Lin's Family.","Processing various documents and discussing various details.","Xiao's Father and Xiao's Mother had been urging Xiao Li'er, and Xiao Li'er waited until work was less hectic before telling Liu Bo that her family had been pressing her to introduce her partner.","Initially, it was just Xiao's Father and Xiao's Mother who wanted to meet him, but her brother Xiao Jun had been constantly fanning the flames with her parents, making them increasingly anxious.","\"Can you handle it when you meet my parents later? Will you be able to cope?\" Xiao Li'er asked.","\"A man can't say he can't do it. Didn't I handle it quite well last time? Don't worry,\" Liu Bo said confidently.","Hearing this, Xiao Li'er was much more reassured.","\"My brother is quite a handful. Be careful later and don't let anything slip. He's quite perceptive and has lots of tricks up his sleeve. From a young age, I don't know how many times he's played tricks on me,\" Xiao Li'er said.","\"Do you want me to get revenge for you?\"","\"Ah, no, no. Regardless, we can't let anything slip, or I'll have to go through blind dates again,\" Xiao Li'er emphasized.","Xiao Li'er's family lived in the old part of town, in a relatively old three-bedroom, one-living room house.","When Liu Bo arrived, he brought a lot of nutritional supplements and even an iPad for Xiao Jun, the latest model.","It was Xiao Jun who opened the door. Xiao's Father and Xiao's Mother had cleaned the house beforehand. When Liu Bo entered, Xiao's Mother was cooking in the kitchen, and Xiao's Father was helping her.","When Xiao's Father saw Liu Bo, he didn't go out to greet him, after all, when meeting his daughter's boyfriend, he had to maintain his composure.","\"Dad, Mom, we're back,\" Xiao Li'er squatted down, changed her shoes, and also brought a pair of slippers for Liu Bo.","After changing into the slippers, Liu Bo entered the house. He was a little nervous inside, but he tried his best not to appear too awkward.","\"Hello, Uncle and Auntie. The company has been quite busy recently, sorry for coming to see you so late,\" Liu Bo said as he placed the nutritional supplements on the floor and handed the iPad to Xiao Jun.","Xiao's Father had a stern expression and didn't speak.","However, Xiao's Mother hurried out of the kitchen, \"Now that you're here, why did you buy so many things?\"","\"It's not much,\" Liu Bo replied. For the first time meeting the parents, he couldn't just come empty-handed, could he?","\"You've worked hard, Little Liu. Next time, don't buy anything. We have plenty at home,\" Xiao's Mother said politely.","\"It's no problem, Auntie.\"","\"Dinner is ready. You can go to the bathroom and wash your hands. We'll eat soon,\" Xiao's Mother returned to the kitchen.","\"Wow, Brother-in-law, this iPad is the latest model!\" Xiao Jun exclaimed in awe.","The iPad Liu Bo gave him was indeed the latest model that had just been released, and it wasn't cheap either.","Xiao Jun immediately felt that this brother-in-law was a keeper. For the first visit, he even knew to bring a gift. Not bad at all.","\"Little Liu, these must have been expensive, right?\"","\"Not expensive.\"","Liu Bo and Xiao Li'er came out of the bathroom, and the dining table was already set with dishes.","Xiao's Father sat at the dining table chair without saying a word.","Xiao's Mother nudged him from behind, signaling him to put on a good face since it was his son-in-law's first visit, and it wasn't good to keep a straight face.","\"Come, sit down, Little Liu. You sit next to Li'er. I don't know your taste, so there are both plain and spicy dishes.\"","\"Thank you, Auntie, for your trouble.\"","Xiao's Mother also sat down. There was an awkward moment at the dining table.","Xiao Jun now treated Liu Bo as if he were his real brother-in-law.","Seeing Xiao Jun's shameless expression, Xiao's Father became angry and kicked him hard under the table.","However, because of Xiao Jun's odd sitting posture, he missed, and the kick landed on Liu Bo's leg instead.","Liu Bo was in pain, thinking he must have done something inappropriate, but Xiao Li'er didn't give him any hints.","Liu Bo looked at Xiao Li'er, but Xiao Li'er didn't understand why Liu Bo was looking at her – they weren't on the same wavelength at all.","But the way they looked at each other at the dining table made them seem like an affectionate young couple.","Xiao Jun was thoroughly enjoying the drama, but Xiao's Father was displeased. He kicked Xiao Jun again, but still missed.","Liu Bo turned to Xiao Li'er and asked softly, \"What's going on? Is there something wrong?\"","\"Nothing, we're just having dinner, what could be wrong?\" Xiao Li'er looked bewildered.","\"Sis, Brother-in-law, how long have you two known each other? How long have you been dating? How did you get together?\" Xiao Jun started gossiping.","These were precisely the questions Xiao's Mother wanted to ask as well.","\"I've known your sister for over a year.\"","\"He's my boss.\"","The two answered the first question.","\"When did you get together?\" Xiao Jun urged impatiently. Why didn't they just answer all the questions at once instead of one by one? It was like teasing people's curiosity.","\"We got together over a month ago, at a matchmaking event,\" Liu Bo said.","\"A matchmaking event?\" Xiao's Mother asked.","Xiao Li'er was afraid of slipping up, so she didn't dare to say anything. What if they said something contradictory and exposed themselves immediately?","Fortunately, Liu Bo had good mental composure and a clear mind, and he was quick to respond.","\"Our company's president is kind and was concerned about employees' marital issues, so he organized a matchmaking event. There were many people at the venue, and Xiao Li'er and I knew quite a few of them, but we felt they were a bit off, or rather, not suitable for us. Later, we sat together, had some food, and chatted. We found we got along quite well, so we got together.\"","\"I see,\" Xiao's Mother said, somewhat disappointed.","\"What does Brother-in-law do?\" Xiao Jun asked again.","Xiao's Mother wished she could give Xiao Jun a few extra chicken drumsticks. Some questions she couldn't ask properly, but Xiao Jun could.","\"I'm your sister's boss. I've been working at the company as a special assistant since the founding of the Heyuan Group. I've been with the company for a long time, so I'm considered a veteran employee. I also have some shares, so I guess you could say I'm a minor shareholder.\"","At first, when Xiao's Mother heard \"special assistant,\" she wasn't too pleased. Her daughter was already an assistant, and if her son-in-law was also an assistant, how would they make a living? But when she heard the latter part about having shares, she immediately changed her opinion.","Not to mention how many shares, she had always taken pride in Xiao Li'er working at the Heyuan Group.","The Heyuan Group is a rising company, with excellent benefits and treatment for its employees. The young president has developed the company into its current state in just two or three short years, earning everyone's admiration.","The Heyuan Group has shares, so even owning just one percent of the shares would provide enough income for two people each month.","Xiao's Mother was increasingly pleased. With shares in the Heyuan Group, she would be considered a minor boss within the company.","Excellent, with money and a job, Xiao Li'er would not suffer hardship.","\"Is your family in Rong City?\""]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: The Benefits of Having a Daughter","paragraphs":["\"My home is in Rong City. I grew up in an orphanage,\" Liu Bo replied with composure.","Xiao's Father and Xiao's Mother exchanged a glance, their eyes filled with a hint of sympathy.","\"It's alright, little Liu. From now on, treat this as your own home. We're all your family. Auntie isn't boasting, but the dishes I cook are quite delicious. Have a taste,\" Xiao's Mother said as she picked up the serving chopsticks and placed a piece of vegetable on Liu Bo's bowl.","Liu Bo was overwhelmed. \"Thank you, Auntie.\"","\"No need to thank me. We're family, no need for such formalities.\"","\"Yeah, brother-in-law, you should come over more often. My mom makes the most delicious sweet and sour pork ribs. Give it a try,\" Xiao Jun added another pork rib to Liu Bo's bowl.","\"Ahem, ahem,\" Xiao's Father pretended to cough from the side.","\"Is your throat not feeling well? Have some water,\" Xiao's Mother put down her chopsticks and handed Xiao's Father a glass of water.","Xiao's Mother and Xiao's Father had been together for so many years that she could understand his every gesture and expression, knowing exactly what he wanted to convey.","And his expression was so obvious this time that Xiao's Mother pretended not to notice his hint. Their daughter had finally found a potential partner, and he seemed like a decent man. If she went along with Xiao's Father, she might miss the chance to have a son-in-law.","At Ziyue Manor, after giving Zhengzheng a bath, Shen Yin placed her on the bed in her room.","When she and Xu Xiuhe were at Ziyue Manor, they were still strangers to each other, so they each had their own separate rooms.","But once Zhengzheng became attached to her, the little doll abandoned her own room and moved into Shen Yin's.","\"Why don't you sleep in my room tonight?\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"Why? It's more comfortable for each of us to have our own room.\"","\"Are you being serious?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yes, I'm serious.\"","\"I don't agree. What kind of married couple sleeps in separate rooms?\"","\"Didn't we sleep in separate rooms when we were at Ziyue Manor before?\"","\"That was when we were fake husband and wife. Now we're real husband and wife. It's different,\" Xu Xiuhe said solemnly.","\"Should I just tell you? I'm on my period,\" Shen Yin laughed.","\"It's fine, I can control myself.\"","\"You can sleep in my room, and Zhengzheng can stay in her own room. When she grows a little older, we'll turn your bedroom into hers, and her current room will become your walk-in closet.\"","Shen Yin...","This time when she returned, she felt that a lot had changed inside the house. The changes on the second floor were less noticeable, but the first floor's layout and decor were completely different.","What Xu Xiuhe had told her before was not a lie at all. He had replaced all the furniture on the first floor with Chinese-style furniture, and the decorative items were also ancient-style folding screens.","The modern decorative paintings that used to hang on the walls had been replaced with traditional Chinese landscape paintings. The overall decor and layout were clearly well-thought-out.","While going downstairs to fetch water, Shen Yin was drawn to the tea set in the living room and couldn't resist brewing some after examining the tea leaves.","Considering her special condition, Shen Yin brewed red tea, drinking only a small amount to be safe. After tasting it herself, she brought the remaining tea upstairs.","Xu Xiuhe was taking a shower, so Shen Yin left the tea on the bedside table and went to take a shower in her own room.","When the man came out, he drank the tea. Shortly after, Shen Yin came to Xu Xiuhe's room, carrying Zhengzheng.","\"Let me take him back to his room. You can get in bed and rest,\" Xu Xiuhe said, taking Zhengzheng from her arms and heading inside.","After Shen Yin got into bed, she picked up her phone and saw a message from Qi Ji.","[Sisters, I think I might be pregnant tonight.]","This message immediately got Shen Yin and Shu Yi's attention.","[How is it, does it hurt?]","[Weren't you two also...]","[Our Qi Ji is going to be a mom! I'm going to have another godchild.] Shu Yi's messages kept popping up one after another.","[Why not a goddaughter?] Qi Ji asked.","Qi Ji loved daughters so much. She could dress them up in all sorts of little dresses, wear matching mother-daughter outfits with them, take them out to show off, and hear them call her \"mommy\" in their sweet, childlike voices.","Just thinking about it was wonderful.","[Alright, a goddaughter, but that's not for you to decide. That depends on Xue Jingrui,] Shu Yi replied.","[I don't care, the baby in my belly will definitely be a little girl,] Qi Ji sent a \"hmph\" emoji.","[But it's just the beginning, doesn't it take some time before you can know for sure?] Shu Yi asked.","[It's not the beginning at all. It's been a long time, since last week or the week before. I feel like there's a baby in my belly now,] Qi Ji replied.","[Damn, so much happened while I was gone!]","[I have to say, Qi Ji is really impressive. As soon as she takes action, she doesn't do things by halves,] Shen Yin responded.","These two were much quicker than her and Xu Xiuhe.","[It's all for the sake of having a child. For the child's sake, Qi Ji needs to sleep now. You two sisters can keep chatting,] Qi Ji replied and put down her phone, preparing to sleep.","Xue Jingrui came in from outside, holding a glass of water in his left hand and a plate of fruit in his right.","\"Have some water and fruit. It's been a while since dinner, and after just now... you must be hungry,\" Xue Jingrui said, looking at Qi Ji.","Qi Ji sat up, and Xue Jingrui brought the glass to her lips, letting her drink the water.","\"Have some fruit,\" Xue Jingrui put down the glass, holding the plate in one hand and a fork in the other, feeding Qi Ji piece by piece.","\"I'm full.\"","\"Really full?\"","\"Mmhmm.\"","\"Alright then, no more.\"","Xue Jingrui set the plate aside and got into bed as well.","\"Jingrui, guess whether the baby in my belly is a boy or a girl,\" Qi Ji said.","Xue Jingrui...","\"I'm not sure if there's even a baby yet,\" Xue Jingrui replied.","\"There must be. I'm perfectly fine, and we've done it so many times without any precautions. It would be abnormal if I didn't get pregnant,\" Qi Ji stared at Xue Jingrui, making him feel uneasy.","\"I'll take some time off tomorrow to go to the hospital with you. We can check.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Why do you like daughters so much?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Do you really want to know?\" Qi Ji asked.","Xue Jingrui nodded and pulled the covers up, tucking Qi Ji in properly.","\"If we have a daughter, let's dress her up like a little princess. Buy her all kinds of pretty hair accessories, fluffy princess dresses... She'll look beautifully groomed and we'll be so proud to take her out. We can braid her hair into pretty little horns, buns, and bald buns. Even if I can't cut her hair myself, I can still trim her straight bangs. It will be so sweet to hear her call us 'daddy' and 'mommy' in her sugary baby voice. She'll be like an extra precious little padded jacket for us.\"","Qi Ji was quite a chatterbox, rambling on endlessly.","Xue Jingrui listened attentively, and after Qi Ji's words, he felt having a daughter would indeed be wonderful, a precious little padded jacket.","\"There's one more really important reason, can you guess what it is?\"","\"What is it?\"","\"If we have a daughter, we can marry her to Shen Yin's son Zhengzheng later on. That little baby boy is so handsome!\""]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Finals Scene","paragraphs":["At Ziyue Manor.","Shen Yin couldn't fall asleep, and neither could Xu Xiuhe. One felt regretful, thinking she shouldn't have been drinking tea so late at night.","Xu Xiuhe also regretted drinking the tea by his bedside so late at night, leaving them both unusually awake.","In the past they could've done other things, but now with Shen Yin's special condition, all they could do was stare at the ceiling blankly.","\"Can't sleep?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Mmm, can't sleep.\"","\"Then shall we watch a movie?\"","\"Sure.\"","Xu Xiuhe got up and adjusted the projector by the bed, which he had barely used before.","\"What shall we watch?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"The Little Prince,\" said Shen Yin. She had wanted to see it before, but had been too busy recently to find the time.","Xu Xiuhe found The Little Prince movie on his phone and began projecting it.","Just as they set up the equipment, the sound of thunder rolled outside.","\"I wonder if Zhengzheng will be scared of the thunder,\" Shen Yin said worriedly, hearing the faint rumbles.","\"Nah, the house is well sound-proofed. When it was built, they added insulation in the walls, so we can only hear it faintly. He's asleep, so he probably can't hear it at all.\"","\"Have you read the book The Little Prince before?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I think I read it when I was little. I still have some impression of it. The book was written by Saint-Exupéry for his wife.\"","\"Is it a love story?\"","\"It's a children's novel. The little prince travels to another planet and experiences all sorts of adventures. The little prince grows up along the way, meets many little companions. So he's not lonely anymore. He sees the world through a child's perspective, celebrating the beauty of humanity.\"","\"The visuals of this movie are so beautiful. And there's a lot of philosophy in it,\" Shen Yin mused.","\"Yeah, love is the sweetest subjection between two people. Just like us,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"I may not say sweet nothings, but I'll show it through my actions.\" Xu Xiuhe hugged Shen Yin.","After the movie ended, Shen Yin was still savoring it.","Hearing what Xu Xiuhe said, she suddenly sat up and turned to say, \"You can't say sweet nothings?\"","Xu Xiuhe nodded.","\"You still can't? You said plenty when you were pursuing me, you know.\"","Xu Xiuhe recalled, ah yes, during that time he might have read some domineering CEO romance novels, plus with guidance from Xiao Li'er, so he could talk quite smoothly.","Lines like \"there's no divorce, only being a widow,\" \"you don't need to do anything, I'll become the kind of person you like,\" \"one day I'll enter your heart.\"","He and Shen Yin had been together for two months already, which felt unbelievable. Every day was sweet, and he had found a sense of home.","They slept late, so they woke up late the next day too. After Zhengzheng woke up from the inner room, he saw his dad and mom still lying in bed, with the projector on the wall still running.","Zhengzheng climbed onto the bed and lay down beside Shen Yin.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng's awake,\" Xu Yunzheng said, looking at Shen Yin's face.","Shen Yin opened her eyes, rubbed them, and sat up. Seeing the faint light through the curtains, she realized she had overslept.","The baby doll happily stood up, wanting to go into Shen Yin's embrace, but ended up losing balance and falling right onto Xu Xiuhe, who was still dreaming as he sat up. Feeling someone on top of him, he struggled to open his eyes.","\"You're going to be late for work today!\" Shen Yin suddenly became fully awake.","\"It's fine, I'm the boss.\"","Shen Yin...","\"I was meaning to tell you last night, my embroidery competition this time is in Hua City. It's in two days, so I might have to go there tomorrow night.\"","\"Okay, I'll go with you,\" Xu Xiuhe said with a yawn.","\"What about the company?\"","\"Liu Bo is there. We're not too busy now after getting that partnership deal settled. The rest of what needs to be done these few days isn't much either.\"","The family of three took a flight to Hua City, which is north of Rong City. It was Shen Yin's first time on a plane, and Xu Xiuhe took good care of her the whole way until they got off and he brought Shen Yin and Zhengzheng back to his alma mater.","Along the way, since it wasn't the school semester yet, there were only a few students remaining on campus. Xu Xiuhe reminisced about his college life and youthful days to Shen Yin.","\"Ah, youth.\"","\"Yes, youth. It's a pity you didn't come into my youth earlier.\"","\"But I'm here now, and that's the best thing.\"","What Shen Yin actually wanted to say was, it didn't matter that she wasn't in his youth, because from now on she would be in every single day of his life.","But she felt that would be too mushy, so she couldn't get the words out and stopped herself abruptly.","She had walked the places he studied, seen the sights he saw, so there was nothing left to regret.","\"Why aren't you nervous this time?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Because I believe in you. I've seen your skills, you'll always be the champion in my heart.\"","\"And Zhengzheng is also a champion.\"","The national embroidery competition naturally gathered the top experts, so even the competition venue was much bigger than the one in Rong City.","At the venue, Shen Yin unexpectedly saw Qi Yan. She didn't understand why Qi Yan would come here too.","Shen Yin turned to look at Xu Xiuhe, who was also stunned for a moment. So there really were people who wouldn't let go, huh.","\"Why is she here?\"","\"Probably just here to watch the competition,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Just like last time, Shen Yin took her position.","The competition venue was quite noisy, with the top three from five regional competitions across the country present, making 15 contestants in total.","The top three winners would not only receive monetary rewards, but more importantly, prestige.","Their embroidery craft might not be as famous in other circles where everyone would know the big names, but within this circle, having a reputation meant not having to worry about the future and having good prospects.","The host went over the rules and revealed the contest theme. There would still be a two-hour break at noon as usual.","Shen Yin wasn't worried at all. With an inner strength, she would fear nothing.","Next to Shen Yin were the second and third place winners from the regional competition in Rong City last time. Shen Yin remembered them, though she hadn't memorized their names back then. But now, she knew.","Each contestant's table had a name card, which was how she also found out why Qi Yan was here.","It was because the woman sitting next to her, who also had the surname Qi, was called Qi Shengwen.","The Qi surname wasn't very common, and even more coincidentally, this woman named Qi Shengwen happened to be related to Qi Shengwu, who was Qi Yan's father from the previous competition in Rong City.","She saw the name and found it very familiar. After thinking for a while, she remembered the person, Qi Shengwu.","This explains the relationship between Qi Yan and Qi Shengwu.","Shen Yin noticed it, and the intelligent Xu Xiuhe also saw it.","\"Dad, Mom's competing.\"","\"Yes, Mom's competing, and she'll win the championship.\"","Qi Yan, who was a few seats away from the father and son, suddenly spoke up: \"It's too early to say who will win the championship.\"","The woman's gaze was fierce as she glanced towards Zhengzheng."]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: Double-sided Embroidery","paragraphs":["The woman's voice was shrill, even grating.","Zhengzheng was scared, never having been yelled at so loudly or seen such a ferocious glare.","Zhengzheng looked at Xu Xiuhe, pouting with a pitiful expression before burying himself into Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","\"Daddy, bad person. Huahua didn't come.\"","The little one still remembered what he said last time about bringing Huahua to bite the bad person. But now, Huahua wasn't here, and the bad person was intimidating him with her glare.","Zhengzheng was cowed, not verbalizing his fear, but his body had already shown it.","Xu Xiuhe gently patted Zhengzheng's back, and only after the little one stopped trembling did he feel reassured.","Xu Xiuhe shot an icy glance at Qi Yan, sending a chill as if the surrounding temperature had dropped.","Qi Yan felt fear, trying to muster her courage and change her sitting posture, but still feeling the sudden coldness as if trapped in an ice cellar.","\"Ahem.\" The woman felt uneasy, not daring to look at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Purposefully venting emotions, showing off force, and provoking others without cause constitute the crime of picking quarrels and making trouble. Serious cases may constitute the crime of intimidation. According to the law, anyone who commits one of the following acts shall be detained for no more than five days or fined no more than 500 yuan; in more serious cases, the offender shall be detained for more than five days but less than ten days, and may also be fined no more than 500 yuan.\" Xu Xiuhe stared at the woman.","During his studies, he had read many books about law, and after having Zhengzheng, he had also read extensively on child protection laws.","Qi Yan didn't dare say a word. She wasn't afraid of the punishments Xu Xiuhe mentioned; her father was about to become a high-ranking official in Rong City. What did she have to fear?","She just hadn't expected the person who had once cared for her so dearly to now speak in such a cold manner. Although she had a feeling, hearing it still made her sad.","\"The competition officially starts. Participants, please check if the tools on your table are complete.\"","Shen Yin glanced over them and began conceptualizing what to embroider this time.","\"All contestants here today are skilled, so for this final round, we won't set a topic. Contestants, feel free to express yourselves and strive to perform at your best in this competition.\"","As soon as the host finished speaking, the competition venue fell silent. Often, not having a set topic was the most challenging.","With a topic, one could focus their thoughts, and all contestants would be constrained within the same scope.","But without a topic, freely expressing themselves, became more difficult. The subject matter, embroidery techniques, and needlework styles were unlimited, and everyone's strengths varied. This free expression was a tremendous challenge for every contestant present.","Everyone was deep in thought, and even the spectators dared not make a sound.","Last time, Shen Yin had embroidered a piece called \"Lady Admiring Lotuses\" that she had conceived herself, both decorative and aesthetically pleasing.","This time, Shen Yin wanted to embroider a famous painting. She was most skilled in Bian Embroidery at the Great Prosperity.","At that time, literati and scholars adored calligraphy and painting, achieving high artistic accomplishments. Therefore, one of the major features of Bian Embroidery was imitating ancient famous paintings.","But she knew many embroidery techniques and needlework styles. If she simply embroidered a famous painting, wouldn't that be too easy? After much contemplation, Shen Yin picked up her needle, ready to begin.","Shen Yin held the needle vertically, without piercing the embroidery thread on the back. That's right, she was going to do double-sided embroidery.","Double-sided embroidery is one of China's outstanding traditional folk arts, originating in the Song Dynasty. It involves embroidering the same outline and equally exquisite patterns on both sides of the same base fabric in a single embroidering process.","Not many people knew this technique, and even fewer could embroider it beautifully.","The paintings \"Hundred Birds Paying Homage to the Phoenix\" and \"Peony of Wealth and Nobility\" were very similar.","Shen Yin had a deep impression of these two paintings. Since they were so alike, she could embroider them on both sides simultaneously.","Double-sided embroidery involves embroidering different patterns on the front and back of the same base fabric, so it requires high embroidery skills. Not only must the patterns be exquisite, but the thread colors must also be harmonious. Most importantly, the thread ends must be concealed, with no loose ends showing, and the stitches must be even.","As the canvas was small, Shen Yin could only rely on her memory to embroider the two paintings. She would cut the thread ends evenly, piercing from the top down, then lifting the needle two or three threads away and pulling the thread through, leaving a short end. When inserting the needle again, she would press the loose end down and conceal it with a few short stitches, ensuring no loose ends showed on either side.","Following this method, Shen Yin first outlined the rough contours of the two paintings with thread.","The paintings were quite large, but the embroidery cloth was limited, so Shen Yin had to proportionally reduce the size of the patterns on the cloth, even zooming in on specific portions, or what we would call close-ups today.","One side portrayed the phoenix, the other a peony.","Shen Yin embroidered for a while, then raised her head, stretching her neck. She checked the time on her phone; it was almost noon, with only half an hour left of the morning session.","Shen Yin looked towards the spectators' seats, where Xu Xiuhe was feeding Xu Yunzheng water.","When father and son noticed Shen Yin looking their way, Xu Xiuhe mouthed \"Keep it up\" to her.","Xu Yunzheng had just woken up and was about to loudly call out \"Mommy!\" when Xu Xiuhe covered his mouth.","After all, the venue was so quiet that they could hear the sound of the needle piercing the cloth.","\"Mommy saw us,\" said Xu Yunzheng, looking up at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Daddy saw that, but now it's competition time. Zhengzheng can't make noise, or else Mommy won't be able to concentrate on the competition.\"","\"Mommy's competing. Mommy's great.\"","\"Then encourage Mommy with gestures and cheer her on.\"","Heeding his father's words, the little one stood on Xu Xiuhe's legs, raising his hands over his head to form a big heart.","Seeing Zhengzheng, Shen Yin suddenly felt revitalized and full of energy.","She couldn't speak, but at that moment, she really wanted to go hug Zhengzheng. However, competition rules had to be followed.","Shen Yin also formed a heart gesture in response.","Seeing this, Zhengzheng was so excited that he almost jumped up, trampling on Xu Xiuhe's legs painfully. Not only were Xu Xiuhe's legs hurting, but he also felt envious, as his wife had never made a heart gesture for him.","He didn't care; this heart was meant for him, too.","In contrast to the father and son's joy, the envious Qi Yan didn't share their happiness, her gaze full of jealousy.","The woman clenched her fists tightly, she wanted to see if they could still laugh after the results of the afternoon competition were announced.","Shen Yin had rested enough, and lowered her head again, continuing to embroider.","She herself didn't have much confidence either, whether she could finish this double-sided embroidery piece. Being double-sided itself took more time than a single-sided one. The phoenix and peony, neither of which was a particularly simple pattern.","One feather too many, one petal too many, the patterns were inherently complex, and the colors were also numerous.","It had to be said that this embroidery work was truly a huge project."]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: The Meaning of Life","paragraphs":["Shen Yin could only speed up, her needle and thread weaving back and forth at a pace that left the onlooking audience in disbelief.","They could barely see the thread in Shen Yin's hands. Those sitting further away even doubted if this person knew how to embroider at all.","Come on, what was she doing? Who embroiders like that? Her hands were flying back and forth, as if she were merely threading a needle rather than creating a pattern.","\"The morning session ends here. We'll resume at 2:30 PM,\" the host announced. The 15 contestants stopped their work.","One difference between this final and the regional competition was that there were no judges present at the venue.","\"Zhengzheng!\" Shen Yin jogged over to where Xu Xiuhe was.","Xu Yunzheng, standing on the ground, also ran towards Shen Yin, hugging her legs.","Shen Yin bent down and gently rubbed Zhengzheng's chubby, collagen-filled cheeks.","Perhaps the meaning of mutual attraction is that both parties find happiness in each other.","Both the little one and the adult's faces were beaming with joyful smiles.","Qi Yan walked by, deliberately stomping her high heels to make her presence known.","Shen Yin chose to ignore her, pretending not to notice, but the little one didn't have such a strong heart to disregard the big bad person nearby.","\"Mommy, bad person, scary, hug,\" he said.","Shen Yin quickly picked up the little one, holding him protectively in her arms.","Xu Yunzheng rested his head on Shen Yin's shoulder, not lifting it up.","Xu Xiuhe came over and took the little one from Shen Yin's arms.","\"Zhengzheng is already two years and four months old, weighing 26 pounds now. He's getting heavy, and Mommy can't carry him easily. From now on, ask Daddy to carry you less often, okay?\"","\"Okay. Daddy hungry,\" the child responded.","Xu Xiuhe playfully said, \"Daddy's not hungry.\"","\"If Daddy's not hungry, Daddy no eat. Zhengzheng hungry, Mommy Zhengzheng hungry hungry.\"","Qi Yan linked her arm with Qi Shengwen's.","\"Auntie, how did it go? Was the morning session smooth?\"","\"It went quite well. I feel like I performed to the best of my ability.\"","\"Wow, Auntie, you'll definitely be the champion this time. During the competition, that Shen Yin didn't look like she was embroidering at all. She's no match for you, especially considering how much money we've spent.\"","\"Yes, I believe I'll win the championship this time,\" Qi Shengwen agreed.","Qi Yan's words made sense. They had spent so much money, and her embroidery skills were excellent. Winning the championship should be a piece of cake.","\"Auntie, if you win the national embroidery competition, you'll become famous. You'll be on national news and give interviews. After lunch, I'll definitely help you touch up your makeup. You'll look stunning for the interview tonight.\"","Qi Shengwen gently tapped Qi Yan's nose, smiling, \"You little sweet talker.\"","\"It's true! Auntie is naturally talented. After you win the award, my studio will also benefit. We might even surpass Shen Yin's clothing studio.\"","\"Of course, our Yan Yan has always been exceptional. I wonder which lucky guy will end up with you. Don't think about that Xu Xiuhe anymore. What's so good about a married man anyway?\"","\"Auntie, I just can't accept it. Why should I stop liking him just because he says he doesn't like me? I'm so outstanding, why would he marry another woman? Their relationship can't be real. I investigated, and found out it was an arranged marriage. Xu Xiuhe only married that woman for his company's interests. They're not truly in love. Even if I can't have him, I won't let them be happy. I'll keep annoying them whenever I can.\"","Qi Shengwen shook her head, not quite agreeing with her niece's perspective. There were plenty of men out there, why fixate on just one? If she remembered correctly, it was her niece who proposed the breakup in the first place.","Seeing her niece so obsessed now, she didn't feel it was right to advise against it. Let her be happy, she thought. If she said something and Yan Yan became upset, what then?","Her brother's political career was going so well, about to be promoted again. If he became the top leader in the future, she, as his sister, would enjoy countless benefits.","In the restaurant, Xu Xiuhe was serving food to Shen Yin. Zhengzheng hugged an ear of corn, nibbling on it like a little squirrel.","\"You worked hard this morning,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"It was okay, just felt a bit pressed for time,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"What happened? Was the embroidery too difficult?\"","\"Sort of, but not really. The embroidery itself isn't hard, it just takes time.\"","\"Did Zhengzheng and I distract you this morning?\"","\"No, I caught up later. If I speed up a bit more in the afternoon and make some progress, I should be able to finish.\"","\"Alright, I've booked a room nearby. After lunch, let's rest for a while so you'll have energy for the afternoon competition.\"","\"Sounds good.\"","Shen Yin didn't feel tired at all now. This man always seemed to arrange everything whenever they went out together, never letting her worry about anything.","\"Even if you don't win the championship, it's okay. The extraordinary distant future always entices us with fantasies, but when we let go of our obsessions and learn to enjoy the ordinary, life is full of surprises everywhere. You don't need to be so tired. You have Zhengzheng, and you have me. We'll always stand behind you.\"","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng will always stand behind you!\" the child chimed in.","\"Wow, why so emotional all of a sudden? Don't you trust me? Believe in me, Mommy will definitely be the champion,\" Shen Yin said, pinching Zhengzheng's little cheeks.","\"Have you heard this saying? If one day we're lost in the sea of humanity, living an ordinary life, it must be because we haven't tried hard enough to live abundantly. Life is a process of constantly moving towards new stages. We can't stagnate; we always need to look forward and strive to enrich ourselves. I believe I can do it, but if I lose and don't win the championship, I won't be discouraged.\"","\"The Creator's arrangements are all reasonable. This includes all the setbacks we encounter and the various obstacles we face. They all have their rationality, just like how I met you. If I can't win the championship, it's okay. I still have the next competition.\"","Shen Yin shared a long reflection on life.","After listening, Xu Xiuhe also found it very reasonable. Isn't living about having one goal after another? Shen Yin's thoughts were clear, and her values were positive. Perhaps it was this aspect that attracted him to her.","When the afternoon competition began, six judges had arrived. Upon seeing these judges, Qi Yan felt reassured. Out of the six judges, she had spent money to establish connections with four of them.","Four judges—what did that mean? It was a clear majority. She had pulled many strings and spent a considerable amount of money to secure these connections. What did she have to fear? This afternoon, she was eager to witness that woman's crestfallen expression and the look of defeat on her face.","What was so impressive about being the regional champion? In the finals, that title would mean nothing when it came to winning the grand prize."]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: Phoenix Peony Embroidery","paragraphs":["Shen Yin didn't dare waste a single moment of the afternoon. She was completely immersed in her embroidery, as if everything around her ceased to exist.","After what seemed like an eternity, Shen Yin finally completed her piece. She looked up at the clock: 4:48 PM. That was close.","Many of the people around her had already stopped working.","The competition host called time, announcing the end of the contest.","\"At 7 PM, we will announce the results of this competition and hold the awards ceremony in Times Square, just outside this venue. Contestants may now proceed to the adjacent dining hall for dinner.\"","Shen Yin stretched her neck and flexed her muscles before getting up to walk towards Xu Xiu.","Confidence, it seems, is when you don't worry at all. Shen Yin felt she had demonstrated her true capabilities. In just six hours, she had completed a double-sided embroidery with two extremely intricate designs. She could hardly believe she had actually succeeded.","\"Let's go eat. I'm starving and want to have lots of delicious food,\" she said.","\"Alright, we'll eat whatever you want,\" Xu Xiu replied.","At Times Square, all fifteen pieces were on display. A giant screen played footage from the day's competition.","There was a red carpet and a judges' panel.","When the family of three returned, Qi Yan and Qi Shengwen were already seated.","As Shen Yin approached, Qi Yan gave her a particularly challenging look, her eyes full of provocation.","Shen Yin chose not to engage, acting as if nothing had happened. Her expression remained unchanged as she calmly took her seat.","\"Please welcome our judges to their seats.\"","The six judges from the afternoon's competition took their places one by one.","\"Now, we will announce the results of the competition.\"","Four of the six judges looked uncomfortable. They had accepted bribes and were supposed to have taken care of things.","But one piece of work had astounded them.","The phoenix has always held an important place in Chinese culture, and this piece stood out among the others in both design and symbolism.","For a skilled embroiderer, such a piece would typically take at least three days to complete, yet it had been finished in just six hours.","When they touched the piece, they found the stitches even and dense. To their astonishment, they felt embroidery on the other side as well. When they turned it over, they were shocked.","On the reverse side was a blooming peony.","Double-sided embroidery! As judges, they had seen many such pieces in embroidery competitions over the years, with some even winning championships.","But the double-sided embroideries they had seen before were simpler, easier, with less complex lines.","They were all well-versed in ancient culture and had studied folk art, with some background in fine arts. If they weren't mistaken, both sides of this piece were reproductions of famous paintings.","\"The Hundred Birds Paying Homage to the Phoenix\" and \"Peony of Wealth and Honor.\"","Their expressions changed. This piece had surely set a record for the embroidery competition.","Completing such a work in just six hours—what else could it be but a miracle?","\"The younger generation is truly admirable and formidable!\" one judge exclaimed.","The judges who had accepted bribes looked troubled. Anyone who wasn't blind could see that among the 15 contestants' works, this one stood out remarkably.","\"The phoenix and peony, double-sided embroidery. This piece deserves nothing less than the championship!\"","One judge remarked, so moved that tears nearly fell from his eyes.","Indeed, this work was not just one, but several levels above the other 14 pieces.","The bribed judges exchanged glances. Originally, only one of them had accepted money.","But the person who offered the bribe had asked that judge to reach out to the others as well.","He had wanted to refuse, but the woman had offered far too much. He simply couldn't resist.","These judges all moved in the same circles and naturally knew each other well. They knew who among them could be tempted by money and who remained impartial and incorruptible.","In the end, he had contacted the others and told them about the offer. At first, they all refused, saying it wasn't right, that this was a national competition meant to be fair and just, to select talent for the embroidery world. How could they accept bribes?","Then he mentioned the price: 5 million. The other three judges began to waver. 5 million, not 500,000—it was indeed a lot.","This judge added some embellishments, saying things like, \"This person's embroidery skills are quite good. They only came in second in the regional competition due to a poor performance.\" He also mentioned, \"This person has connections. Their brother is about to become the top official in Rong City. They have power and money, so there's nothing to fear.\"","In the end, they all took the money, with the lead judge receiving the most: 8 million.","But now, they were hesitant. They weren't blind; they certainly recognized the value of this piece. It might even be directly acquired by the Hua City Museum.","The judges moved to one side, away from the two who knew nothing about the bribe.","\"What should we do? If this piece doesn't win first place, we'll surely be criticized.\"","\"This is indeed a problem. We can't completely abandon our professional integrity, can we?\"","\"Who would have thought such a dark horse would appear and disrupt all our plans?\"","\"She's not a dark horse. We've seen her work from the regional competition. It was indeed good, but this piece—this must be her true ability.\"","\"Now the question is, how do we judge this? If we don't give her the win, we'll be criticized. Haven't you seen the big screen? They've been playing today's competition video non-stop. Her speed was unbelievable, it made me dizzy just watching.\"","\"How could she not be fast? This piece is a major undertaking. If she wasn't quick, how could she have finished it?\"","\"How about this: two of us give this piece full marks, and the other two vote for Qi Shengwen's work. In the end, whoever wins will be up to fate. At least this way, we won't have taken the money for nothing,\" one judge proposed.","\"That's a good idea, but which of us four is willing to play the blind fool? Are you willing? How about you?\" one judge asked, looking at the others.","They fell silent. No one wanted to be criticized or admit to being blind to quality.","The two judges beside them, oblivious to the situation, were incredibly excited. They rushed over and said, \"What are you four discussing? I have a feeling that this piece will go viral instantly. When that happens, it won't just be the embroidery community taking notice—even the general public will find it unbelievable. They might even be utterly shocked.\"","\"Yes, yes, of course,\" the four agreed, their tone somewhat perfunctory.","\"That's fantastic! When the President of the People's Alliance arrives later, she'll be amazed too. I'm sure she'll sing its praises.\"","\"What? Are you saying the President is coming here later?\"","\"That's right.\"","\"Why would she come? She's never attended before, has she?\""]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: The Chairman of the People's Alliance","paragraphs":["Just as they finished speaking, a black car pulled up in Times Square.","Many staff members approached, opening the car door.","An elderly lady with silver hair, leaning on a pure black cane, stepped out.","The old lady wore high heels, though not very tall ones, and a black cheongsam that gave her an extraordinary air of elegance.","The commotion was quite noticeable, and many people in Times Square looked over. Most didn't recognize who she was, but were impressed by the grand reception and staff coming to greet her.","Among them were some who had participated in multiple competitions and recognized this old lady, such as Qi Shengwen.","Su Jin's arrival made Qi Shengwen's already unsettled heart even more nervous. This old lady was known for her unwavering integrity and had an extremely high reputation in the embroidery world. Moreover, it was said that she had connections in Beijing, with not only capital but also government backing.","Qi Shengwen began to worry, fearing that her championship might slip away due to the old lady's arrival.","\"Aunt, what's wrong? You look a bit off. Who is that old woman?\" Qi Yan asked.","Qi Shengwen gripped Qi Yan's hand, which was sweaty. Qi Yan felt uncomfortable and tried to pull away.","Unexpectedly, Qi Shengwen's grip tightened, and she couldn't break free.","\"Yan Yan, she's the President of the People's Alliance, with an extremely high reputation in the embroidery world. Basically, no one dares to contradict what she says. I'm afraid our plan might fall through.\"","Qi Yan turned to look at Su Jin, who was leaning on her cane with white hair, and thought dismissively that an old woman couldn't cause much of a stir.","\"Aunt, don't worry. We have four people, and even if she joins in, you and that Shen Yin woman are still tied. It's not certain who will be the champion in the end,\" Qi Yan reassured her.","Qi Shengwen felt a little more at ease.","On the other side, the six judges had already cast their votes. Originally, two were going to vote for Qi Shengwen, but upon seeing Su Jin arrive, they changed their minds.","They weren't fools. 5 million was indeed a lot, but they were all nearing retirement age. They couldn't risk their reputation for 5 million and end up being labeled as blind judges.","\"Are the results out?\" Su Jin walked to the judges' table. The judges who had just finished scoring and voting had also returned.","Seeing Su Jin, none of them dared to sit down.","\"All votes have been cast. The results will be out in two minutes,\" one judge said.","\"How's the quality of this year's works? Are there any particularly outstanding pieces?\" Su Jin had always had great confidence in Shen Yin's embroidery skills. She knew that with this young lady present, the competition wouldn't be ordinary. But she still asked the question.","It wasn't for any other reason; she just wanted to know if the person she had her eye on could win others' recognition.","\"There's a double-sided embroidery of a phoenix and peony that can truly be called divine. Let's not even discuss whether anyone else could create such a piece; even if they could, it would probably take at least half a month. But this contestant completed it in just six hours.\"","\"Oh? I really must go and see this,\" Su Jin was very interested. She had a feeling that this double-sided phoenix and peony embroidery was done by the young lady she had her eye on.","\"Where is it? I'd like to take a look.\"","One of the judges led the way. As Su Jin walked towards Shen Yin's work, she didn't forget to look at the other contestants' pieces. Overall, they were quite good.","The other works had vibrant and colorful embroidered patterns, some with flowers, some with birds, some with people. There was a wide variety of styles.","Su Jin was satisfied. She arrived beside the \"Phoenix and Peony\" piece.","She looked at it for a good while, then reached out to gently touch it.","Afterward, she returned to the judges' table.","\"Are the results out?\" Su Jin asked.","\"Yes, the final champion is Shen Yin, the winner from the Rong City Area competition,\" the host said.","\"Then let's announce it.\"","Su Jin was quite pleased. Her judgment hadn't been wrong; the person she had her eye on hadn't disappointed her.","\"Now, may we ask the contestants and audience to quiet down. We will announce the competition results. Afterwards, the audience can approach the works to appreciate up close the beauty of our embroidery and traditional art.\"","The venue quieted down, as the exciting moment was about to arrive.","\"Third place goes to Qi Shengwen, second place to Liu Ruchu. And the first place is...\"","The host paused here, deliberately creating suspense.","\"First place goes to Shen Yin from the Rong City Area!\"","Hearing this, Qi Yan's eyes turned red with anger. Qi Shengwen wasn't faring much better. She had expected first place, and even second would have been acceptable now, but she ended up in third.","She was quite old now, and had participated in every embroidery competition since they began. To be honest, making it to the top three this year was already a good result, better than in previous years.","But she wasn't happy. Simply put, the gap between expectation and reality was too large. She had thought she would be the champion, but now...","Qi Yan was envious. She had spent over 20 million to pull strings for Qi Shengwen, hoping she could win the championship and prevent Shen Yin from having such smooth sailing. Now the money was spent, but why was the result so different from what she had expected?","What were those four judges doing? It was just a simple matter of voting and scoring. Why couldn't they just do as she said? And her aunt, Qi Shengwen, was too incompetent. Couldn't she have embroidered better, leaving Shen Yin no chance of winning?","The two women had different thoughts, but they shared one thing in common: neither was happy. One was angry, the other envious.","As for this result, Shen Yin didn't have much of a reaction. She just smiled slightly, as it was within her expectations.","\"Now, may we invite the top three to walk onto the red carpet. Our President of the People's Alliance, Old Madam Su, will personally present the awards.\"","\"Mommy, amazing!\" Seeing Shen Yin walk towards the stage, the little one seemed to understand that mommy had won the competition and looked up at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Yes, mommy is the best. When mommy comes back, will you praise her face to face?\" Xu Xiuhe said.","The little one eagerly agreed.","The best is often saved for last. For instance, Su Jin presented awards to the second and third place winners before giving Shen Yin her award - a crystal trophy with a particularly exquisite emblem on it.","\"How are you? Tired?\" Su Jin approached Shen Yin and asked softly.","\"I'm fine.\"","\"You've worked hard. That piece was a major undertaking. I still can't believe it was embroidered in just 6 hours. Your embroidery skills are even more outstanding than I had imagined.\"","\"Thank you, grandmother. I didn't expect you to attend this competition,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Ha ha, isn't it to present you with the award? I haven't been to many of these before. When it's over, let's have a good chat in Rong City. By the way, do you think you'll still be busy for a while?\" Su Jin replied.","\"Huh?\" Shen Yin, holding the trophy, didn't quite understand Su Jin's words. Wasn't the competition already over? Why would she still be busy for a while?"]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Bribery Scandal","paragraphs":["Soon, Shen Yin understood why she felt so tired. What she faced next were various media outlets and interviews.","After Shen Yin and Su Jin were photographed on the awards podium, various media began to capture images of the \"Phoenix and Peony Embroidery\" piece.","Close-ups, full shots, and videos were taken.","Those who were knowledgeable in the field certainly understood how much effort this work required.","Those who weren't experts were simply amazed. The phoenix was embroidered so vividly, with rich colors. They never imagined that someone could embroider so perfectly.","In no time, various media outlets rushed to report the news, which flew across the sky and occupied the front pages of major headlines.","When Shen Yin stood in front of the cameras, it caused more amazement among the crowd. Shen Yin was so young, just in her early twenties, yet she could create such a masterpiece. It had to be said that there were differences between people. Some people were born different - not only from good families and beautiful, but also successful in their careers, work, and love life.","Now, even in embroidery, she had achieved something unprecedented.","Seeing how young Shen Yin was, several judges fell silent. They didn't know how to describe this contestant and her work anymore.","After photographing the piece, reporters began to gather around Shen Yin. Xu Xiuhe, holding Zhengzheng, wanted to go to Shen Yin's side but was concerned that Zhengzheng might get squeezed in the crowd. So they stood quietly on the outer edge of the reporters.","\"First of all, congratulations to Ms. Shen for winning the championship in this embroidery competition. Ms. Shen is also the youngest contestant in the history of this competition. May I ask, what has been your biggest setback on this journey?\" a reporter asked.","This question truly stumped Shen Yin. It wasn't that she was being pretentious, but she really hadn't prepared for anything. If she had to say something, would the tiger-head shoes count?","\"The biggest setback was not knowing what to embroider during today's competition, and worrying that I wouldn't finish in time due to the tight schedule. That's why I didn't stop working throughout the entire process,\" Shen Yin answered very seriously.","People around her, upon hearing this, started to watch the video replay of the competition scene. The video also gave a close-up of Shen Yin.","Shen Yin's movements were indeed fast. It wasn't just that she didn't stop; every stitch was precise. Her speed was so fast that they couldn't even see clearly how she was threading the needle. Many people even thought the video was playing at three times the normal speed.","The reporter who asked the question laughed awkwardly and said, \"Ma'am, what I meant was, have you encountered any difficulties on your embroidery journey?\"","Shen Yin smiled and shook her head.","There really wasn't anything, except for being scolded by her nanny for being lazy in the past. Other than that, there really wasn't anything.","This answer was unexpected by everyone present. The interview was being broadcast live.","\"Ms. Shen, may I ask how long you've been learning embroidery?\"","\"Five years.\"","\"What kind of opportunity led you down this path?\"","Shen Yin thought for two seconds and said, \"I guess it was out of interest. I found it interesting, so I learned it.\"","Shen Yin felt that she had answered this question very well. Interest is the best teacher, after all. She couldn't possibly say that she was forced into it, that as a daughter of a great family, she had to start learning various feminine skills from the age of ten.","\"Yes, interest is the best teacher. Ms. Shen, you're so young yet possess such exquisite skills. What are your plans for the future?\"","\"To keep improving, I suppose. I don't know how to navigate the future path, so I'll just go with the flow and pass on these excellent skills.\"","The reporter fired one question after another, and Shen Yin truly understood what Su Jin's grandmother meant earlier about it getting more tiring. There were some questions she really didn't know how to answer appropriately, and her mind was racing.","For an entire day, Shen Yin hadn't stopped. During the day, it was physical labor; at night, it was mental labor.","The reporters also showed some tact, seeing that Shen Yin was tired, and didn't continue asking questions.","After it ended, Shen Yin went straight to Xu Xiuhe. The family of three left Times Square under everyone's gaze.","\"Tired?\"","\"Mmm, a bit.\"","\"Then let's go back, take a shower, and get to bed early.\"","After Shen Yin got into the car, it wasn't long before she fell asleep.","Zhengzheng wanted to say something, but Xu Xiuhe turned around and made a \"shh\" gesture.","Zhengzheng immediately closed her mouth, snuggled close to Shen Yin, and remained silent.","Qi Yan was in the restroom at Times Square. She had left her seat when Shen Yin went up to receive the award.","In the bathroom, Qi Yan pressed both hands on the sink, her eyes even redder than before.","Fortunately, she had kept some evidence of the judges accepting bribes.","The woman made a phone call, saying she wanted to release the bill records and videos of four judges accepting bribes. On one hand, the money could be recovered; on the other hand, if it was Shen Yin who had pulled strings and spent money, then tonight's interview would become a scandal tomorrow. At that time, she would be severely embarrassed.","After Shen Yin returned to the hotel, with Xu Xiuhe's help, she quickly took a shower and then lay down on the bed and fell asleep.","\"Mommy sleep, Mommy sleep,\" Xu Yunzheng said, running barefoot to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Yes, Mommy is tired and needs a good rest. How about Daddy gives Zhengzheng a bath tonight?\"","\"Okay!\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng into the bathroom. Over this period of time, Xu Xiuhe had already leveled up to become a successful dad.","For instance, he was now skilled at giving Xu Yunzheng a bath.","Online, Shen Yin's work, along with Shen Yin herself, had become famous. The grand champion of the National Embroidery Competition finals was a 24-year-old young woman.","Shen Yin's halo suddenly became incredibly strong.","But Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe knew nothing about this. The family of three had all fallen asleep until the next morning.","Xu Xiuhe was awakened by a phone call.","\"Hello, CEO,\" Liu Bo's voice was urgent.","\"What's wrong? Did something happen at the company that's so urgent?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"It's not the company. There's a problem with yesterday's National Embroidery Competition.\"","Xu Xiuhe instantly became alert and sat up. Shen Yin was also awakened by Xu Xiuhe's movement.","Rubbing her eyes, she asked, \"What's wrong? Isn't there nothing scheduled for today? Why are we up so early?\"","Xu Xiuhe turned on the speakerphone.","Liu Bo's voice came through from the other end.","\"There are now many media reports claiming that you bribed and bought off four judges, which is why your wife won the championship.\"","The couple was completely stunned upon hearing this. Xu Xiuhe had entertained such a thought during the regional competition, but Shen Yin had stopped him.","So how did this story about bribing the judges come about? Was it completely fabricated?","\"Look into the details of this for me,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Meanwhile, Shen Yin picked up her phone and opened Weibo.","[National Embroidery Competition judges suspected of accepting bribes, champion title is fake.]","The online comments were a mixed bag of reactions."]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Su Jin is Angry","paragraphs":["[Damn, I always thought the National Embroidery Competition was an authoritative contest. I never imagined there could be bribery of judges.]","[Plot twist, everyone! Yesterday the champion was so confident, now how will they save face?]","[You know what, this champion's husband is a famous entrepreneur in Rong City, worth billions. Bribing judges is nothing to them.]","[What a slap in the face!]","[And to think I was saying last night how beautiful and talented this woman was.]","[To be fair, even without bribery, her work could have won first place. After all, there are so many photos of the winning piece online, and even videos of the live embroidery. We can still judge for ourselves whether it's good or not.]","[I don't care, bribery is wrong. No matter how good her embroidery is, she's not a good person. This is cheating and she should be disqualified.]","[It's a shame that such a talented person has been caught up in this scandal.]","The online public opinion was roughly divided into three camps: those blindly criticizing, those believing the champion deserved the win, and those insisting that bribery was wrong regardless.","Also caught up in this storm were the four judges who had accepted money.","They were in a difficult position, unable to explain themselves. They had indeed taken the money, but they hadn't compromised their professional ethics.","The public outcry grew increasingly fierce, with more and more people criticizing them.","But then their bribery records were leaked online, showing hundreds of thousands of yuan in deposits.","If there was an innocent party in this bribery scandal, it would be Shen Yin, who had been unfairly accused of bribery.","Shen Yin knew she had nothing to hide, but in the age of the internet, public opinion could be deadly, and cyberbullying could put anyone in a difficult situation.","\"Don't be afraid, I've already asked people to investigate. I have friends in Hua City too,\" her husband reassured her.","Shen Yin nodded.","Su Jin called immediately.","\"Shen Yin, your work didn't need any bribery to win. You had the skill to win first place, and I saw how confident you were. So when I heard this news, I didn't believe for a second that you would do such a thing. Are you in some kind of trouble, or have you been wrongly accused? Tell your mother-in-law, and I'll stand up for you.\"","Shen Yin was touched by Su Jin's trust in her.","\"Mother-in-law, I didn't bribe anyone. I don't know what's going on.\"","In truth, Shen Yin had an idea of what was happening. It must be Qi Yan's false accusation, but she couldn't say it. She and Qi Yan had been at odds since that auction, and then there was that incident at Qi Ji's wedding. She wasn't stupid; Qi Yan had been at the competition yesterday. After a moment's thought, she knew Qi Yan was behind this.","\"Alright, I understand,\" Su Jin said. \"We've already reported this to the police. No matter what, we'll get to the bottom of this and clear your name.\"","After hanging up, Su Jin called a meeting. She wanted to know what those four people who had taken the money were thinking.","Qi Yan, blinded by hatred and jealousy, never considered the consequences of her actions, only looking at immediate benefits and not thinking things through.","Stupid and foolish, she hadn't considered that by exposing the four bribed judges, she was also giving them a chance to speak out. She only thought they would be too scared to come forward, but she hadn't anticipated that while they had indeed taken money, they hadn't followed her instructions.","Su Jin called the four judges into a separate room.","Su Jin's demeanor changed completely. At nearly 70 years old, she had seen her fair share of major events. She not only commanded respect but could also keep her composure in difficult situations.","\"Is the bribery allegation true?\" Su Jin's tone was unreadable.","Often, the calm before the storm is the most terrifying. If she had simply berated the four judges, they might have felt better.","But she didn't.","The four became even more nervous. Their lifelong reputations were already ruined, and now they deeply regretted it. Was it really worth it for a mere 5 million yuan?","\"The bribery is true,\" one judge said.","Another judge quickly added, \"We took the money, but we didn't compromise our professional integrity.\"","\"Oh? You took money but didn't compromise your integrity?\" Su Jin had never heard such an absurd statement.","\"That's right. Our final scoring still adhered to fair and just principles. We didn't deliberately manipulate scores because of the money.\"","\"Well, your professional ethics must be quite impressive then,\" Su Jin said with a sardonic smile.","Her expression made the four even more afraid.","Madam Su had always been their top-level leader, with a powerful background and a lifetime of achievements.","\"Tell me, where did you get the money from? Explain the whole process and the reasons behind it.\" Su Jin turned on her phone's voice recorder.","The other three judges looked at the one who had initially accepted the bribe.","This judge, feeling a chill down his spine, stammered as he began to explain.","\"Someone named Qi Yan got my number somehow and contacted me. She offered me 5 million yuan to give Qi Shengwen full marks during the scoring. I refused at first, but she said Qi Shengwen had the skills to deserve it, and she was just paying to ensure a guaranteed win.\"","\"Go on,\" Su Jin urged.","\"She also said she was the daughter of the deputy mayor of Rong City, with both power and money, and that the matter wouldn't be exposed. I couldn't resist and agreed, so she gave me 5 million yuan.\"","\"You agreed for just 5 million? If I remember correctly, none of you four are short of that kind of money. What about the rest of you?\"","Su Jin sat in her chair, holding her walking stick. Though advanced in years, her presence was still formidable.","\"The three of us were pulled in by him,\" the other three said in unison.","\"He pulled you in, and you just joined? Are you all so spineless? You're all respected figures in the folk art world, are you really so desperate for money?\"","Su Jin lost her temper, slamming her walking stick on the ground.","The four were so frightened they dared not lift their heads.","\"You, did you only receive 5 million?\" Su Jin pointed her walking stick at the judge who had spoken first.","\"I... eight... eight million,\" the man could barely speak coherently.","Su Jin was heartbroken. Their folk art community already had such a low profile, only wanting to promote traditional culture, relying on government support all these years.","Now they had become famous, but for all the wrong reasons, trending at the top of Weibo for half a day already.","\"What do you intend to do from now on?\" Su Jin asked calmly, her voice devoid of emotion.","\"We promise we'll never accept money again in the future,\" they replied.","\"Do you really think you'll have the chance to accept anything in the future? If we consider The People's Alliance as a martial arts sect, what I'm about to do next is to clean house.\"","Su Jin rested both hands on her cane.","The group, terrified, hurriedly begged for mercy.","\"Elder Su, we were wrong. We won't dare to do it again. We took the money, but we didn't compromise our professional integrity.\"","\"You shouldn't have accepted that money in the first place. This is a matter of principle. Even if I were to keep you on, how could you face yourselves? What would your colleagues think of you? Would you be able to show your faces? Would anyone participate in our competitions in the future?\"","Su Jin fired off a series of questions."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Online Public Opinion","paragraphs":["The group didn't dare to raise their heads. Su Jin looked at them, having said everything she needed to say.","\"You may go now. In learning your craft, you must first learn to be a decent person.\"","Like beaten dogs, they left Su Jin's office without ever lifting their heads.","Su Jin picked up her phone and posted the audio clip on Weibo.","She might be older, but she could still keep up with the times. Her smartphone skills were no worse than those of young people.","Su Jin's Weibo account had quite a few followers. As the chairperson of the People's Alliance, she felt obligated to step forward and clarify the situation immediately.","She had originally intended for the People's Alliance's official account to clarify the incident, but she couldn't wait. She knew that as soon as she posted an update, the official account would surely repost it.","This competition had indeed been an oversight on the part of the organizers. Out of six judges, four had accepted money from contestants. It was truly laughable when you said it out loud.","So when Su Jin posted on Weibo, her first sentence was to admit the mistake and apologize proactively. The second sentence stated that although the judges had accepted money, they hadn't been bought off.","The post was accompanied by the recent audio recording.","As she expected, immediately after she posted on Weibo, it was reposted by the People's Alliance's official account.","The incident had already been fermenting, consistently ranking among the top trending topics on Weibo.","Moreover, Shen Yin's work had gone viral beyond their circle. This was no longer just a matter for the People's Alliance.","When Su Jin posted on Weibo, she also included a hashtag, which was then reposted by many industry bigwigs.","Soon, Su Jin's Weibo post shot to the top of the trending list.","The comments section became a spectacle of people devouring the latest gossip.","Netizens were exclaiming \"Holy crap!\" in their minds at this latest twist. One plot twist had already shocked them.","The fact that four judges in a major national competition had been bought off was infuriating to netizens. It seemed that ordinary people indeed couldn't defeat capital, which was why the topic was so hot. They cursed at capitalism, cursed at Shen Yin, cursed at Xu Xiuhe, and even the stock price of Xu Xiuhe's Heyuan Group started to fall.","Liu Bo was sweating profusely in Rong City. The company held an emergency meeting.","Xu Xiuhe was also pulling strings to clarify the matter, but he was one step behind Su Jin.","Su Jin's Weibo post was incredibly timely.","Another twist, with the gist being: \"We're sorry, we did indeed accept money, but our scoring remained fair. Shen Yin's championship is well-deserved, and the bribery was done by someone else.\"","After listening to the recording, netizens started to pay attention to other people.","For instance, Qi Shengwen.","The recording clearly stated that Qi Shengwen had money and his brother had power.","[Damn, how should we comment on these judges? They took the money but didn't do the job.]","[Wow, I'm impressed, 666]","[So, my sister Yin is innocent. Someone else did the bribing. She's the most innocent one.]","[Exactly! I've been saying all along that \"The Phoenix Peony Embroidery\" completely crushes all the other entries.]","[In the end, I never expected it to be a plot within a plot.]","[I admit, I was a bit harsh on sister Yin earlier.]","[Guys, haven't you noticed this Qi Shengwen?]","Soon, Qi Shengwen's information was dug up. Qi Shengwen, from Rong City, brother is the deputy mayor of Rong City, has participated in the embroidery competition for five consecutive years, made it to the finals last year and this year.","This year, she placed second in the regional competition.","[Second place, a veteran contestant, should have some skill. Why would she think of bribing the judges?]","[If the bribe had been successful, it might have been worth it. But spending money and not succeeding? That's pure foolishness!]","[Who says it wasn't successful? Didn't she get third place in the national competition? That might be what the bribe bought. After all, a national top-three finish is already quite an achievement, very rare.]","[The person above makes a good point.]","[Hope they re-evaluate the scores. Anyway, I believe in my sister Yin's skills. She'll still be the champion.]","[Exactly! With real skill, there's nothing to fear. I've been following my sister Yin since the regional competition. She's beautiful and talented. Her approach in this final was so bold. She did double-sided embroidery, with a peony on one side and a phoenix on the other. Who else would dare to try that? Even if they tried, who could complete such a time-consuming and labor-intensive piece in just 6 hours?]","[My mom does embroidery. She does double-sided embroidery too, but even with a simpler pattern than this, it takes her half a month. So if sister Yin didn't get first place, then there really would be something fishy with the judges.]","[Oh my god, those four judges really crack me up. Taking money but not doing the job. In the recording, they were all so nervous, their voices were as quiet as mosquitoes when facing Old Su.]","[Speaking of Old Su, she's really impressive. Calm in the face of danger, with an imposing presence. Those people were probably so scared their legs turned to jelly.]","The People's Alliance official naturally paid attention to online public opinion. Currently, there weren't many negative comments about the People's Alliance itself. Most of the criticism was directed at the four judges and the person who offered the bribe.","Of course, there were also many people praising Shen Yin.","They also noticed that many netizens suggested re-scoring and re-voting on the entries, demanding fairness, justice, and openness. If that wasn't possible, they suggested letting netizens vote.","When this news reached Su Jin, she directly replied:","Cancel the third place of the contestant who offered the bribe, and ban them from participating in all future competitions held by the People's Alliance.","The result was quickly announced online, with netizens calling it deeply satisfying. This punishment was indeed appropriate, just like having one's score cancelled in a college entrance exam, leaving one in despair.","Moreover, this ban on participation was essentially equivalent to being placed on a permanent blacklist.","Xu Xiuhe's side wasn't idle either. They quickly found concrete evidence of bribery by their briber, and the name Qi Yan soon appeared in netizens' view.","[No wonder. So it's the deputy mayor's daughter. No wonder she was so bold as to attempt bribery all the way in Hua City.]","[If the daughter behaves like this, I wonder what that deputy mayor is like. Could he be a big tiger?]","[This definitely needs to be investigated. As the saying goes, 'like father, like daughter'. If she's like this, her dad probably isn't any better.]","Netizens quickly found footage of Qi Yan from the competition venue.","The clip where she said \"Who knows who will win the championship\" was suddenly dug up by netizens and posted online.","[The way she said that, it's solid proof of her bribery.]","[So disgusting, that expression is so disgusting.]","[Am I the only one who noticed she was saying this to that little darling?]","[The little darling is so cute, he looks like Shen Yin's son.]","[Damn, that woman called Qi Yan should be taken out and shot. The little darling is so adorable, how can she look at him so fiercely and speak in such a harsh tone? What if she scares my little darling?]","[Doesn't this little darling look like the main female character's son in \"Yanxi Biography\"?]","[Wow, sister, now that you mention it, it really is! I was wondering why there was no information about this little actor online. It turns out he's Shen Yin's son. This explains everything.]"]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Mutual Fighting","paragraphs":["Netizens were surfing the 5G internet, and it didn't take long for them to uncover various connections.","[I think I know this woman called Qi Yan. She's the ex-girlfriend of the Heyuan Group's CEO from their university days.]","[Wow, juicy gossip! I'm rich, can I dig deeper?]","[I know some inside information. This woman dumped the CEO.]","Qi Ji was frantically typing on her iPad, contributing to the online discussion. As an illustrator and comic artist, she had her own circle and was quite active online. This time, because it involved Shen Yin's sister, she was particularly attentive. Even before Su Jin posted on Weibo, she had already battled numerous online trolls.","[Wait, is this woman blind? How could she dump such an excellent man? Is this information accurate?] A netizen questioned.","[I remember now. The CEO of Heyuan Group started his own business after graduating from university. He's a self-made man.]","[So did Qi Yan dump him because she thought the pre-startup CEO was poor?]","Qi Ji was excited. This netizen was so smart! She immediately replied, [Sister, you've hit the nail on the head!]","[So now, that white lotus green tea bi*ch can't stand seeing others doing better than her. She's jealous of our Sister Yin, so she didn't want our Sister Yin to win the championship. She bribed the judges, but our Sister Yin's talent was so overwhelming that even after taking the woman's money, the judges were still convinced by Sister Yin's work.]","[Sister, I declare you the voice of the internet.] Qi Ji replied. This generation of netizens was indeed reliable, with their logic on point and master-level deductions.","[This woman is truly disgusting. How can there be such a shameless woman? Now that he's rich, she wants to come back? She should think about whether she even deserves it.]","This kind of person infuriated the netizens the most. Upon seeing this information, they instantly shifted their battleground.","Qi Yan's Weibo private messages were flooded with insults, and even her previously posted photos were now filled with abusive comments.","Sitting on the sofa in her hotel room, Qi Yan was furious. She could tolerate most of the insults, but she couldn't stand the numerous comments calling her ugly and saying that ugly people cause trouble.","She touched her face. How was she ugly? She used to have plenty of men chasing after her.","[You're a scumbag. Your appearance reflects your heart. Looking at how ugly you are, you must have done many bad things.]","After this message popped up, Qi Yan was so angry that she threw her phone across the room.","Beside her, Qi Shengwen looked dejected. All those years of hard work perfecting her embroidery skills had been denied and ruined in an instant.","\"Yan Yan, why did you throw your phone?\" Qi Shengwen reproached.","She knew the current mess wasn't easy to clean up, but no matter how angry one got, throwing a phone wasn't the solution.","\"It's none of your business. It's my phone, I'll throw it if I want to. Who are you to criticize me like this?\" Qi Yan's eyes were wide open, her face contorted with anger.","\"The urgent matter at hand is to find a way to remedy the situation, not throw phones. Besides, I'm your elder, your aunt. How dare you speak to me like that?\" Qi Shengwen stood up. If Qi Yan had a temper, didn't she have one too? If it weren't for Qi Yan's stupidity in releasing the information about bribing the judges, would she have ended up not even placing third?","\"How am I speaking to you? This is how I speak. It's all your fault. If you weren't so stupid, if your skills weren't so inferior that you couldn't even win the championship, why would I be called ugly by people?\" Qi Yan's voice was loud, almost hysterical.","\"I'm stupid? That's rich. You're the one who released the information about bribing the judges. Think about how stupid that was!\"","Qi Shengwen wasn't one to be trifled with. She had tolerated Qi Yan for a long time, and now Qi Yan was turning around and calling her stupid. How could she endure that?","Qi Shengwen stepped forward and slapped Qi Yan across the face.","She was already angry, and when she hit Qi Yan, she didn't control her strength. The slap sent Qi Yan stumbling back several steps.","Qi Yan lost her balance and fell onto the sofa. Holding her slapped cheek, she said in disbelief, \"You hit me? Do you know who my father is? If you treat me like this and my father finds out, you're finished.\"","\"Hahaha, I hit you, and I meant it. Qi Yan, search your conscience. I've treated you well since you were little, buying you clothes and snacks. I thought that's what an elder should do. But you've disappointed me too much. Who's your father? Your father is my brother, the deputy mayor of Rong City. Do you think he doesn't know about this big incident? Your father probably wants to hit you even more than I do. Given his temperament, he'll probably hit us both. Just you wait. When it involves your father's interests, neither of us will escape.\"","\"That's not true. He'll only hit you. I'm his daughter, he can't hit me.\" Qi Yan shook her head.","\"I called you stupid, and you really are stupid. Yan Yan, you weren't like this before. You had your little schemes, but you weren't beyond redemption like this.\"","Qi Yan heard Qi Shengwen call her stupid again. She couldn't reach the people online who called her ugly, but the person calling her stupid was right in front of her.","Qi Yan suddenly stood up and grabbed Qi Shengwen's hair, pulling hard.","Qi Shengwen didn't back down either, grabbing Qi Yan's ear. The two women started fighting.","In a hotel near Huazheng University, Xu Xiuhe looked at the situation that had been dealt with and sighed, \"Honey, it's my fault for being blind before. I'm sorry for letting you get caught up in this mess.\"","\"What's past is past. I have a clear conscience, and nothing really happened. Besides, it seems I've gained a new wave of fans. This time, the fans are from all over the country. It's not a loss. You know what? They call me Sister Yin.\"","\"They call you Sister Yin? What do they call me?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin shook her head. She didn't seem to have seen any nicknames for him online.","\"Oh, I remember now. They call you the self-made CEO.\"","Xu Xiuhe: ...","\"You've got a respectful title, I should have one too. If no one else will call me that, you should. Call me Brother Xu.\"","\"Brother Xu? Sounds a bit like 'hook' in Chinese,\" Shen Yin laughed.","\"Oh? You're getting quite bold.\"","\"You told me to call you that, Brother 'Hook'.\" Shen Yin repeated.","\"Alright, let's change it. Call me Brother Xiuhe.\"","\"Brother Xiuhe?\" Shen Yin's voice was soft and slightly playful.","Shen Yin was quite close to Xu Xiuhe, and this \"Brother Xiuhe\" made his heart flutter.","Shen Yin noticed Xu Xiuhe's gaze becoming different. It was broad daylight, and their son Zhengzheng was still watching TV on the sofa. They couldn't cause any trouble.","\"Ahem, how's your company's stock price doing now?\" Shen Yin attempted to change the subject.","\"Liu Bo just told me that not only has the stock price recovered, but it's also risen a bit compared to before,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Wow, that's great! This woman's move actually ended up benefiting us. Was she this foolish when you were with her before?\" Shen Yin asked curiously.","Xu Xiuhe didn't want to bring up that past anymore. How to put it... They were young back then, and maybe she was just a bit dim-witted, but at the time, he hadn't paid much attention and hadn't noticed.","\"We knew Grandma Su had an extraordinary background, but I didn't expect her to be this powerful,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"Yeah, this matter has gone beyond just the national competition now. Qi Yan causing this incident has had a negative impact, and she's not just an ordinary citizen's child either. In the coming days, we might see even more drama unfold.\""]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: Father Qi is Angry","paragraphs":["Rong City.","At the Xue family home, Xue Kai sat on the sofa, scanning online public opinion while his secretary brought him some documents.","It was the weekend, and Ye Rong was at home, having also seen various comments online that morning.","Initially, this was just an unfair embroidery incident, and at most they were concerned about whether Shen Yin had bribed someone.","Because of their connection to Xue Jingrui, they had watched Xu Xiuhe grow up. They didn't know much about Shen Yin, but during Xue Jingrui's wedding, they heard that the toast outfit worn by Qi Ji was designed by Shen Yin, which had earned them considerable face during the toasts.","So they had a good impression of Shen Yin, believing her to be talented, and naturally assumed she deserved to win the championship.","Now, surprisingly, it turned out that the person who actually bribed the judges was Qi Yan.","Who was Qi Yan? She was Qi Shengwu's daughter, which made Xue Kai and Ye Rong pay extra attention.","Qi Yan, as the daughter of Rong City's deputy mayor, had actually bribed the judges.","This would have a significant impact on her father, Qi Shengwu.","\"They've brought this upon themselves. Hasn't Qi Shengwu been making moves lately? The party secretary is already set to go to Hua City at the end of this month.\"","\"Do you think the higher-ups will come to investigate Qi Shengwu?\" Ye Rong asked.","\"It's hard to say, but they might,\" Xue Kai took a sip of tea. This incident was good news for him.","This Qi Shengwu was cunning and had always wanted to surpass him, even trying to bring him down. Fortunately, over the years, he had conducted himself properly and uprightly, not giving that old fox any leverage.","In the past, their relationship was decent, and he had even considered having Xue Jingrui marry Qi Yan. But Xue Jingrui always said Qi Yan didn't like him, so he didn't pursue it.","It wasn't until there was movement from above, saying that Rong City's top leader was to be transferred, that Qi Shengwu's behavior became increasingly suspicious. If he didn't understand the reason now, he'd be a fool.","At the Qi family home.","Qi Shengwu knew that Qi Yan had been spending more time with her sister Qi Shengwen these past few days. At first, he thought they were just getting along well and didn't think much of it. After all, Qi Yan had an impulsive personality and acted on her whims, so he didn't ask too many questions.","Now, with the incident trending at the top of Weibo and Qi Yan being cyberbullied, he began to regret not paying more attention. If he had, such a big issue might not have occurred.","This was happening at a crucial time in his career advancement. His sister and his daughter had caused such a big problem – how could he not be angry?","Neither of them was reliable. Qi Shengwu sat at his desk, holding an iPad, his entire body trembling with rage.","Qi's mother came in from outside. She had gone for a morning run and just had a shower, completely unaware of what was happening online.","\"Honey, what's wrong? Your hands are shaking,\" Qi's mother asked as she entered the study.","\"You have the nerve to ask? Look at what your daughter has done.\" Qi Shengwu threw the iPad at his wife.","Qi's mother stepped back in fright.","She took out her phone, glanced at it, then looked up guiltily and said, \"Yan Yan is still young, she didn't mean to.\"","Qi's mother knew about Qi Yan spending money to buy off the judges. Qi Yan didn't dare tell her father about this, but her own money wasn't enough, so she had to tell her mother.","At first, Qi's mother was reluctant, saying this couldn't be done now as her father was at a crucial point in his career. If it was exposed, it would cause trouble.","But Qi Yan repeatedly assured her that it wouldn't be exposed, that her father wouldn't find out, and that it would benefit her studio once it succeeded.","Qi's mother was already soft-hearted, and with Qi Yan's coaxing, she couldn't resist and gave her 10 million yuan.","\"What's with that expression?\" Qi Shengwu asked.","This question made Qi's mother even more nervous.","\"Were you also involved in this?\" Although Qi Shengwu's tone was questioning, he was already certain.","Qi's mother didn't dare speak.","Qi Shengwu wiped his face, tears streaming down. He couldn't afford an investigation from above. Right now, he needed to erase all previous bribery records that could be erased.","Online, the situation continued to escalate.","Shen Yin no longer wanted to pay attention to it. In any case, because of this incident, she had become the victim and received quite a bit of sympathy.","Of course, most of the comments were praise.","\"When are we going back to Rong City?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"The flight is this afternoon. We'll go down for lunch first, rest a bit, then head straight to the airport.\"","\"So soon?\" Shen Yin asked.","They had arrived the day before yesterday and participated in the competition yesterday. She thought they might be able to spend some time sightseeing in Hua City after the competition. Hua City had quite a few attractions, and she hadn't had a chance to properly look around since arriving.","\"Is it too early for you? If you haven't had enough fun, we can come back to Hua City specifically for a trip in a while. It's not possible this time. You've just won a big award and are trending online. The buzz is still high, and there will definitely be reporters if we go out. Also, your status has risen to a new level. Not only do people in Rong City know you, but your national recognition has also increased. When we get back, your studio will probably have a lot of orders that the girls can't handle on their own.\"","Xu Xiuhe's logic was clear, and Shen Yin realized he was right. If she didn't go back soon, the girls at the studio would be overwhelmed.","\"Zheng Zheng, we're going back this afternoon!\" Shen Yin called out as she walked from the bedroom to the living room.","Xu Yunzheng was engrossed in watching cartoons and only looked up when Shen Yin came closer.","\"Mommy, Paw Patrol,\" the little one pointed at the TV.","Shen Yin glanced at the TV and said, \"Yes, Paw Patrol. But Zheng Zheng has been watching for a long time now. The puppies are tired and need to rest for a while. So, let's turn off the TV and let the puppies sleep, okay?\" Shen Yin hadn't watched this cartoon and didn't know what it was about; she was just making it up.","She thought the little one might resist, but after a few seconds of consideration, Xu Yunzheng took the remote control and turned off the TV.","\"Okay, let the puppies sleep, but Zheng Zheng is not sleepy,\" the little one climbed down from the sofa and hugged Shen Yin's leg.","The bedroom door was open, and Xu Xiuhe, who was replying to Liu Bo's message, heard the conversation between mother and son and smiled.","One was making things up, and the other believed it. How should he describe this mother and son pair – logic geniuses or innocently adorable?","\"Mommy, Zheng Zheng is hungry.\"","Shen Yin checked the time. It was mealtime. One good thing about children was their very accurate biological clocks – they slept on time and got hungry on time.","\"Call daddy and ask him to come down with us.\"","Xu Yunzheng let go of Shen Yin's leg and scampered into the bedroom, hopping and skipping.","\"Daddy, Zhengzheng is hungry. Mommy told Zhengzheng to call Daddy for dinner,\" Xu Yunzheng said, once again wrapping his arms around Xu Xiuhe's leg.","Xu Xiuhe put away his phone and tried to pick up Zhengzheng, but the little one refused.","He just kept hugging Xu Xiuhe's leg, not letting go.","\"Zhengzheng, Daddy needs to walk now.\"","\"Walk.\"","Xu Xiuhe took a step forward, and the little one, still clinging to Xu Xiuhe's leg, started walking along with him."]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Father Qi Arrested","paragraphs":["As soon as the news broke, there was a stir in Hua City.","Su Jin indeed had someone backing her. With such a grave incident occurring at the competition she organized, those in power couldn't ignore it.","The higher-ups immediately called a meeting and established the Rong City Anti-Corruption Task Force.","As soon as they began gathering information, they discovered irregularities.","As a key national figure, Qi Shengwu's close relatives were supposed to undergo political vetting, and any family members traveling abroad needed to be reported.","However, they hadn't received any such reports, and Qi Yan had only returned from studying abroad a few months ago.","On this point alone, Qi Shengwu had already violated regulations.","The day after the Anti-Corruption Task Force was formed, they headed straight for Rong City.","No one in Rong City received any notice of their arrival. Everything continued to operate as usual.","September arrived.","The previous important figures had been transferred, leaving the position vacant, awaiting appointment from above.","Xue Kai was also worried. Rong City wasn't like other cities; too many people wanted to take up positions here. He feared someone might be parachuted in directly.","Although he didn't care about money, he still wanted power.","Qi Shengwu was even more afraid. He had originally planned to use some tricks, pull some strings, and sling some mud at Xue Kai in hopes of securing the position for himself.","But at this crucial moment, he found himself covered in mud, busy trying to clean himself up, with no time to smear Xue Kai.","In September, the weather was still hot. Everything in Rong City seemed to be proceeding in an orderly fashion.","Students started school, white-collar workers went to their offices, construction workers toiled on building sites. Everything appeared calm on the surface.","But behind the scenes, members of the Anti-Corruption Task Force were running around collecting evidence. Finally, in mid-September, they visited Qi Shengwu's home.","Qi Shengwu was stunned by the arrival of so many people, completely caught off guard.","He thought he had cleaned up thoroughly enough. Because of this, he had given Qi Yan a severe beating, canceled her bank cards, and even confined Qi Yan and Qi's mother to the house for over two weeks.","But what was meant to come, still came.","The Anti-Corruption Task Force members immediately handcuffed him. He wanted to protest, but it was too late. They had solid evidence, laying out all his bribery records before him.","All the properties under his name were also presented to him.","Qi Shengwu wept. He was just one step away from having complete control over Rong City, just one step away.","\"Let's go.\"","Qi Shengwu was taken away.","Qi's mother and Qi Yan, locked in the house, had no idea about the commotion downstairs.","But they had their phones, and before long, the news was reported by all major media outlets.","The news of Qi Shengwu's embezzlement of 300 million yuan continued to dominate Weibo's top trending list.","Netizens cursed Qi Shengwu's ancestors to the eighteenth generation.","Many netizens expressed that they weren't shocked. If Qi Yan knew how to bribe so skillfully, it must be related to her family background.","When Qi Yan's bribery incident first came to light, they had called for an investigation into her father, but there had been no response from above.","It turned out they were collecting evidence without alerting the target, allowing them to catch this big tiger.","It had to be said, the Anti-Corruption Task Force did an excellent job. Three hundred million - what does that concept mean? An ordinary person couldn't earn that much money in ten lifetimes.","All of the Qi family's assets were confiscated, including the house they were currently living in.","Important city leaders all had a special compound, which was why the Qi family lived not far from the Xue family.","Xue Kai stood on the second floor, watching the scene of Qi Shengwu being taken away outside the window, feeling deeply moved.","\"Honey, you haven't done any embezzlement, have you?\" Ye Rong asked worriedly.","\"Do I lack money?\" Xue Kai asked in return.","Ye Rong realized it was true. Their family didn't lack money, and even the company was in her name. The couple's assets were clearly separated.","Xue Kai never interfered in Ye Rong's company affairs, and Ye Rong knew to avoid conflicts of interest. She never discussed matters involving benefits with Xue Kai.","For them, work was work, and life was life. They each had their privacy.","At the Qi household, Qi's mother and Qi Yan were the last to know about Qi Shengwu's downfall. They couldn't believe it, suspecting the online news was fake.","Until someone came to seal off their house.","The household staff, not even waiting for their wages, had already fled. Only the mother and daughter remained in the entire villa.","\"Mom, what are we going to do now?\" Qi Yan cried until her eyes were swollen.","Qi's mother's expression became abnormal. It was all her fault. If she hadn't given Qi Yan that 10 million yuan, Qi Yan wouldn't have bribed anyone, and no one would have come to investigate Qi Shengwu.","The more the woman thought about it, the more distressed she became. This was too big a blow for her. Without Qi Shengwu, how would they survive?","She had never known that Qi Shengwu had taken so much money, nor did she know where this money was kept.","\"I still have some private savings and some jewelry. Let's pack up now, move out, and find a place to wait for your father to return.\"","Qi's mother wiped her tears, comforting Qi Yan.","Qi Yan returned to her room, unable to accept this reality. At 27, she naturally understood the implications of her father embezzling 300 million. He would never get out in this lifetime.","Now she not only hated Shen Yin and Xue Jingrui, but she also hated Qi Shengwu. He had embezzled so much money, why did he only give her a few hundred thousand yuan in living expenses each month?","If he had given her more, would they have been able to trace so much?","And then there was Qi Shengwen. It was all Qi Shengwen's fault for participating in that embroidery competition. Now look, her own brother was gone because of it.","The woman was nearly insane, smashing everything she could in the room. She had to destroy anything she couldn't use. Everyone owed her. Why was the world so unfair to her?","\"Ahhhhh!\" The woman screamed hysterically, her eyes growing increasingly vicious.","\"Hahahaha. Those who owe me, I'll make them pay back even if it costs me my life.\" Qi Yan muttered to herself like a madwoman.","\"Upstairs! Hurry up and pack. This house will be sealed off soon.\" A uniformed person downstairs shouted loudly.","Qi Yan packed her suitcase, took a few bank cards, and left her room.","Qi's mother was also at the door. Her eyes were full of reluctance; this was the place she had lived for decades.","Now nothing belonged to them anymore.","\"Is it heavy? Let mom carry the suitcase for you.\" Qi's mother said, looking at Qi Yan with her bloodshot eyes.","Qi Yan, pampered since childhood and unwilling to suffer even a bit, handed the suitcase to her mother upon hearing this.","Qi's mother struggled to carry two suitcases down the stairs alone, with Qi Yan following behind.","Fortunately, her mother still had some money, so they could continue to make ends meet in the future.","The moment the sealing tape was applied, Qi's mother couldn't hold back her tears. She stood at the doorway, looking for a long, long time before finally turning to leave.","\"Big sister, mom,\" a boy about 10 years old called out as he came running towards them."]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: Qì Shèngwǔ's Illegitimate Child","paragraphs":["\"Who are you calling mama and sister?\" Qi Yan looked at the boy with displeasure.","\"You're my sister, right? My name is Qi Yang. My mom said dad doesn't want us anymore. She has no money and can't afford to raise me, so she sent me here to find you all.\"","At nine years old, it was impossible for the boy to be completely ignorant. He knew his father had made a mistake and been arrested. He also knew his father had a special status, so from the beginning, he understood his own identity wasn't exactly honorable.","At school, his classmates would say he had no father. He desperately wanted to tell them his father's name, but his mother reminded him daily never to reveal it. If he did, she warned, he really would have no father.","Until this morning, when his mother looked at her phone, then hurriedly packed her bags and his. She brought him here, telling him she was in trouble and couldn't manage anymore. She couldn't afford to raise him and told him to find the Qi family, who would take care of him.","\"What's your name?\" Qi's mother had a bad feeling.","\"Qi Yang. My dad is the Deputy Mayor, Qi Shengwu.\" Tears still lingered in the boy's eyes.","Qi's mother fainted on the spot.","\"Mom! Mom!\" Qi Yan called out anxiously, pulling out her phone to dial 120 for emergency services.","\"Sister, what's wrong with her?\" the boy asked.","\"Get out! I'm not your sister. Go wherever you came from!\"","The woman's gaze looked as if it could devour the boy whole. He stumbled back several steps in fright.","Qi Yan kept calling to the woman lying on the ground. In that moment, she was truly scared. Her mother had always been the one who loved her most. Now, the two people she depended on most were gone – one arrested, one collapsed.","The ambulance arrived shortly. Qi's mother had suffered severe shock, resulting in a brief loss of consciousness.","Her husband's arrest and the overnight loss of their vast fortune had already been a massive blow. Now, to suddenly learn that her husband had a nine-year-old love child outside their marriage – it would be a fatal shock to any woman.","In the bustling hospital, Qi Yan felt utterly helpless. She had followed the ambulance here, and her mother was now undergoing emergency treatment inside.","Sitting outside, she felt incredibly desolate. She had just called their former relatives, but not a single one was willing to answer.","All she heard from her phone was: \"Hello, the number you have dialed is temporarily unavailable. Beep beep beep.\"","Back at the compound, Qi Yang sat crying at the bottom of the stairs.","Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui happened to be returning to the old house.","Seeing the child crying so bitterly, Qi Ji approached and asked, \"Little one, why are you crying?\"","\"My dad and mom don't want me anymore.\"","\"Where's your home?\"","\"My home isn't here.\"","Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui exchanged a glance. Xue Jingrui then asked, \"Who's your father?\"","\"My dad is called Qi Shengwu. I'm Qi Yang. My dad and mom both don't want me anymore.\"","Hearing this, Xue Jingrui was stunned. He had known the Qi family for so many years, how could he not know they had a son? Had he missed some crucial information?","\"Where's your mom?\"","\"My mom left.\"","\"What about your sister?\"","\"My sister left too.\"","\"What should we do, Brother Jingrui? He's just a child. He's innocent of the adults' mistakes.\"","\"I don't know. Maybe we should take him back and let my dad handle it. After all, Qi Shengwu used to be his colleague.\"","\"It's hot outside. Come inside with us first.\"","Xue Jingrui and Qi Ji led Qi Yang to the door and knocked.","Ye Rong answered.","\"Oh, Qi Ji, you're here! Mom has missed you so much.\"","Ye Rong had just grabbed Qi Ji's hand when she noticed the boy behind them.","\"Who's this?\"","Ye Rong looked at the boy, then at her own son. She didn't recall ever seeing this child before.","\"Where's dad?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Wait, Jingrui, what's going on here? This isn't your father's love child, is it? No, impossible, impossible.\"","Ye Rong waved her hand, talking to herself. Then she turned and hurried up the stairs, shouting, \"Old Xue! Come down here quick! Tell me, have you done anything to betray me?\"","Qi Ji watched her imaginative mother-in-law and found her quite adorable.","\"Brother Jingrui, why don't you explain to mom? She's misunderstanding.\"","\"Do you think there's any chance to explain?\" Xue Jingrui looked at Qi Ji.","Qi Ji thought about it and realized he was right. Her mother-in-law was efficient and fiery in her actions, with a quick temper. She wouldn't wait for Xue Jingrui's explanation.","\"What's the matter, Old Ye? Weren't you calling me 'husband' just this morning? How quickly things change!\" Xue Kai hurriedly came out of the study, glasses in hand.","\"Have you done anything to betray me?\" Ye Rong asked again.","\"I haven't been forcing you to drink any health tonics lately. I haven't done anything to betray you.\"","\"Dad,\" Xue Jingrui called from downstairs.","\"Oh, my son and daughter-in-law are here!\" Xue Kai hurried down the stairs.","\"Who's this?\" Xue Kai looked at the boy behind Xue Jingrui and Qi Ji, his eyes full of questions.","Ye Rong finally relaxed. As she had guessed, he wouldn't have the guts.","\"Who is he, Old Ye? You didn't suspect I had a love child outside, did you? Let me tell you, I, Xue Kai, am not only loyal to the country and the party, but I'm also loyal to you. I've never done anything to betray you. If I did such a thing, I'd be disciplined!\"","\"Ahem.\" Ye Rong felt a bit embarrassed. Their son and daughter-in-law were still here, not to mention the child. At their age, weren't they ashamed?","Xue Kai glanced at his son and daughter-in-law, cleared his throat, and his expression instantly became serious.","\"Ahem, who is this?\" Xue Kai asked.","At first, Xue Jingrui had been wondering why he didn't know Qi Shengwu had such a big son. But after his parents' little scene, he seemed to understand – this child might be Qi Shengwu's illegitimate son.","\"His father is Qi Shengwu.\"","Hearing this, Xue Kai and Ye Rong were also stunned. They lived nearby and had known Qi Shengwu for so many years, yet they never knew he had a son. This could only mean the boy was an illegitimate child.","\"Why did you bring someone else's love child into our home?\"","\"He was crying outside our gate, saying his parents didn't want him anymore. I was worried it would look bad, and it's hot outside, so I brought him in. I'm leaving it to you to handle.\"","Ye Rong went to pour some water and brought glasses for Qi Ji, Xue Jingrui, and the boy.","Xue Kai was also worried. Qi Shengwu had already been taken away, yet he still left a troublesome situation behind. The boy could have cried anywhere, but he chose to do it right at Xue Kai's doorstep.","\"Is your father Qi Shengwu?\" Xue Kai asked.","\"Yes, my father is Qi Shengwu,\" the boy replied, taking a sip of water. His face was streaked with tears.","\"How old are you?\"","\"I'm nine years old.\"","\"Who's your mother?\"","\"My mother is called Liu Xian'er.\"","Ye Rong glanced at Xue Kai, who took a drink of water. This situation was indeed quite thorny.","\"What should we do, Dad? How should we handle him?\" Ye Rong asked.","\"How would I know? He's not my son. You brought him here, so you figure it out,\" Xue Kai replied."]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Qiji is Pregnant","paragraphs":["Xue Kai was still angry that Xue Jingrui had suddenly brought back a child, causing his wife to suspect him.","\"Dad, it's mainly because he was crying so hard,\" Qi Ji said, feeling sorry for Xue Jingrui when she heard Xue Kai scolding him, and couldn't help but explain on his behalf.","\"Don't worry, Qi Ji,\" Ye Rong was secretly pleased. Her daughter-in-law speaking up for her son showed that they had a good relationship. Naturally, as a mother, she was happy to see her son and daughter-in-law getting along well.","Ye Rong held Qi Ji's hand, feeling more and more delighted the longer she looked at her. She really had good judgment in choosing such a wonderful daughter-in-law for Xue Jingrui - obedient, beautiful, and even fulfilling her dream of having a daughter.","\"Old Xue, what do you think we should do about this situation? The child needs somewhere to go,\" Ye Rong said.","\"Where are Qi Yan and her mother?\" Xue Kai asked.","\"We don't know for sure, but I heard that someone came to take away the Qi family's house this morning,\" Ye Rong replied.","\"Oh, and I heard that an ambulance came to our courtyard this morning.\"","\"The sister's mother fainted when she saw me. The sister called 120, and then they left,\" the boy suddenly chimed in from the side.","The four adults didn't know what to say for a moment, realizing that even this young child understood that someone had fainted upon seeing him.","\"Well, you must be in third or fourth grade by now, so you probably understand quite a bit. You should also know about your situation,\" Xue Kai began, but was suddenly nudged by Ye Rong.","\"Be gentle, he's still a child,\" Ye Rong whispered in Xue Kai's ear.","\"You should know that your father made a mistake, and mistakes naturally have consequences. Your mother's departure is also human nature, but you are innocent. The fact that your mother told you to find the Qi family shows she thought they could raise you, but as you've seen, they fainted when you arrived. So, I'll give you two choices. Do you want to hear them?\"","The boy nodded.","\"One, I can have someone take you to the hospital to continue looking for the Qi family. Two, I can help you choose a welfare institute. I know you're innocent, but you still have a blood relation to Qi Shengwu. Sometimes in life, we face situations beyond our control that we can't escape, and we have to go through various hardships. Do you understand? You've done nothing wrong, but there are some consequences you may have to bear.\"","Xue Kai said this to Qi Yang, unsure if the 9-year-old boy in front of him could truly understand. The other three adults were all waiting for the boy's answer.","\"Uncle, please send me to the welfare institute. My father's mistakes have nothing to do with me, and I don't want to have a father who makes mistakes,\" the boy said firmly, as if making the biggest decision of his life.","\"Alright. It's lunchtime now, so have a meal here first. Someone will come to pick you up after lunch.\"","\"Jingrui, put on a cartoon for him to watch, then come with me to the study.\"","Xue Kai went upstairs.","After turning on the TV and putting on a cartoon, Xue Jingrui followed Xue Kai upstairs.","In the living room, only Ye Rong and Qi Ji remained.","Fearing that the boy might feel uncomfortable with them there, Ye Rong took Qi Ji to a nearby bedroom.","\"Qi Ji, it's been a long time since I've seen you. How are you? Jingrui hasn't been bullying you, has he?\"","Qi Ji noticed that her mother-in-law always asked if Jingrui was bullying her.","\"No, Brother Jingrui is very good to me and takes good care of me. Thank you for your concern, Mom.\"","\"Don't say thank you. He's your husband, and he should take care of you. You've come all the way from Yang City to marry him. If he doesn't take care of you, who will? Qi Ji, if he ever bullies you, you must tell me. I'll teach him a lesson for you.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"What would you like to eat? I'll ask the housekeeper to make it.\"","\"Anything is fine with me.\"","\"I've realized that you're so much easier to feed than Jingrui. He's such a picky eater.\"","Ye Rong was pointing out her son's shortcomings.","Qi Ji smiled along with her.","\"By the way, how have you been feeling lately?\"","\"I'm doing well. I went to the hospital for a check-up recently, and the doctor said everything was normal.\"","At the mention of the hospital, Ye Rong's heart skipped a beat.","\"Was it because you weren't feeling well, or just a routine check-up?\" Ye Rong asked, a bit nervously, her question tinged with caution.","\"It was a prenatal check-up, Mom. I have a baby in my tummy now,\" Qi Ji said softly, a bit shy.","\"What?\"","The joy came so suddenly that Ye Rong could hardly speak.","\"Qi Ji, are you saying you're going to be a mother, and I'm going to be a grandmother?\" Ye Rong asked again.","\"Yes, Mom, you're going to be a grandmother.\"","Ye Rong looked at Qi Ji's stomach, which was flat and showed no sign of pregnancy.","\"How far along are you?\"","\"The doctor said almost a month.\"","\"That far already.\"","Ye Rong couldn't resist touching Qi Ji's belly.","\"Qi Ji, why don't you and Jingrui move back here to live? I'm worried he won't take good care of you.\"","Qi Ji...","She seemed to have anticipated this outcome.","\"Mom, I...\"","\"It's decided then. You'll move back, and I won't go to work anymore. I'll stay home every day to take care of you and my chubby grandson.\"","\"Mom, the baby might be a girl.\"","\"Qi Ji likes little girls?\"","Qi Ji nodded.","\"What a coincidence, Mom likes girls too. When I was pregnant with Jingrui, I hoped every day that he would be a girl. But he turned out to be a boy. At that time, I wanted to have another one, but your father was at the peak of his career. The policy didn't allow it, so I didn't.\"","\"Mom likes girls too?\"","\"Yes, girls are so soft and sweet. How nice. Unlike Jingrui, who was such a handful as a child, always coming home covered in dirt.\"","Qi Ji imagined the baby in her belly being a girl, and buying all sorts of little dresses for her. The thought alone made her happy.","\"Mom, I've already found a future son-in-law.\"","\"Oh, so quick? Who is it?\"","\"It's Sister Shen Yin's baby. He's two years old this year, very handsome, well-behaved, and sensible.\"","\"Good. Xiuhe is Jingrui's good friend. This way, we'll keep it all in the family.\"","Ye Rong didn't object at all. She felt that arranged marriages weren't necessarily bad. After all, Jingrui and Qi Ji were about to have a child now, weren't they? The main thing was knowing the family background and being well-matched. With time, feelings would naturally develop.","Isn't love always cultivated through spending time together?","At Qinghe Villa, Shen Yin was indeed busy, spending the weekend taking the little girls and Zheng Zheng to build their strength and learn martial arts.","Usually busy with matters in her studio, ever since she became famous nationwide, the studio's orders had been increasing, with people from other cities seeking her out after hearing of her reputation.","Now, the orders were scheduled all the way into the following year.","Shen Yin didn't want to continue expanding the studio. After all, the brand had already been established. The next step was to manage this brand, implementing purchase limits and exclusive offerings."]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: Together","paragraphs":["In fact, Shen Yin had an idea: in this era, what matters most is not the size of the store, but how well-known the brand is.","Although the current studio was small, it had its own system in place.","She was now busy training Wang Nannan and teaching the two seamstresses some techniques. As long as they were satisfied with the clothes they made, and the customers were satisfied, that would be a success.","Once she finished training them, she would have more free time again.","Opening a martial arts school was a hobby, and she could practice along the way. The Chinese furniture business didn't require much of her attention now either.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng misses Daddy,\" her child said.","\"It's only been a day since you last saw him. How come you're missing him again?\"","\"I miss Daddy.\"","Seeing that work at the studio was wrapping up, Shen Yin gathered her things, picked up Zhengzheng, and got into the car.","\"Driver, please take us to Heyuan Group,\" she instructed.","The driver had been quite busy these past few days, shuttling between Ziyue Manor and Qinghe Street.","\"Haven't seen Mr. Xu for several days now,\" the driver remarked.","\"He's probably been busy with work at the company lately.\"","It had been a while since Shen Yin last visited Xu Xiuhe's company. As soon as she arrived, she attracted attention once again.","She hadn't been to Heyuan Group since winning the national championship.","Chang Xue, the receptionist, was so excited to see Shen Yin that she almost asked for an autograph. Her fangirl expression was so obvious that if Xu Xiuhe had seen it, he might have considered firing her.","\"Welcome, madam. Hello, little one,\" Chang Xue greeted them.","Shen Yin, without any airs, smiled gently and said to Zhengzheng, \"Sweetie, someone just greeted you. What should you say?\"","\"Hello, big sister,\" the child replied.","Chang Xue's heart melted. How could a child be so adorable? The way he called her \"big sister\" in that sweet, childish voice – she was certain no girl could resist such charm.","Shen Yin led Xu Yunzheng into the elevator.","Unable to contain her excitement, Chang Xue bragged in the company group chat: [The boss's wife and the little prince are here! If you want to run into them, hurry up!]","[Wow, really? Ever since the madam won the national embroidery competition, I've been completely captivated by her charm. What kind of goddess is she? Beautiful, rich, and talented, with such a handsome husband and an adorable baby. She's truly living her best life.]","[It's true! Who am I? My eyesight is 20/20, thank you very much. Even if I were blind, I could still use my ears. The little prince called me 'big sister' in that adorable voice. Oh my god, I can't take it!]","[Chang Xue, you're so naughty, making the baby call you 'big sister.' You're probably older than the boss's wife. Aren't you ashamed?]","[Not at all! I don't care. He called me 'big sister,' not you. Hmph!]","[I'm so jealous of being called 'big sister.' Guys, I want to hear the little prince call me 'big sister' too.]","[I'm 22, just graduated. Do you think I have a chance?]","[What the hell? Which department are you from? Where's your conscience? He's only 2 years old!]","[Wah, I'm just asking! The temptation is too great. If I could win over the little prince, I'd not only get a handsome man but the entire Heyuan Group would be mine.]","[You guys are absolutely insane.]","Xu Xiuhe glanced at his phone and saw these unusual messages, falling into deep thought.","What should he do about employees always letting their imaginations run wild?","Suddenly, he realized something. Why were they talking about his son out of the blue in the group chat?","Xu Xiuhe scrolled through the messages above and his eyes lit up – his wife had come to see him!","He stood up and left his office. Just then, Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng stepped out of the elevator.","\"Ahem, how come you're out here?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Because I knew you were coming, so I was waiting for you here,\" Xu Xiuhe said as he took Xu Yunzheng from her.","\"How did you know we were coming? We didn't tell you in advance. Don't tell me you watch the lobby's security cameras every day?\" Shen Yin asked curiously.","\"Maybe we're just in sync. I always know what you're thinking,\" he replied smoothly.","\"Ahem,\" Shen Yin coughed, feeling shy.","They quickly entered Xu Xiuhe's office.","The group of assistants outside were left dumbfounded. It was the first time they had witnessed their boss being so shameless.","\"I never imagined the boss would be like this.\"","\"He clearly saw the message in the group chat, yet he has the nerve to say they're in sync. Ugh!\"","\"It's just a bit of flirting between husband and wife. It's normal. Mo'er, are you jealous? If you are, go find a boyfriend. If you don't hurry, you might not be able to find one later.\"","Yang Mo fake-coughed and said, \"Me? I don't want to plunge into the bitter sea of love. I'm a firm believer in staying single.\"","After speaking, Yang Mo glanced at Qin Zhenzhen.","\"What about you, Zhenzhen? You've never had a boyfriend either, right?\"","\"I'm the same as Mo'er. I might not want to find a boyfriend,\" Qin Zhenzhen replied.","\"Wow, being single is great too. Just look at Elder Sister Gu and Elder Sister Yang – they're always so busy,\" one of the junior assistants chimed in.","\"Exactly! If you get married and your husband takes good care of you, that's fine. But if he doesn't care about anything, you're better off not getting married. Living on your own is so much more comfortable,\" another added.","\"That's right, that's right,\" Elder Sister Gu agreed.","\"Li'er, how are things going between you and Liu Assistant?\"","The urge to gossip is universal.","Everyone turned their attention to Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er wanted to avoid the topic. She and Liu Bo were just pretending to be a couple. What could she say? It was what it was.","Xiao Li'er, having read many novels and possessing keen observation skills, had long suspected that something was going on between Yang Mo and Qin Zhenzhen. She just hadn't been able to confirm it.","But after seeing that glance Yang Mo gave Qin Zhenzhen earlier, Xiao Li'er was certain. They were definitely a couple.","Wow, this was too exciting! Such great material for shipping!","\"Mo'er, since you and Zhenzhen both don't want to get married, why don't you two live together?\" Xiao Li'er suggested deliberately. \"You won't be lonely in your old age. Best friends living together sounds so comfortable!\"","\"Yeah, I think that's a great idea,\" the others chimed in.","Yang Mo laughed awkwardly and said, \"Well, I suppose it's not impossible. Right, Zhenzhen?\"","\"Sure, why not?\" Qin Zhenzhen replied.","Xiao Li'er wore a knowing smile. This gossip was too juicy! She truly was an unassuming gossip-detecting genius.","Looking at it this way, she seemed to have figured out who was...","What they didn't know was that the two had already been living together.","Both Qin Zhenzhen and Yang Mo felt a bit nervous, worried that the others might catch on to something.","After all, many people don't accept this kind of love. They want to speak out, but after saying it aloud, they lack the courage to face those strange looks. They're afraid of being called abnormal by others.","Countless times they wanted to tell their colleagues in the assistant department, but always gave up.","They're still afraid, still fearful.","The people in the assistant department are all nice, good people.","\"Yang Mo, Qin Zhenzhen, you two are so well-matched. If it's really not working out with others, you should be together,\" Xiao Li'er continued.","\"What? Can you all accept that? Many people can't accept this, you know.\""]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Dominance and Distant Group","paragraphs":["\"Why can't it be accepted? Nowadays, many foreign countries have legalized it and allow marriage. As long as you're happy, why care about what others think?\"","\"That's right, Li Er has a point,\" Elder Sister Gu said. \"Let me tell you unmarried ones - when choosing a man, you must be careful. It's better to stay single than to settle, otherwise it's too difficult. Look at me - every day after work I still have to cook for that dog of a man. I don't know how long I can keep living like this. If it weren't for the kids, I'd really want a divorce.\"","\"So you see, there's nothing wrong if you two get together,\" Xiao Li'er said. \"You have common interests, similar financial situations - it's perfect.\"","Yang Mo and Qin Zhenzhen both felt a bit embarrassed.","Elder Sister Gu teased, \"If those two really got together, we'd save on one wedding gift. But when it comes to love, who can say for sure?\"","In Xu Xiuhe's office, Zhengzheng was pestering Xu Xiuhe to play games with him. Shen Yin sat on Xu Xiuhe's desk, looking at the thick stacks of documents.","\"You must have been very busy lately,\" Shen Yin asked.","\"It's not too bad. You must have been very busy too, with all the orders coming into the studio recently,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"That's over now. It was only hectic for a few days. I've trained everyone and adjusted how we take orders. It won't be so tiring in the future. From now on, I can focus on spending time with my little Zhengzheng.\"","\"Zhengzheng wants to be with Mommy's baby!\"","As father and son played, Shen Yin watched them.","Shen Yin was particularly curious about how Xu Xiuhe always seemed to know when she and Zhengzheng were coming.","\"How do you always know in advance when Zhengzheng and I are coming?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Do you really want to know?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin nodded.","\"What's in it for me?\"","\"What do you want?\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment. There were many benefits he wanted.","\"Can we discuss what I want tonight?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Ahem,\" Shen Yin coughed, knowing exactly what Xu Xiuhe was thinking from his tone.","\"You tell me first how you know.\"","The two haggled back and forth.","\"My phone is on the desk. You know the password. Open QQ and there's a group called 'Dominating Heyuan Group.'\"","Shen Yin leaned on Xu Xiuhe's chair and opened his phone.","In the small \"Dominating Heyuan Group\" chat:","99+ messages","Curious about the answer and feeling bored, Shen Yin kept scrolling through the chat history.","It was quite interesting. She kept reading the chat logs, occasionally laughing.","\"Your company employees are quite adorable,\" she said.","\"Mm, they are quite adorable,\" Xu Xiuhe agreed.","How could they not be adorable? Every day a group of people were shipping him and his wife, constantly sharing their photos and sweet moments. As the subject of their attention, he himself found it quite entertaining.","\"Do they know you're in this group?\" she asked.","\"If they knew I was in this group, would they dare to be so brazen? They often talk bad about me.\"","\"What do they say?\"","\"They say I don't last long.\"","Shen Yin was speechless.","Only she knew the truth about such matters. Unless someone was hiding under their bed at night, Shen Yin found it hilarious.","\"You're laughing? Don't you know me best?\" he said.","\"I don't know,\" Shen Yin said innocently.","\"Alright, you don't know now, but I'll make sure you do.\"","\"Daddy, what don't you know?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"Letting your mom know that Daddy is strong and has good stamina.\"","\"Daddy is strong! Daddy, lift me up high!\" Xu Yunzheng said in his childish, sweet voice.","Xu Xiuhe lifted Zhengzheng up over his head and asked, \"Zhengzheng, is Daddy strong?\"","He was asking Zhengzheng, but his eyes were fixed on Shen Yin.","\"How childish,\" Shen Yin laughed.","\"Childish.\"","\"Hey, how did you get into the group without them knowing?\" Shen Yin asked curiously.","\"Liu Bo added me. He had been in the group for a long time without inviting me. Later, he accidentally revealed it and was forced to add me.\"","\"And him?\"","\"Him? Along with the entire assistant department, they don't dare speak in the group anymore.\"","\"Haha, that's so funny!\"","\"They might be planning to create a smaller group.\"","\"They don't need to. The assistant department has many people. They organize various documents and send out all kinds of messages every day. They're not particularly busy and have plenty of time to chat together. Don't believe me? Go out and look, I bet they're chatting again.\"","This result was completely unexpected for Shen Yin. She looked surprised.","\"Liu Bo is good to them, possibly because his girlfriend is in the assistant department. He can't bear to get angry. As long as work efficiency is high, I don't mind the rest. Sometimes, being happy is most important. When people are happy, efficiency improves. Why should I bother managing them further?\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin was close to giving Xu Xiuhe a thumbs up. Not only did he win people's hearts, but he also had his own ideas. No wonder Heyuan Group had developed so quickly in just a few short years.","Perhaps some people are just born to be leaders.","\"The young ladies in your assistant department seem quite nice. Every time I come, they smile and greet me.\"","\"Yes, a few young assistants were hired last year. The older ones have been with the company from the beginning.\"","\"So how are those two you mentioned last time, Zhenzhen and Yang Mo?\"","\"I don't know. I promised to keep it confidential.\"","\"I want to go see.\"","\"Go ahead. Do you want me to come with you?\"","\"No need.\"","Shen Yin simply thought the atmosphere in Heyuan Group's assistant department was good, and after hearing Xu Xiuhe mention those two girls, she became curious and wanted to go see for herself.","Just as Shen Yin opened the office door, the assistants who had been chatting happily outside suddenly fell silent. They seemed a bit nervous.","The boss's wife had come down to inspect, and they felt guilty. They had just been talking so much, would they be criticized?","Shen Yin walked to the office area.","\"What's wrong? Why did it suddenly get so quiet? Did I disturb you?\"","Xiao Li'er and Yang Mo exchanged glances.","\"No, not at all.\"","\"They're playing games inside, father and son. I was bored in there, so I came out for a walk,\" Shen Yin said with a gentle smile.","Seeing Shen Yin up close again, the group could hardly take their eyes off her.","Shen Yin was the boss's wife, but she was also a beauty. Who doesn't like looking at beautiful women?","\"Ma'am, your skin is really nice,\" Xiao Li'er couldn't help but say.","Shen Yin had good habits and a good foundation. Combined with her regular exercise and sweating, her face was flawless, with pores so fine they were almost invisible. Her skin was delicate and smooth, comparable even to that of a baby.","\"Thank you. Maintaining good habits and regular exercise are beneficial for the skin,\" Shen Yin said, and with that, the conversation among the group opened up.","They had barely been talking for two minutes when Liu Bo walked out of his office. He had originally intended to come and get some documents, but found the CEO's wife was there.","\"Li Er, is Special Assistant Liu here to see you?\""]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Glazed CP","paragraphs":["After all, Liu Bo's hesitant demeanor didn't seem to indicate anything serious.","Xiao Li'er felt embarrassed as the others teased her.","Standing nearby, Shen Yin felt like she was intruding and prepared to leave. As she turned to go, she took a deliberate look, easily distinguishing between those who were married and those who weren't. She could immediately tell who Qin Zhenzhen and Yang Mo were.","She found herself wondering when she had become so nosy. It must be Xu Xiuhe's influence rubbing off on her.","In the company group chat, people were still enthusiastically shipping the \"Yin He Couple.\"","Shen Yin returned to Xu Xiuhe's office and sat back down in the chair at his desk, picking up her phone.","\"The 'Yin He Couple' has a nice ring to it,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"I don't particularly like it,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Why not?\"","\"The implication doesn't seem positive. What is the Milky Way, after all? It's what separates the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl, preventing them from meeting.\"","Shen Yin was taken aback.","\"That's just a folk tale, a myth,\" she said.","[What are we going to do about Assistant Liu?]","Shen Yin looked at the message and asked, \"Xiuhe, what happened to Assistant Liu? Why are people in the group chat wondering what to do about him?\"","Xu Xiuhe walked over, having a general idea of the situation. While people above were shipping him and his wife, someone suddenly popped up asking what to do about Assistant Liu.","He had been keeping an eye on the group chat messages lately and naturally knew they were shipping him with Liu Bo.","[Liu Bo is in a relationship.]","[What? Bro, which department are you in? Is this info reliable?]","[Holy crap! The eternal bachelor has a girlfriend? I suddenly feel like I'm one step closer to finding love.]","[Oh my god, Assistant Liu has a partner? Could it be that the recent mixer was effective? Why don't I have a partner?]","[So who is it?]","A flurry of messages tagged Xu Xiuhe's alternate account.","[It's his assistant, Xiao Li'er.]","[Wow, internal affairs in the assistant department, huh? I heard there are still a few single girls there. Can someone set me up?]","It was just about time to clock out, and the messages in the group chat were multiplying rapidly.","[What did I just see? They've been keeping this under wraps so well.]","[A new ship has set sail!]","[Quick, come up with a couple name for Liu Bo and Xiao Li'er.]","[Glass CP? Bo Xiao CP? Liuli CP?]","[Let's go with the last one. Glass isn't as precious as liuli.]","The people in the assistant department were nearly dying of laughter as they read the group chat messages. If they remembered correctly, the person who just announced that Liu Bo was in a relationship was their CEO's alternate account.","So their boss knew about Liu Bo and Xiao Li'er's office romance? That was impressive—he really had his finger on the pulse of everything.","\"Is it possible that the boss's wife noticed something between them earlier and used the CEO's phone to post about it when she got back?\" Yang Mo suggested.","The others considered this and agreed it was plausible.","\"Then she must have seen all the messages shipping the Yin He Couple too.\"","\"I wonder how it feels to get the inside scoop from the main characters themselves.\"","Liu Bo was in his office, frantically reading through the group chat messages. He was panicking—how could the CEO just spill everything like that? It wasn't true; it was all fake!","He was now worried that Xiao Li'er would get angry and confront him later.","\"Ready for dinner?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Daddy, dinner!\" the little one chimed in.","\"Alright.\"","Xu Xiuhe put down his phone and picked up his son.","Shen Yin grabbed Xu Xiuhe's phone and the baby bag, and they headed down to the cafeteria.","This time, Xu Xiuhe didn't suggest eating out. The last time they ate in the employee cafeteria, things had gotten quite awkward. A successful man never stumbles twice in the same place, even if he knew that particular situation was unlikely to happen again.","Suddenly, Shen Yin's phone rang.","When she answered, Qi Ji's baby face filled the entire screen.","\"Sister Yin Yin,\" Qi Ji greeted.","\"Ah, Qi Ji.\"","\"Wrong, not Qi Ji. From now on, you should call me your in-law.\"","Shen Yin looked confused for a moment before it dawned on her.","\"Qi Ji, are you pregnant?\"","Shu Yi, who had just entered the room, caught the tail end of the conversation: \"Qi Ji, are you pregnant?\"","\"Oh my goodness, Qi Ji, you're my hero!\" Shu Yi exclaimed.","Shu Yi was certain she hadn't misheard. Qi Ji was a woman of action—last month she said she wanted a baby, and this month she was telling them she was expecting.","\"Don't get too excited. The most thrilled should be Zhengzheng—he's going to have a wife in the future,\" Qi Ji said.","\"I'm so envious that you two are becoming in-laws,\" Shu Yi said, genuinely jealous.","\"Can you really tell if the baby is a boy or a girl so quickly?\" Shen Yin asked curiously.","\"We can't,\" Qi Ji replied.","\"Then how do you know the baby in your belly is a girl?\"","\"I'm guessing. It's a spiritual connection. Even if it's not a girl, it will become one.\"","\"Hahaha, that's one way to look at it. As the godmother, I'd better work hard and earn money. In the future, I'll not only have to buy gifts for my goddaughter, but I'll also have to give a red envelope when my godson and goddaughter get married.\"","\"You're thinking that far ahead?\"","\"Is it really that far off? Let me tell you some good news—I've just wrapped up this drama, and next, I'm going on a trip. I'm going somewhere far, far away.\"","\"Where to?\"","\"The Tibetan City.\"","\"Sister Shu Yi is so cute. One moment she's talking about working hard to earn money, and the next she's going on vacation.\"","Shen Yin chuckled as well. \"I've got to go now. I'm getting hungry, so I'm off to eat.\"","\"Bye-bye, Yin Yin.\"","\"Bye-bye, in-law.\"","Shen Yin put down her phone. Xu Xiuhe had already set out all the dishes.","\"Qi Ji is pregnant?\" he asked.","\"Yep, you've got an in-law now.\"","\"In-law, in-law!\" Xu Yunzheng clapped his hands.","\"It's not your in-law. You now have a father-in-law and a mother-in-law. In the future, when you meet Uncle Jing Rui and Auntie Qi Ji, you'll have to call them Dad and Mom,\" Xu Xiuhe explained to Xu Yunzheng.","\"But Zhengzheng already has a dad and mom,\" the little one protested.","\"He's still young; he doesn't understand yet. When he's older, there will come a time when he'll want to call them that,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Are you scared?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Of what?\"","\"Afraid that when Zhengzheng gets a wife, he'll forget his mother,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Zhengzheng won't forget his mother when he gets a wife,\" the little one declared, lifting his face.","Hearing this, Shen Yin said, \"I'm not afraid.\"","Shen Yin truly wasn't afraid. There's a saying that raising a child is a journey of self-cultivation, nurturing the parents' emotions and wisdom.","Shen Yin had always believed that if a child is raised well, they won't forget their mother.","There's a popular saying online: \"The hardest job in the world is being a mom.\"","Although Shen Yin did not experience ten months of pregnancy, after such a long time together, the same blood flows in their bones. She has already made Zheng Zheng an inseparable part of her life.","Zheng Zheng is so well-behaved and kind now; his future path will surely be smooth.","Even if one day Zheng Zheng leaves her to sail far away on his own,","She will always wish him well. Even if he forgets her in the future, Shen Yin won't feel sad. Life always has partings, and most of life's journey is solitary. In the end, the only one who will accompany her into old age is likely to be her partner."]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: The Honeymoon Plan","paragraphs":["Shu Yi didn't go directly to Tibet, but returned to Rong City.","The group hadn't seen each other for a long time, and Qi Ji wanted to see her son-in-law quickly, so she organized another dinner gathering.","\"Zhengzheng, let your mother-in-law give you a hug.\"","\"Pretty auntie,\" Zhengzheng hadn't seen Qi Ji for a long time, but when they met again, he didn't act shy at all.","\"His memory is really excellent,\" Shu Yi marveled.","\"I don't know if kids nowadays are too smart, or if my godson is just too clever. In any case, I was pretty clueless when I was little, not understanding anything,\" Shu Yi said.","\"Sister Shu Yi, why do you want to go to Tibetan City? Although it's beautiful, it's easy to get altitude sickness there.\"","\"Maybe I want to let myself go, to travel far away. I've always gone to places that are relatively close before, but this time I have a longer break, so I want to go on a spur-of-the-moment trip.\"","\"Be careful.\"","\"By the way, is there any follow-up on Qi Yan's situation?\" Shu Yi asked curiously.","She had been filming for a while and such a big event had occurred. Who could have imagined that such a high position could be entered just like that?","It really is true that if the top beam is crooked, the lower ones will be askew. So how a child turns out has a lot to do with their parents' education. If the parents go astray, it subtly influences the children.","\"There is a follow-up. Just a few days after the news broke, my brother Jingrui and I happened to go back to the old house. Their family's house was confiscated, and then her father's illegitimate son showed up.\"","\"An illegitimate son?\"","\"Yes, he looks a bit like Qi Yan, only 9 years old.\"","\"Then what happened?\"","\"Later, this boy was sent to an orphanage by his father. Qi Yan's mother reportedly fell ill due to the great shock, suffered a stroke, and it's uncertain whether she'll wake up for the rest of her life.\"","\"Qi Yan's mother is also a pitiful person.\"","\"Perhaps those who are pitiful must have something detestable about them,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Let's not worry about them now, let's order first.\"","\"Sister Yin Yin, guess if they're still next door,\" Qi Ji asked.","\"Try a video call,\" Shu Yi suggested.","Qi Ji took out her phone and made a video call.","Indeed, they were in the private room next door.","\"Who is it?\"","\"Qi Ji.\"","\"Damn, Jingrui, blur the background,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","\"Why do we need to blur the background?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","This question really stumped Chang Zhiyuan. Indeed, why blur the background? They were openly having a meal together, coincidentally next door to them. What were they afraid of? It's not like they were doing anything shameful.","\"Brother Jingrui, where are you?\"","\"Guess.\"","\"I guess you're next door to us.\"","\"You've become smarter.\"","\"I've always been smart, okay? Don't look down on art students, my academic grades were quite good.\"","\"Alright, Qi Ji is smart, and our baby will be smart in the future too,\" Xue Jingrui said with a doting expression.","Chang Zhiyuan felt sour; he was the only single one among them.","\"Little cabbage in the field, yellow and unloved, can only cry,\" Chang Zhiyuan deliberately raised his voice.","Shu Yi actually heard it. She also knew very well that Chang Zhiyuan was saying it for her to hear, but what could she do?","Without fail, as soon as they finished eating, the three men would come over.","\"Sister Shu Yi, are you really not considering Chang Zhiyuan?\"","Shu Yi had considered it. To be honest, Chang Zhiyuan had indeed been good to her during this time, taking care of her on set. Anyone could see that Chang Zhiyuan was pursuing her.","How could she not be moved? What touches people's hearts has never been what a man says, but what he does for you. Looking at it this way, Chang Zhiyuan had indeed put his heart into it.","And it had been several months now. It was already the end of September, from when he sent her a bag in March until now, it had been six months, half a year.","She also suspected that perhaps the unattainable is always the best, because of men's desire to conquer, so he could keep pursuing her.","But she was a romantic at heart. If she couldn't hold back and ended up getting hurt in the end, she would surely feel like dying, in unbearable pain.","\"We'll see, I haven't decided yet,\" Shu Yi sighed.","\"Take it slow, no rush. You're still young. Look, how many young female celebrities, just at the start of their careers, rush into marriage?\" Shen Yin comforted her.","She now understood this world pretty well, keeping up with most news and events. She also paid attention to entertainment news, after all, many of her studio's clients were from the industry.","After they finished eating, the three men really came from next door, as if it had all happened just yesterday.","\"Everyone get some rest early, especially you, little Qi Ji,\" Shen Yin reminded.","Among the three, she seemed to be the most mature psychologically.","\"Not little Qi Ji, but mother-in-law.\"","\"Alright, alright, mother-in-law, go to bed early, and be good to my future daughter-in-law.\"","Qi Ji happily bounced out of the private room like a child, with Xue Jingrui following behind like an old father, carrying the bags.","\"She's really happy,\" Shu Yi sighed.","\"Yes, carefree. That's good, it's good for my future daughter-in-law,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Ah, you two are already calling each other in-laws, and talking about son-in-law and daughter-in-law. I have reason to suspect you're isolating me.\"","\"You're overthinking it, we're not doing that at all.\"","\"Alright, I'm heading back too.\"","\"Together.\"","\"You're going back to Ziyue Manor?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Yin Yin, do you know who's the happiest about you returning to Ziyue Manor?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Who?\"","\"Me. I'll come freeload meals at your place when I return from my trip.\"","Since Shu Yi and Shen Yin were going the same way, Chang Zhiyuan wanted to send Shu Yi home, but was refused by Shu Yi.","Chang Zhiyuan had no reason to insist.","A spur-of-the-moment trip really was spontaneous.","The next morning, Shu Yi had packed her luggage and headed to the airport.","She only told her parents, Qi Ji, and Shen Yin.","No one else knew, including her assistant.","She flew to Chuan City, and then started taking the train to enter Tibetan City.","At each place, she reported her safety to the group chat.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe said they were envious.","The man stroked Shen Yin's hair and said, \"After the National Day holiday, when there are fewer people, we'll go on a honeymoon too.\"","\"Then during this time, I'll take care of the studio's affairs.\"","Actually, the studio's affairs no longer needed her intervention, she just needed to give some final instructions.","These days, apart from looking after Zhengzheng, teaching her to recite ancient poems, doing arithmetic with her, and telling her stories, she didn't have much else to do.","It was good that Zhengzheng was there to keep her company, otherwise she would have felt bored.","\"Where should we go for our trip?\"","\"Where would you like to go?\"","\"Somewhere with fewer people, I suppose.\" The man spent the whole evening on his phone and computer, researching travel tips.","\"How are we going to get there? By plane?\" Shen Yin asked."]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Making the Moon","paragraphs":["\"We're not taking a plane. I just looked at an RV. I'll go buy it tomorrow.\"","\"Is it like Shu Yi's RV?\"","Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment, realizing there was a difference. The RV Shu Yi had on set was probably specifically for actors. It was different from the one he had been looking at.","Xu Xiuhe had already set his sights on a particular RV - an off-road model worth 9 million yuan, 9 meters long and 2 meters wide.","The interior was spacious, with four booth seats, two hidden beds, a bathroom, a small kitchen with a washing machine, and a refrigerator. It was essentially a compact apartment.","\"What do you think of this kind of RV?\" Xu Xiuhe handed the tablet to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin took it, zooming in on the images and examining the details.","\"This is much bigger than Shu Yi's RV, and it's so well-equipped inside.\"","\"An actor's RV is different from one for traveling.\"","\"I just ordered it. It should be delivered tomorrow. I'll go to the office to catch up on work during the National Day holiday, and we'll set off after the holiday ends.\"","\"Whatever you arrange is fine. I'm not very familiar with these things.\"","Shen Yin truly wasn't familiar with other places. In ancient times, travel was inconvenient, and it took a long time to go anywhere. So Shen Yin had never been on a long journey, not even to visit her maternal grandfather who had returned to his hometown years ago.","\"Honey.\"","With just one look from Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin knew what he was thinking.","\"Not now, okay?\"","The man seemed to have been doused with cold water, but then he thought of something.","\"Wait a moment.\"","Xu Xiuhe left the bedroom and went down to the kitchen.","Every time Shen Yin had her special period, she didn't have much of a reaction. She wouldn't feel uncomfortable in her stomach, as if nothing was wrong.","But Xu Xiuhe had read many CEO novels, which said that women need special care during their special period, like drinking brown sugar and red date tea.","\"Why did you bring this up?\"","The implication was that she didn't seem to need brown sugar and red date tea, as her stomach wasn't hurting.","\"Books say that drinking brown sugar and red date tea during your period warms your body and is good for your health,\" the man said sincerely.","Shen Yin took the brown sugar and red date tea and drank it in a few gulps.","\"Thank you, but you don't need to make this for me next time. My body doesn't need it.\"","When Shen Yin had checked her pulse, she discovered that this body was quite good. Ever since she learned that the original owner didn't want to have children, she had examined the body.","If a woman doesn't take good care of herself during the postpartum period, she can fall ill. Perhaps it was the power of money, but during her confinement, she had several postpartum caregivers.","\"I want to eat something cold.\"","Shen Yin had one particularly bad habit. Usually, she didn't want to eat cold foods, but during her special period, she especially craved them. Fortunately, she could control herself, and had even made Shu Yi avoid certain foods before.","Controlling herself was one thing, but craving cold foods was another.","Shen Yin wasn't actually that old, but she always presented a mature side of herself.","\"Be good, you can eat that when this is over. You can't eat it now.\" Xu Xiuhe put the cup on the bedside table, lay down, and hugged Shen Yin.","\"The moon outside is so bright. Is it almost Mid-Autumn Festival?\" Shen Yin looked out the window, then turned and wrapped her arms around Xu Xiuhe's waist.","She rarely showed her vulnerable side to others. Xu Xiuhe was the first.","Sometimes, an embrace can truly warm one's heart.","Shen Yin was like a hedgehog, with a thick layer of armor on the outside, but soft and tender on the inside. Because she feared pain and injury, she tightly wrapped herself up.","\"It's coming soon, in about a month. We might be celebrating Mid-Autumn Festival outside by then.\" Xu Xiuhe gently patted Shen Yin's back, soothing her like a child.","Her breathing gradually steadied as Shen Yin fell asleep.","Shu Yi had arrived in Western Sichuan, very close to the Tibetan City. Perhaps due to excitement, she found herself unable to sleep.","The moon outside was large and round. She suddenly remembered a scene from her new drama, 'I Just Want to Be With You'.","The female lead said she wanted to see the moon, to see it hanging from the treetops, to experience it directly overhead.","But that night, not only was it not cloudy, it was pouring rain, making it impossible to see the moon.","Yet the male lead said he would watch the moon with her.","The world was very quiet, with the bright moon gently lulling people to sleep.","But Shu Yi's heart was far from calm.","She was the female lead, and Chang Zhiyuan was the male lead.","Because of one plot point, because of something she said, Chang Zhiyuan changed the script and created a moon.","This scene was postponed for a long time and was only filmed just before wrapping up.","Because during his free time on set, Chang Zhiyuan had been making a moon - one that could shine even on a rainy night.","Those who gaze at the moon each have their own thoughts. Everyone is like a moon, with a side they're unwilling to show others. Just like her - it seemed she had fallen for him.","In that scene, to let the female lead see the moon on a cloudy day, the male lead made her a moon lamp, a handmade one.","The prop for this moon lamp was made by Chang Zhiyuan himself. At first, Shu Yi didn't know and thought it was prepared by the props department.","Chang Zhiyuan reshot some footage.","But later she saw the behind-the-scenes footage.","The moon lamp was made of wood, with thin wood shavings that could transmit light. Using a balloon as the core, the thin wood shavings were glued onto it bit by bit.","The wood shavings themselves weren't smooth and could easily pop the balloon. Chang Zhiyuan burst many balloons before finally mastering the right pressure and understanding how much glue was needed for the wood shavings to be translucent enough to let light through.","Watching the video of Chang Zhiyuan with glue in one hand, still trying and pasting, Shu Yi couldn't help but be moved.","This prop, which he wasn't supposed to make, took him a long time to complete.","The final moon was round and large, and even waterproof.","Shu Yi knew he wasn't just pursuing perfection.","When reading the script, she had said, \"The male lead making a wooden moon for the female lead is so romantic.\"","Later, he personally glued those tiny wood shavings together, piece by piece.","So, he must be serious, right?","People always feel happiest when approaching happiness, but become anxious and worried when in the midst of it.","So what was she? She was content with her current life, but over the years, as she had emerged from her insecurities and transformed from an ugly duckling into a swan in others' eyes, she still remained insecure at her core.","She didn't feel extremely happy, nor was she truly happy, yet she had already begun to worry about losing what she had.","The bright moon between the clouds was racing towards fullness, as the clouds gradually dispersed.","Shu Yi sat by the hotel window, gazing at the bright moon in the sky. Her thoughts were elsewhere.","At 24 years old, her romantic life was a blank slate. From her once unwavering determination to her current state of gradual uncertainty, she had become afraid.","This trip to the Tibetan City, rather than being a relaxation after finishing her film shoot, was more of an opportunity she had given herself to erase the feelings that shouldn't have arisen in her heart.","They say the winds of the Tibetan City can carry away one's sorrows."]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Model","paragraphs":["It's said that the air in Tibetan City can cleanse one's soul, so everything will pass.","After staying in a hotel for several days, Shu Yi fully equipped herself and went to a large mall in Western Sichuan to purchase supplies for her trip to Tibet.","Shen Yin also bought quite a few items. It had been a long time since she had the chance to showcase her culinary skills and prepare a full table of dishes. Now that she wasn't busy, she naturally wanted to make more delicious food to treat herself.","The Indian summer was still ongoing, and the weather was stuffy and hot, so it was important to stimulate the appetite.","Shen Yin made a cold noodle salad with sour and spicy dressing as the main course. She mixed minced garlic, sesame seeds, and chili powder with hot oil, then added soy sauce, oyster sauce, aged vinegar, salt, and sugar. After cooking the noodles, she drained them and added various seasonal vegetables, tomatoes, cucumber strips, and cilantro.","The cold noodle salad looked vibrant and tasted delicious.","Worried that the noodles might be too sour and spicy for little Zhengzheng, Shen Yin specially made eggplant meat patties for him as the main dish.","She also prepared shrimp and egg custard, spicy chicken wings, boneless chicken feet, carp and tofu soup, \"tiger skin\" eggs, garlic vermicelli, and king oyster mushrooms in a fragrant sauce.","\"Mommy, it's delicious,\" said the little one, holding an eggplant meat patty in one hand and a small spoon in the other to scoop up the carp soup from his bowl.","After the meal, Xu Xiuhe volunteered to clean up the table, while Shen Yin was pulled into the living room by Zhengzheng.","\"Mommy, draw,\" the little one said, bringing out his coloring book for Shen Yin to color.","\"Sweetie, this is green. Look at the crayons and find the one that matches this color. Then you can use it to color this area,\" Shen Yin instructed.","She had bought the coloring book, initially hesitating and worrying that Zhengzheng might be too young to understand or know how to color. But after bringing it home on a whim, she discovered that she had greatly underestimated Zhengzheng. Not only could he use the crayons to fill in the colors, but he did so with great patience, coloring every corner neatly.","Shen Yin also noticed something else – in professional terms, Zhengzheng showed signs of obsessive-compulsive disorder.","This was a trait that Xu Xiuhe didn't have.","When playing with building blocks, the little one would arrange them extremely neatly. After playing with toys, he would put them away in storage boxes, arranging them perfectly straight without any misalignment.","Even when eating and spitting out bones, he would arrange them neatly on the dining table.","The little one lowered his head to color for a while, then unexpectedly fell asleep while kneeling.","Shen Yin carried him to the sofa and continued coloring the unfinished parts of his picture.","When Xu Xiuhe came out of the kitchen, he saw Shen Yin lying on the sofa like a child doing homework, carefully coloring the picture book.","\"Are you drawing?\" he asked.","\"No, this is Zhengzheng's coloring book. It's quite interesting. Look, after coloring, the patterns become clear. It's quite satisfying,\" she replied.","\"Don't you feel satisfied when you paint your own pictures?\" Xu Xiuhe asked. He had seen Shen Yin's paintings before – whether Chinese landscapes or Western oil paintings, they all had clear lines and distinct colors, very aesthetically pleasing.","\"I do, but it's a different kind of satisfaction,\" she explained.","Xu Xiuhe sat down.","\"What's the matter? You're sitting down too,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"Let's date,\" he said.","Shen Yin almost had a question mark written on her face.","\"Our dating isn't over yet. Isn't this what young couples do nowadays? Doing activities together, you draw, and I watch.\"","\"What's there to watch in this? It's boring. This is for children to exercise their minds, improve concentration, and distinguish colors. I'm only doing it because I find it satisfying. I'm not drawing you, so you don't have to watch.\"","\"Good idea. You can draw me instead.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt a bit jealous. There were many oil paintings by Shen Yin in the house, but the subject of each one was Xu Yunzheng. Why hadn't she painted one of him?","\"Alright, I'll draw you,\" she agreed.","They carried Zhengzheng back to his room on the second floor and put him to bed. Zhengzheng usually slept soundly during his naps, typically for about three hours without waking up.","Feeling assured, they went up to the third floor.","In Ziyue Manor, the first floor consisted of the living room, kitchen, dining room, and guest room. The second floor had the master bedroom, secondary bedrooms, and a study. The third floor was for various entertainment, fitness, and leisure activities.","Shen Yin's painting supplies were on the third floor.","Xu Xiuhe found a spot with good lighting and moved Shen Yin's easel there.","Then he took off his shirt.","\"What are you doing?\" she asked.","\"Aren't many oil painting models shirtless in foreign countries? Don't figure models pose without shirts?\"","\"Do you have some misunderstanding about oil painting? Qi Ji studied at the Academy of Fine Arts for several years, majoring in oil painting, and I've never heard that oil painting models don't wear shirts.\"","\"It's fine. You're the one painting, and only you will see it. It doesn't matter whether I wear a shirt or not.\"","Unable to persuade Xu Xiuhe otherwise, Shen Yin went along with it.","Due to his regular workouts, Xu Xiuhe had an impressive physique. His skin tone was a perfect balance between tanned and fair. His abdominal muscles were well-defined, with just the right amount of muscle.","Shen Yin glanced up once, then quickly lowered her head. Showing off abs in broad daylight, how inappropriate!","\"Why aren't you looking at me while you draw?\" he asked.","Shen Yin, blushing, replied, \"You know very well why.\"","\"Wife, are you feeling shy?\"","Shen Yin dared not look up again. In broad daylight, that upper body was just...","\"Be quiet! Models aren't supposed to talk.\"","\"I'm not just your oil painting model, I'm also your husband. Or are you saying you know me so well that you can draw me without even looking?\"","\"Mm-hmm, I remember well enough.\"","\"It's been a while since you've really gotten familiar with my body. Why don't we reacquaint ourselves?\"","Shen Yin was past her special period, and Xu Xiuhe had no reservations. His words were flirtatious, and his actions even more so. Shen Yin couldn't resist.","And so, in the afternoon, on the third floor, next to the easel...","\"That's enough, Zhengzheng will wake up soon,\" Shen Yin said, exhausted. Judging by the sun outside, she guessed the time. Zhengzheng should indeed be waking up soon.","\"Did you plan this all along?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"No, it's just that you kept blushing. It was a spur-of-the-moment thing,\" he replied.","Shen Yin would be a fool to believe a man's lies. Spur of the moment? How could everything be so well-prepared then? She didn't believe he carried those things with him all the time. It must have been premeditated.","When they went downstairs, Zhengzheng had just woken up. Rubbing his eyes, he asked, \"Daddy, Mommy, is it dark outside?\"","\"No, it's not dark yet, Zhengzheng.\"","\"Wah, Zhengzheng had a nightmare. Zhengzheng dreamed of falling into water.\"","\"Zhengzheng, it was just a dream, not real. Mommy's here to hold you,\" Shen Yin said, scooping up Zhengzheng to comfort her before she even had a chance to wash up.","\"Water... water...\" the little one whimpered, her voice choked with tears.","\"There, there. Dreams aren't real, sweetie. Don't cry, Zhengzheng. You're safe in Mommy's arms. There's no water here,\" Shen Yin soothed.","Xu Yunzheng clung tightly to Shen Yin's neck, burying his face in her shoulder.","\"What's wrong? Did he not wake up properly?\" Xu Xiuhe asked as he came downstairs, noticing Zhengzheng crying."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: RV","paragraphs":["\"I think he had a nightmare. He's been crying since he woke up, saying something about water.\"","Xu Xiuhe was also a first-time father, and faced with this situation, he felt at a loss. If it had been Shen Yin having a nightmare, he could have comforted her. But when a child has a nightmare and is frightened, they often can't hear what adults are saying.","\"It's okay, Zhengzheng. Don't be afraid. Mommy and Daddy are here,\" Shen Yin said, gently patting Zhengzheng's back.","The little one's cries gradually subsided, but he still felt no sense of security, curling up small in Shen Yin's arms.","\"Let me hold him. He's quite heavy,\" Xu Xiuhe said, reaching out to take Zhengzheng.","\"No, no! Want Mommy!\" Zhengzheng clung even tighter.","\"It's alright, I'm not tired,\" Shen Yin reassured her husband.","Shen Yin had been holding Zhengzheng for a long time. When she tried to put him down, his whole body protested.","With him like this, Shen Yin couldn't do anything else.","Even dinner was prepared by Xu Xiuhe.","\"What do you want to eat?\"","\"I don't feel like eating. I'm a bit worried about him,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"I'll make something light to fill our stomachs, then we can take him to see a doctor.\"","\"Okay, which department should we go to?\"","Xu Xiuhe was stumped. He really didn't know which department to visit when a baby has a nightmare and is too scared to stop crying.","Xu Xiuhe made some egg drop soup and stir-fried potato strips, but neither of them ate much.","\"Zhengzheng, would you like some soup? You'll be hungry if you don't eat,\" Shen Yin coaxed.","Xu Yunzheng, still in Shen Yin's arms, didn't speak but shook his head in refusal.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were truly alarmed. Zhengzheng had never been like this before. Logically, he should have forgotten about the nightmare by now.","They had forgotten one thing: Zhengzheng had a good memory.","\"Let's take him to the hospital. Wait downstairs for a moment, I'll go up and pack some things for him,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","He went upstairs, grabbed Zhengzheng's daily-use bag, and brought down Shen Yin's phone as well.","The man drove, and the family of three arrived at Rong City's largest pediatric hospital.","After consulting with several doctors, they were told that in such cases, parental companionship and comfort were needed to reduce the child's anxiety. They advised not to leave the baby alone in a room and said it would get better in a few days.","With no other options, the family returned home.","Back at the house, Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng towards the second floor, but as soon as they started up the stairs, Zhengzheng began to cry again.","\"Stairs... water...\" he whimpered.","\"Try again,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","Shen Yin took a couple more steps up, but Zhengzheng cried even louder.","She quickly retreated to the first floor.","\"What should we do?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Let's all sleep downstairs tonight. We won't go upstairs for now,\" Xu Xiuhe proposed. \"I'll go up and bring down our pajamas and Zhengzheng's, and the toiletries too.\"","\"Alright.\"","Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng to the guest bedroom downstairs.","\"Zhengzheng, shall we take a bath?\" she asked gently.","\"No, no!\" he protested.","\"But you won't feel comfortable sleeping without a bath. Let's go to the bathroom, okay? You'll smell nice after a bath.\"","As Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng towards the bathroom, he started crying fiercely again.","\"No water, no water! Scared!\"","Xu Yunzheng was trembling in Shen Yin's arms, which terrified her.","\"What's wrong? Is he still scared?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, concerned.","\"He's afraid of water. He doesn't want to go upstairs or to the bathroom. What should we do?\" Shen Yin had never experienced anything like this before.","Seeing Zhengzheng like this broke her heart, and she couldn't help but shed tears herself.","\"Let's just put him to bed for now. Once he's sound asleep, we can wipe him down with a towel,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","Shen Yin paced back and forth in the room, holding Zhengzheng.","\"You go take a shower first. He'll probably be asleep by the time you're done, then I'll go in.\"","Xu Xiuhe took his pajamas and a towel into the bathroom while Shen Yin continued to gently pat Zhengzheng's back.","After a while, Zhengzheng finally fell asleep.","When Xu Xiuhe came out of the bathroom, he carefully took Xu Yunzheng from Shen Yin's arms.","Shen Yin showered distractedly, worried that Zhengzheng might have another nightmare or start crying again. She finished much quicker than usual.","\"Did he wake up?\" she asked as she came out.","\"No, he's still asleep.\"","\"That's good. I suspect he might have dreamed about water, and it was on the second floor, which is why he doesn't want to go upstairs or take a bath.\"","\"There's not much a doctor can do about this. Tomorrow is the last day of the National Day holiday. Why don't we leave tomorrow night?\"","\"Is everything settled at the company?\"","\"Yes, I've signed all the necessary documents. Liu Bo can handle the rest of the work, and we can have meetings online.\"","\"Hmm? How long are we planning to go for? It sounds like you're preparing for a long trip.\"","\"About a month. I've never really been on a vacation before. I was always too busy with work. Now the timing is perfect, we can travel for a while and spend time with Zhengzheng.\"","The next day, early in the morning, Xu Xiuhe drove to the supermarket to buy supplies.","Zhengzheng still refused to go upstairs and stuck to Shen Yin like glue, almost like her little shadow.","\"Mommy, where's Daddy?\" he asked.","\"Daddy went to buy some things. We're going on a trip this afternoon. Are you excited, Zhengzheng?\"","\"Yes!\"","Shen Yin crouched down and felt Zhengzheng's forehead. She had read that when babies sleep curled up, it's a sign of feeling insecure.","That was exactly how Zhengzheng had been. The entire night, the little one's body hadn't relaxed, his brow furrowed the whole time. What kind of dream could make a baby remember it for so long?","Since the baby wouldn't go upstairs and wouldn't let Shen Yin go up either, she couldn't pack their luggage. Fortunately, Xu Xiuhe had a good memory and was reliable. He made several trips up and down the stairs, packing luggage for all three of them and loading it into the RV.","It was also Shen Yin's first time in Xu Xiuhe's newly purchased RV. The space inside was indeed quite large, almost like a small home.","\"Mommy, Huahua!\" Zhengzheng suddenly said.","Shen Yin glanced at Xu Xiuhe. They hadn't initially planned to bring Huahua along. There were three dogs (Tibetan Mastiffs) at Ziyue Manor, and they had staff specifically to feed and bathe them, so Xu Xiuhe wasn't worried about Huahua and the others going hungry at home.","\"Do you mean Huahua or Pi Pi?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Huahua!\"","Xu Xiuhe made a last-minute decision to bring Huahua along. Huahua had grown up with Zhengzheng, so even though there were other Tibetan Mastiffs, Zhengzheng still favored Huahua and always wanted to share his food with her.","The family of three and their dog moved into the RV. Xu Xiuhe's driver's license was just right for operating this vehicle. Initially, Xu Xiuhe had considered hiring a professional RV driver, but then he thought that since it was a family trip for the three of them, it would be better if they did everything themselves.","\"Are you all settled in?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Xu Xiuhe was at the wheel, while Shen Yin and Zhengzheng sat at the booth in the back. Taking an RV trip was a first-time experience for both Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe. They weren't sure what kind of challenges they might encounter on the road.","However, they firmly believed that as long as the family of three stuck together, they could overcome any difficult situation they might face."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Taking Care of Qi Ji","paragraphs":["[We're setting off too!]","Shen Yin posted a photo of their RV in the small group chat, along with a travel-themed emoji.","[I'm heading to Tibet.]","Shu Yi shared a photo of herself on the train.","Qi Ji expressed how envious she was, wondering why everyone was going on trips. Had they secretly planned this behind her back?","[Sister Shu Yi, you're actually taking the train?]","Qi Ji was shocked. After all, Sister Shu Yi was a well-known actress now. Walking down the street, 8 out of 10 people would recognize her. Of the other two, one would be an elderly person and the other a child.","[Yes, I am.]","[Aren't you afraid of being recognized? Sister, what about your image as an idol?]","[What's this 'idol image' thing?]","Shen Yin asked.","[Sister Shen Yin, 'idol image' is internet slang. It basically means that beautiful people, especially in your industry, care a lot about their appearance.]","[I see. If Shu Yi dares to take the train now, she must have made herself completely unrecognizable.]","Shen Yin remarked.","Shu Yi sat on the train. She might have looked ordinary earlier, but now she had an image to maintain. The train to Tibet had private compartments. When boarding, she wore a very plain coat, a large hat, and a face mask. Without looking closely, no one would realize she was a celebrity.","Indeed, who would imagine that a glamorous superstar would choose to travel by train?","Ever since Ye Rong learned about Qi Ji's pregnancy, she had neglected the company, spending all day at home researching various foods for pregnant women.","Qi Ji felt like she had already gained weight.","\"What's wrong? You're pouting. Did I upset you? You look unhappy,\" Xue Jingrui asked, lying on the bed.","\"It's not that, Brother Jingrui. Do you think I've gotten fat? I feel like I've become so round.\"","Xue Jingrui looked at Qi Ji carefully and said, \"Where are you round? You're not just yourself anymore, so of course there are changes.\"","\"If I get fat, I won't look good,\" Qi Ji said.","\"How could you not look good? A little plump is cute.\"","\"Brother Jingrui, I feel like my identity has changed again,\" Qi Ji said, walking over to Xue Jingrui.","\"How has it changed?\" Xue Jingrui wanted to add that no matter how she changed, she was still his wife.","\"Don't you think I'm a bit like a panda now?\"","\"Hm?\"","\"Like, at home, Dad doesn't dare speak loudly anymore, afraid of startling me. Mom spends all day in the kitchen researching what I should eat.\"","\"Isn't that good? It shows they care about you.\"","Qi Ji thought about it and realized he was right. If they didn't care, they wouldn't be so attentive. Especially Ye Rong – she could feel that Ye Rong treated her like her own daughter. Anyone who didn't know better might think Ye Rong was her birth mother.","\"Why do you still look unhappy?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Do you really want me to say it?\"","\"Go ahead.\"","\"Sister Shu Yi and Sister Shen Yin have both gone traveling, and I'm so envious. I wasn't like this before. I used to prefer staying at home, but now I've changed. Seeing them go out, I really want to travel too.\"","\"Let me see if I can take some annual leave and accompany you on a trip for a few days, okay?\"","\"Is that possible?\"","\"It should be.\"","That evening at dinner, when Xue Jingrui brought up the idea of taking Qi Ji on a trip, Ye Rong immediately vetoed it.","\"No way!\"","\"Why not?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"You're a man, you don't understand. Young women are delicate. Qi Ji's pregnancy is still in the early stages, not stable yet. The journey would be tiring, and tourist spots are crowded. What if something unexpected happens?\"","Xue Jingrui thought about it and realized it indeed wasn't safe. Qi Ji looked too thin, still like a child, so fragile. If anything unexpected happened, the consequences were unthinkable.","\"Then when can we go on a trip?\"","\"Normally, the first three months of pregnancy are when the fetus is unstable and prone to issues. After three months, it's generally okay. But it also depends on your own body. Some people, after three months, as the pregnancy progresses and they get heavier, don't have the energy to think about traveling. It varies from person to person. Let's wait a few months and see. If it's possible, I'll accompany you.\"","Ye Rong, having been through this herself, understood more. Hearing that the fetus was unstable in the first three months and prone to accidents, Qi Ji didn't dare think about traveling anymore.","The baby in her belly was something she had worked so hard to have.","Of course, Xue Jingrui didn't know about this thought. If he did, he would certainly say, wasn't it because he had worked hard too?","\"Mom, are you really not going to the company anymore?\"","\"My daughter-in-law is more important.\"","Ye Rong's company was neither very large nor small. As the only child in her family, she had inherited the family business.","When she married Xue Kai, his status wasn't what it is now. His career took off after their marriage.","Over the years, Ye Rong had been managing the company alone. She was a career-driven woman, both tough and gentle.","So the employees were quite good, and the company had its own unique operating system. After all, as a woman, Ye Rong needed not only a career but also to be there for her family.","There are always more solutions than problems. Because of her family and Xue Jingrui, she couldn't always stay at the company without going home. Plus, being by Xue Kai's side, she had learned by osmosis how to use people, what kind of people to use, and how to balance relationships between different levels.","Their company had systems of responsibility, supervision, election, and voting. Often, documents didn't even need her signature. In recent years, with the advancement of the internet, she frequently worked from home online.","So when she said these things, she meant it. She could keep an eye on the company, but her daughter-in-law and granddaughter were the priority.","\"Here, Qi Ji, drink more fish soup.\"","Ye Rong served Qi Ji several dishes.","\"Thank you, Mom.\"","\"Don't be polite, Qi Ji. Don't worry about eating too much and gaining weight. You're not eating for one now, but for two. You need to eat enough for proper nutrition. You won't get too fat. The meals I prepare for you are all pregnancy-friendly. You won't gain too much weight.\"","Ye Rong was still concerned.","\"Okay.\"","\"Jingrui, don't just focus on yourself. Remove the bones for Qi Ji. Eating some fish is good for pregnant women too.\"","\"Alright.\"","Xue Jingrui picked up a piece of fish, put it on his own plate, and carefully removed the bones.","After dinner, Xue Jingrui took Qi Ji out for a walk.","Qi Ji patted his belly and said, \"The baby is so lucky to have so many people loving her.\"","\"You're very lucky too,\" came the reply.","\"Yes, Qi Ji is very happy too. Mom has been so good to me, I don't even know how to thank her,\" Qi Ji said, taking small steps and stretching his arms.","\"Taking care of you is probably what makes her happy right now. If you try to thank her, she might think you're being too formal.\"","\"Alright then. Let's wait and see how things are in three months. If possible, we'll go on a trip. If not, we'll wait until after the baby is born and take her along.\"","The moon appeared. Qi Ji took out his phone and snapped a photo."]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Water","paragraphs":["Qi Ji found another angle and thought, how beautiful the moon is. Sharing the moon is such a romantic thing to do.","[I wonder if we're looking at the same moon.]","Qi Ji posted the photo in the group chat and asked them about it.","Shu Yi had almost forgotten about the moon, but when Qi Ji shared the moon picture, her heart felt like it was being pinched by ants.","[It's the same one.]","Shen Yin casually took a picture of the moon and sent it.","Shu Yi looked up at the window of the train. It was nice - she couldn't see the moon from here. Did that mean her current feelings were like the moon outside the train window - ethereal and fleeting, destined to fade away without a trace?","\"Zhengzheng, shall we look at the moon together?\"","Zhengzheng had started to relax since getting into the RV that afternoon, no longer clinging to Shen Yin every moment.","\"Moon,\" Xu Yunzheng pointed at the moon.","\"What does the moon look like?\"","\"The crescent moon looks like a little boat.\"","\"Zhengzheng, the moon isn't actually crescent-shaped. It's just partially covered by clouds. Shall we take a bath?\" Shen Yin tried to coax Zhengzheng into bathing.","Xu Xiuhe had chosen the RV, considering that Zhengzheng was small and would need adults to bathe him. He had specifically picked one with a large bathroom.","\"There's water.\"","The RV was now parked at a service area.","Xu Xiuhe had closed all the doors and windows of the RV.","Xu Yunzheng still didn't want to take a bath.","Shen Yin glanced at Xu Xiuhe, then lowered her head.","\"Zhengzheng, can you tell Mommy and Daddy what's wrong with the water?\"","Xu Yunzheng seemed to be thinking hard about Shen Yin's question.","\"Water drowns people. People can't get up.\"","\"Zhengzheng, that was just a dream. Dreams aren't real. Don't be afraid, okay? Will you let Mommy give you a bath?\" Xu Xiuhe tried to comfort him.","The little boy still shook his head.","\"Zhengzheng, how about Mommy gives you a bath while Daddy stays right outside the door with us? There won't be much water, it can't drown you.\"","Seeing that Zhengzheng was wavering a bit, Xu Xiuhe added, \"Zhengzheng, Mommy and Daddy will be right there. We won't let the water drown you. After your bath, we'll all go to sleep together.\"","\"Children who don't bathe aren't being good. Will you let Mommy give you a bath?\"","Shen Yin picked up Xu Yunzheng to carry him to the bathroom.","The little boy didn't resist, clinging tightly to Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe followed behind the mother and son.","During the bath, Zhengzheng still wouldn't get in the water, keeping his legs tucked up.","The bathroom was small, so Xu Xiuhe couldn't go in. He could only stand outside the door, talking to distract Xu Yunzheng's attention.","The bath was extremely difficult, and when it was over, Shen Yin was so exhausted she could barely stand up.","Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng to the bedside, but as soon as he tried to put him down, the little boy's whole body tensed with resistance.","\"Let's sleep. Daddy will hold you while you sleep.\"","After the little one fell asleep, Xu Xiuhe placed him on the bed and covered him with a blanket.","The sleeping Xu Yunzheng's eyelids fluttered a few times. Xu Xiuhe gently patted him, and the little boy continued sleeping.","Shen Yin sat in the nearby booth, running her fingers through her hair. Faced with this situation, she felt powerless for the first time.","If he were sick, it would be easier - they could go to the hospital, see a doctor. But now, seeing Zhengzheng so tense, startled by the slightest movement, her heart ached terribly.","Xu Xiuhe came over from the bedside and sat down in the booth as well. Seeing Zhengzheng like this made both him and Shen Yin feel awful and emotionally drained.","It turns out that many times, many things can't be solved just with money.","\"It's okay now. He'll be better in a few days.\"","Xu Xiuhe pulled Shen Yin into his arms.","\"It's all our fault. If we had stayed with him while he slept, would this have happened?\"","Shen Yin started to blame herself.","\"It's okay, it's not your fault. We couldn't have prevented this. Even when I'm with you, don't you often have nightmares?\"","Shen Yin suddenly perked up and sat up straight.","\"When I have nightmares, I forget them quickly. But real nightmares, you never forget. Do you think Zhengzheng might be the same way? Could he have had a premonition dream?\"","Shen Yin's question truly stumped Xu Xiuhe.","\"Surely not. He's still so young. It was probably just a nightmare that scared him. Don't overthink it.\"","\"Alright, but we should still take precautions. For a while, when we go out, let's not go anywhere near water.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"And tomorrow night, let's not sleep in the RV.\"","\"Where should we go then?\"","\"Tomorrow morning, we'll explore this city a bit. Then in the afternoon, we'll drive. We should be able to reach South City by tomorrow night.\"","\"South City?\"","\"Yes, that's where my mother's family is from. My mother was always trying to leave me a way out. Even my startup capital was left to me by her. When I graduated from university, the Sun family in South City - that's my uncle's family - sent me some money to start my business.\"","\"Your uncle?\"","\"Yes, my mother's family has always been quite well-off. She married from South City to Rong City. But back then, transportation wasn't as developed as it is now, and the distance between South City and Rong City was quite far. Xu Guimin was always busy with work, so my mother hardly ever went back to South City. I'm not very close with my uncle.\"","\"So this time when we go to South City, will we visit your uncle's house?\"","\"We'll go see him. He must be quite old by now. We should pay him a visit. After all, he is my mother's brother.\"","\"After your mother passed away, did your uncle know about your life in the Xu family?\"","\"After Mom passed, my uncle wanted to take me to South City, but I didn't want to go. I wanted to stay in Rong City with Mom. Later, that man found another woman who already had a child about my age. That made me even more determined to stay.\"","\"It's okay. No matter what happens in the future, I'll always be with you.\"","\"Good. Let's go to sleep too.\"","Inside the RV, the lower bed was just big enough for the family of three. Shen Yin pulled the little one closer to her.","The next morning, while the mother and son were still asleep, Xu Xiuhe went downstairs to buy some food and brought it back up.","Shen Yin woke up to the smell of food. When she opened her eyes, Zhengzheng was in her arms, his big eyes wide open.","\"You must be hungry. Let's get up and have breakfast. After we eat, we'll set off. This morning we're going mountain climbing.\"","\"Sounds great.\"","The weather was perfect, crisp and clear.","\"It's not as hot as it was a few days ago,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"Tomorrow's the Mid-Autumn Festival. If it were still that hot, the weather would be off.\"","\"Oh, that's right. I almost forgot.\"","\"I never imagined we'd be spending the Mid-Autumn Festival away from home as a family of three.\"","\"Mid-Autumn is a festival of reunion. As long as we're together as a family, it doesn't matter where we celebrate it.\"","\"It seems Shu Yi might have to spend the Mid-Autumn Festival alone.\"","\"Has she arrived in Tibetan City?\"","\"Yes, she arrived this morning.\"","\"Chang Zhiyuan knows about it. He's also heading to Tibetan City now. If all goes well, they might spend the Mid-Autumn Festival together tomorrow.\"","\"Did you tell him?\"","\"Not exactly. He figured it out on his own. He just asked me to confirm.\"","\"Their relationship is their own business. None of us should interfere.\""]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: South City","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe readily agreed, saying that winning over a wife should be done on one's own merits, and he wouldn't interfere.","When they arrived at the scenic area in the morning, there weren't many people. The National Day holiday had just ended, and the tourists in the scenic area could be counted on one hand.","Quanya Mountain was quite tall, named for its springs and cliffs. It had been developed for tourism in recent years, so the number of visitors had increased.","\"We won't go to the spring later,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Xiuhe immediately understood what Shen Yin meant.","Halfway up the mountain, both Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe regretted their decision.","Although it was a crisp autumn day, they couldn't withstand continuous exercise. The stairs were steep, and they had a child with them. Sweat was pouring down their faces.","\"Xiuhe, what made you think of mountain climbing?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I read online that mountain climbing can strengthen the body and improve the respiratory and cardiovascular systems,\" Xu Xiuhe replied honestly.","They were holding Zhengzheng's hands. The child had walked this far without asking to be carried, which was quite considerate.","The little one's face was flushed, and sweat kept beading on his forehead.","Not only did Shen Yin start to feel sorry for him, but Xu Xiuhe also felt guilty. Since starting college until now, he had never traveled, so he didn't really understand how to choose tourist attractions.","\"Let's take the cable car down,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"I've been wanting to say that. It's too hot. Luckily, Zhengzheng hasn't asked us to carry him, otherwise...\"","\"Mommy, carry me. Zhengzheng is tired,\" the child said.","Shen Yin: ...","\"Zhengzheng, how about daddy carries you? Mommy is a girl, it's too tiring for her,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","The little one turned to face Xu Xiuhe and stretched out his arms. Xu Xiuhe quickly picked up Xu Yunzheng. He had chosen to climb the mountain, so he had to bear the consequences.","After they came down the mountain, Shen Yin took Zhengzheng while Xu Xiuhe went to take a shower in the RV's bathroom. She sat with Zhengzheng in the booth, telling him the story of the old monk and the young monk.","\"Mommy, what's a monk?\" Zhengzheng asked.","\"A monk is someone who has no hair and leaves home to practice religion,\" she explained.","\"Zhengzheng wants to be a monk.\"","\"Monks can't eat meat. Can Zhengzheng do that?\"","\"No, no, I don't want to be a monk!\" The little one was nearly in tears at the thought of not being able to eat meat.","\"How quickly you change your mind!\"","\"Zhengzheng wants to eat meat.\"","\"Alright, when daddy comes out, we'll go eat.\"","In Tibetan City.","After getting off the train, Shu Yi took a taxi to the hotel she had booked in advance.","It's often said that Tibetan City is a mysterious place, the closest place to heaven. On her train journey, Shu Yi had admired many beautiful landscapes along the way, occasionally seeing free-roaming cattle and sheep on the plains, and often being amazed by the clouds on the horizon.","Some say that Tibetan City is a place everyone wants to visit at least once in their lifetime! It's a place closest to the sky and farthest from the hustle and bustle.","Shu Yi felt the same way. It was her first time traveling alone to such a distant place. She thought she might feel a bit uncomfortable, but she didn't. Her body had already been gradually adapting to the altitude during the train ride.","In the evening.","The sky in Tibetan City seemed more meaningful than in other places. Shu Yi leaned close to the window. It was beautiful - the sky was full of stars, with no moon in sight.","\"Shu Yueru!\"","A name she hadn't heard in a long time was suddenly called out.","Shu Yi looked down through the window. She thought she was hallucinating. She knew it was Chang Zhiyuan's voice without even looking.","The man stood downstairs, calling \"Shu Yueru\" over and over again.","It wasn't a hallucination.","Shu Yi felt like her feet weren't her own anymore. She could have hidden upstairs and not gone down, but she didn't.","She walked down uncontrollably.","\"Why are you here?\" she asked.","\"I should be asking you that. Why did you come to Tibetan City? Don't you know how dangerous it is for a girl to travel alone to such a distant place?\"","\"Did you come all this way just to lecture me?\"","\"Do you think I'm crazy? I drove for 24 hours straight to come here just to lecture you?\"","Shu Yi didn't speak, looking at Chang Zhiyuan's haggard face with a bit of sympathy.","\"Didn't you sleep on the way?\"","\"No. I was worried something might happen to you.\"","\"You might get altitude sickness like this.\"","\"I just asked the hotel, there are no rooms available,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","The man's gaze was fixed on Shu Yi.","Shu Yi felt a bit uncomfortable under his stare.","\"So what should we do?\"","\"I'll sleep in your room. I'll sleep on the floor. I'm too tired.\"","Chang Zhiyuan could barely keep his eyes open. It was a miracle that he had driven all the way from Chuan City without resting.","Shu Yi felt sorry for him.","\"Come up then.\"","Shu Yi led Chang Zhiyuan to her room.","In South City.","The family of three arrived at the Sun family home.","\"Uncle, this is my wife Shen Yin, and this is my son Xu Yunzheng,\" Xu Xiuhe introduced them to Sun Lufei, who was sitting in a wheelchair.","\"That's wonderful. The child is so big already. If your mother were still alive, she would be so happy.\"","\"Come here, child. Let your grand-uncle take a look,\" Sun Lufei beckoned.","Zhengzheng had been timid these past few days, and now faced with a stranger, he didn't dare to approach.","He tightly hugged Shen Yin's leg, hiding behind her.","\"Zhengzheng, don't be afraid. This is your grand-uncle, daddy's uncle. You can say hello to him,\" Shen Yin encouraged.","The little one looked up at Shen Yin, then turned to look at Xu Xiuhe, before slowly walking forward.","\"Hello, Grand-uncle.\"","\"Ah, such a good boy. Here, this is a gift Grand-uncle prepared for Zhengzheng.\"","Sun Lufei took out a jade pendant from his pocket.","Shen Yin immediately recognized it as a high-quality warm jade.","Zhengzheng didn't dare to accept it until Xu Xiuhe spoke up. Then he reached out and took the jade pendant.","\"Thank you, Grand-uncle,\" he said in his little voice, which anyone would find adorable.","Sun Lufei laughed heartily.","\"Uncle, what happened to your leg?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"It's an old problem. A couple of years ago, I was in a car accident. Because of my age, my recovery ability isn't strong, so I've had to use a wheelchair ever since.\"","Sun Lufei spoke about it as if he were talking about someone else's story, without any sadness about his leg condition.","\"What did the doctors say?\"","\"The doctors said surgery might not be successful. I figured, I'm already 60, getting on in years. I don't have many years left, so I might as well just use the wheelchair.\"","\"Look at your uncle, he won't listen to advice. Your cousin and I have talked to him many times, but he just won't listen,\" Sun Lufei's wife said as she walked out.","\"Where's my cousin?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"He doesn't live with us. It's just me and your uncle here every day. It would be nice if you all could stay a few more days. It's livelier with more people around. Oh, that's right, tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival. It's perfect for a family reunion. The last time your aunt saw you was at your mother's... My, how you've grown up so fast, even having a child of your own now.\"","The woman didn't finish the sentence in the middle, but Xu Xiuhe knew what she meant.","At his mother's funeral, Sun Lufei and Xu Guimin had gotten into an argument. He hadn't listened carefully at the time, but the gist of it was that Xu Guimin hadn't taken good care of Wen Ting all these years."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: Sun Family","paragraphs":["\"Wash your hands, it's time to eat. Would you like Great-Aunt to hold you, darling?\" The woman walked over to Zhengzheng.","\"Great-Aunt.\"","\"Yes, dear.\"","The woman was delighted.","Her own grandson rarely came back after starting school. She had always loved children, but her daughter-in-law also wanted to look after him. Fortunately, tomorrow was a holiday, so her son and grandson would both be coming home.","\"When you got married, I couldn't travel to Rong City because of my leg problems. I didn't get to see you wed. Why don't you stay in South City for a while this time?\"","Sun Lufei's face seemed to bear the marks of a lifetime, with wrinkles giving him a weathered appearance.","\"Uncle, at my mother's funeral, you and my father...?\" Xu Xiuhe brought up events from over a decade ago, causing Sun Lufei to fall into deep thought.","\"Ah, I thought you were too young to remember, but I didn't expect you to ask about it. When Wenting married Xu Guimin, my parents - your grandparents - didn't approve. What parents want their daughter to marry far away? Your grandmother was worried Wenting wouldn't have a good life there, so she sent a lot of dowry, hoping it would give your mother some status in the Xu family. Later, when your mother contacted us, she only shared good news, never the bad. She basically never brought you back to visit. Then, the next news I received was that your mother was gravely ill.\"","\"I wanted to bring you to South City, but your father refused. He had promised to take good care of your mother. Your grandparents felt guilty until their dying day, regretting their anger towards your mother, knowing she had suffered so much. They... they didn't look kindly upon you.\"","\"Are you saying my mother insisted on marrying Xu Guimin?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yes. Before your mother passed, she left me some assets to manage for her, to be given to you when you came of age.\"","Xu Xiuhe fell silent for a moment.","\"How is Xu Guimin doing?\" Sun Lufei inquired.","\"I don't know. I haven't been back since I was 18,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"What? Did your stepmother mistreat you?\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't respond.","Did Yang Cui mistreat him? Yes and no.","Not long after his mother's death, his father had married Yang Cui, bringing along a son three or four years younger than him. It was clear that Xu Guimin had been unfaithful for a long time.","He was old enough to understand everything then. He often caused trouble for Yang Cui, so Xu Guimin frequently scolded him, saying he was inconsiderate and didn't respect his elders.","Yang Cui was his elder, and he was supposed to treat her with respect.","To hell with respect, he thought. He was rebellious then and often got beaten. Aunt Song protected and cared for him. When he was in ninth grade, Yang Cui complained that he didn't respect her. Aunt Song said something in his defense, and Yang Cui tattled to Xu Guimin, claiming Aunt Song had talked back to her.","At first, Xu Guimin didn't fire Aunt Song, but after Yang Cui's constant nagging, Aunt Song was eventually dismissed.","Xu Xiuhe had cried when Aunt Song left.","\"It's all in the past now,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Why didn't you come to me? If I had known you were living like this all these years, I would have gone and beaten that scoundrel,\" Sun Lufei said.","Sun Lufei knew about Xu Guimin's remarriage but hadn't thought much of it at first. After all, it wasn't unusual for a widower in his thirties to remarry.","Now, hearing that his nephew had run away at 18, he couldn't help but suspect there was more to the story.","\"That man was having an affair, wasn't he?\"","Xu Xiuhe's silence confirmed it.","\"I'm sorry. I've failed you as an uncle. I should have paid more attention to you all these years,\" Sun Lufei said, filled with regret. He blamed himself for being too busy with work to look after his nephew. Now it felt too late.","\"It's in the past,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","He didn't feel that Sun Lufei had failed him at all. This was his own business, and no matter how much Sun Lufei might have intervened, it couldn't change the fact that Xu Guimin had betrayed his mother.","\"So now, does Xu Guimin have any children other than you?\" Sun Lufei asked.","He only knew that his nephew was capable, having started his own business and gradually built Heyuan Group into a well-known enterprise. He didn't know much about the Xu family's affairs.","\"There's one. Xu Zhengyang, three years younger than me. He works at Xu Group.\"","Hearing this, Sun Lufei understood everything. He had never approved of that man. Outsiders said Sun Wenting had married well, that it was a powerful alliance between her family and the Xu family of Rong City.","Only their family didn't see it that way. How was it powerful? The Xu family wasn't any better than theirs.","\"When I see Xu Guimin, I'm going to break that man's legs. Not only did he fail to take care of Wenting, but he even dared to have an affair while married to her.\"","\"Oh, stop it. You talk about breaking someone's legs when you should worry about fixing your own first,\" his wife interjected from the side.","Sun Lufei shook his head and glanced at his wife. Why did she always have to bring up his sore spots?","\"How did you get here? By plane?\" Sun Lufei asked.","Rong City was in the east, slightly towards the center, while South City was, as its name suggested, in the south.","The two cities were quite far apart. By plane, it would take less than two hours; by high-speed rail, over three hours; and by car, nearly 12 hours.","That's why Sun Lufei asked this question.","\"No, we're not busy lately, and Zhengzheng is over two years old now. We decided to take him on a trip. We came in an RV.\"","\"That must have taken a long time, then?\"","\"It wasn't too bad. We didn't drive non-stop.\"","\"Since you're out traveling, why not stay in South City for a while? There's plenty to see and do here,\" Xu Xiuhe's aunt suggested.","Shen Yin glanced at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Uncle, Aunt, we'll stay until after the Mid-Autumn Festival, then we're planning to spend a few days in Yun City,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"That's good. Yun City is beautiful, with great scenery and fresh air. It's perfect for a short stay,\" Sun Lufei agreed.","\"That may be true, but you need to be careful. It's near the border, so the security might not be as good as here.\"","\"We will.\"","After dinner, Sun Lufei had the housekeeper prepare a bedroom for the family of three.","Zhengzheng was still a bit resistant to water, but thankfully, the room was well-lit. Xu Xiuhe joined them in the bedroom, and together with Shen Yin, they managed to bathe Zhengzheng without him crying.","In a hotel in Tibetan City, Shu Yi was drinking the local specialty liquor while Chang Zhiyuan emerged from the bedroom.","The man wore a white bathrobe, his black hair still dripping with water. As he came out, he seemed to radiate heat from his body.","\"I'm done. You can go wash now. I used the towel, what will you do?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Only now did he realize that there was only one dry towel in the bathroom. This room was originally meant for a single person, so the conditions here were certainly not as good as the hotels in Rong City.","However, it was evident that this hotel was considered quite good in Tibetan City. Well, of course – Shu Yi was something of a wealthy woman herself, and she had a reputation to maintain. How could she possibly settle for staying in hotels with poor conditions?"]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: Like","paragraphs":["It was precisely because of this that Chang Zhiyuan was able to find Shu Yi so quickly and accurately.","When he learned that Shu Yi wasn't in Rong City, he panicked. This woman had left Rong City without a sound, without even notifying the company. He became instantly anxious.","He truly liked Shu Yi, otherwise he wouldn't have pursued her for so long.","Emotions weren't something he could control. Call him a playboy or a womanizer from before, he would admit to it all.","Because in the past, he really didn't care. After all, it was all just a game, so he played. But later, things changed. At first, he just thought Shu Yi was beautiful, with a cold demeanor, not fond of getting involved in company affairs.","She would show up for filming when there was work, and disappear when there wasn't. He accidentally discovered that the company had such a character, and became interested right away.","He sent flowers, gave gifts, but in the end, the most valuable ones were all returned. Perhaps it was a man's desire to conquer that drove him. He was determined to win this woman over. And after winning her, he'd dump her, let her taste the cruelty of the world.","Later, because of Xu Xiu and Shen Yin's relationship, he got to know more about Shu Yi.","As he got to know her better, he discovered that this woman wasn't what she appeared to be. She wasn't cold at all. Or perhaps, she was only cold to people she wasn't familiar with.","For instance, she was indifferent towards him. Despite him being her top boss.","Shu Yi was different with Shen Yin - talkative, expressive, without any celebrity airs, let alone the burden of being an idol.","He was gradually attracted to her. By then, he had been pursuing her for nearly three months.","His initial intention of just playing around had changed.","He wanted to understand her, to know her from her high school days when she was called Shu Yueru. He witnessed her gradual transformation, as if she were a butterfly emerging from its cocoon, becoming who she is now.","He didn't think she wasn't pretty before. The past Shu Yi was also a part of who she is now. Every step in life is meaningful. It was precisely because she had experienced that dimness that she became stronger.","He felt sorry for her during that time, but also found that version of Shu Yi very adorable.","Yes, the entertainment industry doesn't lack beautiful women. Looking around, there are countless gorgeous faces.","But as the saying goes, beautiful faces are a dime a dozen, but interesting souls are one in a million.","As he got to know her, he discovered that Shu Yi was not only beautiful but also interesting.","He didn't know exactly what about Shu Yi attracted him, but he started to get serious. He wanted to be good to Shu Yi. He also knew that his past self might not have been worthy of Shu Yi, but once you like someone, how can you willingly give up?","He guessed that Shu Yi might have gone traveling, but he wasn't sure. If she had left right after returning from Hai City, she would have been gone for several days already. With no other choice, he could only seek help from his good friend.","When he learned that Shu Yi hadn't gone directly to Tibetan City, but had stayed in Chuan City for a few days, he immediately boarded a plane to Chuan City.","Upon finding out that Shu Yi had taken a train to Tibetan City, he rented a car in Chuan City and headed non-stop towards Tibetan City.","On the way, he calculated Shu Yi's arrival time based on the train schedule, and chose a hotel where Shu Yi was most likely to stay, considering the nearby hotel conditions.","Fortunately, he hadn't chosen wrong, nor had he missed her by much.","Shu Yi took out a towel and various toiletries from her suitcase and entered the bathroom.","Chang Zhiyuan was also considerate. He had originally thought of sleeping on the floor, but he had underestimated the hotel's conditions. Now he saw that there was actually a sofa in the room.","So he wouldn't need to sleep on the floor after all.","When Shu Yi came out of the bathroom, she saw Chang Zhiyuan lying on the sofa, wearing a bathrobe.","In October, it was already very cold in Tibetan City, with average daily high temperatures below 20 degrees Celsius, and average daily low temperatures around 4-5 degrees.","Shu Yi had done her research, so she had packed thick clothes in her suitcase. But Chang Zhiyuan hadn't thought about it that much. When he learned that Shu Yi was heading to Tibetan City, he just grabbed a suitcase and came over.","Shu Yi came out of the bathroom wearing pajamas. Considering she wasn't alone in the room, she had even put on a chest sticker.","\"Hello, is this the front desk? Please send up an extra blanket.\"","Shu Yi called room service.","The sofa in the room wasn't small, but for Chang Zhiyuan, who was over 1.80 meters tall, lying on it was indeed a bit cramped.","Shu Yi had no choice. He had come of his own accord; she couldn't very well sleep on the sofa herself.","The man, having driven for a long time without rest, was now sound asleep on the sofa.","After the knock on the door, Shu Yi took the blanket and walked to the sofa, covering Chang Zhiyuan.","The man slept deeply, without any awareness, his features filled with fatigue.","Shu Yi sighed. At this point, questioning how Chang Zhiyuan knew she was here was meaningless.","Her heart began to waver. She had originally planned to come here to clear her mind, sort out her feelings, and get over her troubles with Chang Zhiyuan.","But now, with this man right in front of her, how could she sort out her feelings? It was impossible.","Not only could she not sort things out, but everything had become even more complicated.","After changing the bedding to her own, Shu Yi also lay down.","Closing her eyes, her mind was full of Chang Zhiyuan's image. She realized she had changed. In the past, she would have been much colder, pretending not to hear that \"Shu Yueru,\" and certainly wouldn't have let him into her room.","But now, she was actually sharing a room with a man, and her mind was full of thoughts of him.","Love is an eternally complex proposition.","Being in the entertainment industry, Shu Yi had seen all sorts of relationships, making her more rational. Would love really last forever?","From the \"myth of love\" to today's \"love dilemma,\" many issues made her afraid to develop feelings. As she had said before, she still believed in love, but didn't believe it would happen to her.","From having no one to take care of children after giving birth, to conflicts between mothers-in-law and daughters-in-law, to domestic violence, emotional manipulation, and insurance fraud appearing in the news.","Nowadays, fewer and fewer women are getting married. Shu Yi was not only afraid of marriage but also afraid of her own tendency to be blinded by love. She knew herself too well.","When not involved, she saw things clearer than anyone else. But once she fell into it, she would want to give everything to the other person.","That unrequited love during her high school days was her exercise in restraint and self-control.","Now, she probably could no longer utter those words she had said to Shen Yin long ago—that she would never fall for Chang Zhiyuan.","She began to feel afraid. A faint light filtered in from outside, though she couldn't tell if it was moonlight or the glow from the street lamps below.","She lay in bed, her mind unusually active, without a trace of drowsiness.","Though she should have been exhausted, sleep eluded her.","What would she do tomorrow? How would she face Chang Zhiyuan?"]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Marry Me","paragraphs":["The first ray of morning sunlight shone through the window. Chang Zhiyuan woke up, but Shu Yi didn't. She had suffered from insomnia last night and was still awake at 1 AM.","Seeing Chang Zhiyuan sleeping soundly on the couch, she felt unbalanced and almost wanted to give him a slap to wake him up. But then she remembered that he had been driving for 24 hours without proper rest, and her heart softened. She couldn't bear to wake him. Watching herself slowly falling, she almost wanted to slap herself instead. The more she thought about it, the more awake she became, leading to her insomnia.","When Chang Zhiyuan woke up, he looked at the blanket covering him, then glanced at Shu Yi's bed.","The man lifted the blanket and walked to Shu Yi's bedside. In her sleep, Shu Yi seemed to sense someone near her, and her eyelids twitched.","Chang Zhiyuan didn't disturb her further. He tiptoed back to the couch, opened his suitcase, and took off his robe.","He had tried his best to be quiet, but Shu Yi still woke up.","\"Ah! Ah! Ah! Pervert!\"","Shu Yi was still groggy from sleep. Opening her eyes to see a man in her room wearing only boxer briefs, with his back to her, was more than anyone could handle. Her first thought was that she was being stalked by an obsessive fan who had hidden in her room and was now half-naked.","Shu Yi covered her eyes. Chang Zhiyuan was also startled by Shu Yi's screams. Early in the morning, Shu Yi's screams were as piercing as dolphin sounds.","\"Don't scream, it's me,\" Chang Zhiyuan turned to face her.","In the few seconds that Shu Yi had covered her face, her mind finally cleared a bit. She wasn't in her home in Rong City; there had been a man in her room last night.","Chang Zhiyuan silently picked up his clothes to cover his important parts.","\"Why are you only wearing underwear? I'm still in the room,\" Shu Yi said, now fully awake.","\"I know, but I'm not completely naked. I need to change clothes, don't I?\"","\"I didn't say you shouldn't wear clothes. I meant you could change in the bathroom or shower.\"","\"Opening and closing the bathroom door would have woken you up.\"","Shu Yi was suddenly at a loss for words.","\"Are you shy? It's free to look. You can look often in the future,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, believing that his physique was quite good, with abs, collarbones, and not small elsewhere – no worse than male models.","\"Just put your clothes on quickly.\"","Shu Yi turned away. She also needed to change clothes but could only wait for the man to finish dressing before she could get out of bed and go to the bathroom to change.","After Chang Zhiyuan got dressed, he left the bedroom, giving Shu Yi full privacy.","The man went downstairs, chose some breakfast items, and bought a local specialty of Tibetan City – milk tea.","\"Are you dressed?\" Chang Zhiyuan stood outside, knocking on the hotel room door, not sure if Shu Yi could hear him.","Shu Yi heard the knocking but couldn't make out what Chang Zhiyuan was saying.","Shu Yi opened the door, her face still flushed. She still hadn't adjusted to the situation, as if it were all a dream – this man had chased her from Rong City all the way to Tibetan City.","\"Come in,\" she said.","\"Let's have breakfast first.\"","They sat in chairs with a table between them, on which were two cups of milk tea, dried beef, and tsampa.","As they were finishing their meal, Chang Zhiyuan finally spoke.","\"Why does everyone know you came to Tibetan City except me?\"","\"Not everyone knows. Only Shen Yin and Qi Ji know. Even my parents don't know.\"","Hearing this, Chang Zhiyuan finally felt some balance restored. But if Shen Yin and Qi Ji knew, didn't that mean Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe knew as well? Yet neither of them had told him. If he hadn't asked Xu Xiuhe, Xu Xiuhe probably wouldn't have said anything.","\"Do you really not understand what I mean?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked, his tone calm but unprecedentedly serious.","Shu Yi remained silent.","\"I'm serious. Why can't you give me a chance?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked again.","Shu Yi still said nothing.","\"Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival. I'm here to spend it with you. I don't know what you're thinking, coming to such a far-off place alone on a major holiday. If I hadn't followed you, were you planning to admire the moon by yourself in this remote place?\"","\"I've been working nonstop recently and was too tired. I just wanted to come here to relax and clear my mind,\" Shu Yi said softly.","\"I've been working too. Weren't you filming with me? Do you find being with me too tiring? Do you think I'm a burden? Shu Yueru, if you dare to think that way, I'll stick to you every day. You won't be able to escape. I have all the time in the world to wear you down.\"","\"It's not like that.\"","\"It better not be. Why are you avoiding me so much? Be honest, have I done anything excessive to you?\" Chang Zhiyuan began to doubt himself seeing Shu Yi's attitude.","\"We're not young anymore,\" Shu Yi said.","\"Of course I know I'm not young. I'm almost thirty, I should be married by now. People my age already have two-year-old kids.\"","\"It's not like I'm stopping you from getting married,\" Shu Yi muttered.","\"Shu Yueru, are you really that clueless? I won't marry anyone but you.\"","Shu Yi was speechless.","\"Mr. Chang, we're not kids anymore. We're past the age of seventeen or eighteen where we can just start dating on a whim. I'm 24 this year, at the peak of my career, and my profession is what it is.\"","Since her debut, Shu Yi had been accused of having a powerful backer, and that all her resources were obtained through her body and beauty.","She wasn't oblivious to the internet; she often saw such comments. To be honest, it was normal – such things were common in the entertainment industry. But she had indeed been lucky. In her freshman year of college, she was chosen by a director for her beauty and took a role in a drama, gaining some popularity. After that, she had a period of mediocre success.","It wasn't that no one had approached her, but she had refused them all. So for several years, she mostly played supporting roles without much screen time. She didn't fight or compete, content with what she had. Later, after joining Chang Zhiyuan's media company, she gradually started receiving some respectable resources.","After so many years in the entertainment industry, she had managed to stay clean. Who would believe that if she said it? Sometimes she even doubted herself, deciding she must be a rare exception.","\"What's wrong with your profession? You're not stealing or robbing, you're earning money with your talents,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","\"If you're worried that being with me will affect your career, we can have a secret marriage.\"","Shu Yi was completely shocked by Chang Zhiyuan's words. How had the conversation suddenly jumped to secret marriage?","\"Your family is wealthy and prestigious, while I'm just an actor. Do you understand?\" Shu Yi might as well have written \"Your family will look down on me\" across her face.","\"Don't worry about that. My parents dote on me, so they definitely won't interfere with my marriage,\" Chang Zhiyuan said confidently. Over the years, he had casually dated so many people, and his parents had never gotten involved.","\"It's different this time. The way your sister looked at me last time was different. Your sister already dislikes my profession, let alone your parents. We're not a good match.\"","\"We haven't even gotten together yet. How do you know if we're a good match or not? You'd be marrying me, not my family. Why bother about them?\""]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: Inheritance Dispute","paragraphs":["Early in the morning, the Sun family villa in the south of the city was already bustling with activity.","Several osmanthus trees were planted in the courtyard, their fragrance wafting on the autumn breeze. Since arriving yesterday, Shen Yin had been eyeing these osmanthus trees with interest.","As the ancients said: \"Regular consumption of osmanthus can perfume the body and warm the stomach.\" For a foodie like her, the goal was naturally to find a way to get that osmanthus fragrance into her belly.","\"Aunt, is it alright if I pick some of the osmanthus flowers from the yard? I'd like to make some osmanthus mooncakes or osmanthus cakes,\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Of course! I collect some every year for tea, but I've never made osmanthus cakes before. Are they difficult to make?\"","\"Not at all, Aunt. I'll go pick some flowers now.\"","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng wants to go too!\" The little one had just woken up and was already clinging to Shen Yin.","Aunt followed them out. It was still early, and dew still clung to the osmanthus blossoms, making it the perfect time to pick them without the petals scattering.","With the help of Aunt and Zhengzheng, Shen Yin collected a good amount of osmanthus petals.","\"Yin Yin, what do we do with them now?\" Aunt asked.","\"Let's head to the kitchen, Aunt.\"","Shen Yin washed the osmanthus flowers and removed the stems to prevent any bitterness.","The delicate osmanthus flowers were layered with sugar – a thick coating of fine white sugar covered each layer of petals, gradually absorbing the osmanthus fragrance.","As time passed, the color of the osmanthus became more vibrant and beautiful, while the white sugar turned crystal clear.","\"What are you making?\" Aunt asked, seeing this method of preparing osmanthus for the first time.","\"This is osmanthus sugar syrup, which will be the filling for the osmanthus cakes.\"","Shen Yin continued her work, finding rice and glutinous rice in the cupboard. In the past, when she made osmanthus cakes, the maids would grind the rice into flour days in advance. But now, with no time for that, she was thankful for modern technology – she spotted a high-speed blender among the kitchen appliances.","After steaming the rice flour, Shen Yin followed the steps one by one: kneading, rubbing, beating, arranging, sprinkling, cutting, and imprinting. Finally, a steamer of osmanthus cakes was ready. They looked like mooncakes but more exquisite – white in color with osmanthus flowers dotting the surface, incredibly enticing.","\"These look delicious! Yin Yin, you're so talented. If my daughter-in-law had even half your skills, I'd be content,\" Aunt remarked.","She tried one, finding that the osmanthus cake was initially sweet and moist. After a few seconds, the rice aroma and osmanthus fragrance intertwined, creating a delightfully sweet taste.","\"Delicious! Even better than the ones from the pastry shop,\" Aunt praised after tasting, unable to stop complimenting.","\"Grandma!\" A boy of about 10 years old ran in from outside.","Zhengzheng looked over as the boy approached.","\"Who are you?\" the boy asked.","\"I'm Zhengzheng. Who are you?\" Zhengzheng didn't recognize the boy in front of him and felt a bit timid, even shy.","\"My name is Sun Zhixiao. I'm older than you, so you should call me big brother,\" the boy said.","Zhengzheng looked at Shen Yin, who gave him a gentle pat.","\"Big brother,\" Zhengzheng said obediently.","\"How old are you?\" the boy asked again.","\"I'm two years old,\" Zhengzheng said, holding up two fingers.","\"You're so little!\" Sun Zhixiao exclaimed.","\"Watch your words,\" Aunt chided. \"Of course he's small, he was born later. Zhengzheng, would you like to go play outside with your big brother?\"","Zhengzheng was a bit scared but also wanted to go out. After hesitating for a moment, he followed Sun Zhixiao out of the kitchen.","The living room suddenly became lively.","Hearing Zhengzheng laughing so happily outside, Shen Yin felt a twinge of regret. She realized she had overlooked something important – Zhengzheng had never really played with other children his age. He was always surrounded by uncles and aunts. She wondered if he would have trouble adjusting when he started school.","Sun Lufei's son, who was Xu Xiuhe's cousin, was also a businessman. The two men found common topics to discuss, which eased Sun Lufei's initial worry about them not getting along.","Sun Zhixiao's mother also entered the kitchen. Since it was the Mid-Autumn Festival, the Sun family's housekeeper was on holiday, so the three women busied themselves in the kitchen.","The two children played boisterously in the living room, their laughter and chatter creating a harmonious atmosphere throughout the house.","\"Have you and Xiuhe thought about having a second child?\" Aunt asked.","\"Zhengzheng is still young, so we haven't considered it yet,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Now that the two-child policy has been implemented, and you don't have financial pressures, even having two more wouldn't be overwhelming.\"","\"We're thinking of waiting until Zhengzheng is a bit older before having another.\"","\"That's right, you still look young. There's no rush indeed.\"","Sun Zhixiao's mother always wanted to escape whenever this topic came up. Sure enough, this time was no exception.","\"Zhixiao's mom, you should hurry up and have another one. The earlier you have it, the earlier you'll recover. Don't worry about childcare, I'll help,\" Aunt said.","During lunch, Sun Lufei brought up Shen Yin again, mentioning that he had seen her on television. He praised her capability and complimented Xu Xiuhe on marrying such a good wife.","\"Where did you buy these osmanthus cakes? They're still warm and melt in the mouth,\" Sun Lufei said after tasting one.","\"Yin Yin made them. Store-bought ones aren't this fresh or delicious. The osmanthus flowers were picked from the tree just this morning,\" Aunt explained.","Hearing this, Sun Lufei began to study Shen Yin closely. He prided himself on being a good judge of character, and he could see that his nephew had chosen his wife well.","\"What are your plans regarding Xu Guimin?\" Sun Lufei asked, getting to the point.","Xu Xiuhe, after hearing about his mother's past last night, felt his hatred for Xu Guimin deepen. He had previously planned to let bygones be bygones and pretend he didn't have a father. But now, he felt differently.","His mother's hard work was embedded in Xu Guimin's company. Why should it be given to that illegitimate son? He would take back everything Xu Guimin owed his mother. One day, he would acquire the Xu Corporation.","\"I'll acquire the Xu Group,\" Xu Xiuhe said, causing a sudden silence at the dining table.","Sun Lufei had thought Xu Xiuhe would go back to fight for his inheritance, but instead, he wanted to acquire the Xu Corporation. Impressive – truly his nephew, and indeed Wen Ting's son.","Wen Ting was good in every way, except for her poor judgment in men. If she hadn't been so determined to marry Xu Guimin, she might not have fallen seriously ill at such a young age.","\"As far as I know, the Xu Group is not small. Won't it be difficult to acquire?\" Xu Xiuhe's cousin suddenly asked from across the table.","\"It will be challenging, but the Xu Group is currently on a downward trend. An acquisition is not impossible,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Let me know if you need any help,\" his cousin offered.","\"Thank you, I will.\"","After lunch, the family chatted for a while before Xu Xiuhe prepared to continue their journey. Yun City was their ultimate destination, and it wouldn't be appropriate to overstay their welcome at the Sun family home.","Sun Lufei kept trying to persuade them to stay, but Xu Xiuhe politely declined.","In the RV, Xu Xiuhe was looking at the vehicle when Shen Yin brought up the topic from lunch.","\"Are you really planning to acquire Xu Corporation?\" she asked.","\"Yes. Don't you believe me?\"","\"No, I do believe you, and I support you too. But won't it be quite difficult? If so, it'll be very hard on you.\"","\"It will be extremely difficult.\"","\"Then why not just go back and fight for your inheritance? Xu Zhengyang and Yang Cui seem quite afraid of you returning.\""]}]);
